window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_INFINITE_MANA_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2401,"title":"Chapter 2401: Chapter 2400 Of Light And Shadows! III","paragraphs":["[Reified Enders of Extremity]:: Unique creatures born under a construct of indeterminate Origins. Each one is reforged through a Bound Source of Extremity to take on such a quality as their existence is supported entirely by their Bound Source of Extremity within the Infinite Plane, and upon facing True Death, they will only be recalled into the Infinite Plane and hibernate for half a day before they can be manifested once more. Each Reified Ender of Extremity moves with the will and resources of the Infinite Plane as they are a terrifying part of its Offensive Feature. The Infinite Plane is actively working to produce an Ender of Extremity that can successfully handle two Sources of Extremity within its Soul, with its expansion towards Extremity of all its Sources being an ever-constant process. The power of the Reified Enders of Extremity is scaled at the very minimum to be a third as powerful as the boons of the most powerful Reified Source of Extremity under the master of the Infinite Plane. Current base attributes of a Reified Ender of Nature: 3x your main body's Aeonic Soul Damage Values and 3x of your Aeonic Soul Defense Values...","The Enders of Nature became Reified Enders of Extremity as they were truly stupendous at this moment!","Some were immensely more powerful than the others as apart from the 3x base attributes compared to his main bodies, Enders that held Entropy, Manadynamics, Continuity...or any other high-tier natural laws received varying levels of boons in terms of offense and defense- each one having its own unique quality.","Apart from the Draconian Qilin Phoenix who pulsed with the dense essence of Manadynamics, the visage of Hyperion was massive as surging Entropy burned torrentially around him like endless waves.","Each one...held a singular Boundary at this moment.","But Noah knew they held a ridiculous amount of potential as the moment that he or the Infinite Plane was successful in fusing together different Sources of Extremity...an Ender with a Dynamis of Extremity would be born.","Just...what would its level of power be when such a time came?","The result was something even Noah could only speculate about at this moment!","The Reified Enders of Extremity were the tools of the Infinite Plane as at this moment, multiple of such auras turned into streams of lights that surged towards Noah's body- becoming absorbed into his very Origin and Soul as he merely acted like a medium.","He was having the Reified Sources of Extremity flow through the connection of each of their Source of Extremity through the Eternal Realm and him as he would be a mere medium...for his Dream Dimensional Chassis to draw upon in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution and call them out there!","—","\"Grand Primeval Silas, even though it's Infinitely close to the real thing, we can very well see that this Unruly Descendant merely has his Soul Clone here. To deploy this many forces just for him and divert their opportunities of the Extremity Panaceas for what seems like minor results...\"","The voice of one of the Supreme Ethereal Beings from the Cult of Endless Shadows rang out as they watched the golden being sitting upon the throne and releasing streams of Consummate Boundary Essences outwardly.","\"Whether it is a Clone or not doesn't matter. I've already directed Rosalind to keep a sliver of his Aspects of Existence alive. With it...I can taint it through her and capture the main body in one fell swoop. Though I don't like to have any surprises in the case that this being is particularly powerful amongst Unequaled Reverend Emperors...so I shall send in a request to bring one of our Unyielding Shadow Legions into the Haven of Dissolution to capture him.\"","...!","His words caused surprise amongst the Supreme Ethereal Beings as another one asked.","\"To go so far as to call an Unbreakable Darkness Army just for this being? This...\"","\"Haha, I will just have the Legion on standby. If Rosalind and the other Shadowlings cannot bring him down, then it means his worth encompasses all of them as he may be a top tier Mutated Entity. He'll be useful whether we turn him into one of our soldiers or to dissect his Aspects of Existence and see if we can replicate his mutation en masse.\"","WAA!","Grand Primeval Silas spoke of an Unyielding Shadow Legion being called and put on standby just in case this being turned out to be greater than they had imagined!","Unyielding.","A Legion composed of powerful Peerless Divine Emperors who had begun the process of Apexification...but were not successful in achieving it to completion.","Those who managed to survive from a large number of treasures sacrificed held shattered and fractured Aeonic Extremity Meridians within their bodies that held a single concept that was infinitely close to the 10th Boundary Layer!","It would never reach such a layer since the Aeonic Extremity Meridians were fractured, but beings like this were still a step above mere Peerless Divine Emperors as Inheritances preserved Legions filled with them for special instances!","\"Well, the Unbreakable Darkness Army may not even be needed-\"","BZZT!","Before his words could finish, Silas and all others here felt a pristine pure essence of Extremity erupt from this being before them- and multiple pure streams at that as they enlarged to form massive beings who seemed to portray a concept of Extremity to its very Source!","Dazzling cerulean light overflowed along with a roar as a fantastical Draconian Qilin Phoenix was the first to enter the stage with utmost glory.","Feathery blue wings that seemed like two expanding seas, a Draconian scaled head, and a magnificent body that burned with blue flames...this beast released a sense of beauty and destruction as it was accompanied by the appearance of a massive Draconic Elephantine beast that held swirling waves of chaos around it.","Thereafter, a cerulean scaled Reality Devouring Nine-Pupiled Serpent also roared out as it was followed by a golden colored Empyral Ten-Winged Providential Tiger!","And after their fantastical appearance, 5 more pure lights shone out and manifested into grand beings beside the Genuine Emperor of Essence who sat serenely on a golden throne.","When one gazed closely, they would be able to notice that most of them held a cerulean luster of Manadynamics.","Why...was it so?"]},{"number":2402,"title":"Chapter 2402: Chapter 2401 Of Light And Shadows! IV","paragraphs":["From the Reified Enders of Extremity called out, the vast majority were similar to the Draconian Qilin Phoenix as their bodies shone with a potent blue light!","It was because from the surroundings, with Hyperion at the very center surging with Entropy...Sources of Chaos began to churn wildly as tendrils of Nullity began to bloom around him en masse.","And once these streams of Nullity appeared, they were drawn towards the bodies of the Reified Enders of Extremity who held Manadynamics as very soon, a thin dull lividus color bloomed along with the terrific power of the beginnings of a Dynamis of Extremity!","The beginnings.","But even this alone was enough.","It was Noah's accomplishment, but it could also be used by the Infinite Plane that bound Manadynamics.","The spark of fusion between these two Essences could be recreated here as it made the pressure that the Reified Enders of Extremity release multiple many folds- a sparkling sea of a dim blue burning and shining brilliantly around the golden throne of a being whose voice echoed out grandly!","\"As I said...I will not have to even lift a finger for you lot.\"","HOONG!","Utmost lividus cerulean brilliance shone.","It was a dazzling contrast between Endless shining light on one side, and rising waves of shadows on the other side!","It was an ecstatic contrast of light and shadows!","—","Rosalind's gaze finally became stern at the appearance of huge Beasts before her.","When their path was redirected from the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands to this location by Grand Primeval Silas, she had her complaints that she kept to herself as she knew she had to contribute to the Cult when needed.","After seeing the enemy they were told to take care of, she was even happier as she didn't even sense the feeling of heavy and pristine harmony that she felt whenever she came across others who were operating an Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi!","It meant the enemy would be that much easier to deal with as they couldn't circulate their Boundary essence in harmony to produce unimaginable effects akin to one holding a Dynamis of Extremity.","It took her a great deal of trouble and effort just to gain enough Contribution Points to exchange for the Shadows Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi of the Cult of Endless Shadows, and she only held the First Tome that allowed one to smoothly circulate a maximum of four different Boundary Essences across their Aspects of Existence.","Mateo and Starr were the only others here leading their squadrons who also held the Shadows Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi as the three of them excelled compared to Haven Rank Disciples of other Inheritances that had yet to reach the stage of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity!","So it should have been easy to accomplish their task...yet the enemy before them conjured huge Beasts that very quickly began to be tinged by the light of a genuine Dynamis of Extremity!","A faint one that seemed to barely be in its beginning stages, but it was there nonetheless.","And unlike her, Mateo, and Starr...there were more than 5 of these creatures that shone with a sparkling Lividus color as before they could even adapt, the titanic Draconian Qilin Phoenix moved first as its jaws opened to release an Apocalyptic lividus breath of flames that seemed like a solidified pillar of dim blue light that would erase everything on its path!","THUMP!","Rosalind felt the beat of her heart and her body that had half merged with Shadows.","She felt the circulation of four different Boundary Essences course through her very atoms in fantastical ways as behind her, an endless shadow expanded.","Even though the enemies were powerful, so was she!","Her hand fearlesly surged towards the pillar of deadly lividus light as her shadows were intent on swallowing all Sources of light before her, Mateo and Starr making their own moves along with their squadrons as the huge Beasts opposing them seemed to move in harmony to release deadly attacks!","...!","BOOOM!","Light and Shadows clashed as even on the first round of impact, it was clear which side had victory inclined in their favor.","—","\"...\"","The scene before them caused Grand Primeval Silas and the others to adopt stern expressions as Silas voiced out coldly to the shocked Roan who stared at the essence of Manadynamics he had abandoned too long ago mix with nullity freely!","\"Did you know your Unruly Descendant had already begun the process of forming a Dynamis of Extremity?\"","\"What? Of course I didn't know, this must be why Orion and them...\" Roan had a cloudy expression as he was lost in his own thoughts- still intently fixated on the essence of Manadynamics that seemed to pull on his soul.","The situation before them changed things a great deal as right after the first clash, the billowing dominance of the Beasts called out by the Unruly Descendant was shown as the Shadowlings following Rosalind, Mateo, and Starr were forced to utilize their Apex Aeonic Soul Totems right after.","Grand Primeval Silas looked at this situation closely as something like this reminded him of the Scions of powerful Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity or the prominent Mutated Entities that had yet to become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that their Cult kept tabs on!","The power displayed by this being- or really the beasts he commanded, was just that potent.","He may have to approach this situation differently as if he simply kept throwing more forces under his command in this situation, he may lose more than what he could potentially gain.","'Still, a being akin to the Scions of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity...and he doesn't have any Inheritances behind him. It is someone any faction would want...the only question is how to attain him when things have started off in conflict.'","...!","The shadow within his eyes became deeper as Grand Primeval Silas was deep in thought while watching the unfolding battle.","But even at this same time, he received a message from one of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms he left behind in the Lernaean Domain who was supposed to be taking stock of the remaining Domains of this Lineage and starting the process of Domain Centralization.","\"Say that again.\" It was a message that caused him to grab onto the strand of thought and spoke in a heavy tone, an annoyed reply coming soon after","\"Other Lernaean Domains across this Haven are continuing to go missing, more than 30% have disappeared from their original locations so far.\"","...!"]},{"number":2403,"title":"Chapter 2403: Chapter 2402 Let’s do things differently! I","paragraphs":["The one Lineage within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution that they had made under them.","Their domains were disappearing just like this before their very eyes?!","Their worth was something only he and a few others understood as they didn't look at things in the same manner.","In his eyes, these domains were another source of the next generation of Shadowlings and even those who could be used for the Blood Sacrifice of their Cult of Endless Shadows!","They were tools and commodities that couldn't simply begin to disappear just as he had gained them. Otherwise, he would have a lot to answer for when everything was taken into account by those even higher than him.","Grand Primeval Silas' eyes became utterly chilly as he listened to the many streams coming towards him on all sides- from all Primeval Shadow Elders he had directed to centralize the domains of Lernaeans.","Thinking back to the actions of the Unruly Descendant here, it was possible that others working with him or even an extension of another Clone of his was working with Orion and the other traitors of the Lernaean Lineage that had chosen to leave with him.","Countless thoughts bloomed in his mind as he gave a command right after through the communication channel.","\"Go to all remaining Lernaean Domains and enclose them with an Aeonic Shadow Sphere. This will keep anyone below the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from even being capable of entering or exiting that region. And if an Apex Aeonic Lifeform comes to try and dispel the Aeonic Shadow Sphere, teleport to that location and...","incapacitate as you see fit!\"","BOOM!","A shocking command.","And one that was meant to target the issue head on as the Primeval Shadow Elders moved instantly as instructed!","As for those beside him including Grand Primeval Roan...","\"The Lernaean Domains continue to disappear, you all...\"","Similar commands were given out as alongside this, Roan's expression was stern as he sent a message towards the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that had sided with him.","\"Locate Orion and those who followed him, send him or the others a message if you can reach them. Tell them to stop their efforts as they are only weakening the Lernaeans in the face of the Cult of Endless Shadows!\"","...!","His eyes were filled with a cloudy light this whole time as he couldn't stop sensing the power of Manadynamics that he felt from the creatures that the Unruly Descendant called out, not to mention the burning Entropy and Providence that erupted in the back.","He felt the power and grace of the Universal Principles he remembered all too well along with their change into Boundaries now as a trace of hesitation appeared in his heart.","He had made the right choice, right? For the sake of his own benefits and raising the Lernaean Lineage, the assimilation to the Cult of Endless Shadows was the correct choice...right?","HOONG!","His soul shone powerfully as he became even more stern.","No. What he chose was the right path, and just boons would just show themselves in time!","—","His tusks bellowed with Nullity and Ruin as the chaos around him only became greater.","He focused on Nullity as the more he gathered and called down, the more that the Draconian Qilin Phoenix and other Reified Enders of Manadynamics could gather and turn into a dazzling lividus color as they carried immense waves of power!","This was the task of Hyperion as he felt an interconnectedness that he didn't think he would feel again.","It felt like he was moving in sequence and conjunction with everyone else as the entity controlling all this...was none other than the Infinite Plane itself.","And the Infinite Plane was a little different from the being Hyperion had fused with what seemed like a long time ago!","He had felt the Wills of both of these entities as the Infinite Plane that he felt most closely right now...it was much more callous and calculative as just after the initial clash with the dazzling long ranged attacks filled with the essence of a Dynamis of Extremity, a terrifying move was made.","Hyperion was directed towards releasing a burst of Nullity that used up nearly 80% of his Aeonic Soul Values before they slowly began to regenerate.","It caused a shocking inflow that he saw was instantly taken in by the Reified Enders of Manadynamics, and then the Empyral Ten-Winged Providential Tiger had its spinning golden eyes confirm a terrifying path as beside it...there was none other than the Reified Ender of Relativity.","Relativity.","Hyperion could almost feel the strain on the soul of this Reified Ender of Extremity through its eyes as this creature in the form of a Three-Legged Amaranthine Crow released a reality altering wave of power that spread out to cover all beings here.","Instantly, the very nature of light, space, time, and gravity was altered.","From the locations where six Reified Enders of Manadynamics were, the battle ready figures of six Haven Rank Shadowlings appeared instead.","And in their old spots where one of the three Squadron Leaders known as Mateo was...the massive figures of six Reified Enders of Manadynamics appeared as their Aeonic Souls already released deadly yet different forms of attacks that burned with the Lividus light of the Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity- a light that they conjured with 99% of all their remaining Aeonic Soul Values as they didn't leave even a thread behind for defensive purposes!","Even Hyperion felt a chill in his soul at this as when had an enemy appeared who entirely ignored everything and instantly released every ounce of their full power on a single attack without any reservation or residues left for defense?!","Yet this didn't matter for the Reified Enders of Manadynamics as their target felt horrid attacks on all sides as the moment they closed in, the protection of multiple Layers of three different Apex Aeonic Soul Totems shattered.","\"No...\" His eyes then released unbound terror and terror at such an unexpected situation as before he could even react, the Haven Rank Shadowling known as Mateo faced thundering attacks of a barely forming Dynamis of Extremity from 6 sides.","An unbelievable reality bloomed right after as just at the start of the battle, one of the three most powerful combatants was sniped!"]},{"number":2404,"title":"Chapter 2404: Chapter 2403 Let’s do things differently! II","paragraphs":["Cruel and immaculately more calculative.","This was what Hyperion felt from the move by the Infinite Plane as knowing of the qualities of the Reified Enders of Extremity and that they wouldn't truly die, it abandoned all defensive measures for them and simply focused on offense- using Relativity to scramble the battlefield as in the next moment, the Aspects of Existence of a Haven Rank Shadowling that was a leader of a Squadron was entirely shredded to nothingness!","No, not nothingness.","Due to the connection with the Infinite Plane and in extension to its Master, Hyperion was able to see everything about this existence known as Mateo absorbed toward Noah's direction and greatly amplified with a golden light of Loot, prompts forming before the eyes of the True Emperor of Quintessence that Hyperion barely managed to glean from afar!","{Your Soul is optimizing the Loot you receive to best fit your current self, with the selection of prior loot also being a possibility.}","{You may choose the devoured Aspects of Existence to be broken down and amplified to two of the following Loot: 10x Fragments of the Shadow Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi, 15x Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity, 1x Fragment of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, 1x Aeonic Sanguine Pearl of Extremity.}","...!","Hyperion only saw a glimpse of the wonders that went into making this being situated on a sandy gold throne!","He was even more connected to him than before as the ever present will of the Infinite Plane pulled his gaze away from Noah and towards the scrambled battlefield where yet another move was made.","Seeing the shocking evisceration of the Aspects of Existence of their peer, the figures of Rosalind and Starr that were nearby bellowed out in rage as they felt the minuscule defenses on the Reified Enders of Manadynamics and surged towards them to release deadly attacks that would do the same- their bodies seemingly breathing in the shadows around them as multiple Essences weaved across their bodies to release a terrifying might.","A sea of shadows torrentially surged to encompass everything. And yet...the Reified Enders of Manadynamics coldly pulled upon an endless supply of Mana as far away from them, the Reified Ender of Relativity bellowed out once more!","The battlefield was scrambled yet again as Starr and Rosalind...","found themselves at the positions where the Empyral Ten-Winged Providential Tiger and the Reified Ender of Relativity were- their attacks surging towards each other at the same time.","It was beside the dazzling gold throne of the True Emperor of Quintessence, just a distance away.","Their backs were turned to him as his mind seemed to move in conjunction with the Infinite Plane, and he truly didn't lift a finger but....","{Aeonic Dominator's Haki}.","BOOM!","A billowing Will surged from his eyes and smashed onto their figures as the Endless Shadows accompanying them cracked and fissured- their minds scrambled and fighting an invading Will while they pulled on their Apex Aeonic Soul Totems!","And at such a junction...","Hyperion was the last remaining Ender nearby as he felt his body move naturally.","Tendrils of Entropy surged over his trunk that glimmered like a massive mobile reality- this appendage of his moving like an Apocalyptic pillar to smash down on the figures of these two Haven Rank Shadowlings!","'How beautiful...' This was what Hyperion felt as he observed all of this dreadful and calculative scene playing out!","Yet before it could arrive at its completion...","BZZZT!","An indomitable shadow invaded the battlefield.","A shadow that couldn't be denied!","It was the might of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","But it didn't attack.","It clearly showed no intention of doing so as it only pulled upon the shadows of Rosalind and Starr, extricating them entirely from their current positions as they instantly disappeared.","Far in the skies where he should've been veiled, the visage of Grand Primeval Silas could be seen with a stern expression as the extricated shadows flowed towards him seamlessly- including Rosalind, Starr, and all the remaining Shadowlings.","The instant he saw the drastic change in the battlefield below and the coming deaths of two other Squadron Shadowling Commanders, he intervened as he instantly snatched away the nearly eradicated Rosalind and Starr, along with all other Shadowlings back into his vast Shadow where they first stemmed from!","\"...\"","Thereafter, he remained utterly still as he stared towards the skies ahead.","And only deathly silence permeated as Grand Primeval Silas sighed inwardly while gazing towards the being that had forced him to make a move before any more of his Shadowlings were sacrificed.","He grandly remained on his Throne with a cold expression as the creatures he summoned moved to stand beside him coldly!","\"How stupendous the might of Grand Primeval Silas is...to interfere within a battle of supposedly lower lifeforms so freely. Weren't you going to show me how I wasn't so special?\"","His mocking voice echoed out as Roan also appeared beside Silas with a heavy expression, all the other Primeval Shadow Elders sent to maintain the Lernaean Domains at this juncture.","Silas' gaze was even heavier than Roan's.","This was because of the choice he had to make from here on out.","He could choose to hasten the progression of the Unyielding Shadow Legion he had requested to be on standby to continue his assault on this being, or he could do something else entirely as his heart and soul...went towards a different conclusion the more he stared at this existence and observed his capabilities!","The fact that he had the beginnings of a Dynamis of Extremity alone put him above all Haven Rank Shadowling within the Cult of Endless Shadows.","It was a rarity, nay, even an impossibility as he had only heard of a few rumors within some Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity birthing existences who could form the beginnings of a Dynamis of Extremity even before they forged any Meridians due to unimaginably potent and ancient Circulation Modus Operandi unearthed during the early days of the Havens of Extremity.","And the battle prowess he showed to be capable of erasing one of the top ranked Shadowlings within his Cult like it was nothing and nearly doing the same to the other two...it meant that this being deserved a different form of treatment.","If he appeared before the doors of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity- even they would seek to have him join them!","So when he took what was happening with the Lernaean Domains and this being's possible continued involvement into account in addition to his ridiculous capabilities...","Grand Primeval Silas sighed internally as even though the situation seemed unsalvageable, he went towards another route at this moment!","He spoke grandly as he floated towards the golden Emperor on his Throne.","\"How about we do things differently, O Genius of the Ancestral Lernaeans?\"","...!","Silas' face was exceedingly calm and unfettered while in the back, Roan gazed forward incredulously at this change!","Yet Silus continued while he weighed many things in his mind.","\"In these Havens of Extremity, there are a great deal of unique and potent beings. But...each of them have a backing. No matter how unique or special they are, they join an Inheritance to obtain even greater security and power. It is how Apex Aeonic Lifeforms are easily born, and eventually how one attains Extremity. It is through the support of Inheritances that have legacy engraved across eons.\"","WAA!","\"We will forget the unfortunate events and words exchanged between us as I will take the first step towards a different path. A route where I offer you my hand. Join us...let the Cult of Endless Shadows be your supporter. I can guarantee you better terms than even the ones given to complete Lineages.\"","...!","The shadowy hand of the Grand Primeval Elder of the Cult of Endless Shadows was outstretched magnificently towards the True Emperor of Quintessence!"]},{"number":2405,"title":"Chapter 2405: Chapter 2404 Armaments Of Extremity! I","paragraphs":["The situation should've been something that anyone could see was nearly unsalvageable.","Irrevocable words had been exchanged between the two sides as from forceful methods to a dialogue...one could say that what Silas was trying to achieve was an impossibility!","So then...why was his hand outstretched towards the True Emperor of Quintessence?","It was because even in this situation, Grand Primeval Silas still had something that gave him a level of certainty and confidence.","\"Forget what has occurred? Let the Cult of Endless Shadows be my supporter? What can you offer me when at this very moment, you are taking what is mine?\"","The glorious voice of the True Emperor of Quintessence rang out as Silas remained calm.","He didn't address Noah's words directly as he instead chose another subject entirely, his figure floating closer towards the golden throne surrounded on all sides by extremely pure Sources of Extremity!","\"The Cult of Endless Shadows is nearly at the level of being recognized as an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity, do you know why this is so?\"","The question wasn't an expected one Noah raised his brows with a devilish smile, his words emanating out lazily as if his time was being wasted.","\"Enlighten me.\"","\"...\"","The disrespect in his tone was clear as Grand Primeval Silas ignored it and replied- the figure of Roan finding this all the more incredulous from the back as he gritted his teeth while watching closely.","\"For the distinction of an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity, one of the more straightforward ways of recognition is to have a certain number of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, and a certain number of members to reach Extremity. The Cult of Endless Shadows...has already met the condition of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as at this moment, we only await the successful news of a Pinnacle Primeval Elder reaching Extremity. We achieved all of this within the last few tens of thousands of years due to a singular reason. I want to use that reason to incite you since I know that anything out of the ordinary...you will simply brush off and not even consider my offer.\"","\"Oh?\"","The beginnings of a Dynamis of Extremity.","A Mutated Entity.","Multiple Consummate Boundaries without a single Inheritance behind him!","Terrifying battle prowess that actually put some of the top ranks Haven Disciples of the Cult of Endless Shadows to shame!","The release of extremely pure Sources of Extremity that seemed over and above any other concepts of this same level.","All of these factors and more made Silas want Noah more and more, and he made his move at this moment to draw interest and open a different path with this being after their rocky start!","\"A single thing is responsible for the rise in power of our Cult of Endless Shadows. Something that we have been able to utilize to birth dozens more Pinnacle Aeonic Lifeforms and spur the genius and unmatched few who were already at the peak of this stage to achieve Extremity.\"","WAA!","It was something that only the Elders and higher ups of the Cult of Endless Shadows knew of.","A single thing!","It alone was enough to take an Inheritance towards the distinction of an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity in a few tens of thousand years!","Silas had a stern expression as he revealed exactly what this was.","\"It is because our Esteemed Supremacy of Shadows was able to get a hold of One of the 81 Armaments of Extremity forged by the Extremity of Steel- the Shadow Sword!\"","...!","One of the 81 Armaments of Extremity- the Shadow Sword!","\"Have you heard of the Supremacy of Steel?\" The billowing darkness behind Silas extended out far and wide as he asked in a low tone.","Noah's eyes were sharp as he gave a calm nod, traces of memories from Titus and others flowing in about a certain legend across the Havens of Extremity.","Of a being who was widely known as the Supremacy of Steel, and yet he had achieved Extremity in multiple other paths!","It was a being whose name was synonymous with the beginnings of the Havens of Extremity.","This being stayed true to his path of Steel as he forged 81 Armaments of Supremacy that contained the mysteries of Extremity of the multiple paths he followed.","The personality of this being was eccentric as he then scattered these Armaments across the Seven Aeonic Havens, with a single message echoing out from him to the masses.","Seek the Armaments, Attain Extremity!","A single message.","And a terrifying one that sent many Inheritances on chases over the countless years that passed as at this point in time, a majority of the Armaments of Supremacy were already in the hands of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity.","For the Cult of Endless Shadows to have attained one of such Armaments...it was exactly where their confidence came from!","BZZZT!","Noah felt the Ten-Winged Providential Tiger begin to buzz as his own Source of Providence slowly began to seethe with slow, unknown waves. Was there...actually something to look at here?","He gazed calmly at the visage of Silas as he replied.","\"I've heard a thing or two about the Supremacy of Steel.\"","\"Good, then you know of the grandness of the Armaments of Extremity. In our Cult of Endless Shadows, it has only been passed in sequence across our Supremacy Shadows, Pinnacle Primeval Elders, and some Grand Primeval Elders as we have already strengthened our upper echelons. As soon as a Pinnacle Primeval Elder attains Extremity in the future to come, the time will come for us to fortify our Shadowlings as I...can advocate for you to be one of if not the first. This is my proposition to you. The support I was talking about. A glimpse...of Extremity.\"","...!","Silence reigned.","And a moment later.","\"Interesting.\"","The Emperor atop the sandy gold throne leaned forward as his lips curved up devilishly.","\"Since that is your proposal, let me tell you mine.\"","WAA!","\"When you hear it, you will more than likely scoff in disbelief, become disappointed, and lament at how unreasonable I am. Another path that you can choose to take...is to take my proposal at face value and out of all odds, actually accept it.\"","...!"]},{"number":2406,"title":"Chapter 2406: Chapter 2405 Armaments Of Extremity! II","paragraphs":["A proposal that could be taken in different ways!","As Noah began to speak about this, a billowing obsidian shadow came to cover this region and envelop the area they were in- making it seem like a dark sun had appeared in the skies as Roan and any other prying eyes would not be able to hear what happened next.","Silas seemed to take this situation seriously as he didn't wish for Roan or any others to glimpse at the possibilities that may bloom here, his stare maintaining his calmness as he nodded.","Two paths were laid out by the True Emperor of Quintessence as before he stated his proposal, he asked a question!","\"Let me get this clear first. You came to assimilate the Lernaean Lineage into your folds due to Extremity Sanctification- mainly seeking the strength of its Apex Aeonic Lifeforms after the Initiation Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution ends, and to raise more powerful Shadowlings into your folds?\"","His eyes held shocking sharpness as beside him, Hyperion and the other Reified Enders of Extremity gazed on coldly!","Opposite to Noah, Silas nodded slightly while waving his hands.","\"The Lernaean Lineage and any other unaffiliated Lineages are the goals as the Cult of Endless Shadows planned a process of expansion and strengthening as we become an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity. And the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms would have been elevated by us to become extremely powerful after taking the Oath of Shadows, eventually participating in the Culmination Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution where Apex Aeonic Lifeforms stand a chance to achieve Extremity through Dissolution. This would be the rise of the Cult of Endless Shadows to fully establish itself as a Hegemony not just in the Haven of Penumbra, but across the Seven Havens!\"","WAA!","The Initiation Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution, and then came the Culmination Step where Apex Aeonic Lifeforms reigned!","The ambition and power was pulsing gloriously within Silas' eyes as he spoke, Noah nodding before he replied while waving his hands to show ecstatic scenes of none other than the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","\"Whatever you've thought of me so far, you've exceedingly underestimated me by multiple factors.\"","...!","In the illusory scenes beginning to bloom, the figures of dazzling Reified Sources of Extremity could be seen facing against Phos and the Scions of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity, as well as the stellar and radiant visage of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity going towards the First Extremity Panacea!","\"My other bodies are at this very moment facing off against Scions of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity, and I am among those at the forefront in this Initiation Step of the Extremity Vein Dissolution. Dozens of Consummate Boundaries are at my disposal as becoming an Apex Aeonic Lifeform is only a matter that will be taken care of in weeks if not less. And Extremity...will only be a matter of time for me.\"","WAA!","\"For you all to be putting so much effort into achieving great success in the Culmination Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution in seeking Extremity, it tells me that the Armament of Extremity you all hold isn't an ultimate tool in transforming one into an unstoppable existence. My proposal to you if you truly want to succeed and attain Extremity in the coming Culmination Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution...is to leave the Lernaean Lineage and its domains to me.\"","...!","The shadow below Silas' feet rose as the dark sun they were in buzzed with arcs of grandeur!","\"Oh, I can already see the gaze of doubt coming, but I'll continue regardless. You offered me a glimpse of Extremity? I, the True Emperor of Quintessence, Noah Osmont...do not only offer you a glimpse of it, but I can promise you Extremity within the Culmination Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution!\"","BOOM!","The surrounding reality seethed as Silas didn't let his true thoughts of doubt rise, a smile rising on his lips as he replied.","\"You can promise Extremity within the Culmination of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution? You can promise something that even Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity cannot guarantee? Even with the Armaments of Extremity, one gets a glimpse of it as it smoothes out their path and greatly increases the likelihood of those nearly there, but even it does not guarantee. Yet you can?\"","From his golden throne, Noah shook his head with lamentation as he held his devilish smile while continuing.","\"Yes, yes- I see the doubt I told you about beginning to rise. Me. Someone who hasn't even undergone Apexification promising an Apex Aeonic Lifeform the transcension to Extremity. Again, you can choose any of the two paths I presented before. You can shake your head and lament my words while thinking I'm crazy, or you can go against all odds onto another path. I'll even sweeten the proposal on my end and tell you that I can guarantee you Extremity in less than 100 years.\"","WAA!","The last sentence caused a smile to appear on Silas' calm face as he was forced to laugh.","A hundred years? Even with the glimpse of Extremity through the Armament of Extremity they held, the Cult of Endless Shadows had only managed to elevate a few of their most powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that had lived for a great number of years and were at the cusp of Extremity- and even this took tens of thousands of years!","Yet Osmont could promise this in less than a hundred years?","When Silas thought up to here, his eyes released a blinding radiance as he seemed to have thought of something.","\"Actually, it's very simple for us to settle this issue if you say things like this. How about this- since you hold such a grand promise, simply take not just an Oath of Shadows that the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms would have taken soon- but take the Oath of Extremity under the stare of the Extremity Adjudicator of Dissolution. Should your end of the deal be kept in the next 100 years, you get what you want. If not, I get what I want.\"","...!","Silas' finger rose upwards as crackling shadows instantly seethed and tumbled nearby space!","100 years.","To Silas, this was an incredibly short period of time!","He had lived for billions of years as the passage of a century was akin to a blink of his eyes.","For him to settle things amicably with a Mutated Entity and further strengthen the Cult of Endless Shadows by bringing such a being into their folds? How could he not take such an easy deal!","The only way he would lose is if somehow, against all odds and working understanding of Reality, this being somehow achieved his words and ridiculously made Silas achieve Extremity in 100 years- and even then he wouldn't lose as he would only greatly gain. After all, this was Extremity!","But he knew it wouldn't be possible.","After all, he had to be the one to take the step to achieve Extremity. This being couldn't force it.","Silas...truly didn't see himself losing in any of the paths laid out.","Yet...he also knew this being before him wouldn't stupidly claim these things as he must have something he believed and relied on!","He looked towards him with examination as even after he mentioned the Oath of Extremity laid to be witnessed by another party, Osmont's very eyes and smile curved devilishly as if he had hooked a fish on a bait.","Silas scoffed inwardly as who could say just who was the fish that was about to fall into an inescapable hook?!","\"I'll make it even sweeter for you while laying out my conditions. Not even 100 years- 10 Years. The period for this bet can be 10 years as you leave everything to do with the Lernaean Lineage to me. I get to see the Armament of Extremity within the next few days. In the Initiation Step, I will help your Shadowlings of the Cult of Endless Shadows attain their Extremity Panaceas as in the Culmination Step...I will aid you in achieving Extremity within the next 10 years. Should I not achieve any of these, you get everything back and I shall take the Oath of Shadows to be part of the Cult of Endless Shadows. Should I achieve what I say I will...you shall pledge Fealty and bind yourself to follow me for as long as your soul still thrives!\"","BOOM!","The conditions were laid outright.","Silas' eyes became even sharper as his smile became even wider when he heard this being go from 100 years to 10 years!","Within 10 years, the Initiation Step may not even be completed!","For this being to achieve what he said...it seemed impossible on all accounts as Silas couldn't not take such a sweet deal.","As the Grand Primeval Elder holding authority in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution for this matter, he could make this choice and bear the consequences easily for 1,000 years- much less 100 or 10 years.","The two beings stared at each other as both smiled devilishly with their own thoughts.","Both of their eyes showed a grand light of victory as...who was to say which one would be successful in the end?!"]},{"number":2407,"title":"Chapter 2407: Chapter 2406 An Oath I","paragraphs":["\"This is truly interesting. I do not see you as an existence who wouldn't grasp how inescapable an Oath of Extremity is...so for you to offer up such a proposal is truly preposterous. But...as you and I both know, I have nothing to forfeit on either of the presented paths!\"","Silas' eyes were sharp as he turned jovial at this development and continued.","\"Very well. The Lernaean Lineage and domains you shall have. The glimpse of the Armament of Extremity in a few days...I can do as well. For procuring the Extremity Panaceas for the Shadowlings of the Cult of Endless Shadows, 81 Golden Extremity Panaceas will be enough, no need for Obsidian or the unobtainable Crimson Extremity Panaceas- and this number is about the goal that was given for the Shadowlings initially. If you best other Haven Rank Shadowlings similar to Rosalind who are already within the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands of this Haven, you can even command them! If you agree to this, we can make the Oath right away.\"","\"...\"","The exchange of words was coming to an end as the Emperor atop the sandy gold throne nodded with a smile.","\"Sounds easy enough. Let's get this show on the road.\"","WAA!","The bubbling expanse of Shadows surrounding them began to fade as Silas looked up towards the skies.","There was truly nothing there in this vast expanse where if one looked far enough, they would begin to see swirling spatial vortices and sources of chaos dancing around madly.","In the distance, Roan had a cloudy expression as he watched the unveiled figures of Silas and Osmont, his eyes locking with Osmont at this moment as Roan could swear that within these eyes...he saw mockery and a shred of pity!","He felt like he was being looked down on a great deal as before he could even include himself, the waves of shadows sank into Silas's feet as his voice boomed out while he stared at the endless space above.","\"O Esteemed Adjudicator of Dissolution, I wish to commence an Oath of Extremity.\"","BOOM!","The space above turned heavy and tumultuous as it seemed like the end of the world.","Space cracked and fissured as while this phenomenon unfolded, Roan stared forward incredulously as he asked himself...for what reason would Silas be seeking to make an Oath of Extremity?! He didn't indeed listen to whatever proposal that the Unruly Descendant had spoken of before they became veiled, right?","In his confusion, he felt the horrific descending pressure that felt suffocating to even his soul as he also came to stare at the Endless skies.","There, and covering immense distances...a dazzling veiled face manifested as two eyes that were akin to two Major Planes of Existence rotated madly behind a stellar dark veil, the fair skin on this undoubtedly beautiful face distinctly hidden behind this veil as others could only imagine how it looked!","A deep and ancient voice rang out from this veiled face as it caused tremors in the souls of the two beings below...the visage of Roan looking up but not hearing anything as he wasn't one of the involved parties!","\"An Oath of Extremity will cost you one Golden Haven Albatross.\"","...!","Albatross.","It was a word that more closely translated to burden or responsibility!","It was the price of making an Oath of Extremity no matter the being acting as the mediator- with many powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms using this method to form alliances and binding agreements that they would be forced to stick to even if they reached Extremity.","A lesser version of the Oath of Extremity was the Oath of Shadows that one of the Extremity Shadows could mediate within the Cult of Endless Shadows.","Silas gave a nod of affirmation to the skies as he didn't forfeit in accepting a Golden Haven Albatross now, since he would forcibly receive one within the next 1,000 years to fulfill another Albatross!","This was something only pertained to powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that had gained access to Dynamis of Extremity, Silas knowing what an Albatross indeed meant as in the skies, a spinning golden coin materialized from the veiled head and spun down like a burning sun that Silas reached out to grab.","BZZT!","The coin released a shocking air of ancientness and power as opposite to Silas, Noah watched the unfolding situation with great detail as he didn't wish to miss anything!","After Silas approved the Golden Haven Albatross, it burned and seared itself into his soul as once this was","completed, his shadowy eyes gazed up again as he continued.","\"I'm sure we do not need to repeat ourselves before the Esteemed Extremity Adjudicator, but out of our own free Wills, the two of us have come to an agreement that needs to be bound by the Oath of Extremity.\"","Silas gazed between himself and Noah who remained seated on his golden throne even with the overbearing pressure of Extremity cascading down, his eyes also gazing up in acknowledgment as he heard the monotone yet feminine ancient voice in the skies emanate outwards.","\"You all wasted a sliver of my attention monitoring this region with your mixing of Lifeforms so everything fell under my gaze.\"","WAA!","A frightening set of words came out as even in the shadowy veil that Silas had wrapped Noah and himself in, everything they discussed was heard and known under the grandeur of the Extremity Adjudicator of Dissolution as it was enough of an idea to terrify others of the power of such beings!","Yet Silas only nodded as if it was a matter of fact as the voice continued, but this time its glorious will became centered onto Noah's figure on the throne.","\"You have 10 years to accomplish everything you promised, or you are bound to undergo the Oath of Shadows and enter the folds of the Cult of Endless Shadows while giving back everything you're about to take, do you accept?\"","...!","The voice was cold and callous as it didn't offer any opinion or advice, only acting as a mediator at this moment!","Noah will vibrantly rose up as he gazed to the skies and spoke freely while under the grandeur of Extremity.","\"I accept.\"","BZZT!"]},{"number":2408,"title":"Chapter 2408: Chapter 2407 An Oath II","paragraphs":["\"I accept.\"","BZZT!","A tendril of pure Extremity cascaded down and floated about Noah's head at this moment, the voice from above continuing as this time, it was directed towards Silas.","\"If the other party in this Oath achieves everything promised within the next 10 years, you have to pledge fealty and bind your soul to him as he keeps everything he is about to attain, do you accept.\"","And without a delay, along with a smile on his face...","\"I accept.\"","Silas spoke freely.","A pure unseen cluster of Extremity appeared above him as well, sinking down and branding itself into a Rune within the depths of his soul that read grandly as...[Oath]!","Something similar appeared within Noah's soul as the majestic voice finished things off.","\"An Oath has been made under the watch of Extremity. Should any party renege on it, their very Aspects of Existence shall fall under the control of Extremity.\"","Not death.","Control!","This was the price to pay as one's very soul would have its Will taken away!","Yet both sides that had made this Oath were fearless as Noah simply nodded while Silas cupped his hands respectfully towards the skies where the veiled face had already begun to disappear.","\"I thank the Extremity Adjudicator for their leniency.\"","There were multiple points today where Silas was nearly out of line with his interference against lower life forms, but he wasn't put down or denied the Oath because of it as he knew to give respect to a being that exceeded the most powerful beings who reached Extremity even in Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity!","For them to take on the title of an Adjudicator of a whole Haven...their power was something that even his whole Cult of Endless Shadows couldn't compare to.","When every trace of the overbearing grandeur of Extremity disappeared, Silas had a brilliant smile etched on his face as he nodded towards Noah.","\"I will pull back the Primeval Shadow Elders from the Lernaean Domains. Do with them as you see fit for now as in a short period of time, you will likely be giving them back to me!\"","...!","His voice was resonant as this time since there was no veiled shadow or aura of Extremity blocking things off, his words were able to be heard by the visage of another existence who was also here.","The Deposed Emperor Roan. The newly ordained Grand Primeval Shadow Elder!","He heard the incredulous words spout out from Silas as his abrupt reply reverberated out.","\"What?!\"","The eruption of this single word caused Silas and Noah to gaze towards Roan as Silas' eyes lit up as if he had forgotten, his figure floating towards Roan while speaking out in a somewhat apologetic tone.","\"Fellow Grand Primeval Roan, it seems the time has come to make your first sacrifice for the Cult of Endless Shadows. You can keep your title since you were the one to get the ball rolling, but you will have to lose your standing as the Lernaean Representative and Emperor...\"","...!","As he spoke, Silas also turned around towards Noah while questioning.","\"This works for you, right? You can take on the distinction of the Lernaean Lineage Emperor since I promised you the whole Lineage for now. I shall call the other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to affirm this vote.\"","Words that Roan couldn't even imagine were being uttered as he was entirely flabbergasted, trying to grasp what just happened as an immense foreboding sensation came down!","---","In the Infinite Reality.","Surging waves of essence rotated madly in the surroundings as from 9 Minor Planes of Existence and one Major Plane, the addition of dozens of Planes was occurring in rapid succession as profound and unimaginable changes occurred every nanosecond!","In such an environment, Orion and Aurelia kept the milky white gold portals active as they continued to feel Noah's clones actively move across the Havens of Extremity through the vortices of the coordinates they set.","At the same time, their Wills marveled at their surroundings as aside from the Initial Planes of Existence they had seen when they first arrived here, the area they were in that should have been close to the external barrier of this plane was now only a small portion of this- the barrier pushed far back behind them as they could see radiant Planes of Existence being structured and formed behind them!","And the 9 Dimensions sitting below an expanse of stellar and massive Cosmos were rapidly expanding with no end as the 9 Dimensions truly could not be designated as Minor Planes anymore.","In the midst of such a marvel and transformation, the voice of none other than the master of the Infinite Plane echoed out from all around.","\"You all can head back into the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Domain for a vote. I've made an Oath of Extremity with the Grand Primeval Shadow Elder of the Cult of Endless Shadows.\"","\"What?!\" Orion's expression changed greatly as before he could form any assumptions, Noah's voice continued!","\"The Cult of Endless Shadows shall leave the Lernaean Lineage alone as the Grand Primeval Silas and I came to an agreement...a gamble that was mediated by the Extremity Adjudicator of Dissolution!\"","WAA!","Incredulous words emanated out as Genesis and Aurelia's expressions became stern, their souls buzzing as they realized they truly didn't understand the being they had just come across.","In such a short period of time, how the hell did the situation develop to even allow for the inclusion of the Extremity Adjudicator?!","SAA!","Space twisted as another milky gold portal unfolded above a region of light.","Dense vegetation floated serenely in a stellar space as verdant purple plant like Lifeforms released serene waves of essence all around, their trunks pointed away from a vibrant Major Plane of Existence that was currently covered by an immense shadow!","Above this Plane, the visage of a Primeval Shadow Elder could be seen as Noah stepped out of the portal and towards the Lernaean Plane encompassed by the shadow calmly.","As he neared, the Apex Aeonic Lifeform that had just released the Aeonic Shadow Sphere sighed with a sharp expression as he recalled the Sphere since he had received another order!","Noah smiled devilishly as after sparing the Apex Aeonic Lifeform a mere glance, his hand glowed as the authority of the Pocket Infinite Plane erupted out along with his Aeonic Dominator's Haki to devour the plane and existences below him.","There were always more ways to fight battles.","Noah couldn't truly fight with Apex Aeonic Lifeforms yet, and yet he was mixing with them and gaining victories without even fighting!","This was the more recent victory as a whole Lineage within the Haven of Dissolution...was about to have every single one of its realms and all of their beings consumed into his Infinite Plane!","How great a platform would it rise to then?","How potent would the light of Conquest be? Would it allow him to take his Golden Consummate Boundaries to Obsidian or even Crimson in conjunction with his own Soul?","And just how would the surroundings of the Haven of Dissolution change due to his actions as at this very moment, other Inheritances from different Havens went to stand behind the Noblesse, Quasarians, and Planeswalkers!"]},{"number":2409,"title":"Chapter 2409: Chapter 2408 Lineage Emperor Osmont I","paragraphs":["Austere waves of essence flowed in the surroundings as in the distance, a cluster of thrones circled this pristine domain that contained the Wills of a few Lernaean Apex Aeonic Soul Clones.","At such a juncture...","WAP!","Multiple spatial vortices formed as the aura of many more Apex Aeonic Lifeforms bloomed, the Primeval Shadow Elders of the Cult of Endless Shadows returning along with the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who were with them!","In addition to this, the most powerful aura bloomed from a spatial vortex as the figures of Silas and Noah's Dream Dimensional Chassis were revealed, along with the visage of Roan who had a livid expression that he couldn't contain in his eyes.","Noah gazed around this pristine domain which only held the signatures of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as","he felt the gazes of all of these beings landing on him!","The Primeval Shadow Elders even more so as they were the ones to receive the conflicting commands from Silas as they wondered what deal he and Silas came to for things to be like this.","Soon after their arrival, the party of Lifeforms that had left far in advance containing the main Bodies of Orion, Aurelia, Lucia, and a few others appeared with cautious expressions on their faces.","Silas gave a nod at all those here as his voice echoed out.","\"I'll make this a quick one. As members of the Cult of Endless Shadows, we have to reorganize our ranks every now and then, and such a time has come.\"","The expressions of nearly everyone here were dark as what was this? The ranks were just established not even an hour ago as how were they changing so quickly?!","But Silas remained impassive to the gazes as he continued.","\"While keeping the honorary title as a Grand Primeval Shadow Elder, Roan will be Deposed as the Lernaean Representative and Apex Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor. All those in favor...\"","Silas' hand rose as the dozen Shadow Elders with him didn't ask questions while doing the same, Genesis and the True Emperor of Fortune that had just arrived gazing towards the visage of Noah who smiled freely during all this as they shook their heads inexplicably before their hands also rose!","The majority was instantly reached as Roan's face became utterly livid.","\"You contacted me and made a deal with me. We had an agreement, we-\"","BZZT!","\"Grand Primeval Roan, please. We can discuss your benefits after this...no need for a scene now.\" Silas' expression was cold as he spoke in an overpowering demeanor, Roan gritting his teeth while being stared down as Silas continued.","\"Now, the being who shall be working with us for anything to do with the Lernaean Lineage is this Entity here...\"","His gaze and attention came to Noah as did all other eyes!","\"He will be running point with our Shadowlings in the Extremity Vein of Dissolution to attain Extremity Panaceas, and he will be a guest of our Cult of Endless Shadows in the near future. Known as the True Emperor of Quintessence, it is Osmont who is now in line to be the Lernaean Representative and the Lineage Emperor. All those in favor...\"","BOOOM!","A shocking development that even Aurelia and Orion in the distance couldn't fully believe!","When Silas was speaking, he held a hint of a smile as every time, he couldn't stop thinking how many boons he had attained with this one move!","The whole Lernaean Lineage was kept together, and he would have a Mutated Entity rivaling if not exceeding Disciples of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity work with their Shadowlings to obtain Extremity Panaceas!","And after all this, he would get it all","back within 10 years.","'Haha, unless he advances me to reach Extremity?' His Soul buzzed with joviality at this as even though every part of logic told him this was impossible, if it actually occurred...he would win even more!","But, the future was the future, and he would wait for it to arrive.","At this point, he watched the hands of the Primeval Shadow Elders rising along with the hesitant hands of the majority of Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, the smile on Silas becoming wider as he announced right after.","\"So it shall be. I announce the Coronation of-\"","Silas was stopped in his words as Noah's hand landed on his shoulders, his figure revealing a devilish smile as he spoke lightly.","\"I can take it from here.\"","WAA!","His words caused the eyes of Silas to turn sharp, but he humored him nonetheless as he watched Noah's figure float towards the center of the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Domain and point his finger forward, a dazzling sandy gold throne beginning to form soon after as he...went to grandly sit upon it!","Under the blaring Wills of extremely powerful existences that far exceeded him in power, he gazed towards them freely as with a devilish smile, he spoke out.","\"I've had many titles and distinctions in my life as today, I shall take on the distinctions of Lernaean Representative and Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor.\"","He!","A Descendant that had only arrived in the Havens of Extremity in the past two days!","Just how had events played out to the extent that at this point in time, he was standing before mighty Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and declaring himself the Lineage Emperor?!","His demeanor was stupendous as he addressed the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as if they were his peers, his voice continuing to emanate outwards.","\"You all may not know me, but you will come to understand me very well in the days and weeks to come. I shall not only lead and reorganize the Lernaean Domains to strengthen Lernaean...I will also expand a helping hand to the Apex Aeonic entities here.\"","WAA!","Boundlessly potent auras rose as on the sandy gold throne, Noah's hands arched up to reveal a dazzling lividus color!","\"Dynamis of Extremity, Dozens of Consummate Boundaries...if you search for the resources to help you achieve Extremity- you can come to me at any time!\""]},{"number":2410,"title":"Chapter 2410: Chapter 2409 Lineage Emperor Osmont II","paragraphs":["\"If you seek the tools to help you achieve Extremity- you can come to me at any time!\"","A shocking set of words were released from the newly enthroned Lernaean Lineage Emperor Osmont as while facing existences more powerful than the current him...he actually offered them aid towards achieving Extremity!","Silas' eyes turned dark at this as he didn't expect Noah to try stretching his influence even past their deal, but this didn't violate anything as for the sake of the future relationship with this Mutated Entity and his eventful inclusion as a Shadowling, Silas allowed this without interfering.","Not too far for him, he continued to place his pressure on the visage of Roan to make sure thing being didn't erupt, where at this point in time- Roan harrumphed while a spatial vortex wrapped around him, his figure entirely disappearing!","Noah only spared this a glance as he smiled while his figure also began to become transparent on the sandy gold throne.","\"My throne will be here for any of those that wish to get in contact. For now...I must tend to complete the relocation of the Lernaean Domains.\"","He gazed upon the slightly confused and disbelieving faces of the grandiose Apex Aeonic Lifeforms around him as after nodding towards Genesis and Aurelia, his figure entirely disappeared- only leaving behind a single golden throne that symbolically floated at the very center of this domain!","As soon as he left, Silas looked towards the masses of beings around him and spoke with sharp eyes.","\"I look forward to working with everyone here. The triumph of the Lernaean Lineage is after all, the success of the Cult of Endless Shadows. If you all wish for even greater types of might and even experiencing something as Grand as an Armament of Extremity...my entryways are always open.\"","His words were similar to Noah's as they seemed magnanimous, Aurelia releasing a snort at this moment as she disappeared- soon to be followed by Genesis while discussions broke out in this domain.","\"Just what...\"","Above the Argentate Sacrarium- one of the most important locations for Ancestral Lernaeans within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution where below it- the Minor Plane containing the Domain that a newly crowned Lineage Emperor was just crowned.","The earth below remained covered deeply by a vast silver sea of Nullity, crystalline silver mountains rising up as their peaks were constantly smashed with waves of Nullity and forged to become ever stronger.","The beings of armored Lernaeans with pickaxes releasing the light of EPOCH Relics could be seen mining the crystalline mountains to harvest materials even now, some working under the silver sea with some seen on the peak of mountains as each of them were accomplished beings in the Boundary Expansion Realm!","The figure of Roan could be seen in the skies thundering with tendrils of Nullity amidst all this as he stared down towards the silver sea below and the Major Plane of Existence hidden deep underneath it.","The rage within his eyes was palpable as at this moment, the figure of Genesis came to appear behind him while gazing towards the expanse below as well!","\"I called you a fool and knew you would come to regret your choices, but I never expected it to happen this fast.\"","Orion's words came out straight as they only further enraged Roan, his face staring straight as he bellowed out without even gazing back.","\"If you came here to gloat, save it! I am in no mood, Genesis.\"","\"I am not here to gloat.\" Orion's voice was calm as he stared at the far away Lernaean Domain while the memories of what he was currently seeing in the Infinite Plane flowed in his mind.","\"I'm here to tell you not to make any more foolish choices. Fall in line as if it is not for the Lernaean Lineage, then for your own sake. The one you called an Unruly Descendant who usurped your throne and everything you had less than an hour...I understand him very little as you cannot even begin to grasp him. What he now means to the Lernaean Lineage far exceeds you and what you meant all these years. If you make any foolish choices towards him again...he won't have to even lift a finger. I will be the first one to move- this, I promise you!\"","WAA!","Crackling nullity resonated with his words as after he uttered what he needed to do, his figure disappeared soon after!","All that was behind was the appearance of Roan amidst tendrils of Nullity.","His figure seemed desolate- the figure of s being that had both gained and lost everything within a span of a day!","In the Planar Palisades of Extremity.","A construct the size of a grain of sand shone with utmost brilliance in an insignificant corner of these Palisades as it underwent stupendous transformations!","For the first time in the past days, Noah's Main Body left the Source of Reality where he was enclosed in as he appeared above the 9 Dimensions and massive clusters of the Realities and Cosmos that used to be the Desolate Mausoleum.","In the surroundings of all this, Noah could see the formation of massive new Planes as his commands continued to be relayed to the Infinite Plane!","\"Choose from the Templates of already devoured Planes and keep a record of each of them as well as their qualities. I may use the Templates in the future...\"","Of the Planes being built, some held dazzling hints of silver Nullity, others head Ruin, and then there were some Planes...that shine with the light of the Natural Laws of Reality!","A plane filled with the multicolored luster of Relativity.","A plane filled with the blue luster of Manadynamics as it was akin to a vast stellar cerulean sea!","A plane releasing a golden light as Providence shone brightly from it!","Within these Planes, Reified Enders of Extremity would be born and raised.","His people would delve into them to deeply sense their essence of Extremity and achieve even grander stages of power.","As Quintillions and Quintillions more Lernaeans arrived into the Infinite Plane having already pledged Fealty, Noah only felt the concentration of the blinding light of Conquest growing ever higher!","He looked at the many changes around the Infinite Plane as he knew this was it.","The tool for him to use for his domination and conquest.","The tool that was already swallowing one of the Lineages within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution as the others would surely follow!","This tool would be a grand part of his Foundation as it would be a weapon he would use against the ancient Inheritances already established across the Havens before he swallowed them up.","And to do so, he also had to enact his own stupendous Inheritance that would hold monstrous existences that others could only imagine.","\"My Inheritance...\"","He thought of himself and what he stood for as when it came to the Inheritance he would establish... everything for it was already set in stone!"]},{"number":2411,"title":"Chapter 2411: Chapter 2410 Two Different Forges I","paragraphs":["As he stared at the expanse of transformations of the Infinite Plane and theorized possibilities for the future, he felt a blazing aura erupt behind him as a sonorous voice rang out soon after.","\"Mmm, so this is your main body.\"","The visage of the dazzling Aurelia appeared behind him as her golden hair draped way past her shoulders, her figure utterly dazzling to look at as Noah was unfettered at her appearance.","\"Yes, so what?\"","\"You really aren't afraid of us to so easily show your main body? Even with the countermeasures you've supposedly taken, the will of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform can move extremely fast when they wish to attack.\" Her eyes shone like golden suns as she spoke lazily, probing into Noah as he shook his head freely while turning to gaze at the expansion of planes around him.","\"You wouldn't be able to kill me even if you tried. Maybe someone who has reached Extremity has a chance of doing so.\"","Yes!","Just who could kill him now?","His life was tied to the Infinite Plane as if its Source wasn't destroyed, he wouldn't be destroyed!","And going even further past this, if he manifested the 9 Dimensions around him- he also couldn't perish until they did so!","Along with the countermeasures he had already taken against Aurelia and Orion, he wasn't the least bit worried.","The laziness in Aurelia's eyes lifted slightly as she straightened up while instantly appearing opposite to Noah.","\"Speaking of Extremity, will you truly aid the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms towards Extremity?\" Aurelia asked with a hint of skepticism as Noah smiled lightly.","\"Do you think I will so simply aid those who sat on their thrones and passed the verdict of Cataclysm on the Barren Lands and in extension myself? No, if they seek anything from me...they can only get it by pledging fealty!\"","WAA!","Nothing could have been decided unless the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms made a verdict with the majority similar to how the recent votes took place.","For those who had made this choice, Noah wouldn't let them off lightly as the Elder Ancestors across the Lernaean Domains...Noah was already conquering them through his sheer will!","All that was left were the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","They would have to grovel beneath his feet and make a pledge of Fealty to attain anything from him!","\"Ah, Orion was locked up at the time, and I voted No when I eventually heard about it. I should be excluded from this power trip, yes?\"","Her golden eyes blinked innocently as she asked, Noah focusing on this past True Emperor who spent most of her time secluded as he asked coldly.","\"What do you want?\"","\"I'll ignore your tone since I'm still very intrigued to see what you've done with the base of my Golden Forge. I told you that I would make the first move by showing you mine and you can then show me yours. Since things are somewhat settling down now, I can't wait much longer.\"","The laziness was all but fading in her eyes when she talked about the Golden Forge, Noah's luminous eyes staring at her with scrutiny as when he thought of his own Forge that was benefitting from the elevation of his soul, he was still very curious of the direction this being took hers in- and how vastly different it was under the grandeur of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","\"Very well.?","HUUM!","So he grandly spoke during this period of immense transformations.","\"Let me inside you.\"","With his cosmic grandeur surging wildly, he finally agreed to the exchange of ideas the True Emperor of Fortune sought so much as the sun- like eyes of Aurelia brightened up entirely!","Her grandeur of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform seemed greatly reduced as with an expression of someone wishing to show off, her forehead began to bloom with a dazzling golden light.","\"Send a sliver of your soul in. My Aeonic Forge of Extremity has no set nexus in dimension or time as you can enter it through any extension of my soul. Don't be too surprised at what you find there!\"","Excitement was prevalent in her eyes as it seemed like for the first time ever, she could share her love of Loot with someone who shared a similar mindset and even managed to make a Forge similar to hers!","Noah closely studied the facial expression of this existence as without fear, a multicolored ball of light moved from his body and sank into the golden blooming light on Aurelia's forehead.","This portion of his Soul then faced an unprecedented movement as it warped into the very soul of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform- seemingly traversing through an endless sea as he was led to one singular point of halcyon light!","After this blinding light went down, the environment gradually became apparent as his soul descended towards a massive golden mountain that made him seem like an ant in comparison.","BZZT!","Streams of golden loot light gradually descended on this mountain in an austere and beautiful show of wonder.","His figure stabilized at the bottom of this mountain as at his feet, crystals pulsing with dense essence of Extremity were laid out as if they were mere trash.","Entrenched in a field of these crystals, dozens of EPOCH Relics could be seen here and there as when gazing upwards towards this mountain, one could see a variety of different Loot stretched out all around!","They ranged in grandeur and sizes as on the left, Noah could see massive golden Vessels and even cosmic sized statues releasing vibrant glimmers of light.","And everything only seemed to get brighter as one went up the mountain as higher up, Noah could sense heavy auras that could only represent Apex Aeonic Relics!","And at its peak- a blinding light shone that Noah's soul had yet to pierce through.","\"I've always gone back and forth on the form that my Forge took.\"","The voice of Aurelia rang out with a hint of enthusiasm as a appearance of hers manifested beside Noah.","\"A millennium ago, it was in the form of a treasure chest as every time I came in, it was like opening a enormous cache of wonders to take what I wanted. The time before that, I had clusters of islands each holding different Loot...I change it up every now and then as this time, it is a mountain of Loot where the higher up you go, the more pristine the Loot becomes!\"","Her voice was resonant across this whole dimension as her figure and Noah's began to scale up this mountain at this very moment!"]},{"number":2412,"title":"Chapter 2412: Chapter 2411 Two Different Forges Il","paragraphs":["Noah's will spread out across the Aeonic Forge of Extremity where his size was currently the same as one of the innumerable crystals stretched out across this Endless mountain, his eyes picking up the identity of a variety of Loot of Aurelia continued to speak while bringing their bodies to a portion of the Forge that pulsed with a dense clustered aura of Extremity.","She reached out to grab a transparent cubical crystal at this moment.","\"This is the [Aeonic Dynamis Illuminator] that began generating in my forge after I became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform- it allowed me to test which of my Boundaries had the greatest compatibility as when utilizing a sufficient number of them, they can aid you in the formation of a Dynamis of Extremity...\"","\"Oh, and this is [The Fortune of Extreme Greed], it allows you to exchange the Boundary Layers of one Boundary into another...\"","\"This is...\"","Their figures flew across the massive mountain as Aurelia talked nonstop, her demeanor making one forget her grandeur as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as Noah's eyes lit up brightly with appreciation at all the new Loot he saw!","Viewing such things could always provide him 'references' for the Loot he would have forming in his own Infinite Forge after all.","\"Oh, and this is a good one. This bad boy is the [Artificial Intelligence Meridian Theorizer], it allows Unequaled Reverend Emperors to run simulations of their Apexification before they truly proceed with it, with the simulations running at least a thousand times the computational speed of an average Reverend.\"","Their figures came to a stop before a massive glass like circular innovation that had tendrils of mechanical hands all around- simply waiting for someone to enter it as they held sharp ends ready to connect onto their bodies and souls!","\"Interesting...\"","Noah nodded as he looked at this and more marvels within the Aeonic Forge of Extremity as while they traversed across the mountain, his gaze continued to be drawn over to the peak where the blinding light was.","He interrupted Aurelia's words that were about to come out as he asked.","\"Up there on the peak...what do you have there?\"","\"..oh? You can feel it too, huh?\" Her ears and eyes perked up excitedly as she instantly carried their figures towards the top of this vast mountain, the blinding light gradually being repressed and allowing for the item hidden underneath to be seen as Aurelia spoke about it as it was unveiled.","\"My greatest creation. A Relic that I was using before I attained the seat of True Emperor of Fortune, and one that I anchored to my Forge to automatically swallow a percentage of all the Loot formed for the past few billion years. It exceeds any other Apex Aeonic Relics as if I equip this while fighting someone who holds even a dozen Dynamis of Extremity...I should be able to come out on top!\"","WAA!","A wondrous set of words came out of her as before their eyes, a vibrant white gold necklace surrounded by pulsing streams of Dynamis of Extremity showed itself.","It seemed like hundreds of intricately designed diamonds were weaved together, each one releasing a light as if it were a dazzling Plane of Existence that contained countless mysteries.","Strings of such dazzling diamonds were connected together as when worn by any woman- they would forever cause all others near them to seem dull in comparison!","\"I call it...[The Riviere of Fortune].\"","Noah's eyes locked onto this dazzling Loot as he asked with sharp eyes.","\"You said you anchored this Relic in your Forge and had it inactively swallow a percentage of all forming Loot?\"","\"Yes, otherwise this mountain would be ten times as large with things that I don't need nor use. With this, I can be a little bit more optimized...\"","She spoke cheerfully as Noah wasn't listening to her anymore, thinking about a certain Relic that always seemed to get left behind a day or two after its most recent upgrade.","He thought of the tool he had obtained from the Dark Universe- the cosmic treasure that was being utilized by Sages and Great Sages of the Primordial Cosmos and the initiator of apocalypse through their actions- something that Noah had then taken from scratch and put together its Cores before raising it to what it was today!","He thought of RUINATION.","One of the first physiques he attained was the Universal Origin Physique that first allowed him to use RUINATION, and it had taken a backseat for too long since his Conquest of the Havens of Extremity began.","If he connected it to his Infinite Forge and allowed it to absorb some or all of the Sources of boundless Loot forming within it always...its ranking would never fall behind again as the loss that Ruination had against the Infinite Plane...there lay a possibility for it to return on the spotlight!","\"Hey. Hey, your eyes are sparkling. Did my words give you an epiphany? How about we treat that as a favor and you now show me your Forge?\"","Beside him, Aurelia smiled brilliantly as Noah turned towards her carefully.","\"From your own words, I can take one thing from your Forge?\" He spoke while gazing towards the dazzling Reviere of Fortune as the smile instantly faded from Aurelia.","\"Not fucking that. Are you crazy? I'll recommend something for you after I get to see your Forge. Let's go.\"","The mountain before their eyes gradually began to fade as very quickly, Noah's figure was pulled away from this space in the depths of Aurelia's Soul, very quickly exiting her forehead and returning to his main body!","He then saw the expectant face of Aurelia being right before his eyes, the excitement within them not being able to be hidden.","\"Well? Let's go. I've shown you mine. I want to see how differently you changed my forge, how you structured it, and what Loot there is...\"","This unique existence only had the thought of Loot in her eyes as Noah released a slight smile while waving his hands to show the weaving of a magnificent Epitaph that showed the composition of the past Golden Forge and how he had altered it.","Aurelia was beginning to be absorbed into it before she shook her head angrily soon after!","\"No! I told you I wanted to see the real thing, just let me into your Soul for a second...\"","Seeing the dazzling figure of this being, Noah's devilish smile became even wider as he wouldn't do anything without receiving major gains.","So he spoke slowly while erasing the illusory scene of the epitaph.","\"I could bring you in...but I want to get something in return apart from the promised Loot from your Forge that you just denied me. Instead of that, I'll need something even simpler- a promise from you to help me elevate the strength of my Soul and my progression towards forming my Dynamis of Extremity with a technique of my choosing.\"","\"Oh? That's it?\" Aurelia's eyes were perplexed as she nodded soon after with conviction, placing her hand on her bountiful chest as she nodded righteously!","\"No worries, this I can promise!\"","She wanted to see the profound changes in her construct of the Golden Forge as she nodded freely!","And the devilish smile on Noah only became wider as his head also shone brilliantly.","\"Very well, I welcome you into my Infinite Forge...\""]},{"number":2413,"title":"Chapter 2413: Chapter 2412 The Infinite Forgeof Extremity I","paragraphs":["His head shone with astounding brilliance as he opened up a pathway to a place within the very depths of his soul- a place no existence other than him had ever been to as for better or worse, the second person would actually be Aurelia.","Caterina Aurelia Dismukes!","The past True Emperor of Fortune and arguably the most powerful Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms barring those currently not within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","And she had achieved this level of strength not by fighting or working tirelessly over time, but simply by elevating her Golden Forge to become an Aeonic Forge of Extremity as her current level of power was owed to her sitting back and simply enjoying the boons from her Forge over the years.","Her nature was inherently lazy as when she had the chance to peer into the soul of another being that had taken what she made and turned it into something that he argued was even more profound...she was truly expectant to see it as she showed more emotions today than in the past millions of years combined.","The moment the pathway was formed, all of Aurelia's Soul Clone turned into a stream of golden light that barged in, her first instincts being that of shock as she noticed...","The breadth of the soul she was entering.","Its size was massive.","It wasn't something that even Unequaled Reverend Emperors should have as it felt like an endless sea, and it contained torrential waves of entropic chaos, bloody arcs of light, golden waves of grandeur, and so much more...but it was all kept together by a multicolored light that she recognized after interacting with this being.","Quintessence!","It caused the soul to release immense waves of radiance as the path she took was one that she would have to put slight effort in to drill through if she wished to do any harm.","But she stayed still as she was carried by a grand stream of golden light, her will being exposed to the beginning of a massive Epitaph as she saw the area she was being brought to...was only a part of this Epitaph!","'His Forge...is only a part of his Construct?!' Her red lips parted in shock as her overly strong soul captured everything with Clarity, feeling herself sucked into a massive lemniscate symbol as she was instantly taken into a domain not anchored anywhere in space and time!","SHAA!","A brief moment of light.","She then opened her eyes.","The first thing she saw was the visage of Noah beside her as his stellar strands of dark hair just barely grazed his broad shoulders, his body draped in a halcyon Emperor's Robe inscribed with innumerable Infinity symbols as his fair skin released pulsing waves of radiance.","It was a representation of his soul as it carried devilish grace and handsomeness, his pupils spinning like vibrant singularities whose lights formed into an Infinity symbol during their rotation!","This was him.","When Aurelia's eyes went to gaze at everything around them, her red lips parted even further and formed into an O at the sheer grandiosity before them.","Around them, four massive lemniscate symbols the size of Major Planes of Existence in relation to their current statures could be seen in all four directions.","Each one spun in the air as they released multicolored light wrapped in milky gold grandeur- the essence of Extremity patently wrapping around them as the essence of Loot, Providence, Destiny, Fortune, Manadynamics....the potent aura of multiple concepts of Extremity wrapped around these symbols tightly as they released extremely concentrated milky Loot light that cascaded away from these symbols!","And when this light reached a certain point, it transformed into genuine and brilliant Loot light that became something else entirely.","Aurelia could see crystalline shining singularities releasing a black light forming by the hundreds in one direction as she gasped when she saw it, her eyes wrapping around it quizzically.","\"That...is an Aeonic Treasures that can instantly boost a Boundary by 6 Layers?!\"","She came across Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearls of Extremity as she gasped, her eyes going towards","another direction and seeing other Pearls of singularities shining with a crimson light!","\"And those can expand a concept to the 8th or 9th Boundary Layer!\"","She marveled at the Complete Crimson I, II, and III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity that were also forming from the multicolored light cascading down as what surprised her wasn't just that they existed- but the sheer number that were forming and those already stretched out around them!","This was because within the domain of the four massive Plane sized Infinity symbols, the whole cluster of the Forge she was looking at seemed like a stellar system.","Like a constantly moving construct where countless bundles of Loot were strewn about and moving in clumps as if they were stellar Cosmos spinning in a vast reality!","Just nearby, she could see radiant armors, swords, axes, and a myriad of other Relics that each ranged from EPOCH I to EPOCH IX.","She had similar treasure like this in her Forge, but the issue was that in this Forge- there seemed to be tens of thousands of such Loot!","It overwhelmed her by both amount and quality as radiant EPOCH Relics that even Reverends would adorn were strewn about as if they were nothing.","In another region, massive silver mountains of Ingots of Nullinium spun with glory as in other regions, a cerulean sea of Ingots of Mananium in the billions shone with blinding light!","Swirling within arm's reach at this moment, Aurelia's beautiful hands reached out as she pulled from a cluster of tens of rotating cosmic balls of light and obtained...","[Random Innate Boundary Pearl]","A Loot that could grant one a genuine Innate Boundary was truly grasped by her as tens of other such Loot floated away from her.","The sheer dazzling grade and amount of treasure spinning around her like cosmic bodies as well as the four massive Infinity symbols in the far distance caused her to spread her arms out in joy as her figure followed the pull of gravity to float and swim with the endless Loot around her!"]},{"number":2414,"title":"Chapter 2414: Chapter 2413 The Infinite Forgeof Extremity II","paragraphs":["'Sheesh...' Noah couldn't help but sigh when seeing the expression of pure joy and excitement on Aurelia weaving around the dense cluster of Loot.","He had seen many beautiful women in his life, but the soul of this being was utterly stunning to look at- especially when it showed such pure joy!","Her golden strands of hair seemed like innumerable reality that wrapped around her, the simple milky gold dress she had on amplifying every part of her as she moved to confirm every single Loot in this Endless expanse of spinning wonder with her own eyes.","The closer one was towards Extremity, the more pristine and beautiful they were. Aurelia took this to a whole different level as even Noah was taken back for a second- and it wasn't merely due to this beauty, but it was the unfettered expression of joy that someone free of worries showed.","Other beings didn't have the luxury of ever feeling and expressing this level of joy as they always had worries weighing down on their shoulders!","But this Apex Aeonic Lifeform who always kept to herself and didn't entangle herself in any relationships or conflicts could show such a pure expression- with Noah only being taken away from it due to the appearance of dazzling prompts booming before his eyes.","[The Infinite Forge of Extremity has been born after countless advancements and refinements with your Soul and the Essence of Boundaries of Extremity.]","[The Infinite Forge of Extremity is seeking the direction of future Loot from its Master.]","[95% of the accumulated Loot Light of the Infinite Forge of Extremity for the past 2 days has been preserved and can be utilized to transform into the Loot you specify.]","A wondrous prompt appeared before him as Noah couldn't help but smile.","He knew of his current foundation and what he needed the most to optimize his power and bring him ever close to Extremity!","At this stage, he could push aside other factors and bring forward the continued elevation of his Soul that boosted everything about him, his Lineage, and then the management of Boundaries and their fusion into Dynamis of Extremity.","Before he jumped into anything else, he wanted to complete the Convergence of Manadynamics and Nullity.","He also wanted to get his hands on the Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi that allowed Scions of Inheritances to display stupendous power- a methodology of circulating multiple Boundary Essenced together as this would lay the foundation for the smooth Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity in the future!","He recalled the option of choices of Loot when he killed the Shadowling before Silas intervened and his selection of the 1x Fragment of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi and 1x Aeonic Sanguine Pearl of Extremity.","He already had enough Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity and as for the Fragments of the Shadow Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi- he would simply get this technique from Silas to use as a mere reference when he eventually makes the trip to observe the Armament of Extremity!","One of the more vital things was the Aeonic Sanguine Pearl of Extremity that would go towards elevating his Quintessential Kainos Emperor Lineage, and then the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi that was a circulation method that the Boundary of Loot brought to light!","[Fragment of Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi]:: A Fragment of a methodology that has not appeared in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. When 100 Fragments are gathered, the first Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi will be completed as it allows one to smoothly circulate up to 24 different Boundary Essences across their every atom with a single breath. The harmony brought by each breath will shed light on the Boundaries harmonious for Convergence, and the efforts of every single breath can be focused on specific compatible Boundaries to increase their rate of Convergence towards becoming a Dynamis of Extremity. While others struggle to circulate a few Boundaries in harmony with huge concentration and effort, a mere breath from you will bring you ever closer to Extremity. To take a single breath while following the methodology of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, an extremely strong Aeonic Soul is required as a prerequisite- along with a fortified Body and Origin. Unquantified possibilities are yet to be displayed regarding the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi that will only be clearer once the first Volume is brought to fruition, with future Volumes holding immeasurable possibilities...","Yes.","Something just for him.","The Shadow Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi that Rosalind and the other 2 Shadowlings displayed that could circulate 4 Boundary Essences was utter trash compared to this as when it came to comprehensively raising Noah's strength...this tool that even Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity kept under lock and key was undoubtedly a first choice at this moment in time!","So towards the direction where his Infinite Forge of Extremity should go...","\"Utilize as much of the accumulated Loot Light of the Infinite Forge of Extremity as needed towards forming 99 Fragments of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi.\"","BZZT!","Immense radiance overflowed as the four Infinity symbols all around blared out even more intense authority, Aurelia's figures looking at this in shock as after she heard Noah's words, her figure instantly flashed to appear before him with her innocent eyes shining like golden suns blinking over and over again.","\"Breath of Extremity? Don't tell me that is an Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi...even I've barely managed to form rudimentary circulation methods that allowed me to form my Dynamis of Extremity! And you can just command your Forge to do this? Where is the wait time for such a Loot to generate? How did you even alter the Golden Forge construct to be capable of such outrageous Reality altering features? Hey? Hey!\"","Her attention was divided into seeing what was about to be formed by a dazzling Loot Light while also seeking answers from Noah who had his eyes closed at this moment- his hand motioning out as apart from the Initial command of generating Fragments of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, he was also focused on drawing a Relic deep into his Soul!","HUUM!","Crimson brilliance bloomed as drums of anticipation resounded.","The beat connected to the pulsing light forming dazzling Fragments as an instant later, a radiant figure of a woman with crimson skin etched with countless golden runic markings appeared at the center of the Infinite Forge of Extremity- the appearance of none other than RUINATION in her humanoid form coming to be as her eyes opened to release amazing brilliance!"]},{"number":2415,"title":"Chapter 2415: Chapter 2414 The Infinite Forgeof Extremity III","paragraphs":["Ruination was drawn into the Infinite Forge of Extremity as the moment her eyes opened, she called out with sadness towards the being who had neglected her.","\"Master.\"","Her single word caused Noah to smile wryly as even Aurelia turned to look towards him with a hint of anger- wondering what he had done to cause this Relic to feel like so!","She waved her hand as Ruination's visage was instantly brought before them, Aurelia patting her pure crimson hair as she looked back and forth between her and Noah.","\"It's okay. Tell Big Sis what this guy did. Did he promise you enhancements that he didn't keep you?\"","She probed as her senses sank into Ruination to see just how unique this sentient Relic that had the rank of EPOCH was, but Ruination said nothing against her Master while Aurelia continued her probing!","\"Hmm? For him to bring you into his Forge...\"","Her quizzical eyes brightened up as if she had figured something out, her golden pupils that shine like suns becoming ever brighter as she laughed.","\"Was that the epiphany you had after seeing my Reviere of Fortune? This Relic is important enough to you that you would anchor it to your Forge?\"","The words caused Ruination to glow brightly as the conviction in her eyes slowly returned.","She had lost by too many factors to the Infinite Plane that she couldn't even face it as she used to anymore- she truly couldn't even compete with it at this point in time!","But she still wanted to continue to be of great use to her Master- for her to at least rise at the same pace and him and to continue multiplying his Loot or even to just be held in his hands again.","Being such a large part of his strength while he was rising and then not being able to do much for him as he stepped on the stage of Havens of Extremity hurt Ruination greatly as all of these emotions faded away the moment her Master called on her as she instinctively now knew...the elevation this time may not just be a one of thing as she would be surpassed a few days later.","So before the countenance of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, Ruination sank to her knees as she voiced out with utmost loyalty.","\"Let me be of use to you again, Master. Now and forever.\"","Her eyes and gaze were resolute as Noah nodded with bright eyes, his Will erupting out as while the four Infinity symbols spun and released waves of Loot light that began to form into Fragments of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi...","\"Anchor Ruination to the nexus of the Infinite Forge of Extremity. Let her be bathed with the light of Loot and all the EPOCH Relics formed here so far...\"","WAA!","There were many dazzling Relics swirling like resplendent stellar bodies in the surroundings already.","They and a whole lot more would be pulled towards Ruination as a path to make sure she wasn't left behind again unfolded!","Aurelia watched this happen with a smile as she observed the figure of Ruination become wrapped in a golden light and pulled towards the very center of the four Infinity symbols- glowing splendor wrapping around her as she metamorphosed into a magisterial Relic!","And in addition to all this...Providence shone within Noah's eyes as he motioned with his hands.","And a moment later, Aeonic Pearls of Extremity began to move towards the blinding light around Ruination!","Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity floated towards her as Noah wanted to see if this Relic that far surpassed other Relics in terms of the amount of will and autonomy she held...he wanted to see just how far she could go.","And since she was now the Ruined Blade of Epochal Quintessence that contained both the Origins of Ruination and Primordial Essence...","\"Take the concepts of Ruination and Primordiality towards Extremity. Let's see just how far you can rise!\"","As he spoke, the Sources of two Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity also surged forth within his Origin as he focused on Ruination and Primordial Essence!","His distinction as the Quintessential Aeonic Curator was already actively working to make sure these concepts were no less than of the Golden Consummate Boundary Tier- a amazing action being taken in the Infinite Forge of Extremity at this moment!","Around this same time.","In swarming tendrils of nullity above the Argentate Sacrarium of the Ancestral Lernaeans.","The countenance of Silas wrapped in dense waves of shadows could barely be discerned as he stared at the countless lives hidden deep under the silver sea as well as the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms within its deeper domains.","He currently held a resplendent obsidian Runestone that released waves of terrifying darkness an instant later- a deep and ancient voice that caused all nearby light to be sucked in echoing out!","\"Status report.?","Silas instantly became serious as he spoke in a respectful tone towards the voice of one of the Extremity Shadows of the Cult of Endless Shadows.","\"The Light of the Seven has fully integrated their forces with the aboriginals known as Planeswalkers. The Genesis Institute of Extremity has laid claim to the aboriginals known as","Noblesse, and the aboriginals known as Quasarians have not come to a decision- but they will likely ally with the Singularity Overseers over anyone else.\"","Silas relayed the happenings of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution as he knew it, the Inheritances wishing to increase their boons within the Haven of Dissolution having made their moves as other Inheritances...either believed it wasn't worth it to fight for the alliances with aboriginals, or they believed in their power enough that they weren't even worried of the advantage that Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who had undergone Apexification in the Haven of Dissolution would have!","Some may even question...why did the myriad of Inheritances who wished to eventually participate in the Extremity Sanctification of the last Haven not send Unequaled Reverend Emperors to simply undergo Apexification in this Haven of Dissolution over the years and gradually build up their advantage?!"]},{"number":2416,"title":"Chapter 2416: Chapter 2415 Indefatigable I","paragraphs":["Why weren't the many Disciples of Inheritances wishing to seek fortune in the Youngest Haven when Extremity Sanctification began sent here to build up their power over the years?","After all, the Extremity Sanctification of the First Haven was a special one- and the Extremity Sanctification of the Last Haven was bound to be just as fantastical!","The answer to this...lay in the utter importance of the recognition and branding of the Haven one was in during their Apexification as those already in other stages of Extremity Sanctification provided immensely more benefit than what Dissolution could potentially come to provide later on.","There were even a myriad of Inheritances with many Unequaled Reverend Emperors ready to undergo Apexification as they waited to see how grand the results of the Initiation Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution would be before deciding to put their forces and efforts into the Culmination Step where the might of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms would come into play.","Some were even planning on utilizing the Scions participating in the Initiation Step to attain Extremity Panaceas for these purposes!","There were many different methods... but the end result would always be determined by a single factor.","Power!","Even if those undergoing Apexification in the Haven of Dissolution had an advantage, if they faced an Apex Aeonic Lifeform who held multiple Dynamis of Extremity with multiple Boundaries at the 10th Boundary Layer...would it really matter?!","But the up and coming Cult of Endless Shadows made its moves as at this moment, the Extremity Shadow of Immeasurable Darkness asked Silas.","\"And our progress?\"","At such a question, Silas steeled himself as he began speaking slowly.","\"I came across a Mutated Entity without an Inheritance, and yet he held over a dozen Consummate Boundaries and showed prowess rivaling if not exceeding top ranked Disciples of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity. He has even begun the Convergence of a Dynamis of Extremity as to tie this talent towards our Cult...I made an Oath of Extremity.\"","...!","\"What?\"","BZZZT!","A single word came from the other end as Silas felt a heavy and inescapable pressure, very quickly explaining the sequence of events as well as the contents of his Oath as when the Extremity Shadow of Immeasurable Darkness heard everything, he remained silent thereafter!","Silas took the silence as a good thing as a sigh rang out with words following it soon after.","\"There don't seem to be any loopholes as achieving Extremity in 10 years is impossible even with your talent, even if we gave you the Shadow Sword for all those 10 years. But even though it is impossible, that is exactly what Extremity seeks to achieve... impossibility. I wish you came to me before you made the Oath as I could've confirmed how it would play out, but nobody can peer into the possible results now with the involvement of the Oath of Extremity. Very well...you shall bear all responsibility for this. We will see how things go with the procurement of the Extremity Panaceas for the Shadowlings first...\"","The words caused the immense pressure on Silas to slowly fade as he nodded with a smile!","\"Understood!\"","He looked forward to the future.","There were bound to be many benefits and surprises for his Cult of Endless Shadows!","-","Aurelia stared intently as a Relic was anchored at the very center of a stunning Forge, streams of multicolored light wrapping around her smoothly as the light of already formed EPOCH Relics also went towards her to be absorbed.","This was already fantastical enough, but her heart was pulsing when she watched the tens of Fragments forming near this same region that released an air of profound Extremity!","Pieces of Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi.","The tool that the most powerful Inheritances kept tightly guarded and utilized to circulate a myriad of Boundaries in unique ways, achieving stupendous results in the form of Dynamis of Extremity as this...all went towards their members achieving Extremity!","But...then what?","Was it truly worthy to be excited for what came as one became a powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeform and even those lucky enough to reach Extremity?","When Aurelia thought of this, her free heartfelt suppressed as a feeling of oppression she had felt a long time ago returned!","Her head turned to stare at the being focused on the formation of Loot as she felt like he was similar to her in their mindset. It was why he was able to revolutionize her Forge, after all.","Maybe he would be able to understand her.","\"Do you...know why Inheritances and ancient factions run around recruiting as many beings as possible to bolster their power? Why all the Havens are so intent on Extremity?\"","Her question caught Noah off guard as he turned towards her with bright eyes, his expression calm as he continued gazing at the forming Fragments of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity while he replied.","\"I have an idea.\"","An idea of what lay ahead.","Aurelia laughed ruefully at this as she opened her hands wide and floated back into a cluster of Complete Obsidian Aeonic Pearls of Extremity.","\"When you reach Apexification, they'll forcefully tell you the whole picture. They'll tell you what responsibilities you now hold and what to look for in your future. Do you know how frustrating it was for me to spend a few billion years living freely how I liked, secluded and surrounded by my treasures, and the moment I reach a grand stage of might and undergo Apexification...I am imposed restrictions tighter than any freedom I had prior?\"","WAA!","Her strands of golden hair danced on the dazzling circles of singularities around her.","Her fair skin illuminated with golden light as her sun like eyes looked dimmer than before!","\"Achieving greater stages of might should've come with even more freedom, but I've to realize it's the opposite. Even if you reach Extremity... the weight around you only gets heavier. It makes one contemplate whether it's worth it to tirelessly and indefatigably pursue greater strength. Whether one should truly even seek Extremity.\"","Her wide eyes blinked as it seemed like two suns were brightening and dimming at the same time, Noah taking his stare away from the formation of Loot as he turned to closely look at this being whose carefree smile and expression were long replaced by anxiety...and even a hint of fear!","\"Did you know that in these Seven Havens...the mortality rate of those who have reached Extremity is even higher than Apex Aeonic Lifeforms?\"","BOOOM!","Horrific words emanated from her mouth as she raised her right hand up- trying to grasp something that seemed too far away!","\"When looking at their total numbers and how many face death, the ratio is much greater for the mighty and powerful figures who should be those with the most freedom!\""]},{"number":2417,"title":"Chapter 2417: Chapter 2416 Indefatigable II","paragraphs":["\"The percentage of death is actually that much greater for the mighty and powerful figures who should be those with the most freedom- does that make any sense? The profoundness of Extremity that makes any Apex Aeonic Lifeforms feel useless...for even such a power to die like so, what are we struggling so much for?\"","Her eyes always seemed free of worries.","She was one of the most powerful Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as she was revered by many! Yet even such a being was ground down by the immense pressure that came from whatever knowledge she was given when she succeeded in Apexification.","\"When I learned of all this, I wanted to run away. I wanted to be lost in the Planar Palisades of Extremity and roam around without worry at whatever enemy- at whatever phenomenon could actually kill even those who have achieved Extremity. But...I haven't been able to do so. I haven't been able to cut off these fools who can barely take care of themselves...\"","Swimming amidst golden bundles of Loot, Aurelia laughed wryly amidst a deep sense of desolation that she very quickly repressed and pushed down, shaking her head as she looked towards the area above them where tens of dazzling multicolored Fragments of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi were forming.","\"Ah fuck, I got sentimental. Don't mind me.\" The smile she always showed began to return.","At this point in time, one couldn't see any of the fear or desolation she showed when she spoke of a subject that even she couldn't touch too much on!","Someone had to succeed in Apexification for them to learn everything fully.","This was part of the Oath she was bound to.","As she stared at the generation Fragments, Noah's Will thought of her words as his eyes remained the same.","Even while Aurelia showed the fear and a sense of loss at such a reality waiting for them, Noah's heart didn't waver or tremble, nor did he begin to feel any sense of pressure!","He would do what he always did.","He would do what he was best at- he would adapt to any impossible situation and overcome it!","So even in the face of the reality before him, he wouldn't fear. He wouldn't falter.","He thought of the word that Aurelia said.","'Indefatigable, was it?'","BZZZT!","His soul buzzed as the Infinite Forge of Extremity released boundless radiance.","[89% of preserved Loot Light of the Infinite Forge of Extremity has been used up to form 99 Fragments of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity.]","A fantastical sight that took Aurelia out of her stupor arose.","Noah's hand waved towards the dazzling multicolored Fragments before him as the 100th erupted from his solidified will and mixed in with the other pieces- a blinding light of resonance and grandeur erupting out as they all came together!","[The First Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi has been generated.]","A massive scroll shining with magisterial multicolored grandeur unfolded, its page holding torrential runic ecritures that spoke of a language nobody apart from Noah would be able to understand!","A tongue that only after he read it and spread it to others could it be known!","It was Quintessential!","It was the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi!","Towards this scripture laid our just for him, Noah bellowed out.","\"Come!\"","His hands motioned for it as it didn't come directly before him- it instead turned into countless golden waves of light that suffused across his soul.","The First Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi had formed in his soul, and it was absorbed by his soul as an instant later, Aurelia's eyes opened in surprise as she felt her Aeonic Soul Clone pulled away from the Infinite Forge of Extremity.","In a fraction of a nanosecond, she found herself outside of Noah's main body once more as she stared at the devilishly handsome man adorned in a stellar multicolored Emperor's Robe- a man that at this moment seemed about to conduct an action that even the lowest of Lifeforms performed.","He...was about to breathe.","Because in the description of the Modus Operandi he had just absorbed, there was a single line laid out as he would fill the description himself as he experienced the splendor that he got a glimpse of from the description of the Fragments of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity.","[Quintessential Breath of Extremity- Volume 1]:: A breath of Quintessence, a move to Extremity.","...!","A breath of Quintessence!","A move to Extremity!","There were no flowery words or abstruse techniques to understand.","He only...had to breathe, and he would take a move closer towards Extremity!","The phenomenon to unfold next caused the figure of Aurelia that was nearest to Noah to tremble as from afar, the will of Orion who was still operating the spatial vortices that teleported Noah's clones also gazed upwards in shock!","It wasn't just them as the Dimensional Rulers, the main bodies of Noah's closest family stretched out across the Infinite Plane, and even the quintillions upon quintillions of Lernaeans currently looking towards Maximilian in the Dream Dimension...","They all felt their Wills drawn towards a certain region towards the very top of the Infinite Plane as here, Noah's main body breathed in!","And this single action that took the span of a nanosecond to be completed...","HOOONG!","Caused the selected Essences of some of the past natural laws turned into Boundaries to surge torrentially towards his body.","The selected essences of some of the Dimensions turned into Boundaries fervently flooded towards him like nine Endless seas!","The myriad of Domain Spaces being forged as Planes of Existence that held the essences of Quintessence, Loot, Blood, Conquest, Nullity, Ruin... all totaling up to 20 Boundary Essences crazily flooded towards him within this span of a nanosecond as it felt like all the Sources of Essence of these concepts in the surroundings were sucked dry and made lifeless from this single breath!","All of it sank into Noah as within this short time span, these unquantified units of a myriad of Boundary Essences flourished on his head before following a unique pathway as they turned into countless streams of multicolored lightly that moved from the top of his head all the way to the soles of his feet, going upwards past his chest and lungs as thereafter- his nose expelled even brighter shades of these streams of light!","But in the single nanosecond that passed, something filled with profundity had occurred.","The 20 Sources of essence had turned into innumerable streams that crossed every single one of Noah's atoms.","Not his cells...but the very atoms!","A single cell had an approximation of 100 trillion atoms.","And within the body of a Rank F Existence, there were at the very minimum 50 Trillion Cells!","Noah's body that had undergone immeasurable transformations and elevations...the sheer number of cells alone were unquantifiable as the number of atoms were even more so.","Yet a single breath as designed by the Quintessential Breath of Extremity had passed the essence of 20 Boundaries in the span of a nanosecond!"]},{"number":2418,"title":"Chapter 2418: Chapter 2417 Indefatigable III","paragraphs":["In this span of a nanosecond, all of Noah's atoms encountered streams of 20 different Boundaries flowing smoothly through them- these boundaries undergoing a minuscule refinement of purity with every atom.","A minuscule refinement.","But when taking into account the trillions of atoms in a single cell and the trillions of cells within Noah's body, this minuscule refinement at every atop caused such immense and immeasurable purity that when this essence was breathed out by Noah...","BZZT!","The surroundings shuddered as it seemed like endless waves of multicolored light were released from him.","These waves instantly covered nearby regions as within a nanosecond, they covered all of the Infinite Plane as every single Cosmos, Reality, and Plane of Existence cheered and drank from the pristinely pure essence of concepts of Extremity!","This wasn't all as the skin of all existences felt this pure Boundary essence suffusing into them as if they expanded this Boundary...they felt their Boundary Layers begin to advance as they became ever closer to Extremity!","This effect was even privy to Orion and Aurelia as this was the reason for their shock.","[The first Breath of Quintessence has been taken.]","A prompt rose in Noah's mind as he didn't pay attention to anything else and moved by instinct.","After preselecting 20 Boundaries to course through him with a single breath, he added 2 more at this moment as from the very Cosmos of the Infinite Plane, crimson and white seas surged out.","Primordial Essence!","The Essence of Ruination!","They stemmed from concepts that were merely Supreme Cosmic Daos that controlled the workings of Cosmos.","Essences of the beginning and of the end.","Primordiality and Ruination!","States of Chaos like Ruin and Nullity were very much similar to Ruination, with Primordiality being very similar to Genesis...but where was the line of differences and variation? Did these","concepts differ greatly, or were they all leading towards the same thing?","If the concepts that used to govern Cosmos were expanded under the same light of Extremity similar to states of Verisimilitude like Ruin and Nullity, just what result would they usher forth?!","His mind seemed to instinctively want to know.","It wanted to find out!","And so Primordiality and Ruination joined the fray.","BOOOM!","And...the result was ushered forth at such a juncture.","He breathed.","His heart made a beat.","THUMP!","The myriad of Boundary Essences surged into every single atom that made up his body.","And he breathed again!","THUMP!","And his heart made a resounding beat!","Everything he did so, it felt like he drew out boundless sources of essence in the Infinite Plane before he filled it with even purer sources of essence, each breath only culminating to a grander and greater sense of wonder and power!","There were stupendous changes outwardly, but his body was undergoing the greatest change as it felt like everything was moving in conjunction, his heart resounding loudly with every breath as his aura rose to a magisterial level.","And in such a cycle...some of the boundary Essences smoothly circulated across innumerable atoms began to be pulled together in an intense and unfathomable process!","The streams of two in particular had an fierce reaction.","It was none other than Primordiality and Ruination.","Milky white and crimson streams clashed within a single atom out of the countless as an immediate later, Noah's visage illuminated with a milky crimson light.","[The Quintessential Breath of Extremity has come across two Quintessentially compatible concepts.]","The beginning and the end. They mixed with each other in a deep sense of Convergence as an instant later...","[A second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity is taking root within your Soul.]","A milky crimson light shone as Noah's soul felt enormous euphoria, his eyes opening like grand suns as he was about to bellow out in achievement!","But before he could roar out with glory...","THUMP!","His heart banged again as another breath was unconsciously taken.","And the milky crimson light that was the intermixing of Primordiality and Ruination went utterly wild.","It pulled upon multiple other sources of Boundaries at this moment and sucked them towards itself forcefully!","[The Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity has released a wave of Quintessential Resonance towards The Sources of Chaos within your Aspects of Existence!]","[The Convergence of the Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity rises sharply!]","[Entropy is pulled into the Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity.]","[Nullity is pulled into the Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity.]","[Ruin is pulled into the Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity.]","Something unexpected occurred.","Something that even Noah couldn't have hoped for- nor did he fully understand!","The mixture of beginning and the end resonated with all Sources of Chaos as a terrifying and ancient aura erupted from his body as he breathed once more, those aware to Boundaries within the Infinite Plane feeling a massive weight cascading down their souls.","Orion and Aurelia felt this even more closely as even though their Dynamis of Extremity had achieved full Convergence, they cried out as they felt a deep sense of oppression at this moment!","This was because the Dynamis of Extremity being born didn't have 2 concepts within it.","It held far more than this as when Noah picked up on its resonance with sources of chaos...","He pulled from the Sources of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity within his soul as he spoke grandly.","\"Add Armageddon into the mix!\"","WAA!","\"Let Apocalypse mix in as well","Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity burned as multiple more Boundaries were instantly raised to the 9th Boundary Layer- his job as a Quintessential Aeonic Curator going to work to make them Consummate at the same time!","Their essences bloomed as their addition came to match the 24 number of essences that the First Volume of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity could handle.","And the result...","[Armageddon is pulled into the Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity.]","[Apocalypse is pulled into the Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity.]","[The Convergence of the Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity rises Quintessentially!]","[The Convergence of the Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity has reached a critical threshold as it has named itself]","[The Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity has been born.]","[The Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity has exceeded 10% Convergence!]","[The Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity vibrates with Quintessential Instability!]","[Warning! Immediate action is required to correct a Quintessential Instability!]","...!","THUMP!","His heart beat again as this time, a massive crack erupted on his chest similar to to a Plane of Existence shattering as a sea of multicolored stellar blood gushed out!"]},{"number":2419,"title":"Chapter 2419: Chapter 2418 Indefatigable IV","paragraphs":["Shock, followed by a feeling of horror and immense sorrow!","These were the emotions of the Vassals under Noah who were gazing at his blinding visage that was akin to a breathing engine that devoured Essences and spat out even more purified versions.","They were staring at his glory before as an instant later, the situation drastically changed with the blaring of an oppressive aura that was enough to bring them to their knees!","An aura that Aurelia and Orion felt more closely than anyone else as the two of them had forged Dynamis of Extremity.","They could instinctively feel the difference in the Dynamis of Extremit of others compared to their own as they could gauge just how much stronger one was!","Typically, the Convergence of two concepts would not greatly differ in power-one of the factors being whether it was two Golden Consummate Boundaries or two Crimson Consummate Boundaries.","But an even heavier factor...was the number of concepts one converged to bring together a Dynamis of Extremity! Adding two concepts was already something only geniuses were able to do perform as combining three or four concepts? Only the Elders of the Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity being spoiled with drives of Resources and treasures could even dream of such a thing.","So the overwhelming aura that bellowed out from Noah... it entirely caused Genesis to become ashen as he felt his Origin Dynamis of Extremity cower in his soul!","The Dynamis of a lower life form... caused the Dynamis of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform to cower!","Genesis wasn't the only one as Aurelia who was closest to Noah at this junction...her soul trembled as she felt the birth of this terrifying Dynamis of Extremity, her closeness telling her one thing with surety.","That there lay a possibility... of this blooming Dynamis to actually be capable of reaching her! That it may be able to bypass the limitations of lower lifeforms and touch the glorious stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","But before she could feel this oppression for too long...","CRACK!","It was akin to a Plane shattering.","And a multicolored sea of blood gushed out as the broad chest of the man before her split as wild Instability erupted out!","...!","\"No....\"","Aurelia faced such a shocking phenomenon as she instantly felt the Instability of the forming Dynamis of Extremity as she felt great sorrow!","Would such a thing actually never be allowed to form? Would it go so far as to even destroy the existence trying to bring it together?!","How could it be so easy?","To bring together multiple concepts of Extremity into a single Dynamis of Extremity...how could this be allowed?","How could such an achievement come by so simply!","More often than not, prodigies who bit off more than they could chew would be destroyed under their own glory as... was this what was going to unfold before her?","\"Father!\"","\"Little Fish!\"","\"Noah!\"","From afar, those closest to Noah had long felt the changes like many others as they had come to watch the unfolding glory, only to see an unfolding disaster.","Yet even while others worried and gazed towards him in astonishment and horror, Noah's Will remained robust and steady even as his Aspects of Existence took a hit.","He had to act quickly, otherwise everything would be lost!","Bringing together all of these concepts under the same conditions may be a possibility, but Noah felt like it would be insurmountable and immensely difficult to do so in the future.","So his mind worked fast as an instant later...","[Warning! Immediate rectification is required!]","Cracks continued to spread across his chest and towards his whole body as the very cluster of Essences he was trying to form seemed to be running wild and trying to annihilate him.","At such a juncture, Noah fearlessly breathed in again.","...!","His heart let out another resounding beat as a sea of multicolored stellar blood gushed from him endlessly.","Time slowed under his eyes.","The unbelievably beautiful figure of a worried Aurelia before him.","The figures of his close family and friends in the distance.","Everything faded as his Soul came to focus on nothing other than himself.","He felt the Essences ravaging across his very atoms as it seemed there was...","'Too much chaos...'","WAA!","There was a heavy and firm imbalance towards the Sources of Chaos that the initial mixture of Ruination and Primordiality called in.","This was one problem.","The other...was Noah's Aspects of Existence themselves as they felt like they were trying to contain a raging sea in a body that was akin to a small pond!","What he was doing...was far too advanced for his stage.","His Origin, Body, and Soul felt this strain closely!","But Noah didn't focus on this second issue. He felt that if he could solve the issue of Instability, the latter issue would have a smoother pathway to follow.","And to solve the issue of having too many Sources of Chaos... he had to pull one away and add other ingredients to balance things- because he knew there was a very, very limited number of concepts he could continue to force together to make the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity!","And when he looked at the currently mixing Sources of chaos, he eliminated the thought of removing any of those that stemmed from him.","Anything he made was Quintessential. So his gaze came to Ruin and Nullity as an instant later, he gazed ever close to Ruin. He then gazed at Ruination. Seeing their infinitely close qualities and grandeur with the latter being something entirely his...","BZZT!","[Ruin is pulled out of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.]","[The Quintessential Instability still persists!]","A single state of chaos was removed as it didn't change the situation drastically. But this was to be expected.","If he removed a Source of Chaos, he then had to add something that could bring order.","His soul released profound waves of radiance as he uttered out.","\"Expand the concept of Genesis to the 9th Boundary Layer.\"","A Source of Complete Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity burned as Noah enacted his version of Genesis!","Not the concept of Genesis exemplified by the First True Emperor- Orion, but his own distinguished concept of Genesis!"]},{"number":2420,"title":"Chapter 2420: Chapter 2419 Indefatigable V","paragraphs":["Genesis.","Similar to Primordiality, it spoke of beginnings.","What was Noah's true beginning?","When he was born? When his blue planet began its Apocalypse? Or when he used the Rank F Fireball Skill Book and became a Hunter? Or when he sat on the True Throne of Quintessence?","Just what was his true beginning?","As this question arose, so did a blinding white gold light from the depths of his Soul as it already passed through the hands of the Curator to become of the Golden Consummate Tier!","It was his own version of Genesis with its own 9 profound Layers, and it joined the fray at this moment!","[Genesis is pulled into the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.]","WAA!","The Essences calmed slightly.","They pulsed with glorious synchrony as even with this...it still wasn't enough as his skin and musculature fractured even more!","Yet his eyes still shone like massive lanterns of light as in this slowed time, he made another move.","Since the many concepts of the end and destruction needed to be balanced out...","Since there was a concept that was a huge part to how these concepts achieved their current level...","Since it was a Quintessential Instability...","Noah's will buzzed as he moved decisively, forcing the essence of Quintessence into the fray at this moment!","Quintessence!","All the Boundaries he enacted were Quintessential as this quality was at their very core- and what better concept of stabilization could there be if not this?!","[Quintessence is pulled into the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.]","The torrential waves of essence ravaging his body calmed down a little bit more as still..there remained a hint of Instability.","His body shone unstably with the Essences of Primordiality, Ruination, Entropy, Nullity, Armageddon, Apocalypse, Genesis, and Quintessence!","8 Essences.","5 were of chaos and destruction. 3 were of beginnings and order.","Noah felt like...he needed one more. He felt like he required one more piece of the puzzle that would grant complete stabilization!","Now, what could he use to bring everything together?","What could work with Quintessence to calm down raging waves of Essences as it would have no trouble mixing with so many different Essences, and may instead only bring them closer?!","A devilish smile bloomed on his bloody face even as more cracks spread throughout his body.","But he wasn't worried.","He was unfettered.","And just like the Dynamis of Extremity he was about to bring to fruition...","He was Indefatigable!","THUMP!","A breath of Quintessence was taken. A resounding heart made a beat. And...","A blue light shone.","Mana flourished.","Infinite Mana!","Glorious and endless waves of mana! Manadynamics surged into the fray.","[Manadynamics is pulled into the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity!]","A blue sea permeated across his very atoms.","It was like a calming surge that came to cool down and wash all things.","This concept that stated power was neither created nor destroyed...it went on to act as the mediator between concepts of the beginning and the end!","BZZZT!","[A Quintessential Resonance of Extremity is washing away all instabilities]","[The two concepts that make up the First Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity are undergoing resonance in the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.]","[All possibilities of the First Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity are absorbed into the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity!]","...!","The cracks stopped spreading across his body.","THUMP!","His heart beat again as an instant later, all damaged musculature, organs, skin, and bones healed as astounding brilliance erupted all around him!","[An Achievement worthy of being Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!]","[Against improbable odds, the Convergence of a Dynamis of Extremity made of 9 Concepts of","Extremity has been born.]","[The Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity is stabilizing and has achieved 25% Convergence]","[You have come across One of the Absolute Seeds of Extremity!]","The slowed time felt like it came to a stop.","A milky red coral-colored light erupted from Noah and covered utterly everything as an unfathomable radiance of Extremity spread.","A light that caused the Dynamis of Aurelia and Orion to shudder as they affirmed that when this light was completely converged, it would even be able to reach Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","But more than anything, the man at the center of it all felt profound and unimaginable changes as at the center of his soul, a massive Rune that constantly ushered forth waves of Extremity was being etched with glory.","The Rune simply read [INDEFATIGABLE] in a few strokes as...","THUMP!","It pulsed with Noah's heartbeat.","WAA!","And it pulsed in conjunction with his breath.","Everything seemed to be in a deep synchrony as endless coral waves of essence surged out from this Rune and spread out across every atom in his body!","[The Essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity has begun to cycle across your Aspects of Existence with every Quintessential Breath.]","[The Breadth of your Existence is being expanded.]","[Your Body, Origin, and Soul are being expanded and refined under the light of One of the Absolute Seeds of Extremity!]","Torrential waves of mana erupted from the very depths of his being as the second issue in all this...began its resolution!","The breadth of his Existence was forcefully and unimaginably raised as his Second Plane of Extremity expanded rapidly, his Aeonic Soul Values curving upwards exponentially","while his body commenced to release a luster of impenetrability!","This was all due to...Indefatigability!","One of the Absolute Seeds of Extremity! As for what such a distinction meant? Noah wasn't able to delve into it yet as the feeling of his very Existence being expanded caused him to vibrate like a blooming singularity, a bellow erupting from him that released a stellar coral colored light that even escaped the walls of the Infinite Plane to illuminate the barren Planar Palisades of Extremity.","OOOOH!","A bellow that seemed like an ancient primal beast awakening.","A bellow of an existence making a deep achievement!","It was the bellow of the True Emperor of Quintessence after he enacted a Dynamis of Extremity with 9 Concepts of Extremity swirling in harmony!"]},{"number":2421,"title":"Chapter 2421: Chapter 2420 An Absolute Seedof Extremity I","paragraphs":["Coral colored.","Magenta.","It could vary depending on the eyes set on it!","The color seemed deeply red at times as an instant later, the milky white turned it into a beautiful coral light that dazzled one's very soul.","Such a dense hue of wonder erupted from Noah and covered the vast Infinite Plane entirely, even blaring out into the Planar Palisades of Extremity as it stretched out across all parts of Noah!","All parts.","His clones.","His Reified Sources of Extremity.","Everything!","In the utterly chaotic domain filled with floating obelisks and Unequaled Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution- along with a blossoming Extremity Panacea that was radiating less gold and obsidian light as a crimson grandeur Extremity surrounded it!","Many beings were surging towards it even with the massive Leviathans surrounding it, with some regions in particular showing the discrepancy in the power between Unequaled Reverend Emperors.","In one area, a young woman with a dazzling horn on her forehead cut across space like a stellar ruler of light- the sheer heat emanating from her burning the skin of any nearby Reverends as the area around her was entirely empty- and she seemed like a lone sun that was surging towards Extremity!","She was Ayame of the Infinite Extremity.","In another region, a being donning white slippers, loose stellar white shorts, and a blue beach shirt moved across space with his hands freely entrenched in his pockets- his tan skin radiating wonder as his eyes released a calculative and authoritative light as if everything here was captured within them!","A smile lingered on his face as a single step he took...warped space and took him past many beings as at this juncture, he passed by a Scion of an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity who reacted instinctively to stop the advancement of a competitor- his hand erupting out with over a dozen Consummate Boundaries that weaved into a roaring cluster of Essences smashing towards Erikson.","Yet this being didn't even bat an eye as he only took his right hand out of his pocket.","His beach shirt glimmered with dazzling light as he waved his hand towards the released attack, the roaring flames of Boundaries instantly being snuffed out as if they were never there as the Scion who sent the attack out was instantly filled with immense shock and terror- an invisible pressure seemingly wrapping around him on all sides as his body deformed and folded in itself- akin to a tomato being crushed in one's hands an instant later, all he was was a mass of blood and bones!","Erikson didn't even look back as he continued, those near him seeing this scene and moving away from this region as some even whispered in the distance!","\"It is Master Erikson...\"","\"The Immovable Reverend!\"","His name and distinction carried fear as this was a sense of discrepancy between Reverends as some were leagues apart from others.","Each of them were filled with pride and power.","But at this moment...their gazes changed.","Shock overcame them.","This was because in a certain direction, there was the visage of an existence whose very body seemed to be made of stellar Realities and Cosmos.","It was the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity that at this moment began to radiate a coral colored light!","This light caused the gazes of shock as the souls of nearly all Reverends shuddered fearfully.","And the souls of all others felt a strain as in one direction, Ayame turned towards this radiating light in shock!","In another direction, Erikson stopped as his massive figure turned around- his eyes showing genuine shock as an moment later, a wild smile bloomed on his face as he changed direction.","He no longer went towards the blossoming Extremity Panacea!","He barreled forth as if he was a volatile singularity, his hands coming out of his pockets as with an imposing demeanor- everyone on his path was smashed away like a cannonball with the wind knocked out of them!","His path was straight as veered towards the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity shining with bright coral grandeur, coming to float opposite him as a sense of wildness and freedom emanated from him.","Not too long after, powerful auras of Unequaled Reverend Emperors donned in neat suits appeared behind him, a woman in a tight fitting suit pushing up the rims of her glasses as she hid the shock in her eyes while asking lightly.","\"What are we doing, Master Erikson?\"","Their bodies buzzed with a profound sense of grandeur as over a dozen Boundary Essences swirled with purpose and intent- a unique Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi being operated by them as they were ready to follow this being in whatever action he wanted to take.","The shining stellar visage of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity also gazed towards him coldly as his stare glanced past him towards the shining Extremity Panacea in the distance.","As if seeing this gaze, Erikson smiled as he waved his hands freely.","\"Nobody here will be able to obtain the First Extremity Panacea easily. There's the Leviathans of Dissolution to tire out and kill along with something extra...so we can afford a few minutes.\"","He held a wild charm and handsomeness while he spoke, his massive figure in comparison to others making him seem like a titan as he continued to speak at this moment.","\"Let me be the first to congratulate you on such a deep achievement. You don't come across too many Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who can form an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, much less someone who hasn't even undergone Apexification.\"","WAA!","His words caused the powerful Scions adorned in suits behind him to settle calmly as the battle intent they had faded after they heard Master Erikson's words.","But what he uttered next caused them to gape in shock as this being said something that caused the very surroundings to tremble!","\"Friend, I stand before you today representing the Sima Clan in extending an invitation.\"","BOOM!","\"Master Erikson!\"","\"Sir!\"","His words caused an eruption of a deep sense of Extremity just from being uttered.","This was especially so for the words [Sima]!","The Sima Clan!"]},{"number":2422,"title":"Chapter 2422: Chapter 2421 An Absolute Seedof Extremity II","paragraphs":["The Sima Clan!","It didn't have any grandiose name like Infinite Extremity or Genesis Institute of Extremity, and it stood alone and imposing in its power and nature as this was a Behemoth that stood above most Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity.","There were too many Inheritances across the Seven Aeonic Havens.","But there were a limited number of Inheritances that were Known as Clans.","And for those in the surroundings who heard the words uttered by Erikson, they couldn't help but recoil in shock and wonder as some knew an unbroken truth about this behemoth!","\"The Sima Clan has only ever had direct Bloodline Descendants take their name. Do you really have the authority to represent the Sima Clan in breaking one of its oldest rules?\"","A crimson horn shone as Ayame of the Infinite Extremity appeared to the left, her gaze shining with perplexing emotions as she voiced out towards Erikson while focusing on Noah's astounding visage.","Erikson's magnetic figure didn't even turn as his gaze remained straight, remaining on Noah as he continued.","\"If I say I have the authority to represent, then I have the authority to represent. The Inheritance of the Infinite Extremity has no power to fight me on this.\"","WAA!","His demeanor was carefree and wild.","His Will was dominating as he looked towards Noah, the first thought on his mind being to extend an olive branch and invite this being into the folds of one of the most powerful hegemonies within the Seven Aeonic Havens!","And all of this was brought about by the grandeur of a dazzling coral light.","And as soon as the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity radiated this","coral light, 8 other Sources of Extremity in the far distance who were standing before the combined forces of a few hundred Scions of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity also released the same dazzling grandeur.","The Harbinger of Entropy- Bellicus, was at the very forefront as this radiating light caused Phos and all other Scions who had chosen to join him to instantly turn grim!","Their bodies instantly blared with the light of Apex Aeonic Soul Totems, but even with this- their hearts didn't feel at ease as it seemed like it may not be enough.","This was just within the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands that had a layer of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution beginning to show.","Far away from this.","Away from glacial layers of Nullity covering the Abyss.","In the regions that held the Lernaean Domains.","ραndαsnοvεl.cοm The flourishing of the coral colored light bloomed from 9 different directions as it represented the 9 Dimensional Chassis currently moving to devour the Lernaean Domains!","When this light flashed, the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in this region of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution turned towards these different directions in shock.","And even further away from this region, in the Lands of the Noblesse, Quasarians, and Planeswalkers- the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in these regions all also felt a hint of this radiating coral light as when it shone, it briefly rose to the skies above the 9 different points of light and caused a cloud of brilliant Extremity to flourish.","As if the very Havens of Dissolution were commending this action that was being recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","Dissolution.","In a region where no Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could reach, an existence with the title of Dissolution turned her head away from the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands where she observed a similar coral light, turning towards the 9 points of brightness right now as she gazed towards blossoming coral lights within this region of the Haven she monitored.","Her gaze and face were veiled as usual, but one could sense genuine surprise and appreciation from it!","\"The grandeur of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity? From a lifeform that hasn't even undergone Apexification?\"","An Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","Its distinction had to be like so as this was a hidden condition very few beings knew the true standing of.","If one was ever able to pull together a sufficient number of concepts and Converge them to form an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, then they had just opened one of the pathways to Extremity.","They had attained one of the Absolute Seeds of Extremity as it would accompany them in their Existence, with the absolute promise that so long as they didn't die, with enough time... they would achieve Extremity!","Extremity was an uncertainty with all beings, but those who had attained an Absolute Seed of Extremity only had the factor of time.","It meant that the being releasing this grand light of glory was guaranteed to reach Extremity in his lifetime!","But this wasn't all.","There was something that the Adjudicator of Dissolution held with much more importance when it came to Absolute Seeds of Extremity blooming within existences.","It meant...","\"He has a nearly guaranteed chance to attain that...\"","That.","She didn't state clearly what it was, but it was the decider between life and death.","It was something that Apex Aeonic Lifeforms or even those who had reached Extremity couldn't seek as they either had it, or they didn't!","Those who had it were the bastions and pillars of Extremity, and entities like her- an Adjudicator of a Haven... were in their positions to monitor things just like this.","To monitor the Extremity Sanctification and workings of Havens as they were here to rectify and","optimize the errors of previous Sanctifications in the first 6 Havens!","To ensure that the greatest possible number of beings reached the level of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform and for as many as possible to attain Extremity.","And the current situation fell in line with her duties.","She wanted to convey with this being right away to ready him for what was to come, but it wasn't entirely following procedure if she did so, so she would instead monitor.","When the time came where he reached Apexification, he would come to know!","BZZZT!","Arcs of light erupted around the barely discernible figure of the Adjudicator of Dissolution as around her, illusory screens of light showing some of the moving Dimensional Chassis and even","Reified Sources of Extremity- a particularly dominant being paying a closer look at the True Emperor of Quintessence as he appeared in her radar!"]},{"number":2423,"title":"Chapter 2423: Chapter 2422 An Absolute Seedof Extremity III","paragraphs":["Wrapped in Shadows, Grand Primeval Silas was instantly awoken as he stared towards 9 different directions blaring with glorious light.","An instant later, his figure shot out towards it as the feeling from his soul when it felt this light...it forced him to seek to understand the Source it came from!","He wasn't the only one as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in this region all scrambled to see what the source was.","Even further, those in the Domains of Noblesse, Quasarians, and Planeswalkers also moved towards the o blinding points of light as they had to affirm something!","This was the wildness caused by the advent of the Absolute Dynamis of Extremity- the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity!","So what boons did it provide the being who had actually forged it?","[The Essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity is cycling across your Aspects of Existence with every Quintessential Breath, forever altering your Aspects Of Existence]","[Your Foundation is proceeding towards your own unique type of Extremity Foundation with every cycle of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.]","[Your Second Plane of Extremity is devouring the grandeur of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity and expanding the 9 Major Dimensions.]","Such were the prompts passing over Noah's eyes as his main body cascaded with coral waves of light that enriched everything within the Infinite Plane in unfathomable ways.","He seemed like a radiant sun that others could stare at for too long as right in front of him, the figure of Aurelia gazed at his figure with utmost incredulity.","\"You actually...succeeded?\"","Her throat felt dry as she spoke, the visage of Orion also appearing near this region along with Dimensional Rulers, Noah's closest companions, and a few other prominent Vassals who could barely handle the pressing pressure.","He succeeded in something that actually caused Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to feel a sense of threat as what did this mean?","If he truly developed this Dynamis of Extremity to full convergence, would he actually be able to stand against Apex Aeonic Lifeforms?","ραndαsnοvεl.cοm The idea alone was enough to drive one mad as even in the wake of such a grand accomplishment, Noah couldn't share it joyfully as its boons were only continuing to open before his eyes!","[The Authority of Aeonic Anti-Mana is now possible through the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.]","Aeonic Anti-Mana!","A feature that was only just mentioned when the First Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity between Mana and Nullity formed, and it would have been accessible to Noah at 100% complete Convergence of that Dynamis!","Now that both Mana and Nullity were absorbed into the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity that entirely ate up the workings of the First Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity, this Authority was shockingly received before the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity was even fully converged.","Only at 25% Convergence, and it already granted the same authority as a Dynamis with the mixture of 2 Concepts of Extremity","But this wasn't all.","The prompts continued to come.","[The Authority of Aeonic Mana Drain is now possible through the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.]","[The path you walk on is unfathomable as it was able to produce the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, and it therefore cannot and should not be changed.]","[The path of others is predictable and mundane, and you can therefore manipulate its beginning and its end. Through the use of the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, the Feature of Realm Reconstruction is born]","Anti-Mana, Mana Drain, and Realm Reconstruction!","Realm Reconstruction!","Noah's eyes opened at such a grand proclamation as he put all other notifications on standby while focusing on this.","[Realm Reconstruction]:: An Ability brought to light through the essence of the Absolute Seed of Extremity- the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity. The essence of this Dynamis allows for you to bring an conclusion to the Realm of existences and offer them a new beginning- one that can be manipulated through your hands as you can extrapolate new stages of power or construct a route similar to what you followed. Nobody else will be able to replicate the Realm and path you are following, but a Lesser Realm Pathway of Quintessence can be chosen as the template for your targets to follow through your hands. You can reconstruct the Realm of Existences from beginning to the end that is only limited by your own equivalent stage of power, with your Convergence in the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity increasing the more beginnings and ends you experience with your own hands, along with your understanding of all concepts related to Extremity. The source of power for the Realm Reconstruction will be purely supplied by the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity as existences with reforged Realms will be on the path to attain a Lesser Indefatigable Foundation of Extremity or other Extremity Foundations depending on how you construct their Realm. Experience the beginning and the end, experience Extremity!","A grandiose feature that allowed Noah to do ridiculous things with the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity- something that wasn't directly affecting him, but through it... he would take even closer steps towards Extremity as he would experience the beginnings and ends of as many creatures as he performed it on.","This...was just one of the benefits of this Absolute Seed of Extremity!","What was the purpose of the Initiation Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution? All Reverends were fighting to achieve Extremity Panaceas that would grant them a profound Extremity Foundation that would aid them in smoothly undergoing Apexification!","Yet Noah's Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity...could restructure Realms as just one of its features, with the conclusion result being an Extremity Foundation.","What a magnificent Dynamis!","Truly an Absolute Seed of Extremity!","Seeing this ridiculous feature, Noah's heart couldn't sit still as while his body pulsed with the coral allure of grandeur, his eyes opened to gaze at the worried looks around him as he released a smile that caused all anxious expressions to fade.","He was gazing at all of them as he wanted to test out this feature right away, and for this...he needed the first test subject!"]},{"number":2424,"title":"Chapter 2424: Chapter 2423 An Absolute Seedof Extremity IV","paragraphs":["As the anxiety caused by the prior situation faded from their eyes, Noah looked through the masses around him as his eyes passed over Adelaide and Henry, past Barbatos and Kazuhiko, past Eowyn and the Dimensional Rulers...it passed over many beings as they came to stop on the First Spiritual Beast- the Emperor Penguin!","The golden eyes of this creature that pulsed with Providence shone as similar to the Reified Enders of Nature that were connected to the will of the Past Barren Lands that was now assimilated to the Infinite Plane, it was a Creature that was closely connected to the past Spiritual Land that the whole of Infinite Plane stemmed from.","It enjoyed similar boons as its Source could now be stirred with the Sources of the Natural Laws as it was painted gold with Providence.","Noah beckoned to this Spiritual Beast as it blinked and pointed its right flipper to itself, a nod of affirmation coming from Noah as the Emperor Penguin instantly turned into a streak","of light!","RAA!","With a glorious bellow, it appeared before Noah as its sleek fur released boundless luster and glory.","Noah looked at the Emperor Penguin alone as the shocked gazes of Aurelia, Orion, or any other beings were utterly ignored.","\"Do you trust me?\"","He spoke simply to the being bound to him before his eyes.","And the Emperor Penguin didn't even miss a beat as his golden beak nodded vehemently!","Noah's smile was brilliant at such a scene as he waved his hands and uttered out.","[Realm Reconstruction].","BZZT!","The pristine coral light of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity moved out like an endless time from Noah, merging around the Emperor Penguin as the body of this existence became crystalline, its Origin becoming apparent under Noah's eyes as the built up Origin of an Apocryphal Planar Haven made up of clusters of Grotto Havens...was caused to crumble in the next instant as gasps rang out in the surroundings.","The body of the Emperor Penguin had become crystalline as its Origin was clear, and everyone was able to see its Realm that some took millions or billions of years to forge...was utterly destroyed and taken away in an instant!","The Origin of the Emperor Penguin was ground down to nothing and brought to an end.","Under the astonished and shocked gazes of all beings, Noah felt the vibrant essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity leak from him and cradle the body of the Emperor Penguin.","No Instability occurred within its Aspects of Existence even though the soul and body seemed to lose a crucial part as they also became extremely weak!","And the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity that held Ruination, Apocalypse, and other concepts that could smoothly bring about an end became even stronger as the Realm of the Emperor Penguin was reversed to be so thin that one could barely sense its aura!","Its halcyon grandeur faded as its sleek fur seemed to lose light.","Its aura decayed to the extent that it became the weakest being in all of the Infinite Plane...holding a Rank never before seen due to just how powerful the atmospheric essence across the Infinite Plane was.","The Emperor Penguin emanated weak waves Of life at Rank F.","It was an astonishing scene to observe as an moment later...","THUMP!","Akin to the beating of a heart, the core of the Emperor Penguin lit up brightly as its Origin began to be reconstructed.","The same essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity that had destroyed everything it held now turned to express astonishing life force and an aura of beginning as the enacted core very quickly increased in concentration- Noah becoming entirely focused at this moment as he experienced the end, and he was now watching and even directing a new beginning!","A new Realm!","'At its core...let us have the essence of Primordiality.'","He began his experimentations as an abundant Life force erupted, the aura the Emperor Penguin expressed very quickly jumping from Rank F all the way to Rank S, and then instantly jumping across the stages of Epic, Legendary, Mythical, Phantasmal, Transcendent, Saint, Void, and Soul as its body became covered by a gorgeous milky white light!","Others were able to see this scene, but Noah experienced all of its minute variations as the life he lived seemed to flash before his eyes- as if he could see himself when he crossed these stages!","A light of profundity shone with his eyes as he observed the beginning of this pathway.","[Under the Influence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, you are observing a cycle of an end and a beginning. Your Convergence of this Dynamis increases slightly.]","Such a prompt flashed before his eyes as he continued.","Within the core of the Emperor Penguin, a Domain formed as it was filled with an overabundance of Primordiality.","When this process arrived, one could see the body and soul that housed this core begin to break down and change as an air of profound ancientness began to emanate from the weak body of the Emperor Penguin!","And from the constructed Domain...a World formed as the World Realm was reached in but an instant.","This World was then compressed and condensed into a star as the Emperor Penguin reached the Star Forging Realm, and not too long after...this star underwent controlled destruction and turned into countless dots of dust that formed into a Nebula!","A Nebula filled with dazzling miniature stars as vast as the grains of sand- and it still shone with abundant Primordiality!","Thereafter, Nebulae condensed to form supermassive black holes that then bloomed into Quasars- innumerable numbers of such stellar bodies coming into the picture as in no time... a dazzling milky white Galaxy formed.","RAA!","The Emperor Penguin roared out as his body and soul underwent fundamental changes while his Origin became something of an entirely different composition compared to before!","And from a single galaxy, countless more bloomed as a Galactic Filament was born, 100 Billion Galaxies quickly becoming exceeded until 1,000 Billion were reached. Noah's eyes released gorgeous grandeur as he watched all of these galaxies shine to form a Universal Seed that in the next instant...bloomed into a Universe.","And then like a chain reaction that was under his very fingertips, Noah watched this dazzling Origin go from a single Universe to a Universal Filament with a myriad of dazzling Universes...and these billions of Universes finally came together to form a single Cosmos.","The essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity nudged the process forward as Noah felt 25% of his total Aeonic Soul Values already be used up, watching as a single Cosmos became multiple and multiplied madly until they reached the critical point where normally, a Reality would form!","But...Noah didn't let the Cosmos fall under a Reality.","His eyes were bright as he spoke out.","\"Let the Cosmos be contained in a Plane...just one of the 9 future Planes.\"","He held 9 Dimensions when he was rising up as this was his uniqueness. Nobody else could replicate what he did as even this restructuring he was doing right now...the Realm he would produce here would be lesser than his grand Origin!","Even more Cosmos multiplied within the Origin of the Emperor Penguin as a thin Planar light wrapped around it, Noah's eyes shining as endless waves of the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity surged out from him like an endless sea.","\"The First Plane will take the nature of Gravitation...with the other 8 Planes corresponding to the other 8 Natural Laws. This shall be the basis of his Origin!\"","WAA!","9 Planes based on the workings of the 9 Natural Laws!","As soon as Noah laid this out, the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity erupted out madly and surged into the Origin of the Emperor Penguin to make this a reality, 9 interconnected circular rings forming around each other while countless Cosmos bloomed within them!","The Natural Laws were Natural Laws, but they were also expanded as Boundaries.","Within the Origin of the Emperor Penguin, the intense essence of concepts of Extremity bloomed as its body and soul burned with astonishing brilliance, a prompt rising before Noah's eyes at such a point as he came across his first achievement in Realm Reconstruction!","[You have opened the path of the Nine Natures Extremity Foundation]","Less than a minute had passed since he began the process of Realm Restructuring.","60% of his current Aeonic Soul Values were used up in order to provide the required potency of essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, but at the end of the process...he actually ended up opening a type of Extremity Foundation that should be the first of its kind in the Seven Aeonic Havens!"]},{"number":2425,"title":"Chapter 2425: Chapter 2424 An Absolute Seed Of Extremity! V","paragraphs":["For Apexification, others sought to build a stupendous foundation that would enable them to smoothly become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and not fail their advancement at such a juncture.","One of the more immaculate means to obtain a strong base lay in the procurement of Extremity Panaceas with the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification, such treasures allowing one to forge a type of Extremity Foundation as they only appeared as exclusivities across the Havens thereafter!","Yet Noah...he managed to forge a type of Extremity Foundation that should be the first of its kind in the Seven Aeonic Havens in less than a minute with his own efforts and capabilities that were only made possible by the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","RAA!","The Emperor Penguin roared out madly as droves of intense power coursed through it.","The Nine Natures Extremity Foundation!","This was the path that this being now walked on as his Origin held 9 rotating Planes of Existence that were each filled with the workings of the 9 Natural Laws of Reality that shone with a light of Extremity!","Among those watching this scene in shock, Orion and Aurelia understood intricacies more than most due to their domain as seeing the hint of Extremity blocking within this being's Origin after he was reduced to a state of nothing just seconds ago... they couldn't hide the shock in their eyes at the method that made it possible.","At the means of this being before them!","He had called out Realm Reconstruction before as he did so as was this the extent of what he could do?!","The answer was a resounding no.","BZZT!","The raging power within the body of the Emperor Penguin continued to torrential swirl as its flippers shone with crystalline black and gold grandeur, a multicolored stripe of 9 colors appeared behind its wide back and extended onto a halcyon beak!","It looked with immense fervor towards Noah who thrust his hand forward and continued to release the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","This was because of a particular passage in the description of [Realm Reconstruction].","[...You can reconstruct the Realm of Existences from beginning to the end that is only limited by your own equivalent stage of power, with your Convergence in the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity increasing the more beginnings and ends your experience with your own hands...]","It was only limited to his own equivalent stage of power.","This was how far he could take their cycles of beginning and end as even though it cost Noah greatly with over 60% of his total Aeonic Soul Values being utilized over half of this had already recovered in the past few seconds as his own Aspects of Existence were experiencing changes brought about from 2 fronts.","One was the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, and the other was every Breath he took from the Quintessential Breath of Extremity!","Since he had the means, he continued.","Trillions of Cosmos continued to bloom within the Origin of the Emperor Penguin as his Body and Soul reacted to these changes and became ever more exemplary!","The Essence of the 9 Boundaries of the past Natural Laws surged like tendrils of lightning on his very skin as in no time...","[The Nine Natures Extremity Foundation has been established in the First Spiritual Beast.]","[When all of the 9 Natures correlating to its Origin reach the 9th Boundary Layer and the 9 Planes of Nature reach complete saturation, the First Spiritual Beast can undergo Apexification with a 100% chance of raising to become an Apex Aeonic Lifeform with a Nine Natures Meridian Apex Aeonic Foundation. With such a foundation, the extrapolation of Dynamis of Extremity connected to the Nine Natures will be possible with relative ease, and if the Will of the Emperor Penguin carries even a trace of the Quintessence of its Master- it can try to bring together all Nine Natures to form an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.]","\"Ah...\"","This information flourished in Noah's mind.","The Emperor Penguin also understood as it couldn't help but exclaim!","Noah had the pathway to the Nine Natures Extremity Foundation opened before, but he continued further and established it entirely as the moment the Emperor Penguin's Origin reached full saturation along with the Nine Boundaries reaching the 9th Boundary Layer, it could begin his raising its level towards that of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","This wasn't to mention the fact that a pathway for a Second Absolute Dynamis of Extremity was shown!","This was something for Noah to also put together, but just the formation of a single Absolute Dynamis of Extremity had already taken up every space within his Soul as his 'Breadth' wasn't even sufficient for it before and was one of the reasons for the Quintessential Instability.","His Aspects of Existence were being stretched out and strengthened now to handle the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity that hadn't even reached 100% Convergence as it would only get more powerful, and after it was fully established with Noah's Aspects of Existence being elevated to even greater heights...he should be able to form another Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","BZZZT!","Arcs of grandeur buzzed around the Emperor Penguin as from afar, the Wills of the Reverend Emperors from the Lernaean Lineage finally arrived in this area to also observe this grand occasion as their souls stirred.","When they watched the figure of the Emperor Penguin, they felt great pressure as among Reverend Emperors, it could truly be considered Unequaled!","Its power exceeded beings like Rosalind from the Cult of Endless Shadows as the pressure emanating from the Emperor Penguin was akin to some of the more powerful Scions of the ancient Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity.","When the strength of its soul reached greater heights and its proficiency in Boundaries increased...it would no doubt exceed even these Scions as it had already created its Extremity Foundation and simply waited for its completion and saturation!","\"Do you know what to do?\"","Noah's voice was resonant as he spoke, the Emperor Penguin nodding its beak as dazzling Crimson III Aeonic Pearls of Extremity flowed towards it.","\"Yes, Master!\"","A radiant stripe of nine colors radiated grandeur on its back as it rose and connected to its beak, the First Spiritual Beast becoming one of the most powerful combatants in the Infinite Plane in an instant after this Realm Reconstruction!"]},{"number":2426,"title":"Chapter 2426: Chapter 2425 An Absolute Seed Of Extremity! VI","paragraphs":["Through the single Realm Reconstruction he utilized on the Emperor Penguin, Noah increased his rate of Convergence in the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity while also opening a pathway for a second Absolute Dynamis of Extremity in the future.","This was the boon of Realm Reconstruction as even though he would not and should not alter his own Realm, altering the Realms of others and experiencing cycles of beginnings and ends aided him greatly towards his own path!","It meant many more experimentations were in order as when he rebuilt Origins, he could test different Essences and structures to act as the base as what if instead of 9 Planes correlating to the Natural Laws, what if he restructured an Origin to be made of Planes correlating to the 6 Fundamental Natural Laws? Or even combinations of different concepts of Extremity?","He could establish multiple Extremity Foundations and even gain possible epiphanies into forming more Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as the possibilities were endless!","\"Let's see...\"","Around the beings gathered here gazing towards him, Noah's Will swept out again even as the vast majority continued to stare in shock, with the figure of Aurelia recovering first as her voice echoed out.","\"You can't just do that without explaining anything...how many concepts did you converge to make a Dynamis that terrifying? Hey, Hey!\"","She spoke freely as Noah didn't answer her, his eyes having caught onto a figure that caused his eyes to light up with interest as he was an interesting test subject!","SHAA!","His hand beckoned forward as from the back of the hundreds of prominent beings gathered here, the Soul Clone of the being that had been managing the quintillions of Lernaeans was pushed forward.","His body came to the spotlight as his eyes kept in their somberness and shock, the past Interim Aeonic Lernaean Lineage Emperor appearing as it was Maximilian!","A being that had failed Apexification.","A being who was forever closed off to the grandeur of Extremity.","\"You wouldn't...\" Orion's voice came out in utter disbelief and shock as he and Aurelia were the first to catch on to what Noah was trying to do.","And Noah himself...he pulled upon the Fealty that Maximilian had sworn before he devoured the Abecedarian Sacrarium as he exerting pressure on the Aeonic Soul before him, pulling its main body that was traveling with the main bodies of Orion, Aurelia, and Lucia among others since they left the Lernaean Domain!","BZZT!","A spatial vortex formed as he easily pulled the main body out through the connection with its Soul- causing it to appear in the Infinite Plane right before his eyes as an instant later...his finger tapped out again.","...!","A coral colored light shone.","It blazed around Noah's figure like burning flames of utter regality as while adorned in his Emperor's Robes, he seemed like an ancient celestial that was picking and choosing minor existences to experiment on for his own purposes!","The tap of his finger released a vibrant light of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity that came to focus on the main body of Maximilian as it invaded his Origin, and a moment later...","ραndαsnοvεl.cοm CRACK!","The Apocryphal Planar Haven he had shattered. The twisted and fractured Meridians he had tried to enact during a failed Apexification...they also destroyed as his Realm began to experience an apocalypse and deteriorate!","All the way...to a barely discernible whisper of life force at Rank F.","...!","The scene was incredulous as even the Aeonic Souls of the 2 Apex Aeonic Lifeforms here had no more words.","Because thereafter, a scene that had just occurred began to repeat again as an Origin reformed and began to rise across the stages of power.","\"Genesis shall be the base of the initial Origin...and you shall also have the Nine Natures Extremity Foundation.\"","WAA!","He made this process go extremely quickly as he didn't try too different of a recipe for this, with his goal affirming something utterly disastrous.","The reality that he ended the Origin of an existence that had failed Apexification.","An existence that was denied Extremity!","And thereafter, he began their Origin anew and even set them on a path of an Extremity Foundation as when Maximilian sought Apexification again...he would have a 100% chance of success!","He...was reversing the very workings of Extremity and the consequences of failed ascensions!","It was so shocking that the being this was all centered around had tears form in his eyes when he felt his reconstructed Origin, tears that formed into stellar rivers as he gazed towards the True Emperor of Quintessence doing all this with utmost reverence that he didn't even look towards Orion or Aurelia with.","And when the Origin of Maximilian formed 9 Planes and the route of a Nine Natures Extremity Foundation opened for him...","HOONG!","Wild waves of Extremity erupted around Noah's visage as notifications rose in waves.","[You have succeeded in doing the impossible!]","[Under the Influence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, you overcame the reality of an Existence that reached their Absolute End.]","...!","An existence that had reached their Absolute End! One who could never even have the hope of achieving Extremity in their lifetime!","Noah reversed such a reality through nothing other than the Absolute Dynamis of Extremity","The thing considered an Absolute Seed of Extremity- the Indefatigable Dynamis!","[You have reversed an Absolute End and gone further to open up a new beginning that guarantees the targeted existence exceeding their prior accomplishments. Your Convergence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity increases greatly.]","[Your achievements are being Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.]","[Your Authority as a Quintessential Aeonic Curator has Quintessentially risen.]","His achievements continued to climb as it became abundantly clear...this stage of combining concepts of Extremity held too much in store.","The abilities and potential alone held glorious hints of Extremity itself.","And all this...merely stemmed from a lesser than half formed Absolute Seed of Extremity.","What would Noah be capable of doing when this seed flourished?","What would happen when he actually achieved Extremity?!","...!","The answer was disastrous enough to make his name feared across the Seven Aeonic Havens in the very near future!"]},{"number":2427,"title":"Chapter 2427: Chapter 2426 A Deadly Scheme! I","paragraphs":["[Your Authority as a Quintessential Aeonic Curator has Quintessentially risen.]","ραndαsnοvεl.cοm [Your Authority as a Quintessential Aeonic Curator...]","The prompt repeated a few times before Noah as the overabundance of cherry colored essence swirled around him.","The very essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity moved from him and entrenched itself into Maximilian as he established the Nine Natures Extremity Foundation similar to the Emperor Penguin, the visage of Maximilian shaking as he radiated grandeur and power!","He seemed to emanate the majesty of an Emperor as his hair had changed to contain 9 streaks of colors matching his Nine Natures Extremity Foundation, his eyes now swirling with multicolored light as even with all this grandeur that he gave off...","His visage came to kneel on the vibrant space they were in as the tears in his eyes remained.","\"You have done the unimaginable for me. Mere words cannot show my appreciation, but...I wholeheartedly give you all of my Aspects of Existence. Whatever your will is, I shall carry it out!\"","WAA!","The tears in his eyes showed the unimaginable happiness at literally having the whole direction of his life flipped around, the gaze he looked towards Noah with being one that not even the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms ever received!","Noah nodded towards Maximilian with a smile as he then looked around him once more.","The gazes of all beings here were expectant and excited as Noah looked towards them and the now quiet Soul Clones of Orion and Aurelia as he spoke grandly.","\"In the bounds of Extremity, anything is possible.\"","The cherry essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity coiled around him like an indomitable snake as he continued.","\"In a short two days, the Lernaean Domains are on the way to be assimilated into the Infinite Plane as even this accomplishment...is a small one in the expanse of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, much less in all of Extremity\"","\"You all are about to receive an overhaul of your strength as I will reconstruct you into something even grander, so if you wish to give back...then bring to my feet the rest of the Domains within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.\"","WAA!","\"Whether it is the domains of Noblesse, Quasarians, or Planeswalkers...so long as you can use your power to Conquer them under the banner of the Quintessential Kainos Emperor, you have done your part!\"","Wild essence buzzed as while he spoke, the very concentration of energy in the surroundings changed with every breath.","The beings before him felt their blood surging as Katelyn, Eowyn, Henry, Kazuhiko, Barbatos...a great number of beings connected to him became even more firm in their resolve as they made promises to themselves.","\"Strength is relative.\"","His figure floated above the beings here as stellar cherry tendrils of light formed beneath his feet like coiling rivers, the grandeur of Extremity they emanated making him feel like an ancient Emperor addressing his subjects!","\"I may seem strong now, and you may look at those who have achieved the level of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms or even the prized Extremity as if they are immovable and unending...but even they die.\"","...!","\"So do not take these levels of power and attaining them to mean that we are invincible. There are unknown enemies out there butchering even those who have reached Extremity...so do not be complacent.\"","The Quintessential Kainos Emperor addressed his people as their Wills buzzed powerfully in response, his grand figure gazing towards them as he waved his hand to call forth an illusory blinding scroll of light.","\"Now, as part of restructuring your strength...let me show you all how to breathe Quintessence.\"","WAA!","Intent on understanding as much as he could about the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, Noah also pulled out the means of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity as alongside the goal of utilizing Realm Reconstruction on all prominent beings here- he would have them live and breathe Quintessence as he would Forge existences for surpassing even the Scions he was now facing in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands!","---","Within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Two points of blinding light surged towards the region of the Ancestral Lernaeans that had coral colored points of light bloom- lights that made any other Dynamis of Extremity shudder as the vast majority of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms had to go towards it to see!","It meant that something profound had happened within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, or a particularly powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms had entered this Haven that they now had to be careful of.","Either way, they had to see.","But the moment these points of light crossed into the Lernaean Domains...","BZZZT!","A hazy veil of light simmering with Extremity rose as it came with a single message.","[Turn back.]","...!","A message that caused the two lights comprising of two Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to come to a halt!","After all, it carried with it the undeniable will of Extremity.","It didn't just appear before their eyes, but it appeared simultaneously before the figures of all Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that were seeking the origin of the oppressive Dynamis of Extremity!","\"The hell? Why would something like this require the intervention of the Judge of Dissolution?\"","A feminine voice filled with distaste and exasperation rang out as it was an exquisite humanoid figure of a Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeform with glowing obsidian skin that was covered by a tight black body suit that mapped out every glorious curvature of her figure. Dark hair draped past her shoulders to finish off her entire black attire as her beauty was utterly cosmic.","The man beside her gazed forward curiously at their advancement being stopped as he replied with caution.","\"The Judge would only interfere when called upon to make an Oath, or if any fights arise with multiple Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, or if a lesser life form is involved against an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.\"","\"Hmph, these were the changes of the birth of a Essence of Extremity with multiple concepts. What reason would there be for us to be stopped when we can even grasp something out of seeing its formation? For it to come from the Lernaean lands also concerns me...\"","The female Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeform spat out her words as from her expression, one could sense great exasperation and callousness!"]},{"number":2428,"title":"Chapter 2428: Chapter 2427 A Deadly Scheme! II","paragraphs":["\"...For it to come from the Lernaean lands also bothers me...\"","Her last words were said with distaste as both she and the man beside her turned around to return to their domains.","Having received the command of someone that had reached Extremity, they of course wouldn't even dare of going against it!","The calculative man beside this exceedingly beautiful Noblesse replied while the void buzzed around him.","\"Euryale...your frustration with the Lernaeans stems from their troops capturing over a dozen of our domains?\"","\"Hmph, fucking opportunistic rats is what they are,\" Euryale replied with sharp eyes as she continued.","\"Our strongest contenders are sent to the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands for the purposes of Extremity Sanctification, and they use this time to send their forces to our weakened domains. What's even more distasteful is that somehow, the Eyes of that holier-than-thou Genesis seem to have shifted hands from our people and onto the commander leading the Lernaean forces.\"","As she spoke, her hands waved before them to reveal the image of a devilishly handsome young man with hair shining blue and black, his body surrounded by the light of wondrous Boundaries- this figure being none other than the Son of the True Emperor of Quintessence.","\"And for them to be using multiple Consummate Boundaries, of course our unprepared troops would fall to them. It seems the Cult of Endless Shadows reached out to them far earlier and gave them the boons we're just now grasping from the Genesis Institute of Extremity.\"","The Cult of Endless Shadows had their influence fall on the Lernaeans as the Noblesse accepted the alliance with the Genesis Institute of Extremity!","The Planeswalkers had the Light of the Seven as their backing, and the Quasarians were likely to ally with the Singularity Overseers.","Euryale's dark pupils shone with malice as they returned to the Noblesse Domains, passing through the ones currently under occupation by Lernaeans as she spoke coldly.","\"And for us to even be denied entry into Lernaean lands by the Extremity Adjudicator...its only just pushed me to carry out the plan I told you.\"","WAA!","Her words caused the man beside her to turn towards her with surprise as he shook his head while releasing calmer words out of the two.","\"It may not be so wise, especially when Extremity Sanctification is just beginning in our Haven with multiple forces coming in. The Adjudicator is especially perceptive at a time like this to make sure that no regulations are being broken.\"","...!","\"My dear Brother Richard...what I plan to do will not break any regulations. But I do want it to send a very clear message to the Lernaeans for them to not overstep their Boundaries. I plan to simply attack a part of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform that is being used to unfairly dominate our Noblesse Reverends. Of course, the impact of attacks of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform can very easily carry over to the being holding the part of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform and those around him as these...will just be unintended casualties.\"","BOOM!","Her words were utterly deadly as she smiled with cruelty when she spoke!","She knew very well their position as for the past years, their forces were using the eyes of the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeform they dug out for the purposes of treasure seeking.","They just didn't expect them to be taken back and fused into another Lernaean Lifeform seamlessly as at this point...she could act in a gray area!","She had immense frustrations from sitting back and dealing with the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Genesis Institute of Extremity coming in while they kept their prideful dispositions and distaste while talking to the Noblesse, and she had even more frustrations from seeing the domains of Noblesse be taken over one after another.","Being stopped by the Adjudicator from even entering Lernaean lands tipped her over the edge as something she had only thought of before...she wanted to put it into action now!","Yet beside her, Richard sighed while he rubbed his obsidian temples.","\"Euryale...this whole thing just carries an unnecessary risk with very little rewards. All of those Lernaeans seem to be moving with clones as even if you reach their main bodies with your attack- the strongest commanders will likely have Apex Aeonic Lifeforms protecting their main bodies. Especially this boy that has the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform. And if you do manage to kill all of their Aspects of Existence entirely...you will then earn the disfavor of the Adjudicator of Dissolution for breaking regulations. At the very least, you may be forced to accept multiple Golden Haven Albatrosses or even an Obsidian Haven Albatross. At worst, you may be forced to take a Crimson Haven Albatross that even those who have reached Extremity can find peril with, if not being confined for a few million years.\"","His voice tried to be one of reason as there were too many things at stake.","Even the Culmination Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution may begin anytime within the next 100 years- and this would be a stage where Apex Aeonic Lifeforms can fight for opportunities to reach Extremity!","Why risk all this just for a single action?","Euryale smiled at such a thought as she turned towards Richard.","\"You know me. Have I always been reasonable when it comes to my anger?\"","...!","The Apex Aeonic Lifeform opposite to her didn't reply as he instead looked past the Noblesse territories passing below them while sighing.","\"And since I will be attacking the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, I'll only get a slap on the wrist for the casualties around it. A Golden Haven Albatross or two at most...it doesn't really matter. But because of this, I want to ensure that my actions don't go to waste. I want to ensure that when I do make the move, it will be my strongest possible attack and that little rat leading the Lernaeans and those around him receive permanent demise without question. Let's see what the prophetic potential tells me...\"","...!","A dazzling verdant white light shone from her dark eyes as she focused on the illusory image of Henry before her.","An instant later, her brows rose as she smiled with brutality.","\"You were right, if I were to attack now, the essence of the prophetic potential of Extremity tells me that the aura of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform is near him as they may be able to react to save his main body and a few others. I want their deaths to be certainties...so I will wait for the Prognostic Dynamis to tell me when the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms are furthest from the main bodies of these rats. Thereafter...ah, I relish thinking of their despair! Let's see if they dare to make a move for the Noblesse Domains then!\"","WAA!","Brutal! Callous!","A deadly set of words erupted from her as Richard remained entirely silent!"]},{"number":2429,"title":"Chapter 2429: Chapter 2428 I Love Making Enemies! I","paragraphs":["Richard remained silent for a little while as he stared at the face of callousness and cruelty before he asked.","\"And if the Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms come to seek retribution and seek war?\"","\"Haha, spark an Apex War over a lesser lifeform? Doubtful. But even if they do, then what? You know how much Apex Aeonic Lifeforms are valued. Before we kill too many of them, the Adjudicator of Dissolution would likely intervene and stop the conflict. We may have one or two casualties on our side as to erase the power of one of the Lineages vying for hegemony here...it's a worthy enough cost. I don't much care if the casualties are Irena and Gakus who were acting like the dogs of the Genesis Institute of Extremity already to get in their good shoes.\"","...!","An Apex War!","Apex Aeonic Lifeforms represented a grand power across the Havens as they were treasured, with fights to the death frowned upon as the goal was to grow as many Apex Aeonic Lifeforms across the Seven Aeonic Havens.","But there were times when irreconcilable differences occurred, and a certain War could be waged.","A War between two sides where the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms fought for supremacy.","An Apex War!","The radiant obsidian skin of Euryale and Richard shone brightly as each one had their own thoughts.","The latter thought of the consequences of all this while the former...","The Essence of the Prognostic Dynamis of Extremity shone brightly in her eyes as she waited.","She waited for the most opportune time to make a move and strike at the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform attached to a lesser lifeform...eradicating this being's Clone and the main body wherever it was hidden!","Her Dynamis of Extremity would ensure so!","Her eyes held a vile and twisted sense of power as even after living for millions or billions of years, the base nature of some beings never changed.","If cruelty and unreasonableness were ingrained in their minds, they wouldn't so easily fade away in time.","And so, an utterly unreasonable Apex Aeonic Lifeform set her eyes on the visage of Henry Osmont and the Vassals following him as the fallout to come from the actions she wanted to commit was unknown!","---","Within the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","Colossal obelisks floated in the vibrant space as titanic Leviathans of Dissolution stood imposingly above them- every single one lying in front of the path leading towards the Crimson Extremity Panacea blooming in the distance!","Scions of extremely powerful Inheritances moved around with intent and purpose as among the most powerful, their bodies buzzed with unique circulation methods as Boundary Essences surged around them with purpose and glory!","The visage of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity remained stellar as his cosmic purple blue humanoid form gained a hint of coral colored grandeur, the essence of Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity seemingly adding its color to his stellar humanoid form as he stared towards the laid back figure of Erikson.","Of the Scion stemming from the Sima Clan who just extended an invitation!","So he replied calmly and with grandiosity.","\"I don't know much about the Sima Clan to decide whether it is worthy of having someone like me.\"","...!","Words that drew sharp breaths for those spreading their Wills here to listen!","These words even caused the Scions adorned in suits behind Master Erikson to squint their eyes sharply while Erikson himself...smiled and laughed boisterously.","\"Haha, with guts to say things like that, you're fit to join the Sima Clan. Since you didn't give me a straight answer, I'll assume you aren't thinking of joining factions right now or you're holding back since you aren't yet aware of what it truly means to join a Hegemony like the Sima Clan. How about we have a friendly competition for the First Extremity Panacea over there? I'll get to show you what SIMA means as whether I win it or you win it, you can make your decision then.\"","WAA!","His words were those of grandeur and confidence.","Even after seeing the light radiating from Noah's body that explicitly showed a high tier Dynamis of Extremity, Erikson was actually not fearful as he proposed a amicable competition!","The eyes consisted of spinning Infinite singularities within Noah's blank face twisted into a devilish smile as he replied.","\"I don't normally have amicable competitions. Anyone I compete with for anything normally ends up devoured by me to lay the stones of my foundation.\"","...!","When he fought or competed against others, it was mainly enemies who in the end would grant Loot!","\"Well...\" Yet towards his words, Erikson pointed freely in the distance as he also smiled calmly.","\"...I'm sure those guys in the distance will be enough for you to devour and remain happy for now. What will it be?\"","A Scion of the Sima Clan extended a proposal as after the curiosity of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity was piqued, he waved his hand while nodding and reading the waves of Providence and Destiny!","\"Then let me see the caliber of Scions who sit above normal Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity.\"","\"Mmm, good. Let's go!\"","The Scions adorned in suits behind him faded and moved out of the way as the astounding countenance of Erikson shot out like a bullet, a blinding light shining from Noah's Reified Source of Quintessence as he also disappeared!","Around this same time, the voice of Ayame rang out across this space.","\"You two seem to think you're the only powerful ones here...\"","BZZZT!","Her figure also shot out like a blazing sun as from multiple other directions, potent auras far exceeding the norms of Reverend Emperors appeared one after another to prove themselves!","In the distance, the words uttered by Noah and Erikson were picked up on by Phos and the few hundred Scions surrounding Noah's 8 other Reified Sources of Extremity.","Phos's expression was unpleasant as the runic magic circle below his feet radiated even deadlier light as his voice echoed out towards Noah's different forms that had begun to be wrapped with an incandescent coral colored light.","\"You're obviously someone with status belongings to an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity, are you sure you should be making enemies with this many Scions of multiple Inheritances? Can you manage the stress that shall be pressing down on you and your people?!\""]},{"number":2430,"title":"Chapter 2430: Chapter 2429 I Love Making Enemies! II","paragraphs":["\"... Can you handle the pressure that shall be pressing down on you and your people?!\"","...!","Phos questioned whether this being truly wanted an all out war when they could all be focusing on procuring Extremity Panaceas!","Yet the form of Noah sitting on an Apocalyptic war horse stepped forward and spoke with a cold smile.","\"I love making enemies.\"","WAA","It was the Harbinger of Entropy- Bellicus!","He carried the devilish looks of Noah's main body along with swirling waves of Entropy as he continued, the reified forms of the Arcane Haven Source Engine, The Apocalyptic Haven Dragon of Ruin, The Nullified Phoenix of Cataclysm, The Dreamer of Extremity, The Aeonic Demon Emperor of Destruction, The Aeonic Cache Bringer, and The Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity all stood beside him with glorious waves of power- each one expressing Noah's soul and will through their own extremes!","\"I love making enemies so much that I even treat my enemies better than my friends, after all...my enemies are kind enough to give me loot!\"","...!","His demeanor was imposing as he didn't take a step back, those facing him realizing this fully as Phos' expression hardened.","He was Phos of the Extremity of Light from the Aeonic Haven of Helios.","Magic circles constantly rotated around his body, his hair shining with a stellar white and blue luster as he was someone of great standing!","For his own pride and to stand for the honor of the name of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity, he had chosen to stand against this being and teach him a lesson.","But this was before learning that this being was one that had already managed to step on the path of forming a Dynamis of Extremity with multiple concepts within it!","The pressure he felt from the essence that seemed to go from a light crimson to coral to cherry red felt the same as what a select few Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in his Extremity of Light gave off.","Since he was a being with such an identity, Phos had tried to back off just now!","But this being was unreasonable. Even when others gave him a step back, he didn't do the same as he barreled towards conflict with a hundred more steps.","So he voiced out to those he had garnered the support of around him.","\"Extremity Panaceas have begun to bloom as this fiend lies before us to purposefully stop our advancement. Go all out and let's wrap this up quickly!\"","WAA!","In the surroundings, dozens of Sources of light glimmered as the bodies of the Scions stemming from Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity buzzed with grandeur, each one using their own unique Circulation Modus Operandi to churn their Boundaries across their bodies and achieve a terrific effect of power!","Phos and the other Scions from the Extremity of Light did the same as their bodies became covered by a hazy cerulean gold light, each of them achieving a state of [Superluminal] speed as facing off against any other Scions, they were a force to fear.","Yet the 8 Reified Sources of Extremity before them also erupted at this moment as the Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity that represented the Boundary of Blood stepped forth beside Bellicus, his image being that of an existence that all Vampyres revere and tremble as his mere presence as silver hair dripped past his shoulders!","An illusory endless sea of blood could be seen in his eyes and stretched out behind him as he seemed like a more refined and slender visage of Noah, his silver strands of hair that seemed like silver rivers of reality vibrating as he spoke with a devilish smile.","\"You call that the circulation of Boundaries?\"","...!","A question that caused an awe inspiring foreboding sense to descend.","As the Scions of various Inheritances circulated their Boundary Essences, Noah gazed at them with cold disdain as he spoke out grandly.","\"This...is the circulation of Boundaries!\"","THUMP!","His devilishly handsome face exhaled in as all those here felt like they heard the beating of an ancient drum.","His chest then expanded as he...breathed in. And the moment he did so, everything went haywire!","BZZZT!","Torrential waves of essence in the surroundings were seemingly pulled towards the Reified Sources of Blood as he wasn't alone, all 8 of Noah's Reified Sources here breathing in Quintessentially as it seemed all concepts of Extremity were flowing towards them.","Even the circulating essence within the bodies of the Scions was disrupted and brought to a halt as their methods of circulation were affected and superseded, a decent number of skins turning red and spitting out crimson gold blood from the mere aftershock of his breath!","Of Noah simply breathing!","His 8 Reified bodies then released incandescent glows as even if one took the strength of the aura of a Dynamis of Extremity swirling around him, the way his body hummed from the circulation of more than a dozen Boundaries released a pressure multiple levels more than any of the Scions surrounding him.","\"...\"","A heavy silence briefly descended before soon after...","\"Oh, fuck this.\"","Those in the periphery of forces surrounding Noah had their senses buzz as some retracted standing up for the name of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity and began pulling back.","Many beings here had their pride and arrogance as they would stand for the name of their Inheritances, but when seeing the mere breathing of the Entity they surrounded throw the whole surroundings into chaos and even suppress their own circulation methods?","Some instantly knew to take a step back!","Yet at such a juncture...","\"Now is no time to regret the choices already made.\"","The figure of the Dreamer of Extremity- Noah's Reified Source of Dreams uttered out grandly as he was decorated in sandy gold robes- an immaculate reality of Dreams forming around him as to his left, The Reified Sources of Ruin- The Apocalyptic Haven Dragon of Ruin, spoke next while releasing a cherry colored light that was mixed with an immense shadow of darkness.","\"Now is the time for you all to hold on tightly to your destiny... and make sure that it is not brought to an untimely end.\"","...!","[Aeonic Anti-Mana].","HOOONG!","A hint of crimson.","A hint of white.","A hint of blue.","A hint of immense darkness...all mixed in and burst outwards into a realm that covered all the enemies near Noah!","Anti-Mana.","What Noah would've been able to utilize fully at 100% Convergence of the First Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity.","What attained before even a quarter of the Convergence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity was completed!","What exactly did it entail?","A glimpse of a single sentence within its description predicted the terrors to come.","[Aeonic Anti-Mana]...The complete deniability of the workings of Reality...","...!"]},{"number":2431,"title":"Chapter 2431: Chapter 2430 The Dread Of Anti-Mana! I","paragraphs":["[Aeonic Anti-Mana]: Born from a collection of beginnings and ends, this feature is usable with the essence of Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity. It requires a large amount of Aeonic Soul Values to activate, with the cost increasing based on the area this skill covers, and an even larger quantity to keep active- with the required value varying until the full quantification of the boons of the Quintessential Breath of Extremity are obtained in regards to resource regeneration. The feature of Anti-Mana stands for the complete deniability of the workings of Reality. Over the area it covers, the very essence of reality is denied as the targets contained within face non-existence. The very makeup of the fabric of Reality is denied as targets cannot comprehend space, time, essence, and all other factors that make up reality as if they spend enough time in an area of Anti-Mana, their very existence may be denied. In such an area absent of reality, only the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity can lead the way forward. Only the Absolute Seed of Extremity can show the way forward!","...!","Yes.","The description of Anti-Mana was utterly disastrous as its usage was also quite costly!","And something that had to be done for Noah to fully grasp just how draining this feature would be on his soul, he had to also acclimate with the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi.","The description of the First Volume of this Extremity Circulation method was not fully completed as Noah had to find out its boons for himself, where on top of the birth of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity through it, there was also the factor of how greatly his Aspects of Existence were affected as the rate his Soul Values recovered was substantial with every breath he now took!","And this was exactly the time for experimentation in all fields.","What did Anti-Mana promise?","Deniability from Reality! In the expanded dense field of Anti- Mana, Noah wanted to experience what his enemies felt as with just his Reified Source of Dreams...he recalled the essence of Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","He recalled it as an instant later...","An immense and confounding darkness covered his Reified Source of Dreams!","A darkness so heavy that in less than a nanosecond, the Reified Source of Dreams erupted with the essence of Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity as his golden tinted face was dark and somber.","\"Well, shit...\"","In just the span of less than a nanosecond, this portion of Noah's will didn't wish to be in the effects of Anti-Mana any longer as they were just that dreadful!","No sense of time or space.","No spatial awareness.","His Reified Source of Dreams...couldn't even feel the core circulating across its body as Noah had to forcefully cause the essence of Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity to erupt from its origin through the connection of his soul!","It felt entirely disagreeable to him as the caster, so just how dreadful was the feeling for his enemies?","---","Phos' figure was covered by a superluminal light when the darkness mixed with the magnificence of red, white, and blue surged out at a speed that came to instantly cover everything nearby.","At a speed that seemed faster than his superluminal light speed!","But he knew it wasn't faster- it was simply the authority of the Dynamis of Extremity exceeding most others here as this was the reason for his speed being overcome.","But even this darkness...would not be able to hold him.","OOOH!","He roared out and crushed multiple Apex Aeonic Soul Totems on his body as dazzling grandeur of power erupted from his body just as the enveloping darkness wrapped all around him!","And...","'Huh?'","His mind buzzed as the lights of the Apex Aeonic Soul Totems he just sent out seemed to entirely disappear as he couldn't feel them anymore.","The dozens of Scions behind him and around him from the Extremity of Light and the dozens more behind him...also all disappeared before his gaze and will!","'What is this...'","His expression changed as he truly couldn't see anything!","It felt like he was in a void of nothingness as all of sudden, he felt the Superluminal Circulation Modus Operandi he was utilizing begin to falter as the 9 Boundary Essences he was flowing to grant him immense strength also began to falter.","And the moment this small weakness appeared...a cherry colored magnificence flashed from the darkness and silently wrapped around him as in the next instant...","'Huh?'","He couldn't feel the core of the Boundaries he always controlled.","His soul then buzzed as he realized...he couldn't even feel...his own body!","Nor could he feel his Origin.","Even though his soul should have been entirely assimilated into all of his Aspects of Existence, he actually couldn't feel his body and origin at this moment!","A sense of apprehension began to rise in his soul as he tried to send his will out.","And...nothing.","No reaction.","Immense darkness.","No source of light.","There seemed to be nothing around him as there was also immense and absolute silence!","'How can it be so silent?'","This thought came down dreadfully as Phos didn't like that he had fallen under his enemy's attack for this long!","In this period of time, his enemy could have attacked his body or even held his defenseless Aspects of Existence hostage.","\"Time...' When Phos thought of this, his soul further felt a rising sense of dread as he realized he couldn't tell how much time had passed.","A nanosecond? A millisecond? Less than that? Or more?","Phos couldn't tell as he utterly felt nothing!","Only darkness surrounded him.","He felt like a small minuscule grain of sand floating in this darkness as nothing about him could be felt!","In such a situation, his soul felt an increasing sense of dread as he wanted to bellow out that he had made a mistake and that his Aeonic Inheritance would pay any price to settle this misunderstanding.","But there was no voice.","He had no voice, no feeling, no hearing- nothing! He didn't even know if he was floating up or down, or if he was even floating at all!"]},{"number":2432,"title":"Chapter 2432: Chapter 2431 The Dread Of Anti-Mana! II","paragraphs":["The sense of dread that Phos felt only grew as at this moment, he began to feel the soul that he was thinking with...a sliver of it began to be eaten away and disappear.","He wanted to reach out and defend, but he couldn't even feel any essence or even rouse any part of his soul!","The dread only increased.","'I was wrong...'","He couldn't bellow out, so he spoke within his soul as loudly as he could in hopes of the other side hearing his words.","But there was no reply. The dread in his soul grew as Phis once more realized he didn't know how much time had passed.","He only wondered in the darkness as he began to count the seconds.","'10...1,000...1 Million...'","He tried to steer his soul in any direction as he truly couldn't feel anything!","He continued to count down the seconds.","He counted until a whole day passed.","'Is he just keeping us all hostage? He can keep the skill up for this long?\"","The dread in Phos' heart only increased as he continued to count!","A week passed.","The dread entirely gave way to fear.","A year passed.","At this point, Phos' soul was numb as more and more slivers were lost, with the constant nothingness around him having nearly driven him crazy as other Reverends...he felt like they wouldn't have even lasted a day!","But his soul was strong, so he continued to count.","A hundred years passed.","Fear and paranoia filled Phos' soul as it didn't make sense anymore.","No being should be able to cast an ability like this for such a long time!","Did it mess with his sense of time? If it could block away even sensation and vision, maybe the time he felt wasn't entirely correct?","But... Phos had been counting the seconds this whole time as he shouldn't be wrong.","If he waited long enough, he would be able to overcome this!","A thousand years passed.","'Did he take our bodies and keep them locked in a domain this whole time, never fully waking us up?'","The dread in Phos's soul began to give way to countless possibilities and paranoia.","Ten thousand years passed.","This...was far more than Phos had lived his entire lifetime.","A million years passed.","Phos could barely think anymore.","His soul felt empty as countless slivers had left him.","Despair filled his heart.","Immense regret filled every part of his soul as every now and then, he screamed out hoping the other side could hear him!","A hundred million years passed.","They had to have passed...after all, he was counting this whole time.","'Let's see, where was I? Ah...'","At this moment, he lost count.","His soul was blank.","He felt like...there was not a sliver of it remaining that could be filled away.","He felt nothing.","Absolutely and utterly nothing.","'If only...'","In the last million years, this thought had begun to repeat over and over again.","After another million years, he couldn't think anymore.","The complete blankness and nothing around him...he felt like he was ground down and becoming a part of it.","And the moment he had this thought...","The thought process of the one known as Phos ceased to exist.","Any sliver of Existence entirely disappeared!","---","Noah's soul felt a great strain as just with the passing of a few nanoseconds, he felt like his soul was churning like an engine and had nearly every part of its soul values squeezed dry!","He recalled the cast Anti-Mana in just a few nanoseconds after its effects came down.","He didn't need to keep it active any longer- and he couldn't bear the cost to keep it active any longer!","But the crux of it was that he didn't need to. Because for the enemies within the affected area...","The receding darkness showed their fates as even Noah was stunned at what had occurred in the span of 5-8 nanoseconds since he cast [Aeonic Anti-Mana]!","There were a few hundred Scions of Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity that were covered by the wide domain of Anti-Mana to the extent where Noah was able to spread it.","Each of them had their own unique Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi and multiple tools like Aeonic Soul Totems!","Yet at this moment...their figures couldn't be seen.","The only thing the Wills of all Reverends here stared at in complete shock and grimness was a collection of radiant dust.","Glimmering stellar dust.","This was all that remained.","This was all that was there to show evidence that a few hundred Scions were just surrounding the 8 Reified Sources of Extremity!","And before Noah's will...","[The Sources of 327 Zenith Boundary Expansion Realm Existences have been absorbed into your Origin and turned into Aeonic Loot Light of Quintessence.]","[Aeonic Loot Light of Quintessence can be exchanged for different sets of loot of your choosing.]","Prompts cascaded down as the only thing prevalent was immense silence.","Those in the surroundings felt their souls buzzing in complete shock at the reality that had just occurred, with any Scion nearby very quickly pulling away from the region Noah's Reified Source of Extremity were in as their faces held utmost caution!","And how could they not hold caution?!","They had just witnessed hundreds of Scions unimaginably destroyed within a span of mere nanoseconds- and it had happened in such an inexplicable way as even now, they didn't know how it was possible.","It could only be attributed to his frightening Dynamis of Extremity that caused even the Scion of the Sima Clan to invite him!","The frightening Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity that gave way freely to Anti-Mana, a dreadful capability that denied the very fabric of Reality.","To those affected- unless they had a strong Dynamis of Extremity to defend their souls or another means to replicate something like a Dynamis with the same level of power...their only fate would be turning into nothingness!","To them, a single nanosecond may have felt like a million years.","To them, time itself held no value as they could undergo the decomposition of trillions of years being broken down by the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity...in less than a nanosecond!"]},{"number":2433,"title":"Chapter 2433: Chapter 2432 Fiend! I","paragraphs":["The feature that Noah had ushered forth was truly enough for one to earnestly call it dreadful!","And if its display had given even him a shock, what of the masses watching this?","All the Scions near Noah moved away as a deafening silence descended.","The action that was just carried out was a heavy one, an impossible one, and a dreadful one as it carried too many implications!","A myriad of beings had vastly different reactions- the most common one being great caution as in the far distance, even some of the powerful lights surging in the same direction as Noah's Quintessential Emperor of Extremity paused and increased their distances from Noah!","This was how off balance everyone was from a single move that he made!","Yet...there were also those that didn't change their path and even though they showed shock and amazement, fear did not show on their faces.","Ayame of the Infinite Extremity was one of them.","The other was Erikson of the Sima Clan as his wide visage actually drew closer to Noah, his boisterous voice ringing out as he moved across space in his beach attire!","\"Another bold action that many here cannot even perform, nor would they even dare to! What is the name of the Dynamis you have forged that has made such a thing possible?\"","Instead of feeling even a sense of fear, this being maintained his carefree demeanor as Noah's stellar gaze had its curiosity roused for the secrets of this being and what gave them such a high level of confidence, his gaze straight towards the Crimson Extremity Panaceas that was surrounded by massive Leviathans of Dissolution as he spoke out a single word with clarity.","\"Indefatigable!\"","WAA!","The word caused an eruption of cherry colored essence around him that reminded others very quickly of the actions around the 8 Reified Sources of Extremity in the distance, the Scions near this part of Noah's body moving even further back!","Yet the visage of Erikson who heard this word smiled as he repeated it to himself.","\"Indefatigable...\"","A strong name.","An immovable distinction!","Erikson very much liked this word as he nodded, appreciating this being before him even more as now, he was even more befitting to join the Sima Clan!","As for why he wasn't fearful of a being who could erase a few hundred Scions in a matter of nanoseconds?","This was due to his own power as like the rare few Entities that beings spoke about in hushed tones...he was someone whose very soul was warped under the light of Extremity as one of his many identities was that of a being with a Mutated Soul!","A mutation...was what he initially thought of this part of him, but his distinguished teacher within the Sima Clan had told him to look at it as an early variation of Extremity.","As something that he could fully attain in the future that would allow him to do unimaginable things.","So he at times considered himself a Mutated Entity, and at times did not as everything was ultimately part of Extremity!","But this mutation...had granted him a reality altering capability that was the core reason for him being where he was today.","Something that he termed over his lifetime as...Aeonic Probability Distortion.","The utilization of his Aeonic Soul Values to quite literally distort the probabilities of the very structure of Reality.","An example was the Scion who had chosen to attack him a little bit earlier that he had turned into a crushed pulp with a wave of his hand.","The likelihood of extinguishing the very Aspects of Existence of that Scion with a mere wave of his hands without any input of abilities or essence was 0%.","So he simply distorted this probability...to 100%.","Against an enemy whose Aeonic Soul Values were much lesser than his, barely a shred of anything was used up from his soul as he waved his hands and achieved this probability.","The likelihood of attaining a Dynamis of Extremity before Apexification was less than .01%.","With his current soul strength, he was able to tweak this likelihood of such a reality to 75% as while the many Consummate Boundary Essences circulated across his body, he could feel a Convergence of Boundaries being forcefully put together to follow this increased probability!","The likelihood of him forging an Extremity Foundation even without an Extremity Panacea that was less than 1%...he could also distort this as he didn't even truly need the Extremity Panaceas here!","This was his power that caused the Elders of the Sima Clan to favor him and allow him to do what he wished all these years, attaining resources that others couldn't even imagine.","He could use this reality altering capability actively or passively as one of the few passive distorted probabilities was the fact that...there was a 0% chance for his defenses to be penetrated by any outside sources of essence at all times.","Distorting such a likelihood took over a fourth of his Aeonic Soul Values out of circulation to always keep it active, but it granted him an immense level of confidence and protection as this probability would not be altered until every part of his soul was used up!","So even though this being displayed inexplicable means with his Dynamis of Extremity...Erikson still trusted in his capability to distort the very Probabilities of Reality as the things he had shown...were only the tip of the iceberg!","So his figure continued towards the Crimson Extremity Panaceas as he thought about how to distort reality to recruit this unique existence before him...","As for the 8 beings in the center of stellar dust all around them...","Nobody dared to even direct their hostility towards these 8 Reified Sources of Extremity after what a single one of them had just done.","Grimness filled the space with floating obelisks as the dense silence became even more firm, with it seeming that nobody would truly dare to show any sense of hostility towards these beings after this!","But...even in a field of geniuses, there would always be an idiot or two."]},{"number":2434,"title":"Chapter 2434: Chapter 2433 Fiend! II","paragraphs":["In the far distance while surrounded by over a dozen other white robed Scions, a woman with a sharp gaze and languid eyes was the first one to speak amidst a deafening silence as her expression was grim.","\"You may be a Scion of some great Unknown Inheritance...but you still cannot take such an action of eradicating the Scions of multiple Inheritances!\"","...!","One could see utmost caution and alarm in her eyes, and yet this woman still seemingly forced herself to speak as if it was her duty.","She was from one of the allied Inheritances of the Extremity of Light.","An Inheritance only slightly below the Clans like Sima! She was a Scion of the Church of Perpetual Light!","Even though she felt the sense of wildness and unprecedented danger from this being, it was her duty as a member of the Church of Perpetual Light to point out the grave wrongs others committed- no matter how powerful they may be!","Her fair face filled with utmost beauty shone with brilliance as stellar white strands of hair cascaded down, her pink lips moving once more amidst the stern silence.","\"We are all competing for the grandeur of Extremity as we know conflict is unavoidable, but all Inheritances know that within our competition, we do not seek lethality! Killing others is frowned upon as killing hundreds of Scions that are potential war forces who are bound to become Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and future experts grasping Extremity...this in itself is a grave sin!\"","WAA!","Her white hair gave off a glorious radiance as her eyes shone with righteous light, her courage rising amidst the continued silence as she felt the agreement from all Scions watching this from afar.","\"Inherently, we are all allies here seeking Extremity to fight a common enemy. With your Origins and power, you should know this full well. What you have just done is make great enemies out of every Inheritance that you just erased a part of their forces- simply breeding hostility and disharmony. Cease any more of this conflict and be ready to reimburse the involved Inheritances as in the end...none of us benefit from these deaths amongst each other.\"","When there was a much greater enemy, why would they resort to killing each other so freely?!","Her words seemed to resonate with the other Scions of the Church of Perpetual Light as an instant after, a reply came from the being she addressed.","\"Then, while surrounded by hundreds of Scions intent on killing me, I should've just silently died and not fought back?\"","...!","The calm voice filled with royalty and grandeur rang out as it caused the Scion of the Church of Perpetual Light to become entirely ashen- and this was because she heard this voice right beside her ears!","BZZZT!","Noah's Dreamer of Extremity suddenly appeared behind this Scion as fair hands tinted with the majesty of Dreams was bathed with the cherry light of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","His hand snaked forth like a pillar of cataclysm as the body of this Scions erupted with multiple lights of Aeonic Soul Totems, her body inherently circulating her boundaries as those around her instantly attacked while pulling back!","Yet...","CRACK!","The barriers of defenses that contained hints of the majesty of even Apex Aeonic Lifeforms through Totems were broken down one after another as if they didn't exist, the Scion bellowing out once she felt unmatched danger as she used the point of impact to allow her body to be shot backwards like a cannonball!","She breathed haggardly as she looked towards the figure who didn't even gaze at the attacks swarming towards him from other scions of the Church of Perpetual Light, her eyes turning utterly furious as she bellowed out once more.","\"Cease your actions! There is no reality where you make any permanent gains here- only enemies! If you continue, none of us will even have to lift a hand before you will be struck down by the very Adjudicator of this Haven!\"","...!","Her eyes carried a light of defiance as she was ready to crush more Apex Aeonic Soul Totems while keeping her gaze on the Dreamer of Extremity, but she once more heard a voice right beside her ears that caused the color to drain from her face.","\"I would like to see who can even try to stop me.\"","WAA!","Before she could even turn, the wide hands of Noah's Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity smashed onto her head and titled it unnaturally, his jaws opening as white gold canines with extremely sharp points sank towards her neck- all defenses being eradicated instantly as crimson gold blood overflowed!","The body of the Scion from the Church of Perpetual Light then convulsed as a crimson singularity of light boomed from her body, her clear eyes becoming veiled in a hazy crimson light as when the Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity lifted his fangs from her fair neck- a grand feeling of potency emanated from her as she instantly got on her knees while bowing towards the devilish figure of Noah.","\"Forgive me for my words, Master.\"","...!","On her forehead, a deeply crimson Infinity symbol bloomed to life as the Reified Source of Blood showed off a portion of its current capabilities- forcefully dominating the blood and soul of its target!","Outcries emanated out from the nearby Scions of the Church of Perpetual Light at such a scene as a dense number of Boundaries were circulated, the light of dozens of Aeonic Soul Totems being crushed blooming as aside from Noah's Dreamer of Extremity and the Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity, the Arcane Haven Source Engine, Nullified Phoenix of Cataclysm, and the other remaining Reified Sources of Extremity moved with their bodies tinted by the cherry colored light of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity- their voices ringing out in unison!","\"I remember all those who encircled me ready to attack, even those on the fringes that have now retreated. Once they pay the price of placing their hostility on me...my work is done. Those who opt to defend or fight for them...you can only join them on the path they have chosen!\"","...!"]},{"number":2435,"title":"Chapter 2435: Chapter 2434 Fiend! III","paragraphs":["A scramble.","This was the most apt description after Noah's words that he remembered those who had surrounded him and anyone who defended them would join his list!","Those who had the intent to attack and even those who managed to throw out attacks that were swallowed up by Anti-Mana knew who they were as they didn't wish to face thus being- each of them rushing towards the most powerful clusters of Scions to seek safety in numbers and those with much greater status.","And in the midst of all this, Noah's Reified Sources of Extremity moved across the battlefield- with the glimmer of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity being something that even these Scions who circulated multiple Boundary Essences couldn't handle.","After all, such a thing was commonly found on powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms! Unless they had a similar to it or uniqueness of a different form- denying its effects was an impossibility!","So when the Nullified Phoenix of Cataclysm released glacial typhoons of Nullity or the Mysterious Sanctuary Power Mechanism spat out a sea of cerulean singularities pulsing with a cherry light at their very center...","\"Ah...\"","\"No!\"","Their defenses could not last for longer than a Nanosecond as they perished!","It was to the extent that a sense of deep apprehension and even a sliver of fear began to appear within those scrambling away.","It was to the extent that one of the few remaining Scions from the Church of Perpetual Light bellowed out while his figure remained a streak that ran away in the distance.","\"Stop this wanton killing! Nothing is gained from this!\"","A call to stop this fight for retribution!","But when Phos garnered hundreds of Scions to surround Noah, had anyone screamed for it to stop?","Not a single being did!","So Noah himself...he didn't stop.","Until those that had surrounded him were returned their hostility in kind, he couldn't stop!","It was to the extent that those who earned his gaze shot backwards with utter grimness as they gritted their teeth and bellowed out.","\"Fiend! Do you know how many enemies you are maki-!\"","BOOM!","The core of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity smashed down from Noah's Aeonic Cache Bringer as this voice was silenced an instant after.","But it didn't take long for others to bellow out with regret and unwillingness as Noah's 8 Reified Sources of Extremity moved across the massive obelisks to hunt down all those that had encircled him before.","\"Fiend!\"","The shouts rose like a cacophony.","\"One that doesn't see reason!\"","And the bellows only increased in volume.","\"Fiend!\"","The voices continued to rise and drone outwards as it got to the point that even truly powerful Reverends from the most powerful of Heritages frowned.","Off in the far distance, near the cluster of Scions who were about to come in contact with the Leviathans of Dissolution that were seemingly guarding the First Panacea to bloom.","The figure of Ayame frowned as her will felt the chaos and true deaths occurring behind her, her clear eyes going towards Noah as she knew a bit more things than others regarding the delicate situation of Inheritances, their purpose, and what each Scion here stood for!","Blood must be repaid with blood as she understood where he was coming from, but this scale of wiping out Scions of multiple Aeonic Heritages of Extremity?","It wouldn't end at just this as thinking about the distinctiveness of this being, her gaze focused on the one holding the stellar form not too far from her.","And she then sent a mental message that only he would be able to hear.","\"You're in the right for seeking retribution, but the deaths of this many Scions are not something that will simply be swept under the rug. You may want to take a step back after already killing so many.\"","...!","Her words were those of caution as she was very familiar with how Heritages worked!","And for them to have entire groups of their Scions erased...they truly would not be able to sit still.","Yet towards her words, Ayame felt a reply filled with conviction and grander reverberate in her soul as Noah's figure of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity only glanced at her once.","\"I bear the weight of all my choices. Whether it is the death of one Scion or Hundreds that stood against me, I will never falter because of any consequences that would arise from it!\"","WAA!","His heart was clear as his soul was resolute!","No matter what their background was.","No matter who stood behind them.","No matter the rules that others imposed!","The True Emperor of Quintessence would move according to his own will as he would not fear the Wills of others!","Ayame heard his reply clearly while her body began to blaze like a burning sun, a massive Leviathan of Dissolution appearing before her as they began to move- her horn radiating grandeur Noah's words resonated in her mind...","---","Across the stretches of spacetime.","Across the very layers of Havens!","Within the Haven of Genesis, Penumbra, Helios...the myriad of the Seven Aeonic Havens that had their Heritages send Scions to seek Extremity through Sanctification in the Haven of Dissolution.","Across these pristine lands that were all past the Initiation Step and the Culmination Step of the Extremity Sanctification, the Supreme Eon Creatures across multiple Heritages tracking the Scions they sent out found themselves rising up in perplexity and anger as the Soul Medallions of their geniuses were shattering one after another.","The Genesis Institute of Extremity, the Extremity of Light, the Church of Perpetual Light...","These and many more inheritances found great oddity in the fact that either a large percentage of their Scions were eradicated at once, and some inheritances even felt the destruction of the Souls of all of their Scions occur!","It was a maddening reality to come across as in the Church of Perpetual Light within the Haven of Helios.","In the vast stretches of a golden sky, a crystalline domain the size of hundreds of Major Planes of Existence floated grandly as it seemed all Source of light was converging around it- the grandeur of Extremity shining all of it as it was unknown how many Supreme Eon Creatures were here- much less how many of them had achieved Extremity!"]},{"number":2436,"title":"Chapter 2436: Chapter 2435 Fiend! IV","paragraphs":["At this moment, within the depths of this crystalline-bordered domain floating in an endless stretch of skies...the Wills of multiple Apex Aeonic Lifeforms came together as they faced an unprecedented situation, a light source shooting from them and alerting the Extremities of Light as it sought justice.","[Sirs...our Scions are being eradicated en masse in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution as it cannot be the work of any tools of Dissolution- we seek understanding and accountability on how all of this was allowed to happen!]","...!","The mass deaths of their Scions within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","How could this occur when everything was supposed to be under the gaze of a being more powerful than all of them?!","Such complaints arose within the Church of Perpetual Light as their true sources of power were alerted, and such a scene repeated across over a few dozen Inheritances as the Esteemed Extremities of these massive hegemonies were called upon to rectify and understand how such a thing was allowed to happen!","---","Within an immaculate and veiled domain that very few beings could access in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","An existence that seeped the very pure essence of Extremity from every breath she took could be seen as her veiled visage could not hide the frown she currently had!","This was because within the space she was in, there were tens of thousands of screens showing different things, with a few illusory screens magnified and made bigger as they revealed the happenings around the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Her frown was caused by nothing else other than the events blooming on some of the magnified screens perpetrated by a single being!","Because of his actions, there was a buzz of Extremity around this being as a bubble with a trace of soul power appeared from it, a voice coming out from the other side.","[O Adjudicator of Dissolution. How is the Sanctification of Dissolution proceeding?]","The voice was deep and filled with the grandeur of Extremity as not too long after it rose, another bubble with a trace of a soul popped as another voice rang out.","[Esteemed Svetlana, were there new surprises we did not know of in the Extremity Sanctification of the Last Haven?]","...!","Messages of Existences pulsing with Extremity began to pour in one after another as each of them were very nicely contrived- not a single one actually mentioning anything regarding the events that had happened as those that had reached Extremity...held deep respect towards each other!","Not a single being reaching out towards the Adjudicator of Dissolution voiced out their words that brought into question her authority or what she was doing, and they merely asked what was happening and whether the Initiation Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution was very different from those of other Havens.","But the reason they reached out was clear as at this moment, the Adjudicator of Dissolution sighed while her hand moved.","It released a wondrous glow of Extremity that sank down into a void of nothingness!","This glow traversed extremely far distances as it sank into an Abyss, stretching past storms of Nullity and Ruin until it reached...a raging battlefield that held Scions of powerful Inheritances that had a small portion trying to escape from the grips of a being they were calling a Fiend!","And at this moment, this glow of Extremity descended as in the region where this battle was taking place- where some Scions were escaping while 8 Reified Sources of Extremity were chasing and destroying anything on their path... everything came to a stop.","All moments.","All circulation of essence.","It was extremely eerie and unique as when such a thing happened, joy actually rose in the eyes of the frozen Scions as they also breathed sighs of relief!","Some even thought inwardly...","'Good!'","'Finally!'","\"The Fiend shall pay!'","Relief and joy erupted out from the frozen Scions as in the regions unaffected by this clustered battle, the eyes of beings like Ayame, Erikson, and Atlas frowned while they surged towards the First Extremity Panacea as if this didn't concern them.","Their Wills were also on the figure of Noah's Quintessential Emperor of Extremity who continued forward just like them in this affected region, his body only gazing back at the frozen battlefield from afar as his eyes shone sharply!","---","In the domains of the Lernaeans, above a sandy-filled sky that held a plane of Existence below.","Noah's Avalon Dimensional Chassis was about to begin the process of devouring one of the last remaining Lernaean Domains when a glow of Extremity descended and instantly washed over his visage, his figure disappearing an instant later as he felt an undeniable Will wrap around everything!","This will took him across space and time as he very quickly found himself in a region of nothingness.","Not the nothingness his Aeonin Anti-Mana could call forth, but a different sense of nothingness as he could feel space around him, but it seemed like there was nothing else as this space stretched out endlessly to the point that even his Will could not see its end.","In such a place, a source of light unfolded and brightened up everything as the aura alone was suffocating and encompassing at the same time.","It caused his soul to buzz as he knew he could not currently resist this aura, but there was also an unknown pull that made his soul want to bow in reverence!","When his Tyrannical nature felt such emotions, his Haki flowed as the very aura of Quintessence flowed over him- his head remaining straight as he gazed towards the being before him with Clarity.","An Entity that had far surpassed the stage of Boundary Expansion Realm.","An Entity that had expanded a concept...until it reached its Extreme.","Such a being presented herself before him as Noah had only seen a glimpse of her hand when Caesar was taken away!","Pure Extremity flourished from her body as Noah felt his Boundaries dance around madly, seemingly gazing up at where they sought to be.","The being was hidden entirely in black as even the veil could not hide the unimaginable beauty beneath it, her voice magnetic as it seemed to be coming from all sides.","[Noah Osmont, it was not the time for you and I to meet.]","WAA!","In the midst of a chaotic situation, one of Noah's bodies came face to face with an Existence that had long since attained Extremity!"]},{"number":2437,"title":"Chapter 2437: Chapter 2436 Is That How It Works? I","paragraphs":["A sense of mystery and grandeur.","A sense of her visage being larger than the very reality itself as the aura she gave off was enough to bring any Reverend to their knees, and yet Noah calmly gazed at this veiled being as his tyrannical soul fought off any feelings of reverence trying to bloom!","His Lineage would not allow for such a thing!","A regal purple light covered his Avalon Dimensional Chassis as he replied in a tone that was nowhere close to servile.","\"You are right. It is not time for you and I to meet. I should not be here in this space with you, nor should my other bodies be frozen and stopped on the path they were on in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands. And yet here we are.\"","...!","These words were said with a straight face as even before a being as pristine as her, the back of the True Emperor of Quintessence didn't bend!","Even though his words may have great repercussions, he still spoke as he did.","And the veiled existence seeping Extremity before him...didn't reveal any emotions as the space of nothingness they were in was fully filled with light with a wave of her hands.","Her voice then came from all sides like before as it seemed to have entirely ignored Noah's words.","[Do you know what the most critical thing is when it comes to attaining Extremity?]","WAA!","A grand question emanated out as Noah's Boundaries pulsed at the mere words, the figure of the Esteemed Extremity before Noah raising her fair correct hand and forming a fist as she continued!","[It is confidence. The type of confidence dwelling deep within one's soul as they have a type of certainty that no matter how long it would take...they would inevitably achieve Extremity. To be certain of Extremity when one isn't even close to it. This...is the most crucial thing as if one ever had even a sliver of doubt in their heart, Extremity would forever be from their reach.]","\"...\"","Confidence.","The certainty deep within one's soul that they would reach Extremity!","When it came to Noah himself...it was never a question in his mind whether he would attain Extremity or not.","He knew that it was something he would attain sooner rather than later as when it came to these words from this veiled existence before him, he did not disagree!","Her hand unfurled at this moment as Noah felt as if her gaze fully settled on him.","[This is why whenever I meet Supreme Aeonic Lifeforms who stand tall and speak freely with confidence before me. I do not knock them down or force them to speak subserviently. So I will not do that to you either. Because in the end, it is a benefit to us all- to all the Races and Creeds of the Seven Aeonic Havens...whenever a new Esteemed Extremity enters our ranks.]","Her words seemed like the vocals of a celestial being that nobody should get the honor of listening to, Noah's Boundaries resonating with the voice of this being as his body seemed to want to pull itself towards the same state of Extremity that she had attained!","Yet towards these dazzling words, Noah's soul held strong as he replied sharply.","\"That's why I'm here? To benefit the countless races of the Seven Aeonic Havens by not killing those who had the intent to kill me?\"","He was brought here as the whole region of the battlefield where his 8 Reified Sources of Extremity moved was frozen!","For the Adjudicator of Dissolution to intervene...it showed that they truly took their laws with utmost severity.","The veiled Esteemed Extremity once more didn't directly reply to his question as she spoke at her own pace calmly.","[Out of the many beings who undergo Apexification, a few will achieve Extremity. But it is always just a chance as normally, there are no certainties. But you...you have that certainty. You have an Absolute Seed of Extremity as frankly, I favor you more than the Descendants whose fates and achievements are unknown. But still...I do have to follow the Investiture of Extremity that was adopted by all races after the Extremity Sanctification of the Aeonic Haven of Genesis.]","Investiture of Extremity!","A set of rules and regulations...but also an ordination and pathway towards Extremity.","This was what all beings followed and what Esteemed Extremities enforced!","It was what made the Adjudicator of Dissolution gaze at Noah","[Let the current feud go, and I will not involve myself in any feuds that arise thereafter. You were unknown before as pride and arrogance bred conflict. You're known now as if others still seek you for conflict, it is within your right to do what you wish. For someone who has already attained an Absolute Seed of Extremity, I can make a few exceptions for you. If you craving for enemies you devour...at the very least achieve Apexification. If you have already attained 'that' by then, I will allow you to shoulder an Albatross that will take you across enemies that you can consume endlessly.]","WAA!","The Esteemed Extremity spoke as it felt like she was asking something...but it also felt like she was stating it as it was not something that could be denied!","Her words also contained a myriad of mysteries as Noah unpacked them slowly while continuing to benefit from the mere closeness of the vibe of Extremity that every single one of his cells sought to attain.","\"So there are a great deal of enemies that unite all the beings in the Aeonic Havens of Extremity against them. The myriad of Heritages and their Descendants can have conflict as if hundreds of them surround a single being to kill, it is not worthy of intervention. After all, what is a single being in the expanse of Extremity? But if those hundreds begin to be butchered, intervention is required correct away to save such a set of trash who can never amount to anything. Is that how it works?\"","WAA!"]},{"number":2438,"title":"Chapter 2438: Chapter 2437 Is That How It Works? II","paragraphs":["Noah's tone was truly lacking in reverence that should be shown towards an Esteemed Extremity as he spoke, this veiled Existence maintaining her grandeur as she replied calmly.","[Normally, the lives of the many stand above the few. You are an exception to this as a being with an Absolute Seed of Extremity sits above thousands of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, not to mention a few hundred lesser Lifeforms. I had no need to intervene when you were surrounded as I did not fear a holder of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity to be bullied by mere Scions. I just didn't account for your retaliation to be so heavy and thorough. Sweep it all under the expanse of stars for now. Let this feud be over as if you undergo Apexification and attain 'that', I will give you enemies to fight until you beg for it to stop.]","...!","The Esteemed Extremity did not express any emotions of anger as she once more stated what Noah needed to do! And she stated that if he sought enemies, he would have access to so many until he begged no more after his Apexification.","After he attained...that.","His eyes were sharp as his Will covered his Avalon Dimensional Chassis, his feet wanting to take a step towards the Esteemed Extremity before him boldly but he found...that he was rooted to the ground without being able to move even a single step!","She seemed too far away even though she was right before his eyes.","She was everything that the concepts in his soul sought to achieve as even though he tried, he truly couldn't take a single step closer towards the vibrant essence of Extremity that was strengthening his Aspects of Existence just from being near it!","He was trying to get ever closer because of the prompts that rose before his eyes.","[Your Aeonic Soul is exposed to an Entity that is emanating waves of pure Extremity!]","[The pure waves of Extremity in your surroundings is very conducive to the rate of Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity!]","[The pure waves of Extremity in your surroundings are hungrily devoured into your atoms with every breath as an extremely long exposure will only take you closer towards Extremity!]","Anything that had attained Extremity was something that held a gravitational pull towards all others who had not, Noah feeling his Aeonic Soul Values spiking as because of this meeting, he wanted to have the journey towards the Cult of Endless Shadows in the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra as soon as possible for him to grasp the Armament of Extremity.","BZZZT!","The light of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity shone below his feet as he still tried to take a step closer towards Extremity, his breaths Quintessential and resonating with his main body in the Infinite Plane!","\"That. You keep mentioning that if I attain 'that' after Apexification, I can bear the weight of an Albatross. What is 'that'?\"","His eyes were bright as he peered through the veils of secrecy, merging the memories of the few hundred Scions from the Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity with what he heard now.","[It is something that cannot be sought after or attained just because someone wishes. We've long theorized that it is something hidden within the Soul that even we cannot fully fathom.]","As she spoke, her fair hands waved as an illusory scene of trillions of singularities bloomed all around them. Each of them shone with the grandeur of a Soul as they represented an unknown number of beings across the expanse of Extremity!","[Think of it as simple as a type of authority or a state of being. When one attains Extremity, the transformation of their soul will manifest it. Less commonly, some unique beings who have only undergone Apexification are also able to manifest it. It is something that is critical in facing the adversaries outside the bounds of space, time, and reality itself. Enemies who look upon the Souls of those who have reached Extremity as if they are potent Panaceas for them to devour...and they easily succeed in doing so as even those who have attained Extremity but do not have 'that' authority- they would have to put everything on the line simply to survive an encounter with them.]","...!","Words that were more and more grave by the second emanated out as Noah couldn't help but repeat them with a pondering expression!","\"Enemies living outside of space and time...\"","Around him, the trillions of illusory souls represented as singularities only had a barely discernible portion light up brightly- a portion yesterday seemed far insignificant compared to just how many souls there were!","[Even now, we only possess a small number of beings with 'that'. We've found over the years which types of beings are likely or guaranteed to have it early, with existences who have Mutated Aspects of Being being one, and another is those who have managed to forge an Absolute Seed of Extremity. For someone like you who managed to achieve an Absolute Seed of Extremity, you will join the ranks of the few fighters we have who will awaken 'that'. It's guaranteed when you reach Extremity, but if you are even more extraordinary and awaken it after Apexification, then you will be able to survive just being near our enemies by meeting the requirements of being able to survive outside the bounds space, time, and even reality itself.]","...!","The words of the Esteemed Extremity before Noah caused his mind to buzz as while countless thoughts swirled, one came to the forefront!","Listening to her words, Noah couldn't help but think of the feeling his Reified Source of Extremity felt within the field of Aeonic Anti-Mana.","The feeling that Phos and the others felt as they were denied of the very reality, space, and time around them!","Was being able to survive in such an environment...a part of the power that the Adjudicator of Dissolution mentioned?!","Anti-Mana stemmed from the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, which was an Absolute Seed of Extremity that this existence before him uttered was one of the guarantors of having 'that' power when one reached Extremity.","The power of Anti-Mana was already this tremendous when the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity was only over a fourth completed in its Convergence.","But it was what this feature was able to call forth that made Noah connect a few thoughts and possibilities!","Even though he may not be correct, he wanted to pursue it.","Because apparently, there were adversaries who lived and thrived outside of the bounds of space, time, and reality itself! Yet when Noah experienced it for the span of a shred of an instant, he had to use the connection of the Reified Source of Extremity with his main body to call out the Indefatigable Essence to defend himself as this was the key!","The very Seed of Extremity was the key.","But if it wasn't just his clone or Reified Source that was in a space outside the bounds of space, time, and reality itself. If his main body and everything about him was in this space as he was cut off from accessing the very Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity...how would he survive?","\"...\"","His soul buzzed with grandeur and possibilities.","He knew that he had to work to achieve what 'that' was and brand it into his very Aspects of Existence- where even if he couldn't access a shred of essence, he would be able to traverse freely outside the bounds of space, time, and the very reality itself!"]},{"number":2439,"title":"Chapter 2439: Chapter 2438 Bask In Extremity! I","paragraphs":["Against enemies that lived outside the bounds of space, time, and reality itself- something fantastical was required!","One couldn't even fathom how powerful such beings were as if even time was not something that bound them, just how powerful could they grow to be? The few seconds passing right now which bound Noah and all others under the expanse of Extremity could be akin to millions or trillions of years, or maybe an extended thread of an instant that never passed for them.","\"...\"","The whole thing was simply too abstruse to even fully comprehend as one had to make sure their understanding of it all was not filled with falsehood!","\"An authority to live outside of time...good!\"","He spoke these words to himself as the veiled Extremity before him continued to release an air of glory.","[I'll take this as your agreement to drop the feud. The next time we meet will be when you have undergone Apexification as we will see whether you have attained 'that'. The full picture will also be revealed to you according to the Investiture of Extremity...]","Her words that were akin to a symphony of excellence rang out, the potent aura of Extremity she emanated beginning to fade as Noah's Soul felt like it was being deprived of a source that was greatly boosting his power!","So his eyes flashed sharply as he asked quizzically.","\"Say, do you want anything? Anything that I can give?\"","...!","Did the Esteemed Extremity want anything? Such a question arose from Noah as it was an incredulous one to hear!","But he had to ask as he continued to see dazzling prompts while his soul exponentially surged upwards in power.","[The pure waves of Extremity in your surroundings are hungrily devoured into your atoms with every breath...]","He was breathing in Extremity.","He did not want such a boost to fade away so quickly!","But...what could a being who had not even achieved Apexification give to someone as Esteemed as her?","What could someone who had reached Extremity give to someone who was nowhere close?","The veiled existence before Noah had her voice emanate from all around once more as she replied.","[You can grant me nothing other than becoming a powerful combatant in the future who has attained 'that' as soon as possible.]","WAA!","It was clarified as Noah smiled at such an answer and nodded.","\"Right? You say that you favor me because I have attained the Absolute Seed of Extremity and that Extremity itself is guaranteed for me, and I would have 'that' which is crucial to fight the Unknown enemies. If you truly want to produce such an expert from me, and in a relatively short period of time, nothing helps me more than being close to a pure aura of Extremity. If you want me to very quickly join the ranks of those who bear the weight of an Albatross, you just need to keep me around you while I cultivate and ponder Extremity.\"","...!","BOOOM!","\"It doesn't take anything away from your grandeur, I would just leave one of my bodies wherever you are, and you can contribute to this grand mission of the Aeonic Havens of Extremity to produce a powerful being much faster.\"","Shocking words left his mouth naively as Noah's aim was made apparent!","He wanted to continue inhaling in the greatness of Extremity as the pristine existence before him could not have her emotions read- her words being the only thing to go by as they resounded again.","[You ask for something that you would obtain if you joined an Aeonic Inheritance or something like the Sima Clan. Every few years, their Disciples are able to listen to the lessons of their Esteemed Extremities as the even more prized Disciples are allowed to stay near their abodes to vibrate with the pure essence of Extremity. If you wish for this, simply accept the invitations from the Cult of Endless Shadows or the Sima Clan.]","The nature of Inheritances and their structure was laid out as Noah nodded freely while still pressing forward.","\"And which Inheritance or Clan are you a part of? I'm content cultivating around you for now as apart from this helping achieve the quick rise of an expert with an Absolute Seed of Extremity, I will go further and say that I will take on the weight of an Albatross as the price.\"","...!","[Oh?] Even though she was veiled, Noah felt like he could feel her lips curving up into a smile as his soul buzzed with power- the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity burning around the edges of his skin as he still couldn't take any step closer to her!","\"Yes. This should also be something you want seeing as how it is the cost for making an Oath of Extremity and how it is something forced on all Apex Aeonic Lifeforms routinely. I will accept the weight of a Golden Haven Albatross for let's say... every month that I cultivate near you?\"","His eyes shone with power and ingenuity as he gazed forward.","This grand opportunity was something that wasn't even known or even a possibility moments ago, but the split second Noah felt the turbulent changes within his Aspects of Existence just from being close to an existence that had achieved Extremity, he wanted to continue grasping onto it as the increased pace of progression was too grand!","So he calculated countless possibilities and crafted his words in a way where he would get what he wanted by giving something that an Esteemed Extremity Adjudicator would want.","Seeing her silence, Noah liked his chances as a moment later, she replied with a verdict!","[One Golden Haven Albatross for every week that passes. And if you haven't undergone Apexification within a year, the weight of an Obsidian Haven Albatross shall be added. ]","HUUM!","Noah's eyes curved into a devilish smile as the cherry-colored essence around him granted an exceedingly demonic charm- a charm that contained a deadly light of Indefatigability!"]},{"number":2440,"title":"Chapter 2440: Chapter 2439 Bask In Extremity! II","paragraphs":["Destiny and Providence swirled in his very depths as how could this have been an expected outcome from him butchering Scions of Inheritances?","This wasn't an expectation or any part of his plans, and yet such a boon had been obtained after utilizing the very same regulations from the Investiture of Extremity that bound him to stop obtaining Loot from the rest of his enemies!","At such a result, Noah nodded grandly.","\"Sounds good. And if I haven't achieved Extremity within 10 Years, you can add a Crimson Haven Albatross on top of that. I assume that exists?\"","...!","His words pulsed with grandeur and confidence that no being should express alone, but he did so without question while the Esteemed Extremity before him replied.","[You're making many promises using the factor of time- a relatively short period of time at that. This may work in your favor, or as the years pass...the weight of all of these promises will come crashing down. You do not know what a single Albatross represents as you may come to regret this...but it will achieve the goal of giving you as many enemies as you want.]","As she spoke, her fair right hand moved as the space around them twisted, their figures disappearing soon after.","When space settled, Noah found himself in an expansive area of darkness that gradually brightened up into an endless stellar expanse.","He gazed down as below his feet, countless purple blue glimmering singularities came together to form clusters of cloud-like stellar structures that even formed over an unseen horizon.","They were slightly transparent when one gazed down as far, far beneath them, Noah could see a glimpse of an unknown region of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","The space they were in seemed to be standing high and above the very Haven itself as everything seemed illusory, with his surroundings being filled with the pristine aura of Extremity as the veiled figure of the Adjudicator of Dissolution moved away from Noah and towards an area that held countless illusory screens of light.","Behind her, a roiling cloud of singularities rose up and formed into a wall that made her figure not visible to Noah's eyes as her graceful voice echoed out.","[Bask in the Aura of Extremity and comprehend what you can from it. The time starts now.]","...!","A cloud of dense singularities below him stretching out in all directions, and a raised cloud of singularities in front of him that made it so he couldn't even see the grand visage of the Esteemed Extremity.","Yet her aura still permeated outwards as his body drank it all in!","His eyes shone with a devilish glint as he sat down and controlled his thriving cells.","He hungered for Extremity.","He didn't just want to be near it as he was right now-he wanted it to be within his grasp!","And his soul filled with this hunger thought of countless possibilities while breathing in the aura of Extremity and carrying it to his main body.","As he did this, his gaze instantly turned towards the Infinite Plane as there...the countless possibilities he held could be made into a reality.","If he couldn't have Extremity beneath his feet, he would simply make it with his own hands!","His gaze was far-reaching as it landed on none other than one of the candidates who was the most progressed in Realm and the one who was closer towards Extremity than many among those he knew.","His gaze went towards Aurelia.","If he could take her a step further...","His eyes were bright as countless plans rose, but his soul had to reign in the current opportunity and fully devour what it actually meant from here on out.","An opportunity that he should've only come across for mere seconds was extended greatly, with the cost being him bearing the weight of multiple Albatrosses in the future.","The boons to come from this...were unimaginable!","In the Infinite Plane.","His Main Body was in the midst of experimentation by utilizing Realm Restructuring, but he had to stop momentarily as he inhaled in.","He inhaled Quintessence.","And from the connection he shared with the Avalon Dimensional Chassis...he now inhaled in Extremity.","Pure, unadulterated waved of Extremity!","[The changes to your Aspects of Existence influenced by the birth of the Absolute Seed of Extremity are elevated Quintessentially.]","[The longer you continue to breathe in the pure aura of Extremity, the faster the Convergence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.]","The more he breathed in, the more the powerful aura of Extremity coursed through him.","It coursed through his body as his Foundation went in a shocking direction.","It went through his Origin as the expanding 9 Major Dimensional Planes flourished with quintillions of Cosmos!","It went into his Soul...as it passed through his Infinite System and everything that made him.","It passed through the crimson gold sword that was just anchored into the Infinite Forge of Extremity, and it then passed across the Sources of Extremity that he restricted to himself!","[Your Concepts of Extremity are breathing in the essence of the peak they seek.]","[Your Concepts of Extremity rouse and seek a path past the 9th Boundary Layer!]","THUMP!","His heart beat like an ancient drum.","His soul vibrated with fervor as his Boundaries churned...along with the very Infinite Plane itself!","When he inhaled in, it felt like the whole Plane was resonating with him.","When he inhaled out, pure essence flourished all around as the many beings around him also felt their Aspects of Existence be roused!","Their eyes closed as they felt their understanding of Extremity increase, using this chance as an opportunity.","It was to the extent that even the Aeonic Soul Clones of Orion and Aurelia felt subtle changes in their souls- such an unimaginable thing occurring as they had a hard time believing it!","The mere breathing of an Existence that hadn't even undergone Apexification was causing even their Souls and concepts to be roused?","Their concepts that had already stepped onto the 10th Boundary Layer after they achieved Apexification?!","It was something that didn't entirely make sense as at such a time...even these two beings closed their eyes to profit from this opportunity.","The whole area turned entirely silent as it felt like a massive beast that was an entire plane was sensing and breathing Extremity, its Master being at the very center acting like a massive singularity that affected everything!"]},{"number":2441,"title":"Chapter 2441: Chapter 2440 Bask In Extremity! III","paragraphs":["What was Extremity, and just how vast was the breath of such a Realm?","Out of a dozen beings that had reached Extremity, one may be able to overpower the other 11 with a mere glimpse of their eyes.","There was a great gulf between the might of those that had achieved Extremity as no one being could be quantified and placed on a scale compared to others!","An example was how across the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, only a few names of Esteemed Extremity were stretched out through time and passed on as Legends.","The Extremity of Steel and the 81 Armaments of Extremity he forged.","The Plum Sword of Extremity whose name was later taken to stand for an entire Inheritance.","The Extremity of Reality whose grandeur shone brightly in the Extremity Step of the Extremity Vein of Helios.","The Extremity of Death whose mere soul pressure could fracture the souls of the masses and Forge Legions of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","These were just some examples as their names were Recorded and passed down through history.","Apart from these, there were the Esteemed Extremity who rose to gain enough accomplishments and power to the extent that they were voted to be Adjudicators of entire Havens.","Their might...was far, far vaster than any common Extremity from the myriad of Inheritances.","They were beings that commonly stemmed from the 7 Clans of Extremity, with only a single existence among the 7 Adjudicators currently not coming from the renowned 7 Clans of Extremity!","The breadth and power of such beings were unfathomable as they had achieved Extremity in more than one concept.","They were walking the path similar to beings like the Extremity of Steel or the Extremity of Reality as they were some of the future pillars of the Seven Aeonic Havens.","The Aura of Extremity of beings such as these...was far purer and majestic compared to any other Esteemed Extremity.","And Noah...and somehow skipped over joining any Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity and going through common regulations to be a Scion that eventually earned the right to cultivate near the Abode of an Esteemed Extremity- a unique opportunity rising and entity grasped by him in the developing Haven of Dissolution as he truly sensed, pondered, and breathed the Aura of Extremity from the very Adjudicator of Dissolution!","If word were to spread...it was unknown what the reaction would be.","But while Noah's main body fundamentally rose higher while breathing in a potent Aura of Extremity, events resumed in the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands near the periphery of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution.","The enormous area where hundreds of Scions were frozen and made immovable by an undeniable force was finally released as the emotions of those frozen were roused and vibrant.","The Fiend that had been chasing them down would finally be held accountable!","To kill hundreds of Scions and expect no repercussions?","Laughable!","The eyes of the remaining targeted Scions were hungry to see the disaster that would befall the 8 bodies of this being as the moment they were unfrozen, their Wills spread out to see his state.","Imprisoned? Heavily injured in his very Source? Forced to release an apology towards the Inheritances he offended?","They turned to see his fate with pounding hearts as...","\"Huh?\"","They saw that nothing happened to the 8 Reified Sources of Extremity.","They simply stopped their chases while gazing at everyone coldly, a few dozen Scions branded with a crimson Infinity symbol falling behind the Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity as Noah's majestic voice reverberated out.","\"The rest of you were saved today as remember this...\"","WAA!","\"You may not have known me before, and thus you acted the way you did. Take this as a lesson on how to act in the future no matter who you come across. Let your Inheritances and other scions know...I am Noah Osmont, the True Emperor of Quintessence! Any entity daring to come at me with the intent to kill should expect the same treatment in return. Your Masters will not be able to save you- whether they are Apex Aeonic Lifeforms or those that have attained Extremity. Let this day be the only day of mercy...as I assure you it will not repeat again!\"","BOOM!","His voice was resonant as it rang in the ears of all Scions stretched out across the floating obelisks.","In the far distance, a small cluster of Scions from the Church of Perpetual Light gazed forward with grievances as a dashing blonde Scion spoke while looking at the beings under the control of the Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity.","\"And our people that you have dominated the minds of?\"","\"They are no longer your people.\"","...!","Noah's reply was sharp as he turned towards this cluster of beings and continued.","\"To them, it was either death or domination as their fates chose the latter. If you seek to join them, just attack me with the intent to kill and we can work something out.\"","\"...\"","He left no room for any maneuvering as the Inheritances affected had their Scions grit their teeth, their eyes gazing around and above them as they seemingly questioned why this entity was allowed to do and say what he did!","But the pristine aura of Extremity seemed to have already come to a decision as they could only swallow their grievances and continue- their souls already moving into their own distinctive Communication Medallions to let their Inheritances know of what had occurred.","To let them know of Noah Osmont- the Fiend that had released a light of a Dynamis of Extremity and butchered hundreds of Scions with it!","Thereafter, each of them turned into streaks of light that surged towards the direction of the Crimson Extremity Panacea- towards what they were all here for this whole time.","Noah's eyes watched them all calmly as next, he gazed around the many Scions in the distance while voicing out grandly.","\"Shadowlings of the Cult of Endless Shadows...come before me.\"","...!","As he spoke, the Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity pulled out a dazzling shadowy Runestone that read [Shadows]!"]},{"number":2442,"title":"Chapter 2442: Chapter 2441 True Geniuses! I","paragraphs":["\"Shadowlings of the Cult of Endless Shadows...come before me.\"","His voice reverberated out from the crimson gold Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity as those who heard it were perplexed.","Across the many floating obelisks, in the far region on the periphery- clusters of a few dozen Scions that seemed to be covered in darkness heard his words as their eyes opened in shock and scrutiny!","They questioned why this being that had made enemies out of many Inheritances called out to them, their gazes showing incredulity moments after when they saw the Runestone this being showed in his hands.","\"That is the Runestone carrying an equivalent authority to a Grand Primeval Elder...\"","\"How..?\"","Voices rose amongst the few dozen groups of Shadowlings as when they first heard their name come out of this person's mouth, and they then saw the Runestone, they feared he was implicating them and causing the Cult of Endless Shadows to gain enemies as well!","But the authority of the Grand Primeval Runestone he held could not be denied as from the groups of a few dozen Shadowlings, a stern young man with slanted eyebrows and eyes that held star-shaped pupils voiced out while his figure shot over.","\"Respect the authority of the Grand Primeval Runestone and do not ask questions for now!\"","His body shot out first as the others followed.","The more they thought about the situation, the more complex their expressions became as from incredulity and unwillingness, they gradually began to see the bigger picture as they voiced amongst themselves.","\"Is he a Scion of our Cult we didn't know about? If so, his power...\"","They began to think about the might that this being displayed as it was undeniable, their thoughts about him changing many times over as 5 groups of a dozen Shadowlings soon arrived before Noah's glorious visage!","The young man with slanted eyebrows came forward first, followed by 4 other Shadowlings who led their own squadrons.","\"Vernon acknowledges the holder of the Grand Primeval Runestone.\"","His tone was that of calmness as he and many other Shadowlings felt the scrutiny of other Scions from the myriad of Inheritances now turning their way, but they held their heads high as Noah gazed at them coldly while speaking out.","\"Grand Primeval Silas has made a deal for the procurement of Golden Extremity Panaceas for you all. Follow behind me and participate in battles as needed when they begin to unfold. Any questions?\"","...!","Noah stated the name of the Grand Primeval Shadow Elder in charge of overseeing their current operation along with a deal they had no idea about, but the Shadowlings had just glimpsed his power as when they heard this- their reservations faded as even the figure of Vernon who had stepped forward to lead the Shadowlings here adopted a smile while gazing towards Noah's 8 bodies and the few dozen Scions controlled by the Vampyre of Extreme Sanguinity before them.","\"Then we shall follow your lead, Elder Osmont.\"","The existences across the vastness of Extremity were many.","When the situation presented itself, their pride and arrogance were put away as they knew how to act!","Noah coldly waved his hands towards these beings as his 8 Reified Sources of Extremity began moving forward again, proceeding with his end of the bargain to procure 81 Golden Extremity Panaceas for the Cult of Endless Shadows as within the next day or two...he prepared to send one of his Clones to the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra to see one of the 81 Armaments of Extremity.","The Shadow Sword that was elevating the Cult of Endless Shadows to become an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity!","With this in mind, his 8 Reified Sources of Extremity moved as a cluster of Scions followed behind, their destination being the far area where the 9th Source of Extremity- the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity, was about to compete with the truly genius Scions of the Inheritances here!","---","Close to the blooming Crimson Panacea.","The temperature was high as the Leviathans of Dissolution covered this region with a terrifying aura, their massive bodies releasing guttural roars as they were about to clash with the Scions of the Aeonic Inheritances of Extremity!","The tanned figure of Erikson in beach attire was closest to them as his figure barreled forth like a bomb, but even at this time...he turned towards Noah's direction and spoke out loudly after seeing the events behind them.","\"You're affiliated with the Cult of Endless Shadows?\"","\"No. I just have a agreement with one of their Elders.\"","His words were succinct as the cherry-colored light of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity covered his stellar skin, his fist barreling forward powerfully while Erikson nodded at his words and did the same!","\"Good!\"","HOONG!","One was utilizing an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","The other was utilizing a terrifying capability only known as Aeonic Probability Distortion!","Their figures were small in comparison to the Leviathans of Dissolution they faced, Noah's visage being much larger than the normal Scions as he was a Reified Source of Extremity.","He faced a massive beast that had the distinction of a [Wingless Komodo Prion], its scales glinting in a deep verdant light as its jaws opened to release a poisonous sea of essence!","With its already massive size in comparison to the Scions limited by the authority of Dissolution, the poisonous breath it released covered a vast region as even the burning figure of Ayame and Erikson fell under its range!","Yet their eyes held immense assurance and power as Ayame's horn shone to release an immaculate weaving of 12 Boundary Essences that converged into a sun singularity that burned the incoming poisonous sea wrapped in the authority of Dissolution.","And Erikson's smile widened as he only waved his arms forward, distorting the probability around him and of his enemies as nothing even came close to his body!","Noah's body was wrapped in the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity as even when the crimson poisonous sea descended, the cherry-colored light stably kept everything at bay as he moved forward.","In the midst of this clash, a pink light suddenly shot down from above as it used this chaos to pass in between the two Leviathans of Dissolution blocking the way in this direction- bypassing the blockade of the Leviathans guarding this area and closer to the Crimson Extremity Panacea than everyone else!","This pink figure had a serious look as his robes were fully pink with some white inscriptions of a blooming petal on the left side of the chest. His pupils were also shining with a radiant pink light as they were in the form of a spinning flower petal.","It was the existence known as Atlas from the Aeonic Inheritance of the Plum Sword of Extremity!","In his hands, a pure white sword shot out as from it, countless stellar pink petals bloomed in this whole region.","[Plum Blossom Sword Sea]","As if a stellar spring was blooming in this whole region.","They were in such wild abundance as they even released fluttering sounds akin to the flapping of the wings of trillions of birds.","The pink light of these petals was much lighter than the more Crimson hued cherry colored light of Noah's Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity- with these countless petals even surging towards the Leviathans of Dissolution in other directions who turned around the moment Atlas broke through the encirclement!","But there was no need for this.","Noah observed this scene with scrutiny as he learned of the power of actually powerful Scions and recalled the words of Erikson that even apart from the Leviathans of Dissolution- there was something else that would make it impossible for others to attain the Crimson Extremity Panacea.","And the answer was revealed now as while his white sword released countless flower petals, Atlas' left hand reached out towards the Panacea before him!","But before he could even near...","HOONG!","The crimson from the Panacea coagulated into a frightening power that blared out and pushed everything away- this authority even exceeding what the Aeonic Leviathans of Dissolution emanated!","A roar of valued glory seemed to emanate from the Crimson Extremity Panacea itself as to attain it, one didn't just have to get past the Leviathans of Dissolution- they had to overcome this type of Living Aeonic Treasures itself and make it submit!","The most powerful and most valued of all the Extremity Panaceas.","The Crimson Extremity Panacea was sentient and overflowing with glorious power!"]},{"number":2443,"title":"Chapter 2443: Chapter 2442 True Geniuses! II","paragraphs":["The First and the Last Crimson Panaceas were the most treasured things in the Initiation Step of the Extremity Vein of a Haven!","As the last Haven to undergo Extremity Sanctification, there were bound to be variations or changes- but this point had so far remained the same.","Like titanic protectors, the Leviathans of Dissolution moved to protect the blooming Crimson Extremity Panacea while this Living Aeonic Treasure had its own Will.","At this time, the truly prominent and powerful Scions made a move.","Erikson of the Sima Clan.","Ayame of the Infinite Extremity.","Atlas of the Plum Sword of Extremity!","And coming in a little later after the battles with the Leviathans of Dissolution started...were the powerful Scions who didn't even bother to speak like the eradicated Phos.","True powerhouses that were forged by Inheritances whose achievements were recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","Beings who only considered existences like Erikson, Atlas, or Ayame as those who could even possibly rival them.","ROAAR!","One was a Scion known as Cybele who stemmed from another one of the Seven Aeonic Clans- the Ouroboros Clan!","Her roar shook the waves of power released from the Leviathans and the Crimson Extremity Panacea as her humanoid form transformed into a massive black serpent at least four times larger than the average size of all Scions here.","Uniquely, her serpentine body had two ferocious draconic heads at the front and where the tail should be, massive obsidian flaming wings erupting at the very center as such a being circulated over a dozen Boundaries freely across her body!","Above her, the massive illusory form of a 9-Headed Obsidian Ouroboros flashed as it cascaded with waves of pressure that would erase even the might of Apex Aeonic Soul Totems.","Apart from her, there was also the figure of a blond-haired human with an exceedingly dazzling figure, his eyes as bright as Cosmos as a single white colored wing expanded behind him and stretched out for over a mile.","He was Bharatam of the Prometheus Clan!","The expanded wing was instantly retracted into his body as he filled with light, his eyes releasing bright beams that seemed like tendrils surging out to wrap around the Crimson Extremity Panacea.","Before the tendrils of light could go too far, a snort rang out as opposite to Bharatam, a purple robed woman with a long pointed hat on her head thrust forward a stellar wand from her hand.","It was as if she was holding compressed clusters of Realities in her hand as a beam of light erupted out, her eyes smiling devilishly as she was Antoinette of the Scholars of Extremity!","And then off to the side, above all others, a dark haired man floated grandly as he held a paintbrush in one hand.","He had no canvas to paint on as the vast reality before him... was his canvas.","His white robes billowed with power as his paintbrush began to move, depicting and drawing the figures of the beings before him as the clearer they became, the more oppressive a force was released from him as it cascaded downwards!","He was Leornado Leopold of the Canvas of Extremity!","Even further from this area, an exquisite man dressed like a scholar appeared as around him, massive sculptures made of indestructible Aeonic Stones, Metalloids, and Crystalloids surrounding him as the pressure they gave off was akin to the might of an Apex Aeonic Soul Totem.","And there were dozens of them!","He reigned from the Sculptors of Extremity- a distinguished Scion known as Lodovico!","Such beings and more continued to come out as others were of the same Clan or Inheritances, their power not being any lesser or just slightly behind as these...were the generations of powerhouses that would produce the next true experts among the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Each of them had their own mighty power as an unknown number of them were Mutated Entities, while others simply had too deep of a history or were unfathomable geniuses.","Their numbers quickly proliferated past dozens as this region became entirely chaotic, the massive bodies of the Leviathans of Dissolution roaring out and moving with utmost grandeur as a terrifying battle bloomed!","Noah's eyes were radiant as he looked at all this.","Different forms of powers.","Different forms of Reality-altering capabilities.","Each of them seeking Extremity!","These were beings who had lived for thousands or even millions of years, and here he was competing with them on something as pristine as Extremity!","And so far, he hadn't made any truly major and grand moves as he observed the level of their power and how their Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi compared to his, and whether they could stand against his Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","The answer was surprising as beings like Erikson showed might that wasn't simply limited to Boundaries.","Might that innately came from their souls as it should be a kind of Mutation- something akin to Infinite Mana!","But...could they even compare?","His eyes twinkled brightly as he didn't looked down on them, and he instead wanted to study the distinctive powers they showed as what if he was able to emulate them himself?","His eyes shone as the Aeonic Annals of Providence in his eyes focused on Erikson.","A Million of his Soul Values consumed and flowed into his eyes while supported by the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity as details of this being and what Noah wanted to see the most were drawn out!","[Erikson]:: A Scion of the Sima Clan. The scale of his strength is undefined due to the nature of his trait. [Trait- Aeonic Probability Distortion] allows him to freely alter the probabilities of the workings of Reality as with a strong enough Soul, anything is possible. [Boundaries- Probability(9th Boundary Layer), Strength(9th Boundary Layer), Tenacity(9th Boundary Layer), Adamantine(9th Boundary Layer)...]. [Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi- Unable to be obtained...]...","His eyes shone brightly at the information he managed to pull out at the expenditure of a not insignificant amount of his current Soul Values that were at their minimum levels after using Aeonic Anti-Mana not too long ago!"]},{"number":2444,"title":"Chapter 2444: Chapter 2443 True Geniuses! III","paragraphs":["Noah's body coiled with tendrils of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity as he freely bathed in the poisonous sea spat out by a [Wingless Komodo Prion], his Soul actively moving to ascertain the powerhouses around him as he continued to use the last shreds of his Aeonic Soul Values.","And even this...had a grand reason.","After utilizing Aeonic Anti-Mana, nearly everything was utilized as the only reason Noah could still actively move was because his continued transformation and changes brought about by the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity were still spurring his soul and increasing its power- boosting his Aeonic Soul Values to regenerate much faster than normal.","But even with this, he had less than 30% remaining of his 20 Million Aeonic Soul Values due to his vibrant expenditure!","And yet...he continued to utilize them freely as he was waiting for a grand opportunity.","An opportunity that would only come when nearly all of his Aeonic Soul Values were spent!","So another 1 Million Aeonic Soul Values burned as he continued to peer through the secrets of the geniuses before him who had turned this region into a glorious battle.","His eyes came to land on Ayame who seemed like a burning singularity.","[Ayame]:: A Scion of the Infinite Extremity. She was born from a condensed cluster of Haven Volcanic Singularities that had been tainted by an Aura of Extremity for a billion years. The scale of her strength is undefined due to the nature of her trait. [Trait- Haven Fire Alchemy] allows her to utilize Haven Flames carrying an indiscernible hint of Extremity in unique ways. [Boundaries- Incandescence(9th Boundary Layer), Phlogiston(9th Boundary Layer), Pyre(9th Boundary Layer), Oxidation(9th Boundary Layer)...]. [Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi- Unable to be obtained...]...","[Lodovico]:: A Scion of the Sculptors of Extremity. After birth, he was able to sculpt a singularity as he was born with the Innate Haven Chisel Soul. The scale of his strength is undefined due to the nature of his trait. [Trait- Innate Haven Chisel] allows him to mold the most unlikely materials into Sculptures that follow his will. [Boundaries- Sculptor(9th Boundary Layer), Architect(9th Boundary Layer), Desginer(9th Boundary Layer), Computation(9th Boundary Layer)...]. [Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi- Unable to be obtained...]...","Each one held their own unique history and wonder as Noah continued to gaze around him while his body burned brightly!","[Atlas]:: A Scion of the Plum Sword of Extremity. He survived the 1 Million Cycles of Plum Soul Ablation meant to produce Engineered Entities. The scale of his strength is undefined due to the nature of his trait. [Trait- Aeonic Regressor- During the horrific cycles of Plum Soul Ablation, he was exposed to 9 Unrecorded Histories of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity, of which 3 held his Unrecorded History of achieving Extremity. He is currently on his Third Stage of Awakening and recalling the possible Dynamis of Extremity he would have held in Unrecorded Histories.] [Boundaries- Regression(9th Boundary Layer), Fate(9th Boundary Layer), Destiny(9th Boundary Layer), Plum Sword(9th Boundary Layer)...]. [Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi- Unable to be obtained...]...","...!","Noah's eyes opened wide at this particular being that he came across as it was an Engineered Entity!","And not just that...they went further to gain the distinction of an Aeonic Regressor.","He had seen 9 possible versions of Unrecorded Histories- of different versions of Realities where in 3 of them, he had even attained Extremity!","He was an Existence...who had already seen himself grasping Extremity.","His path should be an exemplary and smooth one as for him, everything was already outlined.","Noah's eyes twinkled with interest when he gazed at Atlas from the Plum Sword of Extremity.","His power was sharp as he had been the one to get closest to the Crimson Extremity Panacea so far, with his power unfettered as his Plum petals remained floating in the space around them- still fluttering like the wings of countless birds!","The whole region was turned utterly tumultuous when it came to the strength of these beings as each one had their own grandeur that normal Unequaled Reverend Emperors couldn't match!","There were other Scions rushing to come into this region, but the mere pressure and might of the dazzling plum petals swirling in the background crushed onto their defenses as they were forced to remain outside of this region.","ROAR!","The Leviathans of Dissolution bellowed out to establish their authority amidst all this as in front of Erikson, a Nine-Legged Virion Otter smashed its whole body forward, this man adorned in beach attire only pushing out with his hands alone as this Leviathan was pushed back with a tremendous force, its whole body turning into a titanic missile that shot back towards the Crimson Extremity Panacea.","The Panacea that then began to move as it turned into a crimson treasured radiance which shot downwards towards the pulsing Vein in the distance!","HO!","The will of multiple Scions moved as the Scion from the Scholars of Extremity flashed to appear directly in front of the Panacea, her wan erupting out with great malice and power as purple blue tendrils of light spread out on all sides to capture it.","BOOM!","A second crimson pulse emitted from the Crimson Extremity Panacea as all the tendrils and other forms of authority were shredded, the miniscule period after this burst once more being used by another Scion as Atlas just so happened to appear from the side, his pure white sword releasing dense plum petals that flooded like a billowing storm to obtain the Panacea before during the delay of its outbursts!","\"...\"","Noah observed such a mad scramble for this Panacea calmly while he examined through the secrets of the beings before him, and he had consumed his Aeonic Soul Values a sufficient amount during this process as barely 5% of it remained.","And at such a junction, Noah smiled as he finally made his move.","A move that could actually only be made when his Aeonic Soul Values were at their absolute lowest!","[Aeonic Mana Drain].","...!","Mana Drain.","Anti-Mana was already dreadful enough.","Just what did another feature that stemmed from the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity hold in store?!"]},{"number":2445,"title":"Chapter 2445: Chapter 2444 Drain! I","paragraphs":["[Aeonic Mana Drain]:: A reality altering feature that is only possible to cast with the spark of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity when your Aeonic Soul Values are 5% or lower. It comes at no cost to you as its purpose is to drain all Sources of Essences around you- whether it is the essence of nature, Boundary Essence, the essence of Dynamis, the essence of Extremity, or even the Resources of the very Souls around you, including that which makes the very fabric of Reality as the goal is to convert all of it for the complete regeneration of 100% of your Aeonic Soul Values. Aeonic Mana Drain goes even further as a Sub-feature of Soul Value Overdrive is activated with every cast, this feature allowing for you to gain an additional reserve of your Maximum Aeonic Soul Values for you to pull from for the span of 1 minute. Depending on the sources of essence you devour, you can exceed the boundaries of your soul and elevate it by an unknown amount. Once your original Aeonic Soul Values and the Soul Values from Overdrive are maxed, the skill will automatically be canceled. The only limitation to this ability apart from needing your Aeonic Soul Values to be 5% or lower is the cooldown of 10 minutes before it can be utilized again.","A grand description!","Similar to Aeonic Anti-Mana, it required the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity to be spurred forth.","And its true wonders...weren't truly displayed in the description as it had to be cast to be understood!","When Noah ushered it forth, his stellar body buzzed as a transparent pulse of cherry blue light was released.","This light was supremely fast as it was akin to a wave of haki spreading out in all directions- and it caused all the immensely powerful Scions to turn towards Noah's visage with caution!","Thereafter, it was as if a storm had erupted with him at the very center.","Waves of coral cerulean light surged out with a magnificent sense of beauty. They carried with them a terrifying gravitational force that pulled everything in!","The dazzling pink Plum petals that were swirling in the surroundings and chirping like trillions of birds were all swept up in the storm that was returning back towards Noah's body.","The massive bodies of Leviathans swirled as their skin and musculature cracked into pieces and followed the heavy pull of the storm!","The immobile obelisks shining silver and crimson in the surroundings shattered into fragments and became drawn in!","The burning flames of singularities that Ayame released.","The heavy and inexplicable force of constantly changing probabilities that Erickson vibrated with his very own body.","The cluster of the sculptures that Lodovico Had surrounding","him...every single thing that consisted of essence one way or another was pulled towards Noah as everything sank into his body and surged towards his soul.","But it didn't just stop at essences!","Those who didn't have powerful barriers of protection around their bodies were shocked to realize that the very power of their souls was becoming drawn outside of their bodies and being pulled towards this being.","This being that at this point in time began to move towards the direction of the Crimson Extremity Panacea with complete freedom as at this point in time, even the figures of the prominent Scions moved back slightly to acclimate and stabilize their souls to make sure that nothing that was theirs was leaking out to become his!","And during such an opportunity, Noah's figure blazed forth freely as he made a beeline directly towards the radiant Panacea.","His body continued to devour everything around him like an immense singularity, to the extent that even the figure of Atlas that was closest to the Panacea retreated backwards with caution as all of his plum petals were ceaselessly devoured by Noah.","The devouring pressure that he released caused even the Crimson Extremity Panacea to feel a great sense of danger as from it...another heavy pulse came out.","The pulse radiating immense waves of Dissolution!","And yet even this..","BZZZT!","Was pulled towards Noah's body like a tonic as his soul drank it up!","His Aeonic Soul Values rapidly surged back towards full capacity as his stellar visage thrust his hand out towards the Crimson Extremity Panacea.","As if he was about to attain it!","But...others couldn't allow this so freely as after adapting to Noah's dreadful devouring force that pulled on their very Souls, they surged back towards him with stern eyes!","Although one being was releasing a boisterous laugh- the visage of Erikson somehow denying the devouring force as he also closed in.","YA!","Ayame's horn burned bright as it released molten stellar stanchions all around, while Atlas' sword buzzed to release one singular massive pink sword made of trillions of Plum petals!","All of these attacks and more surged towards the position of the Crimson Extremity Panacea as they were meant to rebuff Noah's advances just like multiple others were stopped before, but the closer they came to this location...the more they were turned into streams of radiance that went on to power Noah's soul!","His purple blue stellar form covered by waves of gold and coral-colored light pulsed with overflowing power as Soul Value Overdrive had long since activated, Noah's visage bellowing out as the Crimson Extremity Panacea was inches away from his hands- constantly devouring the repulsive force of Dissolution that this living artifact released.","But at such a juncture...","[Aeonic Mana Drain has successfully recovered all Aeonic Soul Values and fully maximized out Soul Value Overdrive.]","[Your Maximum Aeonic Soul Values have permanently increased by +2,000,000 Values due to the rich sources of Essence you devoured.]","[Aeonic Mana Drain has been forcefully canceled and is now on a ten-minute cooldown.]","...!","The prodigies here were immensely in tune with nature as the moment they felt Noah's inexplicable devouring force that swallowed even their Aeonic Soul Values, they reacted in a similar way as most of them had unleashed even more attacks towards his direction.","They purposefully fed him more as they instinctively knew there had to be such a limitation!","And his horrific devouring force stopped just before he could get his hands on the Extremity Panacea.","This leaving artifact breathed out a sigh of relief.","The serious prodigies surrounding Noah became even more focused as they once more moved in ever closer!","Before Noah's eyes, the shape of the Crimson Extremity Panacea was clear.","It looked like a sunflower formed from countless treasured singularities.","Its petals formed into a mocking smile towards him at this moment as it was about to erupt with another burst of Dissolution- seemingly taking the cessation of the devouring force around Noah as its victory!"]},{"number":2446,"title":"Chapter 2446: Chapter 2445 Drain! II","paragraphs":["A mocking expression!","The Living Aeonic Treasure actually expressed such an emotion when it felt that one of the more dangerous enemies who had tried to obtain it had failed in the last nanosecond, with his hand only being inches away!","So it prepared another burst of Dissolution while vibrating gleefully.","But...this was when Noah's expressionless face glowed with majesty and devilishness.","The skill that had just forcefully come to a halt was one that granted him twice his full resource reserves.","So even though it seemed like he would be pushed away from the Crimson Extremity Panacea like all others that had come near it...","[Aeonic Anti-Mana.]","...!","He called out silently as he dared any beings to come close to an erupting mass of nothingness!","And as for the mocking Crimson Extremity Panacea before him, his sharp eyes spinning with lemniscate symbols blazed as he spoke towards it while a heavy darkness engulfed everything.","\"You...need to be taught a lesson.\"","WAA!","The sunflower-like cluster of treasured lights trembled as the pulse of Dissolution it was about to release seemingly disappeared into nothingness, its expression portraying shock and alarm!","As for the genius Scions that were coming forth...","Their souls blazed as the moment the engulfing darkness began to bloom, they pushed their bodies backwards while their own unique waves of power burst forth before their bodies- doing everything in their power to make sure they weren't covered by the domain of nothingness!","Erikson had a stern expression as he had seen this ability from afar, knowing he would have to face it sometime soon as he prepared for it.","His musculature exploded as the beach shirt he had on nearly ripped, a transparent force building up around him as it carried a hint of a gold light!","Towards the engulfing mass of nothingness, his hands came together into a massive clap that released his exorbitant soul values in the form of a distorted probability.","He didn't have to fight against the engulfing darkness, he only had to make it so that the chance of it covering him was close to 0%!","And so the circular engulfing darkness had an area it couldn't spread towards to- waves of pristine gold light wrapping around Erikson as he still became stern when he felt how rapidly his soul values were used up.","The nearby Leviathans of Dissolution tasked with protecting the Extremity Panacea blazed with heavy eyes as they were wrapped by the light of nothingness!","Ayame and others of the same caliber used their own unique means to evade or stop the advancement of the engulfing darkness as none of the Scions allowed it to cover them!","None of them...but one certain Scion.","His pink robes fluttered gloriously in space.","The white sword he held was put away as his dark hair with streaks of pink glimmered like strands of cosmic grandeur.","Towards the coming darkness, an air of profundity spread from him as his eyes flickered, his mind seemingly changing multiple times over as he tried to confirm something!","Thereafter, the petals that were his pupils shone as this being... remained completely still while bringing his hand together in front of his chest.","Thereafter, a singular incandescent plum petal erupted to cover his body as this being...actually chose to be engulfed in the mass of nothingness!","WAA!","In an instant while all others evaded or stopped its advancement, Atlas remained still as his body was covered by Aeonic Anti-Mana.","---","In a region of nothingness.","In an man-made area existing outside of space and time!","A Crimson Extremity Panacea trembled as its light rapidly dwindled around its body, losing the sense of Dissolution and everything else as a terrifying force around it threatened to devour it completely!","When its predecessors were absorbed by others to build an Extremity Foundation, at least they lived on as the base of this foundation.","But the empty surroundings would devour it completely as everything about it would cease to exist!","In such a cluster of darkness that felt like hundreds of years...","\"Where is that ridiculing expression now?\"","A voice emanated out as it seemed like a holy savior that had come to take it from the darkness!","A hint of a cherry colored light appeared before the Extremity Panacea that seemed like the only source of light, its will expressing a mix of emotions as it instantly surged out!","Its voice was meek as it surged towards Noah's figure with haste, its will emanating out!","[Please...get me out of here. Then, you can eat me up!]","WAA!","While feeling the converging dread of nothingness, the Crimson Extremity Panacea willingly threw itself towards Noah's stellar figure and placed itself onto his hands snuggly.","[...]","The dread of void faded as it sighed and dug itself even closer towards the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity, Noah's Will smiling brilliantly as he turned towards another direction.","Someone else apart from four massive Leviathans of Dissolution had managed to be drawn into the field of Anti- Mana that he contained in a small space this time around.","The Leviathans were already wrapped with the light of void as no matter how much they struggled, their minds were undergoing the same process as Phos and many others had undergone.","To them, it felt like countless years were passing the moment that the light of Anti-Mana wrapped around their Aspects of Existence, and their only battle was with their souls until they were fully absorbed into nothingness!","But this Scion...","Noah saw the Aeonic Regressor that was Atlast actually control the light of the incandescent pink plum petal around his body, allowing streaks of void to enter his Aspects of Existence ever so slowly as he seemed to be deliberately experiencing the emptiness of time and space- allowing his soul to experience the passage of an unknown number of years in an instant!","[The Soul Values from the additional reserve of Overdrive have been fully utilized.]","A prompt rose before Noah as the continued maintenance of Anti-Mana was about to dip into his full Aeonic Soul Values.","Having achieved his goal, he recalled the terrifying feature as a Crimson Extremity Panacea was snuggly in his hands!"]},{"number":2447,"title":"Chapter 2447: Chapter 2446 An Eruption of Panaceas! I","paragraphs":["2446 An Eruption of Panaceas! I","To the outside world, the mass of engulfing darkness didn't even last a few seconds as it disappeared just as quickly as it appeared.","But the grand changes it brought...caused those who were far from it to draw sharp breaths!","The massive bodies of four nearby Leviathans of Dissolution were fractured and broken, everything that remained about them continuing to splinter and turn into stellar dust that carried a story of immense insignificance and sadness!","The most astonishing scene was that towards the very center where the engulfing darkness had spread from, a devilishly handsome cosmic being grasped the Crimson Extremity Panacea in his hands meekly.","A scene that caused sharp breaths to be drawn as it should have absorbed everyone's attention for the seconds to follow.","But it didn't.","This was because even the comic being grasping the Crimson Extremity Panacea had his head turned towards a certain direction.","An area that was engulfed by the dread of nothingness where the being who had fallen into it...did not turn into dust!","The figure of Atlas could be seen as he looked extremely aged- as if he had experienced an untold number of years.","His hair was filled with a dull gray luster as his back seemed bent and withered, with the effects of Anti-Mana seemingly being extreme!","And yet Noah's eyes were pm this being because from him, the overabundance force of life was burning and erupting with too much force.","From the weakened looking figure, a glow of pink instantly erupted in the form of a massive illusory plum petal- a deadly aura releasing from him as all Reverends here quickly recognized it and became all the more shocked!","This was because something even more immaculate than it had occurred not too long ago.","It was the emergence of a Dynamis of Extremity around the visage of an Unequaled Reverend Emperor!","It was the second time this occurred today as even though it was a maddening and fearful aura, it still couldn't even compare to a tenth of the grandeur released when the True Emperor of Quintessence unveiled his Dynamis of Extremity.","But something privy only to Apex Aeonic Lifeforms...a second being had seen it today as the eyes of many powerful Scions flashed.","Noah gazed at the visage of Atlas who was entirely reversing the effects of time, his youthful appearance returning as this being...had actually used Noah's domain of Anti-Mana to experience the negation of the flow of time as for his soul, millions of years may have passed!","He took such a dangerous action as he no doubt was forcefully stimulating his trait as an Aeonic Regressor.","Forcefully experiencing the passage of millions of years as he somehow pulled from the Dynamis of one of the paths he had seen during the cycles of Plum Soul Ablation!","BZZT!","His aura rose to a shocking level as he opened his eyes, instantly causing the flourishing of countless plum petals that vibrated with his will.","The light of a Dynamis of Extremity danced around his eyes as he actually nodded towards Noah.","\"I owe you one.\"","WAA!","His eyes were piercing as the petal pupils within spun, Noah smiling as he felt the Will of Atlas and multiple others land on him with the Crimson Extremity Panacea in his hands!","He replied while taking an action that caused all Scions here to sigh in regret.","\"You do owe me one, and I love to collect favors.\"","...!","While he uttered this, his jaws opened wide as the meek Crimson Extremity Panacea was instantly devoured- not giving any time for any of the prominently powerful Scions to make another move to fight for it!","\"Ah...!\"","\"The First Panacea...!\"","Cries rang out in the background from lesser Scions.","Yet in the midst of this all, the raucous laughter of Erikson also echoed out as he took the loss of the First Extremity Panacea in strides.","\"Haha! One being after another showing off a Dynamis of Extremity makes the rest of us seem dull!\"","His prominent body stepped forward freely as he was among the few who were able to escape the dread of Anti-Mana, his eyes blazing as he locked onto Noah.","\"My offer still stands for the Sima Clan even though I lost. Your talent wouldn't shine brighter within any other Clan in these Havens.\"","WAA!","His voice was resonant as it was matched by the calm words of the Scion of the Prometheus Clan- Bharatam!","\"Is Prometheus not up to the standard, O Erikson?\"","His golden hair waved as he spoke, a discussion seemingly about to break out as Erikson's eyes became sharp.","But before anything else could continue...","BZZT!","The environment began to quake.","It was an event activated by the fact that Noah devoured the First Extremity Panacea as it traversed across his Aspects of Existence to arrive before his main body in the Infinite Plane.","He had yet to fully eat it as he deciphered its details, but it was considered to have been claimed as now...Extremity","Sanctification could truly begin for the Haven of Dissolution!","The quaking of space was caused by the fact that the heavy darkness below where the exterior of a pulsing Vein could be seen...it began to rise.","As if a massive churning obsidian sea was parting ways, more of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution rose above as the sunken obelisks bathed in Dissolution shattered due to the sheer power of this rising vein- and from the surface of this vein...a crack began to open up!","As if a blood vessel contained too much grandeur and was about to burst.","And as it rose, the titanic bodies of more and more Leviathans of Dissolution became visible as if they were unearthed from Dissolution itself.","BZZT!","The Extremity Vein of Dissolution continued to rise ever higher as a crevice began on its surface, this fissure becoming wider and wider until...","BOOM!","Innumerable valuable lights of Extremity erupted.","Like a entrance to an antique treasure cache.","Like a crevice leasing into a realm of Extremity treasures!","Like a Vein...paving way towards Extremity Sanctification!"]},{"number":2448,"title":"Chapter 2448: Chapter 2447 An Eruption of Panaceas! II","paragraphs":["2447 An Eruption of Panaceas! II","The Extremity Vein of Dissolution which stretched out endlessly forward and back rose significantly as a fissure opened on its surface, a treasured light erupting from it as it was a pure halcyon light!","A light that felt as if dozens of suns were being born as when the fissure became ever wider, genuine golden treasure suns truly did gush out and erupt as the eyes of Scions shone- the identity of these golden lights being none other than Golden Extremity Panaceas.","Their appearance caused the Scions in the back to get restless once more while Scions of the caliber of Erikson or Atlas remained utterly still while observing everything.","This was because even as fantastical golden lights of dozens of Golden Extremity Panaceas burst forth from the fissure on the Vein of Dissolution, this expanding Vein acted like a doorway that showed a glimpse of a shocking treasure space where countless paths seemed to converge.","Where countless destinies seemed to lie!","When gazing at it and the possible profundities within, the burning figure of Ayame had a stern expression as she spoke.","\"It was said that in the First Extremity Sanctification of Genesis, Panaceas that forged Extremity Foundations were in abundance, but the tools to get ever closer to Extremity were in even greater","abundance for those who were capable of attaining them.\"","...!","Extremity Sanctification.","The goal was the attainment of Extremity!","Apart from the Extremity Panaceas crucial to set up a foundation for a successful Apexification, there were many unknown profundities to further one's progression towards Extremity in the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification that even beings at the Culmination Step may be jealous of!","As if to add onto her words, Atlas felt the rushing waves of a Converging authority around his body as he also spoke calmly.","\"Treasures of Extremity that can aid one in forming a Dynamis, or increase the Convergence of a Dynamis of Extremity.","Treasures to expand one's Soul Value...and even those to elevate your Apocryphal Planar Haven.\"","WAA!","An overabundance of Loot!","This was what lay in wait in the depths of the Vein of Dissolution!","\"You all seem to be forgetting something crucial.\" Erikson smiled as he placed his hands in his short pants, his beach shirt waving over his toned muscles as he continued.","\"All of these treasures won't just be sitting there for you to pluck. You won't see average Leviathans who have been on the periphery of Dissolution that you can simply evade. Within...there are Lineages of Dissolution that have been born and bred in all this grandeur. Aside from fighting amongst ourselves, we will have to actually handle Lineages of creatures who can actively unleash Dissolution from their souls on top of deadly regions of Dissolution itself. And interventions from an outside force are almost impossible while inside the Vein. I predict that even a few of us- nay, a few of you may die in this pursuit.\"","...!","Confidence shone blindingly from him as he corrected himself from saying 'us' among those who may die and simply directed it to others as a possibility!","The fissure below spread wide open as the figures of Scions gathered en masse, Noah's 8 Reified Sources of Extremity also appearing in the distance leading Shadowlings who had bright looks when they gazed at him.","From the opening, one could see a wide and vast treasure place that was no doubt vaster than countless Planes of Existence, the Scions beginning to go towards it en masse as others focused on the Golden Extremity Panaceas that had burst forth around the surroundings of the fissure!","Noah's will observed it all freely as Providence guided his path.","Extremity Sanctification.","The tools for this lay within this Extremity Vein as apart from everything else he was doing, he could obtain the tools to aid in the Convergence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity here!","Magnificence shone as even he explored in.","—","Grand Primeval Silas floated in silver colored skies while grasping a blinking Runestone, his eyes rising up to see the figure of Noah's Dream Dimensional Chassis appearing from a blinking white gold portal.","\"You've come across the Shadowlings near the Extremity Vein?\" He asked calmly as he looked towards Noah with a hungry gaze- as if he was looking at something he must attain!","\"Leading them towards Golden Extremity Panaceas now. Obtaining any other treasures will be upto their skills.\"","Noah's reply was relaxed as his tone held a hint of accomplishment.","This was because at this juncture, his Clones were finishing up the last few Lernaean Domains as it meant a few hundred Planes of Existence were being assimilated into his Infinite Plane!","How stupendous would the effects be? On Noah and on the Infinite Plane itself? On the Natural Laws that were expanded to Boundaries? On the Reified Enders of Extremity and the Spiritual Beasts? On the fantastical features of the Infinite Plane?!","There were too many wonders to look","forward to as with this, it also meant Noah could turn his eyes towards the Noblesse and Quasarian Lands.","He thought of Caesar and the pathway of saving the being known as Xiaomi.","He thought of his Son who was already conquering a portion of the Noblesse domain!","Everything was already set up on the appropriate path as his gaze came to Silas who blazed with a shadowy light while voicing out.","\"Good. Then let us begin the trip towards the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra. Crossing the folds between Havens alone will take a day or two without the aid of Extremity as the Lands of Shadows that are in the Extremity Step of Extremity","Sanctification...crossing them to get to the Cult will be even more dangerous!\"","The preparations were done on Silas' end as the journey to witness one of the 81 Armaments of Extremity was also about to begin!","Multiple pieces fell into place as far away, within a quickly transforming Infinite Plane, Noah's Main body stared at a trembling Crimson Extremity Panacea as everything about it was revealed before his eyes!"]},{"number":2449,"title":"Chapter 2449: Chapter 2448 True Death! I","paragraphs":["2448 True Death! I","Adorned in a stellar Emperor's Robe, Noah's Main Body was surrounded by liquefied waves of Boundaries with every breath.","Around him, the figures of Ophelia, Henry, Barbatos, Anastasia, Aurelia, Orion, Katelyn, Maximilian, the Emperor Penguin, and all other prominent existences within the Infinite Plane were floating serenely with eyes closed- each of them feeling the profundity emanating from Noah as their Souls found new epiphanies and breakthrough with their Boundaries!","This was due to multiple factors emanating from Noah, but two were the most potent.","One was something that had risen from a prompt that rose during its conception!","[The Essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity is cycling across your Aspects of Existence with every Quintessential Breath, forever altering your Aspects Of Existence.]","This promotion had risen some time ago as this essence had continued to cycle within Noah's body- its grandeur also spreading outwardly as others were able to feel wisps of this Absolute Seed of Extremity.","Then, there was the pure aura of Extremity itself that he was now exposed to from an existence who was overseeing the whole Haven he now moved around.","These factors caused Noah's mere presence to be akin to a cultivating haven as the gains he could give others were immeasurable.","The gains he himself attained were even more obscene!","But in the midst of all this, he also obtained the Crimson Extremity Panacea through his Reified Source of Extremity.","The first of its kind for the Extremity Sanctification of the youngest Aeonic Haven!","While he breathed Quintessentially, Noah's eyes blazed with light as his main body grasped this treasure in his hands.","[Crimson Extremity Panacea]:: A treasure rarely born across the eons. It is the first blooming Panacea of the Extremity Sanctification of the Last Haven, beginning the completion of the End Cycle of Extremity as the being to absorb its essence will attain a foundation worthy of such a treasure. Golden and Obsidian Extremity Panaceas normally grant random types of Extremity Foundations in line with the Aspects of Existence of the one devouring them- with the Foundations only amounting to Recorded Aeonic Extremity Foundations that have appeared through the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. The Crimson Extremity Panacea grants the chance to attain an Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Foundation that is capable of forging 81 Extremity Meridian Seeds within one's Aspects of Existence. The Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Foundation obtained from the absorption and assimilation of the essence of this Panacea will be carried into a guaranteed successful Apexification and lay the groundwork for easy Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity, and the smoother pathway of the Boundaries supporting the Meridians to attain Extremity. After devouring a single Panacea and enacting your foundation, all others become useless to you...","\"Mmm...\" Noah appreciated the wonder before his eyes that guaranteed success in the process of Apexification and enacted an Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Foundation with the pillars of 81 Extremity Meridian Seeds.","Even The Mad Apex Emperor Caesar only had a bit over a tenth as many Meridians as what this Extremity Panacea promised!","But...all of these were just the boons of the Crimson Extremity Panacea.","Noah's very own Aspects of Existence were proceeding towards an Extremity Foundation with every cycle of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","There was even the Nine Natures Extremity Foundation that Noah could grant onto his Vassals and other Lesser Indefatigable Foundations of Extremity- all made possible by the capabilities of this Absolute Seed of Extremity.","So Noah was already on a grand path.","'This Panacea...will only solidify and usher my path in quicker.'","His bright eyes locked onto the pulsing Crimson Extremity Panacea as he wanted to use it as a stepping stone to fling himself even closer towards his goals.","One of the biggest things on his mind currently was the question of surviving in a region outside of time itself without relying on the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","It was to attain 'that' which the Adjudicator of Dissolution spoke of- an authority that allowed treasured beings to fight against terrifying enemies whose homes were outside the scope of space, time, and reality itself!","It was commonly an authority that a specific number of beings could manifest when they achieved Extremity, but there were rare Entities who were also able to achieve it as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Even while looking at Noah, the Adjudicator of Dissolution had spurred him to try his best to attain it after Apexification.","When he became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","But in Noah's mind...","'Forget after Apexification, why not now?'","WAA!","Waves of grandeur erupted from him as he had a bold thought!","He knew of the authority.","He sought it.","And so he would do anything in his power to attain it!","The first step...would be the Crimson Extremity Panacea before him.","Noah didn't hesitate as he consumed it once more, this time letting the Panacea settle near the center of his body as he embarked to build the most pristine foundation!","[You have devoured the Crimson Extremity Panacea]","HUUM!","[Your Aspects of Existence have stepped on a path of forging an Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Foundation!]","[Your Origin, Body, and Soul are resonating to establish a Foundation uniquely fitted to you!]","A gorgeous light blared as the process of forming a Foundation was hastened!","But...he didn't stop there.","He thought about his own theories and what he saw Atlas of the Plum Sword of Extremity doing not too long ago as after running countless calculations, he called out lightly.","[Aeonic Anti-Mana].","...!","Silently.","Deadly!","It didn't spread out far distances as the Soul Value expenditure would be greatly lowered.","It was only contained to wrap around Noah's body and nothing else!","BZZZT!","His visage became entirely engulfed in darkness as initially, the vibrant essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity naturally protected him.","This core protected him, but his own Aspects of Existence could not survive outside of the scope of space, time, and Reality!","If the day ever came when he couldn't call out the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, he would be done.","So he sought to change himself and achieve a power that others couldn't even seek.","The roseate colored glow around his body reduced as he formed spaces within it first.","The swallowing nothingness then penetrated through these spaces as they settled into Noah's Aspects of Existence!","...!"]},{"number":2450,"title":"Chapter 2450: Chapter 2449 True Death! II","paragraphs":["2449 True Death! II","A dreadful sensation!","Something that utterly rejected reality, and because Noah was someone who expanded upon reality and altered it in fantastical ways...it seemed entirely opposed to him.","It passed through the gaps between the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity and entered Noah's Aspects of Existence as for some portions of what made him...he couldn't feel them!","A sense of danger came, but it didn't fully settle in as the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity was still present.","With it, he knew that he could push away this dreadful feeling of nothingness at any point in time.","He...could not obtain what he wanted this way!","He wanted to be able to withstand the region that was outside the scope of space, time, and reality without relying on a single essence.","To obtain such a thing, it would be an impossibility when he had something he could always fall back on!","The Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity was a safety net.","So long as he had access to it and could call upon it, he knew that he would always be okay.","But...to achieve the transformation he sought, he had to fully bask in nothingness without this safety net behind him!","He knew in his heart that this was the only way new possibilities would open.","The utilization of clones was meaningless as that was another safety net. It had to be his main body that took this risk.","But...this was too much of a risk!","If things went according to plan, then he would attain something grand.","But in the case he failed...even if he was connected to the Infinite Plane as he wouldn't perish entirely unless this whole massive Plane was destroyed, his main body would still face True Death brought about with nothingness in this region that denied the very workings of Reality on their target!","\"...\"","THUMP!","He could feel the beat of his heart.","He could feel every breath he took.","He could feel the gaps he formed in the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity and the endless waves of nothingness permeating through.","Everybody feared death.","He was no exception!","An unfair death under the hands of someone much, much stronger than him was one of the reasons Noah strived to be as powerful as he could be!","At this moment, Noah tried to let go of this fear.","The results were unknown since he had the ultimate backing of the Infinite Plane, but the possibility of True Death increased greatly at this moment as he...increased the gaps of the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","Threads of his soul were against this heavy risk as they held on to the strands of the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","These parts of him said to simply wait until after Apexification. They proposed that this risk did not need to be taken!","These were the threads with a sliver of fear of the Unknown.","Noah steeled his heart and slowly crushed these threads of fear.","More and more gaps appeared as he recalled the pristine essence of an Absolute Seed of Extremity, pushing its grandeur back into the depths of his soul as he was about to cut off the connection that allowed him to call upon this essence!","Similar to what Phos and the others had gone through when the state of nothingness entered their Aspects of Existence, he wouldn't be able to call upon any of his sources of essence.","He wouldn't be able to feel his Origin or even the limbs on his body!","He would be subjugated to the endlessness of nothingness as he wouldn't even know if seconds or years passed.","THUMP!","The beat of his heart was clear as the recalled essence had a glimpse of it still remaining.","Taking the risk of such a dangerous endeavor was still something in the back of Noah's mind as threads of his soul with slivers of fear still remained, but at this moment...","OOOOH!","The tyrannical essence at the depths of his body rose, Quintessence shining brilliantly as it blared with magnificence and knocked down the last domino!","It blared as it seemed to scream- this Lineage shall have no fear!","Quintessence rose to complete this deadly choice as the connection that allowed Noah to pull the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity was entirely cut, immense darkness flooding into his Body, Origin, and Soul!","\"...\"","A dreadful sensation- or truly a lack of sensation settled in.","The pristine waves of essence he was always familiar with...he couldn't feel them anymore.","Quintessence that had just risen to cut off the last safety net...was nowhere to be found.","His profound Origin with the First and Second Planes of Extremity!","His robust body that was etched like a celestial treasure impervious to the Essences of many Boundaries!","None of it could be felt as he seemed to be swirling in Endless darkness.","His soul was as robust and as strong as ever, feeling the dangers of the lack of Reality around him as he knew if he allowed it to permeate into his soul...that would be it.","True Death!","\"...\"","The heavy beat of his Heart or the Quintessential Breaths he took could not be felt.","Mind you, his Aspects of Existence should have been undergoing a transformation to establish his Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Foundation after he swallowed the Crimson Extremity Panacea!","His soul was burning brightly against the feeling of nothingness even though it seemed to be dissociated from his body and soul.","But Noah knew this sensation was false.","His Aeonic Soul was fully integrated with his Aspects of Existence as his first task was to find them and sense them again.","When he did this, it meant that he had successfully overcome one ordeal of this region that denied reality itself for its target!","That was the first step.","Thereafter, his Aspects of Existence had to be able to survive, move, recognize, and thrive in an environment devoid of everything!","But was this so easy?","The silence and nothingness around him was deafening as his soul vibrated with defiance and power seeking to move around and sense anything around him.","Yet there was only complete darkness.","A week passed.","The strength of his soul remained as vibrant as ever, countless thoughts being computed every second as Noah sought all possibilities!","He couldn't grasp any Essences or call upon any authorities.","A year passed.","There was only nothingness.","Nothingness that always tried to invade Noah's soul and make him part of it, but he remained unfettered as he looked for a solution.","As he looked for what he had to do!","Uniquely, his Soul had not lost any of its power as even though Noah couldn't sense its full capabilities, its defenses towards nothingness remained just as robust.","What Noah didn't know...was that the potent grandeur of the Crimson Extremity Panacea was still spreading across his Aspects of Existence even though he couldn't feel them.","The essence of this treasure was trying to forge an Unrecorded Aeonic Extremity Foundation just for him as it was altering his Aspects of Existence for this purpose!","And at this moment, wisps of absolute nothingness were the only thing around Noah as the swirling essence of the Crimson Extremity Panacea...","naturally tried to resonate with it.","But it couldn't enter his soul.","Noah himself was stopping its entrance as of course if it entered his soul, he would become part of nothingness and face True Death!","But...the parts that he was disconnected to that didn't have a choice.","His Body and Origin which seemed to not have any cellular activity were also bathed with the magnificence of the Crimson Extremity Panacea as these Aspects...had dense wisps of nothingness permeate throughout them.","And the restructuring Noah was going through...these traces of nothingness that existed outside the scope of space, time, and reality were organized and interleaved into his Body and Origin!","But this was not something Noah knew.","His spirit continued to persevere as to him, a thousand years passed.","Countless possibilities came and went as he found no solution.","He then began to think about the Boundaries he held.","He understood every part of them as even though he couldn't sense them, he thought about their Layers and how he could proceed further with them.","His mind was extremely active as he theorized and imagined countless possibilities!","A million years passed.","There was only emptiness around Noah as he made infinite gains towards the possibilities of his Boundaries and what path they could follow.","A billion years passed.","To Noah, these years were not an illusion as he truly lived them, a part of his spirit continuing to count down every passing second!","Yet...it didn't seem like there would be an end in sight.","No matter how he kept himself busy, it seemed like he would be lost in utter nothingness for the innumerable years to come!"]},{"number":2451,"title":"Chapter 2451: Chapter 2450 True Death! III","paragraphs":["2450 True Death! III","What was real, and what was false?","When his body was cut off from reality as he existed outside the scope of space and time, Noah experienced a phenomenon that could be considered false.","This was because outside of the swirling circular mass of Anti-Mana he had conjured, barely a second had passed. Yet for him who was outside the scope of this reality...more than a billion years passed.","It was false...but also entirely real as the critical piece to understand was the simple fact that Noah currently experienced existing outside the scope of time.","The only way for him to formulate time was by counting what he believed to be every passing second! Thus, from his point of view, he calculated the passage of time in a region...that was not bound by time.","It was paradoxical and hard to comprehend as it delved into the complete denial of reality, but Noah used this as an opportunity to accomplish many things!","For the billion years that passed, he had computed countless possibilities for all of his Boundaries and what path they could take past the 9th Boundary Layer.","For the Billion years that followed, he theorized and computed possibilities of his Realm and what path it would follow.","He calculated the possibilities of Realm Reconstruction and what Extremity Foundations he could grant others, and he delved into what possibilities the Infinite Plane and Ruination could delve into","He continued like this ceaselessly as 100 Billion years passed.","His soul felt just as robust as the dread of nothingness all around him now felt familiar.","But not a wisp of it passed through as outside the scope of time...Noah counted what he believed to be the passage of 1 Trillion Years.","\"...\"","A trillion years.","This was an extremely long time for a being who had only lived for some 27 odd years in the scope of reality without accounting for time dilation!","He thought of himself and what he stood for.","He thought of his family whose faces were ever clear even now.","He thought of his mother. He thought of his Son.","He thought of all the women he didn't give enough time and attention to.","And he thought about what the future held in store for all of them.","His soul shone with immeasurable profundity as it changed and transformed into something even more pristine after 'experiencing' trillions of years.","Where at this point, he came to ask himself a question.","Why after all these years, his Soul had never even once lost its strength while being bombarded with the dread of nothingness?","—","A trillion years for him, but an extremely short period of time for others!","In a far domain away from any prying eyes, billowing stellar clouds rolled as Noah's Avalon Dimensional Chassis was situated behind a cloudy wall as he should have been absorbing the pure aura of Extremity from the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","Yet at this moment, the veiled Adjudicator turned towards his direction as all of a sudden...the feeling of life was lost from his body.","...!","HUUM!","Her figure instantly warped to appear behind him as even with her vein, one could see a troubled and inexplicable expression.","The body of a being before her suddenly seemed devoid of any soul and will as such a phenomenon was extremely dreadful with heavy implications!","Extremity Svetlana had seen it a few times as it was reminiscent of the main body of an existence perishing, their clones experiencing a complete absolution of life thereafter before they broke down into pearls of essence.","But this Clone before her...it remained situated calmly even though it seemed to have lost something critical to it!","\"What are you doing...\"","Her eyes were sharp as it was not ideal to lose an existence that had obtained an Absolute Seed of Extremity this easily.","Her fair hand shot out as it released liquefied streams of Extremity that went to wrap around his body, a shocking phenomenon occurring soon after as the husk of the Avalon Dimensional Chassis erupted like an endless black hole that swallowed up the liquefied essence of Extremity greedily!","Extremity Svetlana's eyes squinted as she still sensed no form of life after this, dense waves of liquefied Extremity continuing to surge out endlessly.","—","10 trillion years had passed.","At this point, Noah had conducted countless computations as after extrapolating a nigh Infinite number of modalities, he theorized of a solution to what he had to do.","Be believed it to be right, but it was a drastic one that in the 1% chance he was wrong, that would be it.","But the solution was a simple one.","He sought to attain that which could help him survive outside of the scope of reality.","He sought to survive the dreadful authority of nothingness as the only way to do so...was to become a part of it.","He had to die in order to truly live.","To gain a quality of nothingness, he had to allow it to be a part of him as he theorized that his Origin and Body which didn't have his active control should have already allowed this.","But, Phos and many others had eventually been ground down as nothingness permeated into their souls, but they simply became part of nothingness as there was nothing potent enough to anchor them or maintain their consciousness in this field of non-reality!","What would be there to make sure that when nothingness permeated across his being, he wouldn't simply stop existing?","What if it transcended the authority and boundaries of Reality that stated that Noah was anchored to the Infinite Plane and that he wouldn't perish unless it did?","What if he simply stopped existing as the construct he was connected to...","stopped existing along with him?","\"...\"","Another 10 trillion years passed.","Noah had calculated all the possibilities as everything seemed to point to the only solution he had come across.","During this time, he had gone through his Barriers countless times as he calculated probabilities of which Boundaries were suitable to form Power of Extremity.","He had even calculated possible Absolute Power of Extreme alongside other wonders like the Transformations of beings like Atlas and Erikson and how he could enact them himself!"]},{"number":2452,"title":"Chapter 2452: Chapter 2451 True Death! IV","paragraphs":["2451 True Death! IV","In the total 20 trillion years so far, he also theorized new skills, abilities, and killing techniques in the face of overwhelming authorities like the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity that could transform into anything.","He stipulated how far he could expand Decreta of Dimensions, and just what each of them could accomplish together...or if he Converged them to form a Dynamis of Extremity.","He also stipulated the Natural Laws and Fundamental Natural Laws and what could be birthed with their Convergence!","He made immeasurable gains as when he left this space and took these trillions of years worth of experiences and computations...who knew what result they could bring!","At 30 Trillion Years, Noah had fully decided on the path he would follow as he would choose to allow nothingness to permeate across his soul, with the end result being that he wouldn't be entirely extinguished and he would instead rise to be stronger than ever.","His Soul continued to experience the vicissitudes of time in a region outside the scope of time, repeating the same calculations and reinforcing the same knowledge as after the passing of 50 Trillion Years in his perspective, he was ready to undertake his grand ordeal.","\"...\"","The absence of everything was deafening as Noah felt the dread of emptiness that had been trying to pierce into his soul this whole time.","After countless calculations, he was extremely determined as with a thought, his robust defense around his soul instantly faded as he didn't even wait for the emptiness to rush in, with him spreading his soul outwards to meet the emptiness as gradually...he began to lose sensation and recognition of large swathes of his soul!","He...was becoming a part of utter oblivion and nothingness as not a shred of fear could be seen.","His soul was akin to a vast sea that was slowly swallowed up by darkness, reducing until barely a cluster the size of a grain of rice remained.","Like the last blazing light in the midst of immense darkness that sought to snuff it out of Existence!","And the engulfing waves of darkness rolled in to completely cover the last shred of Noah's soul as everything was permeated with emptiness!","\"...\"","Emptiness.","Nothingness.","Death.","True Death!","His Body and Origin had long since taken the maddening emptiness in while transforming under the grandeur of the Crimson Extremity Panacea.","Now, the soul had taken it in all at once while the light of the Crimson Extremity Panacea still burned with its purpose!","All three aspects of Existence were now filled with emptiness as for those who wanted to live while surrounded by such a thing...their soul had to wake from this emptiness out of its own volition!","No outside help could do it.","The Soul was akin to the spark.","It was required to move the Origin and the Body.","If the soul didn't wake, the other Aspects of Existence would begin to break down and turn completely into nothingness soon after!","At such a juncture of death where sentience was not there, all that remained were the basal responses of the Origin, Body, and Soul.","The response of preservation and life for any living concept.","If they couldn't usher in anything for their survival, they would perish!","There was utmost silence as no reaction occurred while emptiness fully settled into every part of what used to be Noah Osmont.","Thereafter...a minuscule twitch was seen on one of the fingers of his hands as thereafter...nothing!","HUUM!","Then, a slow pulse released from his Origin as thereafter...nothing!","No matter how profound their basal responses were to preserve themselves, the spark had to come from the soul!","And at such a juncture, the countless probabilities that Noah had stipulated came into place.","The reason why he allowed emptiness to permeate into his soul.","It was because he was confident of his success after trillions of years!","And the only reason for this...was nothing other than the nature of his soul.","Nothing other than the culprit who pushed Noah over the cliff when he was indecisive on what to do.","This culprit knew this innately because its nature was the core of Noah's soul.","It was deeply entrenched in him that even if he couldn't feel any Essences or authorities...he should still be able to feel what made up his soul!","And even after he came to this realization trillions of years ago, Noah had not called it forth as he knew he had to first attain the infusion of Complete emptiness.","And so at this juncture, what made up his soul began to hum in the face of Complete extinction.","HUUM!","The humming was immeasurable as it was akin to an ancient celestial fiend waking from oblivion- a variegated light erupting out as...Quintessence blared!","The culprit that had set Noah on this path and the one that made up the very nature of his Soul!","Quintessence shouted out with glory as it was akin to the lighting up of countless cellular flames- his Body and Origin instantly burning with utmost brightness in the area of Complete darkness!","And in the midst of this astonishing brilliance, the eyelids of an entirely new existence flung open.","BOOOM!","Akin to the force of trillions of singularities being born!","The dreadful area of darkness blazed as it wasn't pushed away, waves of it intermixed with this astonishing brilliance and becoming one as in this new stage of life of the being known as Noah Osmont, a prompt shining with halcyon obsidian ecritures blared before his open eyes.","[You Aspects of Existence have been exposed to the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!]","[You have touched minuscule threads of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and integrated them into your being.]","WAA!","Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","It was termed 'that' by the Adjudicator of Dissolution as she didn't speak of what it was freely.","It was what some existences who had attained Extremity would at times arouse or simply have it.","The ability and capability to live and even possibly prosper outside of the scope of space and time itself!","Vacuous!","Hyperversal!","Authority!"]},{"number":2453,"title":"Chapter 2453: Chapter 2452 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! I","paragraphs":["2452 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! I","[You have touched minuscule threads of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and incorporated them into your being.]","This prompt blared before Noah with obsidian gold grandeur as his Aspects of Existence felt the potent streams of emptiness surging all around!","The authority that allowed beings to survive outside the scope of space, time, and reality itself was termed Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as at this moment, Noah had managed to incorporate it into his Existence.","Something that was only possible for beings who had achieved Extremity, or truly special Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","Noah's eyes were calm and deep as they gazed at this transformation, his gaze seeming like that of an ancient life form that had lived for far too long.","His eyes carried deep traces of vicissitudes as he seemed to know everything that was occurring, his hand rising before his eyes as he saw multicolored waves of radiance in addition to utmost emptiness coursing through him.","This current transformation came through with a variety of factors, where he still felt the essence of the Crimson Extremity Panacea and its wonders, as well as something else entirely.","[The scope of reality and non-reality becomes thinner under your eyes.]","[You were drenched with traces of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority during your transformation.]","...!","Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","Noah heard such a term as his newly elevated soul very quickly traced the Source of such an authority as he followed it to his Avalon Dimensional Chassis, and the visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution who was releasing liquefied waves of the aura of Extremity unto him!","Such an authority was termed Hyperversal Extremity Authority, and this being even had hers at Tier 3.","This type of authority was different from the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that existed outside the scope of Reality!","It seemed that existences who expanded a concept all the way to Extremity attained Hyperversal Extremity Authority, and from these beings...those Destined would also attain the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that allowed them to survive and thrive in non-reality.","[The authority of the Crimson Extremity Panacea, Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, and streams of liquefied Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority mixed together to forge an unprecedented foundation.]","THUMP!","The beat of his heart returned even grander than ever.","All the pristine sources of essence within his body cycled in fantastical ways as throughout it, 81 points of light began to bloom like pronounced singularities!","[81 Extremity Meridian Seeds have begun to bloom within your Aspects of Existence.]","Not just within his Body, Origin, or Soul- but throughout all of these Aspects, Extremity Meridian Seeds to ensure successful Apexification bloomed!","And even as they did so...","[The Extremity Meridian Seeds within your body have had their nature altered as they transform into 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds!]","WAA!","An unprecedented rise in grandeur and glory as Noah knew just how crucial the word Hyperversal was.","For his Extremity Meridian Seeds to contain such a term...it was a boon whose wonders would only truly be known later!","Inside his body, 81 Singularities bloomed as they looked like multicolored seeds emanating immense waves of Extremity.","Along with such an action...","[Your Aspects of Existence are establishing the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation.]","[The Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation contains within it wisps of the budding Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!]","A glorious foundation was being established!","The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation!","It was a mouthful, but it was the result of multiple factors coming together.","And within it, there were traces of 'that'.","Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","Noah monitored the advancement of this transformation with aged eyes as the 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds within his Aspects of Existence released blinding lights that connected each of them to each other!","The lines of connection coursed through his body and connected all parts of him together as his Origin, Body, and Soul seemed to be anchored by these 82 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds.","This in itself was utterly fantastical, but did we truly know of its full significance?!","A glimpse of this was about to be shown through another location as the instant Noah's eyes opened with his Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation being established, his Clones underwent profound changes and transformations as well!","And in the region of one particular Clone, there were also answers.","—","Above billowing stellar clouds overseeing a vast Haven.","The veiled figure of the Adjudicator of Dissolution was continuing to allow the flow of her liquified pure aura of Extremity onto the lifeless visage of the Avalon Dimensional Chassis when all of a sudden...","BOOOM!","An immense force of life erupted out from the clone adorned in purple robes, but it wasn't just a force of life!","It carried with it a shocking trace of authority that caused the veiled Esteemed Extremity to express in a single word.","[Impossible...]","...!","Her figure removed her hand as Noah's Avalon Dimensional Chassis opened its bright eyes, a fantastical transformation mimicking what was occurring with his main body beginning to take place as he locked his gaze with the veil of the existence that had emitted liquefied streams of the aura of Extremity into him.","He owed her immense gratitude as she was the reason his profound foundation was about to be utterly ridiculous since what she emitted unto him was her Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","An authority that his body now carried a trace amount of due to his budding foundation as her surprise could not be contained, her figure coming down to Noah's situated level as she spoke again.","[What did you just do? Your Existence is emanating something that is not in any way possible for you to be expressing.]","Something that should be impossible for him!","Noah's countenance was vivacious as he raised his hand and felt the minute changes occurring as he spoke out grandly, his voice carrying immense age and ancientness within it that wasn't there before.","\"Something I shouldn't have...is it the Hyperversal Extremity Authority?\"","...!","He spoke freely as it didn't seem like the words and tone of a junior speaking with an existence who was far older and more achieved than him!","The illusory trillions of years Noah had experienced had impacts that were far too real as it seemed like an entirely different person came out on the other side!"]},{"number":2454,"title":"Chapter 2454: Chapter 2453 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! II","paragraphs":["2453 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! II","His words caused further surprise for the being before him as she rose again.","Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","He didn't truly 'have' it as much as his Foundation was being built with it as the basis- with this Authority being something that was still very far from Noah, or from him being able to actually mobilize it!","The grandeur of Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority blazed around Svetlana's body and focused on her eyes that came to gaze upon Noah freely.","Hee veiled brows rose as she saw something few others could see, her voice coming out knowingly at this moment in time as she saw 81 illusory dots of light on Noah's Avalon Dimensional Chassis- dots that were radiating the authority she was all too familiar with!","Paired with her knowledge and the fact that she observed this being obtaining the First Extremity Panacea...","[You've forged your Extremity Meridian Seeds from the Crimson Extremity Panacea, and yet they carry with them a foundation of Hyperversal Extremity Authority. Do you know exactly what that means?]","Her eyes peered through the veils of secrecy as Noah replied succinctly.","\"Enlighten me.\"","[Hyperversal Extremity Authority is what everyone seeks. When taking any concept towards Extremity, one has to expand it towards new heights, and then resonate it with other concepts of Extremity to further extrapolate its possibilities, and then either of two paths can be taken. Either absolve a single concept from all other concepts to finally take it to achieve Extremity, or take the identity of the singular convergence of concepts and take that towards Extremity. The moment a concept achieves Extremity, one gains access to Hyperversal Extremity Authority]","WAA!","A concept was expanded towards Extremity as later, it was resonated with other Concepts of Extremity to further show its possibilities! This was the Convergence of Concepts to become Dynamis of Extremity!","And after one forged a myriad of Dynamis of Extremity, or even be talented enough to form Absolute Dynamis of Extremity that were also termed Seeds of Extremity, they held a variety of choices on their hands.","It all depends on their definition of Extremity.","If one believed in a singular definition of a concept, they could diverge it from all others and use all obtained authority to take it further than ever before- taking this single concept alone towards Extremity.","Those who believe in the synchrony of their concepts as a whole could choose to take the whole cluster of concepts under one identity- this single identity of a Dynamis being the thing to be taken towards Extremity!","[Taking a Dynamis towards Extremity is unimaginably hard due to the myriad of identities that make it up, so most Hyperversal Extremities will take singular concepts to Extremity so they can attain Hyperversal Extremity Authority. Their Tier will be low, but they will have attained that authority nonetheless. But you...Your Foundation's Meridian Seeds carry traces of Hyperversal Extremity Authority at their core as your expansion of either clusters of concepts under a single identity of a Dynamis or a single concept's expansion towards Extremity...it means you will not face any issues whatever path you take.]","...!","Taking a Dynamis towards Extremity was immensely hard, and this was why any being who was able to form an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity was extremely special- they had an eventual guarantee to expand such a thing towards Extremity!","[Your foundation is quite literally paving the way for you towards Extremity as it is based on an authority you should only gain after you achieve Extremity. My interference should have not been enough to cause such a thing...otherwise we would be able to produce terrifying geniuses every time a Scion absorbed an Extremity Panacea. Hyperversal Extremity Authority is not something you can simply incorporate into your being that easily...so what did you do to allow it to incorporate into your Extremity Meridian Seeds?]","She had unveiled much of the secrecy surrounding this shocking transformation as even then, it should have not been a possibility!","What could he have done to allow such an impossible change to take place?","The most that her infusion of Hyperversal Extremity Authority should have done is to stimulate his Life force and aid in him taking his concepts towards higher Boundary Layers as they came across the authority they would attain if they reached Extremity.","So what exactly had he done?!","Towards such a question, Noah's answer was a simple one.","And it was an answer that caused the Existence who had achieved Extremity and attained Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority to gaze towards him without saying a word for a few seconds.","Noah talked while gazing at the stellar clouds below with an expression of utmost grandness and majesty.","\"For that, I simply had to expose my Body, Origin, and Soul entirely to Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.\"","...!","BOOM!","A shocking set of words!","Words that left the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity before him speechless!","[If you did that, you would have died.]","\"I did die.\"","[...]","\"I died, but who decided I should stay dead? While bathed with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority and your Hyperversal Extremity Authority in conjunction with the Crimson Extremity Panacea, the current results were ushered in. For that, I owe you a favor.\"","He spoke of owing the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity before him a favor as if this was a grand thing for her! As if it was a pristine blessing for anyone to hold!","And the Adjudicator of Dissolution stared back at him grandly as she asked amidst all this.","[Did you...attain 'that'?]","Since he was bathed in it, died, and yet somehow survived, did he now have it?","Had someone who had not even attained Apexification achieved something never before done in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity?!","Towards such a question, Noah's eyes were deep and filled with eons of Age as he smiled devilishly.","—","[You are establishing a foundation that is paving the quickest path towards Extremity.]","[The establishment of the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation is modifying your Aspects of Existence entirely.]","[Your Origin is changing its nature.]","[Your Soul is changing its nature.]","[Your Body is changing its nature.]","Noah observed the glorious changes calmly as at the same time, his Will moved of its own volition.","He had made many gains in the time he had spent in the emptiness of time and space, but some of his biggest gains were what he computed and theorized in the trillions of illusory years he weathered through.","And at this moment, he began to put the many theories into practice as first...","it was the profundity he had managed to achieve in his Boundaries that far, far exceeded the 9th Boundary Layer!","BZZT!","His will imposed its new understanding of Quintessence.","And utmost radiance flourished as...","[Understanding of Quintessence far exceeding the 9th Boundary Layer is being expressed!]","[The 10th Boundary Layer is not achievable unless one's Extremity Meridians are enacted.]","HOONG!","Blaring brilliance erupted as profound changes occurred!","[Your Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds take on the budding Seed of Quintessence!]","[The moment that the Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds bloom into Hyperversal Extremity Meridians, the Seed of Quintessence will bloom into its 10th Boundary Layer!]","...!"]},{"number":2455,"title":"Chapter 2455: Chapter 2454 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! III","paragraphs":["2454 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! III","He had 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian","Seeds as the moment they bloomed into Hyperversal Extremity Meridians, the Seed of Quintessence would bud into its 10th Boundary Layer!","Normally, when beings underwent Apexification, they had to choose one distinction- one concept of Extremity to define themselves as this would be taken to the 10th Boundary Layer.","Now, Noah had Quintessence ready to do so!","But, his gains over the trillions of illusory years he experienced didn't just stop here.","He had theorized too many things.","He had seen across the truth of too many of his concepts and possibilities!","So his will moved once more.","{Understanding of Loot far exceeding the 9th Boundary Layer is being expressed!}","{The 10th Boundary Layer is not achievable unless one's Extremity Meridians are enacted.}","{Your Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds take on the budding Seed of Loot!}","Loot came to a similar conclusion as every single Boundary under Noah...","{Understanding of Manadynamics far exceeding the 9th Boundary Layer is being expressed!}","{Understanding of Blood far exceeding the 9th Boundary Layer is....}","{Understanding of Fantasia...}","Tens of prompts passed over his eyes multiple times over as his soup expressedsome of its gains in the last few illusory countless of years.","And while he enacted the Seeds of 10th Boundary Layers for all of his Boundaries, the transformation of his Aspects of Existence under his new Foundation continued!","It continued, and his involvement in it was calculative and heavy as he came to focus on his soul.","As his Foundation was being established, his Aeonic Soul Values had entirely crossed the 22 Million number as it now surged past 50 Million.","It had much more breadth.","It could contain many more things!","Even though at this moment, the Absolute Seed of one potent concept had made stupendous strides after its Master was able to survive the emptiness it gave out.","Noah's eyes flashed as he pulled up the prompts in regards to the wondrous Absolute Seed of Extremity that had made what just occurred possible.","{The Convergence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity has reached 75%}","{Aeonic Anti-Mana has been changed to become Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain.}","{Aeonic Mana Drain has been changed to become Vacuous Reality Absorption.}","Yes!","Anti-Mana became Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain to truly represent what it stood for, while Mana Drain became Vacuous Reality Absorption.","He would absorb the very reality around him including other beings' essence and soul values, permanently taking it to become his.","Great strides were made.","Stupendous advancements took place.","And yet, Noah truly wasn't done!","His will now came to concentration on his Origin after he sensed the expanded breadth of his Soul.","His Origin that now pulsed with streams of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","An Origin that could survive outside of the bounds of time and space!","The First and Second Planes of Extremity shone with ever increasing radiance at such an elevation as they were more expanded and filled with quintillions more of their respective Cosmos than before.","At such a juncture, Noah wanted to put into practice another gain from the stipulations of countless of illusory years.","His Origin that was made up of Dimensional Realities.","The 9 Dimensional Realities on his First Plane of Extremity that were Minor Planes, and the 9 Dimensional Realities on his Second Plane of Extremity that were Major Planes!","For his Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation, he had to very drastically define and alter this Origin by taking it to another level entirely.","And he knew exactly what to do as commands began to be expressed from his will.","\"Elevate the Concept of Reality towards Extremity.\"","HUUM!","Reality.","It varied for different beings as it could be altered in fantastical ways depending on one's Soul Value.","The strength of one's Soul and the concepts they comprehended were crucial to the alteration of reality.","Those capable of expanding the very concept of Reality towards Extremity were also stepping on a grand path that was one of the more arduous ones to actually take to Extremity!","Yet for Noah, a Source of Crimson III Aeonic Pearl of Extremity burned as it took such a concept across multiple Boundaries Layers until it arrived on the 9th.","And even thereafter, Noah had already extrapolated what the very Boundary Layers of Reality would look like as an instant later...","{Understanding of Reality far exceeding the 9th Boundary Layer is being expressed!}","{Your Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds take on the budding Seed of Reality!}","Reality itself was ready to enter the 10th Boundary Layer.","BZZT!","Tendrils of multicolored grandeur wrapped around Noah after this action as in the Infinite Plane, the darkness he was encased in disappeared.","Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain was turned off as the blaring and immense glow of his enacting Foundation and Seeds of Concepts ready to reach the 10th Boundary Layer erupted from him.","His visage looked otherworldly with all the essence surging around it, and at this moment...Noah's concentration remained on his Origin as he called up the newly enacted Boundary of Reality.","He then...called up the Boundary of Dimensions!","He was about to take a drastic but calculated action for his Origin which held Dimensional Realities...he took a deep breath that focused on cycling the Boundaries of Dimensions and Reality around his Origin.","...!","He was cycling Dimensions and Reality as he initiated on forming a Second Dynamis of Extremity the instant he woke up from his countless computations.","His Soul had grown strong enough with the establishment of his basis as he could handle another seed- a seed that would undoubtedly be an Absolute Seed of Extremity as well!","He knew this with confidence as apart from Dimensions and Reality...","\"Place Dreams into the mix.\"","WAA!","The old Decreta of Dreams expanded into a Boundary was breathed in and cycled together with Dimensions and Reality across Noah's Origin.","It may have been hard or impossible to put these concepts together, but when they quite literally made up his Origin...it was the most natural thing ever as at this moment, the Minor and Major Planes of Dreams in his First and Second Planes of Extremity began to buzz with grandeur!"]},{"number":2456,"title":"Chapter 2456: Chapter 2455 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! IV","paragraphs":["2455 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation!IV","The Minor and Major Planes of Dreams in his First and Second Planes of Extremity began to buzz with grandeur!","And they wouldn't be alone as...","\"Place Avalon into the mix.\"","...!","Noah's voice calculatively continued to ring out as he continued on a glorious path that no others could follow.","One Dimensional Reality after another began to light up thereafter as Noah took their sources and began to cycle them Quintessentially,resonating already connected concepts that held the same identity.","This should have been much more arduous than when he initially made the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity as its total number of Boundaries would exceed 9,and Noah was having an easy time doing it as he had calculated and run countless simulations over the past trillions of illusory years about this and multiple other possible Dynamis of Extremity!","How they would mix.","How they would resonate.","What product they could produce?","And just what changes it would bring to his Origin for him to be doing this.","All of it was under his eyes as a fantastical chain reaction took place while the Dream, Avalon,Niflheim,Fantasia,Apollyon, Mirror,Prana,Elysium,and Quantum Dimensional Realities resonated with pristine authority while their respective concepts were being cycled Quintessentially with the concepts of Dimensions and Reality!","{The Convergence of more than 9 concepts is occurring as your Soul is being put under a great strain!}","His gaze was cold as he felt like he was being squeezed from all directions,but this was when an instant later,a powerful burst of authority supported his Origin and Soul.","{The budding Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation reinforces your Aspects of Existence and supports the birth of an Absolute Seed of Extremity.}","One of the boons of his Foundation!","It was in its name.","Hyperversal Extremity Foundation.It was a foundation meant to lead one towards easily obtaining and utilizing Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","So it would support Noah's ridiculous endeavors like enacting an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity exceeding 9 Boundaries.","{The cycling Boundary Essences have extremely high affinity and similar Origins.}","{The concepts of Dreams,Avalon,Niflheim, Fantasia,Apollyon,Mirror,Prana,Elysium, and Quantum resonate with their respective Dimensional Realities in your Origin,the forged Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity becoming inextricably linked toyour Origin.}","{The concepts of Dimensions and Reality mix harmoniously with the 9 Dimensional Realities and their concepts as a profound Convergence of extremely compatible concepts is occurring!}","Like a well oiled machine,his Origin thrummed.","His soul bore the weight of the coming Second Unnamed Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as its purpose was the growth and Quintessence of his Origin!","Streams of authority from the Dimensional Realities circulated rapidly through his Origin while the authority of Dimensions and Reality mixed in,all of it following a lemniscate path as a blaring configuration of authority clad in a stellar black gold light.","Radiant black gold!","It seemed authoritative,regal,and filled with power.","{Another Absolute Seed of Extremity has begun to be forged!}","Yet another Absolute Seed of Extremity!","Something that genius Apex Aeonic Lifeforms forged,something that was more commonly associated with existences that had reached Extremity.","Yet Noah had forged one as not too long after,another Absolute Seed of Extremity was born.","{A Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity has been born!}","{The unique conditions and link of the concepts within the Second Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity have placed its rate of Convergence at 25%}","{The features of Dimensional String Alteration and String Theory Manifestation have been born!}","...!","His Origin pulsed with utmost grandeur as fantastical changes began to take place, quintillions of unique Dimensional Cosmos beginning to erupt from singularities moving in string like fashion and releasing pristine vibrations around them that caused the emergence of even more cosmic singularities.","It was the advent of a glorious Seed of Extremity meant to advance the Realm of the True Emperor of Quintessence!","—","Within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","In the depths of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands,on the periphery of the floating obelisks where most Scions were.","At this point in time,most had rushed towards the fissure opening up in the Vein of Dissolution while some of the more prominent Scions were grappling to obtain the Golden Extremity Panaceas!","Yet in the far back of the periphery,auras of immense potency and power were appearing as some in particular were as stupendous as Unrivaled Scions like Erikson or Atlas!","Yet they were far in the back.","Hidden in a thick veil that seemed to actually carry traces of Vacuous Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","Why was this?","Across the Seven Aeonic Havens,were all Inheritances and factions united in harmony while seeking Extremity?","Was such a paradisiacal thought even a possibility?","The answer was no!","Everyone sought Extremity in their own way.","And if beings had souls,there would always be greed and conflict.","Some beings in particular...were greedy for the souls of others.","When they made a move,they moved with utmost surety as they would be veiled by an authority that could hide them even under the gaze of an Adjudicator.","And when they did make a move...they didn't move alone as above them,there were unknown Tiers of Hyperversal Extremities backing their actions who would step in to stop the interference of any other Extremities!","The cluster of veiled entities in the periphery of the obelisks were such types of Existence.","At the very forefront,an exceedingly handsome man with a single central eye smiled with brutality and Valor as he spoke while licking his lips.","\"The hunt this time is for carefully selected Mutated Entities.The Engineered Entity Atlas was at the forefront as The Extremity of Destruction ordained,but strategies have changed.Another being has become our top target to devour as he is known as Noah Osmont.A Scion of unknown Origins who is actually combining an Absolute Seed of Extremity at this moment...haha, what do you all think?\"","...!","His voice dripped with power and destruction as those behind him felt enormous with their overly strong souls, some responses coming out nonchalantly.","\"We've consumed many Mutated Entities and acquired what was theirs before,this one won't be any different.\"","\"With a budding Absolute Seed of Extremity...he will be intriguing at least.\"","...!"]},{"number":2457,"title":"Chapter 2457: Chapter 2456 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! V","paragraphs":["2456 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation!V","Within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","In a region that was artificially rejecting the very fabric of Reality,a swirling mass of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority lay hidden with a simple red robe could be seen.","Everything about him seemed simple,yet Vacuous Hyperversal Authority freely flowed from his body and spread out to different directions!","Even with his simplicity,one would come to notice that his eyes were utterly timeless and filled with age,his pupils shining like collapsing suns as they gave off immense waves of destruction.","He was an existence who strove to attain the very peak of Destruction,and he did just that as during the time when he attained Hyperversal Extremity Authority of Destruction,he saw even greater walls ahead of him!","So his path altered and changed as he lived as he propagated chaos and destruction.","He was among the beings that made it so Adjudicators were required.","He was a being who moved free and unbound by constructed laws.","And right now,he released streams of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that covered a group of his Scions of Destruction that went towards the Extremity Vein of Dissolution,and also a group of Elder Scions of Destruction that lay in wait across different parts of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","One Elder Scion in particular did not need to be covered by his Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as his body silently pulsed with such an authority himself.","The Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction gazed towards this being as he was his greatest accomplishment.","A Mutated Entity he had managed to unfurl the talents of as after Apexification, he had actually managed to attain'that'!","He would be his successor in the future to come as his task now was to target an Apex Aeonic Lifeform suspected of having a Mutated Soul.","A being who supported a newly rising Lineage known as Lernaeans while not seeking any of the bounties across the Haven of Dissolution,a child named Aurelia!","She was among the targets of the aboriginal Lineages here as others included Skoal of the Planeswalkers who was a verified Apex Aeonic Lifeform with a Mutated Origin,Babadan of the Noblesse who was suspected to have a Mutated Body,Rhea,and Daphne of the Quasarian Lineage.","Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that had established their Meridians stably along with their Mutations were extremely special as his Elder Scions would benefit from their deaths or experimentations.","And with this,he would bring about more chaos and destruction.","His goal was to cause enough destruction to the extent that the majority of Hyperversal Extremities with their interests spread here would be tipped over the edge to enact another War that would be Recorded in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity!","He was here alone,but he was never truly alone.","Chaos never moved alone.","'Quite literally...haha!'","The Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction laughed as he thought of the Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity of Chaos.","Even though she was more interested in the deadly beings outside of the scope of time and space,she would always come back to enjoy any chaos and destruction in these Havens!","And so,a sequence of destruction and chaos was initiated as multiple hunting hounds were released across the awakening Haven of Dissolution.","—","Before a billowing cloudy wall that endlessly rose up and down,extending for an unknown distance as it was demarcating a wall between Havens.","The visage of Grand Primeval Silas was stern as he held onto the body of the Dream Dimensional Chassis that had turned lifeless moments ago!","Raise had caused him great shock as he saw it remain floating in space,where he couldn't help but come check its status as after a mere second passed...","BOOM!","A heavy aura of an unimaginable authority instantly erupted out as it caused alarm bells to resound within Silas'soul,his figure releasing the hand he had on the shoulder of this being before him as his gaze was grim,and even filled with a trace of anger!","He...had felt alarm and even a sense of fear from a sudden aura that an existence who had not even attained Apexification?","He buried his anger to better understand the situation as Noah's Clone fully opened its eyes,Silas noticing the abrupt change in this being who felt like an entirely different person.","\"Sorry about that,I had to do a little reboot.Let's keep going.\"","...!","As his body throbbed with a dazzling new aura,he floated towards the wall demarcating the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution with other Havens as towards its pulsing billowing clouds,his hand rose as an area parted.","\"....\"","Something that only Apex Aeonic Lifeforms or those that had achieved Extremity could do.","The reason why traversing the walls between Havens required such beings!","Those who had attained Hyperversal Extremity Authority could easily cross across,or Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who could utilize an authority of a Dynamis of Extremity.","Now,an Existence that had not even achieved Apexification erupted with such authority as he made it seem like even with his own efforts,he could cross freely!","Silas'gaze became even more stern as he reevaluated this being once more.","The being he had made an Oath with!","As he took him towards the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra to view one of the 81 Armaments of Extremity,a sense of apprehension began to rise within him!","–","In the Infinite Plane.","Potent waves of Extremity danced wildly as Noah's Foundation was created with such a thing at its base,his successful enactment of a Second Absolute Seed of Extremity bringing about many changes- of which a large percentage were going towards his Origin!","But as it reached 25%Convergence,this Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity pulled on his Origin as its grandeur of black gold spread out all around him.","It asked to be given an identity.","And as Noah felt its quality,as he saw the idea of Dimensions and Reality that made it in addition to all the particular Dimensional Realities...","His eyes released a deep glow as he spoke out grandly.","\"Aletheian.\"","HUUM!","\"The Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity!\"","...!"]},{"number":2458,"title":"Chapter 2458: Chapter 2457 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! VI","paragraphs":["2457 The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation! VI","\"The Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity!\"","...!","He spoke the identity of the Dynamis of Extremity as a black gold light illuminated everything on his body and origin.","In his soul,a rune burned as the word {ALETHEIAN}was inscribed towards his very depths-seemingly like a budding Seed that would grow into the most deep concept!","Aletheian.","It was a word that more closely defined something as the unconcealed essence of truth.The unconcealed essence of Reality and all the Dimensions it encompasses!","With it,Noah planned to revolutionize his Origin.","And it did just that as the moment it was conceived,one of the newly born features of{Dimensional String Alteration}activated without Noah even lifting a finger.","{Dimensional String Alteration}::The nature of your Origin will be passively influenced by the Absolute Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity to become a bastion of progression and power.The method of progression will be the core of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity itself as the changes it brings are through its truth of infinitesimal vibrating Aletheian Strings of essence even smaller than even quarks to produce bursts of singularities at the most efficient cost and speed.Observing this passive process and increasing understanding in the vibrations of the Aletheian Strings and how they twist and turn to produce their reality altering effects will further growth the rate of Convergence at its current stage,and further proper this Absolute Seed of Extremity to attain Hyperversal Extremity Authority thereafter.This feature is the basis of growth for the Origin of the True Emperor of Quintessence as your Aeonic Soul Values will be passively drawn to power up the vibration of the Aletheian Strings,with very rare and few treasures of Extremity also capable of powering up the movements of the Aletheian Strings...","A description of wonder and very,very simple descriptions of strings and quarks.","It was why his Origin exploded massively with great power-and why his aura continued to become extremely heavy!","In his Origin,the First and Second Planes of Extremity vibrated as they became covered by an utterly gorgeous black gold light.","A light carrying the light of an AbsoluteDynamis of Extremity as the Dream,Avalon,Niflheim,Fantasia,Apollyon,Mirror,Prana,Elysium,and Quantum Dimensional Realities resonated and pulsed to release minute and extremely minuscule vibrating strings of light!","They were extremely small,yet they seemed innumerable as an instant later,the Cosmos within each of the Dimensional Realities propagated so much so that in a matter of seconds,they were double what they were before.","And this number only continued to rise explosively as the Dimensional Realities were expanded at an alarming degree,minute changes also occurring along the way as the black gold essence of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity wrapping around the countless strings of light that permeated across his Origin!","{The First Plane of Extremity has been distinguished to become the First Haven of Extremity.}","{The Second Plane of Extremity has been distinguished to become the Second Haven of Extremity.}","{The First Haven of Extremity has exceeded previous limitations as all the Dimensional Realities within it are becoming Major Planes of Existence.}","{The Second Haven of Extremity is coursing with potent essence of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity as its Dimensional Realities are transforming into Minor Aeonic Havens!}","{The Third Haven of Extremity has begun to bud in conjunction with the other Planes of Extremity.}","...!","A magnitude of changes occurred as first,the Planes of Extremity were elevated to become Havens of Extremity,with each one having its past Dimensional Realities become something even greater!","This wasn't to mention that with the coverage of the expanse of black gold light,Noah's Third Haven of Extremity began to be forged right after.","And the alterations weren't done.","{The Havens of Extremity under thebanner of the True Emperor of Quintessence are distinguished as Aletheian Havens of Extremity.}","Aletheian Havens of Extremity.","Grand in name and eminence as what exactly did they stand for?!","{Each Aletheian Haven of Extremity is capable of passively taking the Concepts of Extremity that fabricate its makeup towards attaining Hyperversal Extremity Authority in time.}","{All other Bound Sources of Extremity connected to the Aletheian Havens of Extremity are afforded the same passive progression towards attaining Hyperversal Extremity Authority.}","{When 9 Aletheian Havens of Extremity are completely forged,all Sources of Extremity bound to it will have achieved Hyperversal Extremity Authority.Prior to achieving 9 Aletheian Havens of Extremity,it is possible for the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity to achieve Hyperversal Extremity Authority.}","...!","His Origin would take the concepts within it to passively gain Hyperversal Extremity Authority so long as he continued to build more Havens!","He currently had just had the Third Aletheian Haven of Extremity begin its construction as if he built six more...","Hyperversal Extremity Authority would be his.","But as he felt the droves of Soul Values pouring into{Dimensional String Alteration}to reform and rebuild the first three Aletheian Havens of Extremity..he knew that this would be an extremely arduous task that required the supplementation of a great deal of Loot.","Mountains and mountains of Loot!","The very meaning of{Dimensional String Alteration}pointed to this!","These were the wonders happening to his Origin as in addition to the pristine black gold light of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity,traces of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority were mixing in during such a time...in the same manner as they were mixing into his Body and Soul as his Foundation neared it's precipice!","{The Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation has intricately spread traces of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority across your Aspects of Existence.}","{Your Aspects of Existence are able to survive in regions outside the scope of space,time,and reality itself with the current stage of your Foundation.}","{After achieving Apexification,the Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation will allow for further changes as in addition to being able to survive in regions filled with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority,you may even be able to move around freely.When you have achieved genuine Hyperversal Extremity Authority,you can then thrive in regions made up of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.}","That!","The capability to survive outside the scope of space,time,and reality itself!","And in addition to all this,such afoundation was a Quintessential one as one more notification came in to give aglimpse as to just how deep the changes and reforging of his Aspects of Existence are.","{Your Body,Origin,and Soul are one under the grandeur of the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation as they can express an output of Damage Values equivalent to a tenth of an Apex Aeonic Damage Value.}","...!"]},{"number":2459,"title":"Chapter 2459: Chapter 2458 Reborn! I","paragraphs":["2458 Reborn!I","{Your Body,Origin,and Soul are one under the grandeur of the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation as they can express an output of Damage Values equivalent to a tenth of an Apex Aeonic Damage Value.}","...!","Such a prompt of utmost grandeur ascended while those in the surroundings began to wake from their stupor as they felt the progression of their Boundaries towards Extremity escalate monstrously!","Those who had known Noah for longer than a few days only gazed forward with solidified trust and reverence as off to the side,Barbatos shook her head with a smile that showed a mix of emotions.","This whole time,she had been able to continue calling him Little Fish without worries or incongruity as that's what she was to him.","Not some powerful overlord.","Not some Conqueror of massive planes and Lineages.","To her,he always continued to be Little Fish!","But on this day when she gazed towards him after she closed her eyes for just minutes...he seemed too grand.","It wasn't the aura of Boundaries or Dynamis of Extremity that they felt that caused her to think this.","Whatever change he just went through now...it seemed to have changed him at a fundamental level as his eyes felt different!","The air around him felt different as even someone like her who had hugged him close countless times...wondered if she would be able to do so freely once more!","Whether she would even naturally be able to call him Little Fish again.","This was because there was something Noah currently emanated due to the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation that even he wasn't fully aware of yet! Something he would learn about in the near future as it caused Barbatos and others who gazed towards him to feel a sense of grandness of a being so pristine that they shouldn't be looking at him so closely.","Even Aurelia and Orion were not exempt from this as these Apex Aeonic Lifeforms felt a sensation they never expected to feel from a being who had not even undergone Apexification yet!","Even though it wasn't close...it almost felt like a shred of what they felt when they first stood before the Adjudicator of Dissolution after they became Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","A shred!","But even this caused them alarm and disbelief as they couldn't fathom what was happening before them.","It didn't make sense!","As for the being in question,he also didn't yet know as he was focused on the last prompt that spoke of his output reaching a tenth of an Apex Aeonic Damage Value.","A tenth of an Apex Aeonic Damage Value!","A single Apex Aeonic Damage Value was what an average existence who had just undergone Apexification to define themselves and attained their first Boundary at the 10th Boundary Layer held. An Apex Aeonic Damage Value of 1.","Depending on how many Extremity Meridians one forged,whether they held Dynamis of Extremity,their Foundation, and a myriad of other factors-this value could be much greater than 1 simply after Apexification.","The boons of one's Boundary Layers and all the granted percentages to All Aeonic Parameter Values.","Any multipliers that their boundaries granted.","All of it was collated to a single value that either made 1 or exceeded it.","Noah...held a tenth of an Apex Aeonic Damage Value before he was even close to undergoing Apexification!","He could release a tenth of an attack of a genuine average Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","'And if multiple skills are stacked with multiple clones or Reified Sources of Extremity and released simultaneously...'","His thoughts buzzed wildly as the possibilities were endless.","And all of this was the initial step as his Foundation settled.","He gazed at his Body and felt his Soul as even though their changes weren't as explosive as his Origin that gained the added benefit of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity geared directly towards it,the essence of this Dynamis of Extremity and traces of the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority still permeated across his Body and Soul!","THUMP!","Each pulsing string-like vibration caused his body to thrum rhythmically as his heart beat like an ancient drum.","Each string-like vibration caused his Aeonic Soul Values to explode upwards a few hundred thousand as with the Foundation going towards stabilization,his Aeonic Soul Values would soon exceed 100 Million.","This was his path.","{Your Body,Origin,and Soul now hold the initial might of the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation.}","{You have attained the distinction of One Who Gazes Upon Hyperversal Authority.}","WAA!","The initial might of this foundation was what Noah had achieved.","When he achieved Apexification,his Foundation would expand to even greater heights as at that point in time,even more of its might would unfold!","And when he achieved Extremity...when he actually commanded Hyperversal Extremity Authority...","That would be the day for his enemies to weep and hide in the farthest reaches outside the very scope of reality!","The profound changes around him gradually settled as what he was truly granted continued to show itself through prompts.","{You have attained an Unrecorded Quintessential Hyperversal Soul.}","{You have attained an Unrecorded Quintessential Hyperversal Origin.}","{You have attained an Unrecorded Quintessential Hyperversal Body.}","{Your Soul is tied to your Foundation,with your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value currently equivalent to a tenth of a single Apex Aeonic Soul Value.}","...!","His Aeonic Soul Values that reached 100 Million were akin to a tenth of an average Apex Aeonic Lifeform who had just finished their Apexification,and it was tabulated to be a tenth of a Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value!","No longer was it an Aeonic Soul Value.","It was transforming to a quality that was even grander!","And this wasn't all.","{Your life force is tied to your Foundation, with your Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value currently equivalent to a third of a single Apex Aeonic Vitality Value.}","{An Innate Quintessential Hyperversal Barrier equivalent to a third of a single Apex Aeonic Defense Value emanates from your Body.}","...!"]},{"number":2460,"title":"Chapter 2460: Chapter 2459 Reborn! II","paragraphs":["2459 Reborn!II","There was the Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value that showed Noah's Foundation was more geared towards defense,with his life force three times as much as his Damage output.","Around his stellar body,a transparent barrier that at times shone a multicolored","grandeur manifested as the Innate Quintessential Hyperversal Barrier arrived to be!","It made him seem untouchable and impenetrable-with those who could hurt him seeming very few!","This was outwardly.","Everything gazed glorious and magnificent outwardly as the main point of glory remained within Noah's own Aspects of Existence-a dazzling set of prompts cementing the grandeur of the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation at this moment!","{Your Mana has gained qualities of your Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation and has been transformed into Quintessential Hyperversal Mana.}","{You have gained 5%Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance}","{You have unlocked the numerical auxiliary value of Hyperversal Dignity.}","{You currently hold a Hyperversal Dignity Value of.1}","{You have unlocked the numerical auxiliary value of Hyperversal Mastery.}","{You currently hold a Hyperversal Mastery Value of.1}","Profoundness that caused Noah to pause appeared.","His soul focused on the minute changes brought about by the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation as his eyes illuminated an unknown darkness!","{Absolute Hyperversal Authority","Resistance}::The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation forges the Aspects of Existence to be as strong and as sturdy as possible, with a resistance against Concepts of Extremity granted that makes it harder for the reality altering effects of concepts to work against you-even if they have achieved Extremity.The higher your Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance is,the more unfettered you can become against other beings and their Hyperversal Authority.","Current Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance-5%","{Hyperversal Dignity}::Dignity is something that those who have brought a concept towards Extremity or those forging a connection with Hyperversal Authority attain.Obtaining it before bringing a concept to Extremity while not yet having undergone Apexification is an Unrecorded Achievement worthy of being placed in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity.","This Value allows the soul to emanate a type of Hyperversal Haki that expresses one's dignity,with a higher value being capable of causing a suppressive effect on enemies to the extent that if they choose to act against you with their concepts, their Convergence of essence to cast abilities or skills may fail,or if they do manage to act against you-the effectiveness of their reality altering output will be greatly reduced.An extremely high Hyperversal Dignity stat will make it so that your enemies cannot even stand against you.","Since you have only begun to grasp Hyperversal Dignity, much of its effects are unknown and cannot be fully expressed by you.The effects of Hyperversal Dignity can be expressed or not expressed at your will, with the methods of raising it not fully clear at this moment...","Dignity!","And a Hyperversal Dignity at that!","It was the reason that when Noah's will passed over his Vassals and those closest to him...they felt he was much too grand of a being purely from the pressure he gave off.","This was the feeling his allies felt while gazing at him.","As for those labeled his enemies?","Life was about to be very difficult for them!","His will experienced blinding as he moved on to another newly introduced term.","{Hyperversal Mastery}::A measurement of the competency with which one has towards Hyperversal Authority.The higher the value,the easier it is for one to take concepts towards the Hyperversal State.","When Hyperversal Mastery reaches a sufficient threshold,every concept that one touches will automatically be taken towards Hyperversal Extremity.Due to a very limited understanding and grasp of the value of Hyperversal Mastery,many of its uses and boons are still unknown...","'Glorious...'","Noah's eyes were vibrant as he saw such a wonder,his Will intent on finding out much more about it and its remaining wonders when suddenly...","BZZZT!","His body trembled and gushed with crimson gold radiance.","{Your Lineage has been affected by the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation.}","{The Lineage of Quintessential Kainos Emperor is transforming into the Lineage of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor!}","...!","THUMP!","His Blood churned as it was pumped through his heart and coursed across his vessels,traces of utmost majesty being added to it as the changes of his current foundation were thorough!","And because his Lineage was something he shared with a select few others...","HUUM!","Amidst his people,Henry's body rose as blinding Crimson gold light radiated from him,his jaws opening to release a bellow of ancient power and grandeur as his skin split and changed!","His dark blue hair became stellar as his eyes released beams of ancient light,his body giving off an aura of invincibility akin to his Father in the distance.","Far away from this region,in the center of a massive Cosmos that had millions of Spiritual Herbs releasing a treasured light of Extremity.","The figure of Amelia Osmont could be seen as she plucked Quintessential Singularity Berries in a small basket.","The mother of the True Emperor of Quintessence.","She had no worries about her son and his capabilities as she lived freely,enjoying the work of farming utmost grandeur in the Infinite Plane as at this moment,her figure trembled as she caused the Spiritual Herbs around her to pulse with reverence!","Her power was contained as her figure became much younger,looking like a woman in her 20s as her beauty could put many others in the Infinite Plane to shame!","Changes were occurring to those directly linked to Noah as even Adelaide who bore his soul experienced a change in her very Bloodline as all her Aspects of Existence felt grand changes.","Every single one of them underwent a great change as it was akin to being reborn!","—","{Name}::Noah Osmont","{Realm}::Boundary Expansion(Third Aletheian Haven of Extremity)","{Lineage}::Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor","{Titles}::True Emperor of Quintessence, One Who Gazes Upon Hyperversal Authority,Aletheian,Indefatigable, Tyrannical Emperor...","{Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value}:: Infinite","{Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value}::.33","{Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value}:: .10(100 Million Aeonic Soul Values)","{Quintessential Hyperversal Defense Value}::.33","{Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Value}::.10","{Hyperversal Dignity}::.1","{Hyperversal Mastery}::.1","{Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance}5%","{Dynamis of Extremity}::","Indefatigable(Absolute), Aletheian(Absolute)","{Boundaries of Extremity}::Quintessence, Blood,Manadynamics,Loot,Reality, Dimensions,Genesis,Apocalypse,Prana, Dreams,Avalon..."]},{"number":2461,"title":"Chapter 2461: Chapter 2460 The Infinite Hyperversal Haven! I","paragraphs":["2460 The Infinite Hyperversal Haven! I","Noah and those connected to him underwent great changes.","But...there was one more thing he was intricately connected to.","Something that his past Dimensional Realities were connected to!","It was the vast Dimensions that made up the Infinite Plane.","It was the Infinite Plane itself!","This too, began to undergo profound changes!","—","Hair as dark as night.","Skin shimmering with an Obsidian stellar luster while a black body suit covered her dazzling curves.","Her beauty was a given, yet her face currently showed distaste and revulsion as he watched her prey like a hawk!","She was Euryale of the Noblesse Lineage.","She had the grandeur of the Prognostic Dynamis of Extremity coursing over her eyes as it would tell her when the opportune time would come for her to strike against the Lernaean Commander leading their forces into her Noblesse Domains!","Her lips arched in a smile of cruelty as she wanted this lesson to be fully cemented, and she knew the time neared for her to get what she wanted as she waited patiently.","Beside her, the Apex Aeonic Noblesse known as Richard sighed as he watched this happen, wondering what the extent of the consequences would be.","Around this same time, on another side of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","The visage of the Fantasia Dimensional Chassis opened its eyes as a vast blue sea manifested around it, prompts appearing before it similar to other prompts that Noah's clones were staring at as they woke.","[The Fantasia Dimensional Frame has been transformed into the Fantasia Aletheian Chassis.]","WAA!","Waves of power coursed throughout its body as it began to give off the same majesty as his main body, Noah's will gazing through this Clone as he waved his hand to cause the appearance of a golden singularity of light.","A Golden Extremity Panacea!","Obtaining one was entirely too easy from those erupting in the fissure that had spread out, and Noah took one for a particular purpose as at this moment, his Fantasia Aletheian Chassis turned towards the direction of the far away Quasarian Lands.","He had finished devouring the Lernaean Domains as his son continued his incursion into the land of the Noblesse, and Noah wasted no time as at this moment, the Fantasia Aletheian Chassis began to head towards the Quasarian Lands with an Extremity Panacea in hand.","In those domains, there was an entry pass known as Xiaomi.","In those domains, there was the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar!","SHAA!","The steps that the Fantasia Aletheian Chassis took were akin to a vast body of water shifting every time, Noah's visage giving off a terrific glow of power as he was crossing the Lernaean Domains rapidly.","Every step seemed to twist space as a black gold light of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity wrapped around this Clone that borrowed the power of the entire Aletheian Havens to cross forward!","Thus, a journey that may have taken a Reverend a few hours at top speed to make...Noah would be able to complete it within the next few minutes as he passed through a myriad of different regions across the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","As for what reception awaited him in the Quasarian Lands? This mattered not to him as he barreled forward, intent on obtaining more Planes of Existence as he saw how critical they were to the Infinite Plane.","This was because at this moment, the assimilation of the Lernaean Domains and the changes that had bloomed within Noah's Origin culminated into a wondrous unfolding reality!","—","In the Infinite Plane.","The tower like structuring of the massive 9 Dimensions and the trillions of clusters of Cosmos above them that seemed like the image of an ancient tree holding up countless pearls of light brightened up even more.","And across it all...a radiant black gold light erupted out as the light of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity covered everything!","In addition to this, the pristine aura afforded only to those who had reached the utmost peak of a concept leaked from Noah's Foundation to surge across the connection shared between man and construct.","And then...","[The Sources of all recently devoured Planes of Existence are being utilized as fuel for the birth of special Aletheian Hyperversal Planes in the Infinite Plane.]","...!","Waves of sources sank into the 9 blinding layers that began to expand and proliferate rapidly, more prompts appearing as they did so!","[When the Aletheian Hyperversal Planes expand to a sufficient breadth, the Infinite Plane will naturally become the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.]","[All past features of the Limitless Plane are experiencing major elevation!]","[The Reified Enders of Extremity are being transformed into Hyperversal Enders of Extremity!]","[Aletheian Hyperversal Herbs and Treasures can now be planted and formed within the expanding Aletheian Hyperversal Planes.]","[Items of utmost quality exceeding that of even Apex Aeonic Relics can be forged in the Hyperversal Blacksmith's Forge with materials forming across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.]","[Pills of deep quality can be concocted in the Hyperversal Alchemy Hall.]","[The Offensive and Defensive Features are undergoing a major transformation to match the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!]","The reason for his need for more Planes of Existence.","The reason for his need for Conquest!","It was to continue building up the majesty of the Limitless Plane that was now becoming the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","He, Noah Osmont...was beginning to form his own Haven.","Not part of the Seven Aeonic Havens, and no doubt much smaller in scale and size right now, but it was still a Haven that he built.","And when he incorporated the Domains of Quasarians, Noblesse, and even the Planeswalkers...he waited for what such an accomplishment would bring!","The transformation of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven he was in was just beginning while his Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation was nearing the end of its boons.","His stats and power had been revolutionized greatly as now, it was time to display it fully as he moved unmatched to obtain everything that he wanted!","He gazed at the people around him as he spoke while blinding surges of light flowed around freely.","\"The space around you and the expanding Aletheian Hyperversal Planes contain treasures exceeding Aeonic Treasures of Extremity. Acclimate yourselves and work to procure these treasures that will elevate your Boundaries and Realms even further.\"","...!"]},{"number":2462,"title":"Chapter 2462: Chapter 2461 The Infinite Hyperversal Haven! II","paragraphs":["2461 The Infinite Hyperversal Haven! II","\"...Acclimate yourselves and work to procure these treasures that will elevate your Boundaries and Realms even further.\"","...!","His voice was magnetic as with the effect of Hyperversal Dignity, it felt like a celestial being was calmly giving a command to the masses that rewired him!","He told them to go forth and obtain the bounty and wonder of the expanding Infinite Hyperversal Haven as the souls of these beings before him surged!","RAAA!","A terrifying cry came from an Emperor Penguin as it was the first to adhere to the command of its Master, others moving soon after as they were being dismissed to seek out wondrous boons for now.","Maximilian bowed towards Noah's visage respectfully as he moved back with the past powerhouses of the Lernaean Lineage, only a few existences being left behind as Henry came before Noah while his main body still buzzed with the changes brought about through the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage.","\"Father.\"","Henry's dark blue hair now carried traces of gold as he seemed like a much younger version of Noah, gazing at his father and the Dignity he gave off as Noah's hand came to land on his shoulder.","Father and son looked at each other with understanding and care as Noah replied.","\"I can reforge your Realm into something I have in mind, but take some time to think about what realm you'd like to have yourself. Tell me after you've come to a decision.\"","He had calculated countless things in the illusory trillions of years as the possibilities of Realm Reconstruction were many!","Henry nodded at his father's words as he turned towards the expanding lights of singularities across the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, turning into a streak of light towards them as his eyes were hazy with thoughts on what he wanted his Realm to be.","The only beings left behind in the immediate vicinity came to be the Aeonic Soul Clones of Orion and Aurelia who were utterly perplexed at everything that occurred, Noah turning his head towards Orion as he spoke grandly.","\"You and the other Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms will benefit greatly from the boons about to bloom in this Infinite Hyperversal Haven. Let them know they simply need to bend the knee and all of these resources will be available to them.\"","He spoke in such a manner towards an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, but it didn't feel wrong in any way with the pressure he released as Orion calmed from his shock and gazed at everything with a calculative gaze.","At the same time, Noah's eyes turned towards an inquisitive Aurelia as he spoke.","\"And you...you made a promise to me for the entry into my forge. Let us now fulfill it.\"","Aurelia's eyes which seemed to be lost in thought blinked as she came to, nodding nonchalantly as to her, it also seemed she would get to ask her many questions about this being and how the things he was doing were possible.","\"I don't know how much help I'll be in the elevation of your Realm when you've already done this much, but I will keep to my words. I also have many questions!\"","Her curvaceous figure was draped in halcyon attire as she innocently moved towards Noah, her eyes twinkling with interest on how a being who hadn't even undergone Apexification could release the aura he was currently releasing!","Beside her, Orion was still thinking contemplatively as soon after, his gaze turned towards the direction where Henry had disappeared to.","Among the many things he thought about, there was the prominent sensation of a connection with the Scion of Noah Osmont, Orion very quickly connecting the dots that what he lost all those years ago must have been obtained by him.","The eyes he lost that allowed him to see much more.","He wanted to hear of how they had been and how they ended up in his hands as he turned into a streak of light towards where Little Henry had disappeared to!","—","\"Ho? The time is actually coming!\"","Euryale held a cruel smile as she had given a specific prompt to the Authority of the Prognostic Dynamis of Extremity.","As soon as the aura of the Apex Aeonic Lifeform left the periphery of the main body of the Lernaean Commander, Prognostic would alert her and she would make her move with confidence that nobody could save the Lernaean Commander with dark blue hair and those around him.","And the authority of Prognostic told her the distance between the aura of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform was getting further and further away as she prepared to make a move, her hand coalescing terrifying tendrils of a lethal Dynamis of Extremity as just when she was about to move...","\"Bah...\"","She spat out with distaste as Prognostic told her the expanded distance between the main body of her target and the Apex Aeonic Lifeform reduced greatly again.","She stopped her movements as she waited once more.","She was patient.","She had a lot of time.","She simply wanted to know that when she made her lethal move, it would succeed with utmost surety!","—","Past the floating silver and crimson Obelisks within the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","Past the fissure that opened from the Extremity Vein of Dissolution.","ROAAR!","The bellows of massive Leviathans of Dissolution could be heard as Scions crossed the fissure and into the wondrous domain within, their souls feeling an increased sense of pressure as they felt as if they stepped into a brand new plane!","There were dozens of titanic Leviathans of Dissolution obscuring their views, but the Scions could see a vast and endless heavenly space past the fissure as it didn't seem like there was a floor or ceiling in any direction.","It glimmered black, white, and gold as tendrils of Vein like trees arched across the radiant space shimmering with black, white, and gold, with these tendrils of veins having at their ends vibrant Golden Extremity Panaceas.","Some tendrils of veins in the far distance even held Extremity Panaceas that shone with an Obsidian glint!","This was only what they could see in the periphery as it was also very prevalent on some of the beautifully branching veins that...they had been plucked.","It meant the Leviathans of Dissolution before them had long since eaten from the fruits of these lands as they had forged their stupendous Foundations.","Surviving against them was something only the truly powerful Scions could do, or the cooperation of clusters of Scions!","Among the Scions coming in, the Leviathans of Dissolution roared out and charged forward without waiting as they defended their territory, Scions like Erikson, Ayame, and Atlas already engaging with their enemies as at this moment...a draconic Leviathan turned its majestic snake-like eyes towards a stellar existence that had not been targeted yet.","BZZZT!","The massive body of this Leviathan known as the Silver Striped Imoogi moved, its titanic body seeming like the size of a world compared to the restricted 2 meter size of most Scions here.","It barreled towards the form of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity as it seemed like an ancient beast was about to swallow an insignificant being whole, and yet when the Silver Striped Imoogi was about to near...","...!","Its body came to a halt right before Noah's most pristine Reified Source of Extremity.","The pride and majesty of the dragon Lineage burned in the Silver Striped Imoogi, and yet its pupils constricted in shock as the moment it neared and was about to act, the relatively small body of the being it targeted felt utterly massive and gave off waves of pristine Dignity!","A dignity that made even a Leviathan that had forged its Foundation stop as it felt like a primal beast was staring it down.","Noah's will stared at this Leviathan and the unfolding domain behind it as he made a move to ascertain something.","His Main Body could release an output of .1 Apex Aeonic Damage Value and defend against .33 with his Innate Barrier alone.","Now...his Reified Source of Extremity could display the capabilities of his main body in a range of multiples.","And the Reified Source of Quintessence...had the highest multiple amongst all of his Reified Sources of Extremity!","So...just what level of power could he truly unleash at this moment in time?!"]},{"number":2463,"title":"Chapter 2463: Chapter 2462 Humiliation! I","paragraphs":["2462 Humiliation! I","Silver Striped Imoogi.","A massive serpentine dragon whose body alone towered akin to a world before the Scions and the figures of all others!","It had lived for an unknown number of years as it expanded its concepts towards Extremity while surrounded by Dissolution.","It was wrapped within the Extremity Vein of Dissolution itself for all of its life and restricted to this region where it found others similar to it, their purpose only being to get stronger until ultimately, they could devour the Extremity Panaceas that bloomed from the branches of Dissolution!","Its will was refined by its dozens of Concepts of Extremity and further propelled towards the precipice after it swallowed an Obsidian Extremity Panacea!","Its scales shone with blinding silver and black grandeur as it was a ferocious beast from ancient times that should terrify others with its mere gaze alone.","So...why could it not proceed any further while staring at a single existence before it?!","Noah emanated a suffocating type of pressure towards any of those wishing to act against him, and this Leviathan of Dissolution couldn't bring itself to make a move as at such a juncture...","\"Come on.\"","...!","Noah beckoned towards it.","\"You can go ahead and attack.\"","WAA!","Immense pride and anger of the dragon race rose from the depths of the Silver Striped Imoogi's soul at such words as the hesitation and pressure it felt dissipated.","Its wings flared out as its chest expanded, a runic magic circle quickly becoming etched on its jaws as an instant later, condensed singularities filled with destructive waves of Dissolution and other concepts manifested in large numbers.","When near Scions felt the pressure emanating from these condensed singularities, their gazes became stern as they could sense the deadly potency within a single one.","A single one was equivalent to an attack that one of the more prominent Scions from the major Inheritances or Seven Clans could unleash!","Yet dozens of them formed as the angered and wounded pride of the Silver Striped Imoogi utilized more than 60% of its Aeonic Soul Values into this single move.","[Barrage of Extreme Sorrow!]","The will of the Silver Striped Imoogi blared out as at a rapid pace, the condensed singularities of Dissolution surged out towards the visage of Noah's Quintessential Emperor of Extremity!","At such a critical juncture, not a single move was made on his part.","He calmly watched the surging points of singularities that quickly arrived before his visage, each one being ten times larger than him as they all came from the colossal Silver Striped Imoogi!","Yet as the first one threatened to eclipse and erase him out of Existence...a fantastical scene that caused many beings to pause occurred.","BZZZT!","The buzzing singularity reached his body as he neither evaded nor made a move, not even lifting a finger as the moment it was about to reach him, a thin layer of light lit up that absolutely prevented anything from even landing on his skin.","An Innate Quintessential Hyperversal Barrier.","It caused the first cluster of essence that reached him to vibrate at a shocking rate as an instant later, the entire volatile mass of singularity broke down and turned into fine dust as if it was ground down to nothingness!","....!","And for the dozen other singularities that followed...","PUFF! PUFF! PUFF!","At the moment of impact, each of them turned to dust as they couldn't even graze his stellar skin!","Such a scene alarmed many, but none more than the Silver Striped Imoogi as the roused anger and pride faded as it remembered the sense of oppression it felt before.","CRACK!","The runic magic circle before its jaws that was releasing the dense clusters of singularities actually broke and fizzled out at such a time as his ability actually failed to remain cast.","A deep ominous sensation descended as the Silver Striped Imoogi heard the voice of the dazzling existence it had targeted.","\"A worthy effort...\"","...!","A worthy effort!","These three words caused the soul of the Silver Striped Imoogi to tremble as they seemed like the judgment of an executioner!","And it truly was a worthy effort, but Noah affirmed that his Barrier alone could block attacks equivalent to 3 Quintessential Hyperversal Defense Values!","This was because his Reified Source of Quintessence could display 9x the capabilities of his main body.","His one third Defense Value equivalent to an Apex Aeonic Damage Value became 3 for the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity, and his Damage Value of one tenth...","He wanted to see the magnificence of an attack that would nearly reach the might of an average newly transformed Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","And so with a tinge of sentimentality as he began on a new path with a wondrous set of Damage and Defense Values...he uttered out calmly as he tapped with his finger.","\"Fireball.\"","...!","Noah's Reified Source of Quintessence stood near the forefront of the Scions along with Erikson, Ayame, Atlas, Lodovico, and other notable Scions who faced their own deadly Leviathans of Dissolution.","Apart from the Silver Striped Imoogi eclipsing everything before him, there were other Leviathans behind this one as well as the interweaving branches of dissolution holding hundreds of Extremity Panaceas.","Yet the moment he uttered the word fireball...","The sight of the Imoogi who was hundreds of times larger than him changed.","Its sight became obscured by a fiery Crimson light!","But it wasn't alone.","The Leviathans of Dissolution behind it to its left and right.","The Leviathans in the distance floating near dense clusters of Extremity Panaceas.","Each one was akin to the size of a world compared to the average Scions here as at this moment, they found their sight bathed with a crimson light while their surrounding reality instantly turned blazing!","The Imoogi was the closest to Noah as it heard the word this being uttered out that cemented its judgment.","At the last moment, it wanted to say that this wasn't a ball of fire.","As its silver black scales melted along with the immolation of its Aspects of Existence, it had a single thought.","'This...is a Plane.'","BZZZT!","What appeared with Noah's simple tap was a enormous circular fiery Crimson singularity that covered the Silver Striped Imoogi within it along with 9 other massive Leviathans of Dissolution that were around or behind it!","And none of them had even a nanosecond more to exist as their Aspects of Existence were burnt to declare nothingness, .9 Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Values being unleashed until each of them as the Reified Source of Quintessence showed its grandeur!","And the so called fireball that caused nearby reality to melt and the Scions nearby to move away in shock...it remained floating and burning as it was akin to a unprecedented Plane of Flames!"]},{"number":2464,"title":"Chapter 2464: Chapter 2463 Humiliation! II","paragraphs":["2463 Humiliation! II","CRACKLE!","Immense heat and scalding waves spread as the cast fireball that was akin to a Major Sun Plane of Existence remained burning even after the Leviathans within were burnt to nothingness.","This conflagration of flames that seemed like a burning Sun Plane remained and would stay for the future to come as this reality was utterly changed due to this single attack that took a mere tap.","The nearby reality turned hellish as magma-like stream of light formed on the surface of this Sun Plane, blazing winds and heat beginning to emanate out in the distance as any nearby Scions behind instinctively moved back!","Their scalps tingled as they watched.","Such a level of damage caused them to turn entirely somber as it was far above what any Dynamis of Extremity should do in the hands of an existence that hadn't undergone Apexification!","Far in the back, near the entry of the fissure leading into the Extremity Vein of Dissolution.","Figures hidden in a unique veil appeared silently as they also gazed towards this shocking phenomenon.","Among them, a humanoid Existence with a single central eye blinked with scrutiny as he spoke out.","\"This actually seems to be a tough one physically and with the output of his power- whether it's momentary or not. We also haven't collected enough information on his Absolute Dynamis of Extremity so a direct confrontation would not be ideal. Skylar...this may be a better match for you.\"","As he spoke, he gazed towards a green haired woman whose verdant hair didn't emanate life, but instead seemed extremely vile and poisonous!","Her eyes shone with a beautiful verdant luster as her face carried itself with a deadly beauty, a black robe covering her curvy figure as she smiled kindly towards the words of the One-Eyes Existence.","\"Naturally. Though once I make a move...\"","\"We will all also move to the other targets. Divide and Conquer amidst the chaos, take them away from any possible sources of support or reinforcement. Then...we shall all gather back here with even greater glory.\"","Another voice emanated out as this time, it was from a dark skinned man with a shining bald head adorned in a priest's robe, a large prayer bead in his hands as his eyes burned with righteousness!","BZZT!","The potent power of these beings buzzed as the verdant haired woman named Skylar was the first to make a move.","She was most ideal for beings who were excessively strong physically or held powerful concepts of Extremity that weren't fully understood.","This was because she held a Mutated Soul that granted her a reality altering ability known as Aeonic Soul Consecration Domain that allowed her to stake her soul and the Soul of her target in a sacred soul battlefield outside of time where they would vie for supremacy!","The one with the strongest soul would come out on top as they would attain the memories, talent, soul strength, and concepts of the defeated.","Her ability was already deadly enough, but three hundred years ago, she was able to defeat another Mutated Entity and devour Aspects of their reality altering ability, her Aeonic Soul Consecration being transformed as now, it could isolate the souls within the sacred soul battlefield from their Concepts of Extremity while affording her ten times her normal Soul Value while battling with Aeonic Soul Consecration.","Her soul was already abundant enough after she devoured the strength and concepts of many beings, but she was given wings to expand even further with such a transformation as he terrifying would it be for one to be separated from their concepts entirely as they only had to rely on the nature and strength of their soul?!","A smile curved across her lips as her body shifted across space, her target set as she moved towards the direction of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity while activating Aeonic Soul Consecration.","She never had to use more than 50% of her Aeonic Soul Values before to pull an enemy in, and she didn't expect this time to be any different!","—","Noah's mind was akin to a Convergence of millions of thoughts as countless possibilities flitted across it every second.","And seconds back, he felt Providence shining as he actually gained the knowledge that he would be targeted, with there being boundless possibilities if he played things out properly!","'Not just from the Leviathans of Dissolution...other Scions?'","He felt like he had eyes in the back of his head as he smiled.","He stopped expressing the effects of Hyperversal Dignity.","He wanted to let whatever enemies there were to attack him as thereafter, they would be turned into Loot!","And he didn't have to wait long before he felt a piercing soul power try to connect to his soul right after the defeat of the Silver Striped Imoogi and multiple other Leviathans.","'Oh?'","It felt ticklish as it couldn't even bypass his Innate Quintessential Hyperversal Barrier, but it held a trace of uniqueness that tried to burrow in while ignoring set up defenses!","'Interesting...'","Noah's blinding eyes released an ever brighter luster as he opened up his Barrier and allowed this soul light in.","SHIING!","It managed to touch his pristine soul as he found a part of himself pulled towards a space where uniquely, time felt distorted!","His interest was piqued as he followed the lull of the soul trying to pull him somewhere, coming to arrive at the set location even before this Soul as he gazed around it.","It was a small circular domain that at this moment was trembling, Noah's portion of soul contained within being so massive that the domain seemed like a stretched out bubble with Noah's figure being massive and towering past its boundaries as it nearly burst!","'Hmm...'","He controlled his soul as his figure reduced, his power entirely contained within as he shrank until he became 2 meters in this circular domain that seemed like a small world with roiling green clouds beneath his feet.","The being that had pulled him in here had yet to arrive herself, Noah sensing the changes around him as the authority of this region actually made it so that his connection to his authorities and concepts was very thin!","He found this interesting as he waved his hands and pulled the soul of the being that had initiated this ability closer, allowing her soul to descend at a faster pace as a bright light bloomed not too far from him!"]},{"number":2465,"title":"Chapter 2465: Chapter 2464 Humiliation! III","paragraphs":["2464 Humiliation! III","The light revealed the image of a venomous beautiful woman who whistled as soon as she arrived, a misconception forming in her mind as she gazed towards Noah and believed the two of them had arrived here at the same time.","\"Sheesh, you're the first one to make me use up this much soul power just to bring you in. Did your Absolute Seed of Extremity boost you this much?\"","As she spoke, she took calm steps towards Noah as she seemed unhurried and without any fear!","She even held great expectations as she laughed while continuing to speak, her eyes observing Noah who was displayed in his human form along with his devilish looks.","\"You must be feeling confused right now. Can't sense any of your Boundaries or your budding Dynamis of Extremity? Can't even sense your body outside of here?\"","...!","\"No need to worry. I welcome you to my Aeonic Soul Consecration Domain. In here, we can spend days while barely a nanosecond passes outside. And I...can take all the time I need to grind down your soul and obtain whatever mutation makes you unique!\"","\"...\"","Noah's eyes squinted devilishly as he couldn't help but form a smile while he looked at this being who truly had no idea just who she had targeted.","She saw his smile as she shook her head with a powerful light.","\"Ah yes, the smile of confidence that I've seen on so many others before. You don't know the terror of my Aeonic Soul Consecration Domain until I've shown you a few times just how naked you are without your Concepts of Extremity. You see, in here, the only crucial thing is the nature of your soul. And in this space...the nature of my soul is the strongest!\"","BOOM!","Wild waves of power erupted out with her words as the domain they were in trembled! Her hands rose as a verdant blade coalesced in her hands, her eyes cold as it struck down towards Noah's visage with a deadly killing intent.","Yet before it could even near...","SHAA!","Noah waved his hand simply as the conjured verdant blade disappeared","\"...\"","Skylar blinked a few times as Noah's smile only became more devilish.","\"You don't seem to understand just who you have brought into a critical piece of your soul.\" Noah's voice boomed out in all directions as the circular domain they were in trembled from its sheer might.","The roiling green clouds seethed with terror at the mere strength of his words as the gaze of Skylar's soul changed!","Her hands moved commandingly once more as she tried to use her control in the Aeonic Soul Consecration Domain, and yet it seemed none of the essence and authority in here was listening to her.","Her ability.","Her wonder!","She actually couldn't control it as it could only mean...the other soul in this space was so much greater that it was influencing everything here under its will!","Her pupils trembled as in the next second, the small figure of the man who should have been contained in this domain began to enlarge.","His size came to far surpass her small figure as he expanded into a titanic stature that felt like it couldn't be contained in this small domain, coming to even reach the edges of its boundary as his gaze then bore down towards her with utmost glory!","Skylar felt a perilous sense of danger at such a phenomenon as immense fear rose up, realizing the nature of the soul of this being was far, far greater than any of them had imagined!","So she instantly activated her safeguard that she had never before utilized.","At the heavy cost of wounding her soul, she could cancel her Aeonic Soul Consecration Domain and separate herself from the target she was connected to!","Yet the moment she tried this...","\"...\"","Nothing occurred.","THUMP!","She was in her soul form, and yet she felt the illusory sensation of her heart beating fearfully.","She stared at the massive visage of the being towering over her Aeonic Soul Consecration Domain as he gazed down towards her coldly, as if she was a mere rat or insect trapped in his grand design!","\"Name.\"","BZZT!","A single word.","Yet Skylar's soul faced tumultuous waves of oppression as she forgot everything about her pride and magnificence as she stammered out her words.","\"Skylar. Skylar Blackvine.\"","Her soul trembled as she felt as if she was speaking in front of the revered Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of her Clan!","His exceedingly cold eyes flashed as he spoke again.","\"Affiliation.\"","\"Part of the hidden Scions of the Avernus Clan.\" Skylar spoke out hurriedly as her soul was thoroughly grasped by fear!","\"And the crux of this domain?\"","Like a billowing ancient giant, he inquired authoritatively as Skylar replied while her verdant pupils trembled!","\"A domain where the winning soul...devours everything about the other person.\"","As she said these words, she trembled.","This was because in the next moment...","\"Oh.\"","A single word was uttered.","Then Noah's massive visage brought its hand down, the weight of the whole world crashing down towards Skylar!","A domain where the nature of one's Soul was the most important as they were cut off from their Boundaries and Dynamis.","With his Quintessential Hyperversal Soul, the enemy was only throwing themselves into oblivion by targeting him!","\"Wait...!\"","A pleading cry was the only thing to come out, and it was thoroughly ignored as the visage of a massive hand smashed down.","—","Why Skylar had released her attack, the other Mutated Entities targeting the prominent Scions also moved!","Each one held their own unique might as they thundered down not just to clash with their chosen targets- but also erupting to cause utmost chaos as they had the goal of isolating, dividing, and conquering.","The One-Eyed Existence targeted the robed Atlas who was surrounded by plum petals, his figure blaring like a black pillar of light that Atlas instinctively felt it and turned around to clash with- their forms shooting out towards the vines filled with Extremity Panaceas in the far distance!","A similar scene occurred for most prominent Scions as a violet beam of light crashed into Erikson, a transparent barrier radiant around him as his eyes rose up authoritatively while his dark hands waved down with dominance!"]},{"number":2466,"title":"Chapter 2466: Chapter 2465 Humiliation! IV","paragraphs":["2465 Humiliation! IV","Chaos bloomed across this region as Ayame, Lodovico, and many others were targeted by unknown combatants.","The Leviathans of Dissolution that were still recovering from the shock of the massive blaring Sun Plane still burning before a certain someone also recovered as they used this chaos to fight back and flip this area utterly wild.","Barely a nanosecond had passed since everything began, with Noah's figure only stopped lightly as not too long later, his eyes regained their full faculties as he gazed at the prompts before him.","[You have come out as the victor from the Aeonic Soul Consecration Domain!]","[Everything of the defeated party is claimed by you.]","[A type of Golden Soul Mutationem Embryo has been obtained!]","...!","His eyes opened sharply.","In his soul, a dazzling jewel-like singularity bloomed as it released pristine waves of authority that emanated change and transformation!","His will focused on it as wondrous details bloomed soon after.","[Golden Soul Mutationem Embryo]:: An Embryo holding the reality altering trait of Aeonic Soul Consecration Domain. One can choose to devour it as depending on the strength of their Soul, they may either obtain all of the Trait or only parts of it. The Mutationem Embryo can also be utilized as fuel to empower already existing traits to express even greater reality altering capabilities. Existing traits or reality altering features linked to your soul that are capable of advancement: Infinite Mana, Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation, Infinite System...","WAA!","A short and simple description of utmost glory.","A Soul Mutationem Embryo that could be utilized in different ways- to the extent that it could have been applied to a variety of Reality Altering features or abilities under Noah!","It wasn't just limited to Traits as Noah could use it as fuel for even something as wondrous as the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation.","After Noah read its details, he couldn't help but smile brilliantly as the memories from Skylar swirled across his mind.","She was a hidden Scion of the Avernus Clan as it seemed among the Inheritances at the very peak of power in the Aeonic Havens of Extremity, there were of course those standing against others whether in the open or in the dark!","And she was not alone as Noah's eyes perused the memories of all the beings she came with.","Each of them with their own unique identity as they were Mutated Entities or normal Scions who had absorbed traces of a Mutationem Embryo!","What was even more astounding was the path they took to get here as this was a cluster of beings which branched off from Elder Scions holding might at the Apex Aeonic Lifeform level, such beings currently spread out across the Haven of Dissolution as above all of them and working in tandem with this group currently...","Was none other than an existence that had achieved Hyperversal Extremity Authority.","And not just that, but they also held Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as well!","\"Ah...\"","Noah couldn't help but lick his lips at such a vast cluster of possible Loot.","His eyes shone with a devilish glint as even when faced with the possibility of an intervention of a Hyperversal Extremity Existence, he was unfettered and didn't even think of stepping back!","His memories from Skylar were broken down as the profiles of multiple of her comrades appeared, his body flashing with indomitable might as he moved towards a certain direction soon after!","—","\"Haha, the famous Son of Haven, Atlas! To think you would form a Dynamis of Extremity without even the interference of treasures...what exactly are you hiding in your soul?!\"","A booming voice followed by bookings pillars of black light smashed down as stellar black, gold, and white vines were ripped out, scintillating Golden Extremity Panaceas thrown about and floating in space wondrously.","Atlas' robe was drenched in a deeply pink light as he held his white sword in front of him, his eyes sharp as he stared at the One-Eyed Existence before him!","He was actually someone that Atlas had heard of before- from the reclusive and hidden giant known as the Avernus Clan!","\"The One-Eyed Hunter Azazel...what bolstered you to have crawled out of the hole in the depths of hell you normally hide in?\"","Atlas' eyes were sharp as 150 years ago, stories had spread about how Scions from the Avernus Clan and the Barbarians of Extremity had come to a conflict, and there was outrage at the atrocities where Azazel wiped out entire squadrons of Scions until Apex Aeonic Lifeforms had to intervene- a small war breaking out between the two sides!","He had moved in the shadows thereafter as not much was heard about him, but for him to appear here...","Atlas had a calm expression as he pulled his sword close.","His memories as a Regressor didn't show much about this being as he had only seen a few of the possibilities.","He gazed towards the far away blinding Sun Plane that a unique existence had cast and their current position as he voiced out while hundreds of Plum petals unfurled around him.","\"I've heard that you are a Mutated Entity with something called...\"","\"Absolute Defense Penetration.\" Azazel's voice rang out domineeringly as his hands conjured dozens of black pillars of light.","His single eye squinted with bloodlust as he was a being who could ignore the authorities of other beings' boundaries and to an extent even Dynamis of Extremity to entirely bypass their defenses and directly wound their souls!","He was a straightforward and deadly combatant whose attacks had caught many off guard with their deaths being cemented.","His body bellowed with pillars of black light as he bellowed out!","\"I come today with the glorious purpose of claiming nothing else other than your soul. Thereafter...I shall establish my Foundation before participating in the Culmination Step of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution where even your Elders of the Plum Sword of Extremity...they shall all be falling under my ar-\"","BZZZT!","Before Azazel could finish his hand monologue, space warped as the appearance of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity appeared behind him- the arms of this pristine Existence coming from both left and right as two radiant cherry-colored Infinity symbols rotated and smashed towards each other with Azazel at the center!","His head was barely able to turn as his eyes showed unbelievable shock and a rising sense of dread, but the two hands with rotating Infinity symbols came together without any interference as akin to a pancake...the entire body of Azazel was flattened!","...!","Torrential waves of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity vibrated as an instant later, the flattened being buzzed as everything about him was ground to dust.","\"...\"","Atlas was silent as he contained his shock, because what had just happened wasn't even a fight.","It was utter humiliation!","And the being responsible seemed unfettered as his voice emanated out.","\"Another one down.\"","The appearance of the Reified Source of Quintessence uttered out with a devilish glint in its eyes as a message rose.","[A type of Golden Body Mutationem Embryo has been obtained!]","A dazzling message that only caused his eyes to shine with a greedy light of greed as without even gazing at Atlas, he turned towards another direction where the next Mutated Entity lay!"]},{"number":2467,"title":"Chapter 2467: Chapter 2466 No Mercy! I","paragraphs":["2466 No Mercy! I","Henry gazed at the fantastical scene of the expansion of utterly massive Aletheian Hyperversal Planes that used to be small Dimensions not too long ago.","His sight focused on the lowest layer which was the past Dream Dimension as he saw rapidly proliferating sandy gold mountains that were as massive as cosmos, with some snaking across the land to be as stupendous ancient holy lands!","They seemed like a mere glimpse of the titanic Reality Passages he at times saw in his father's Origin along with the unbreakable pillars of stanchions of glorious light.","A sense of profundity was contained within as he watched this process, with his thoughts disorganized as he pondered about what to do for his own Origin.","There were a great deal of opportunities from his father, and if he grasped this one to forge something utterly unimaginable...","HOONG!","While in his thoughts, he felt the booming aura of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform behind him as the visage of Orion came to a stop a few meters from him.","His own gaze was a mix of emotions as this was an Ancestor of the Lernaean Lineage who was the very first True Emperor of the past Barren Lands!","Henry knew why he was here as he spoke calmly towards this being even though he should have been someone of much higher status than him!","\"Have you come to take back your eyes?\"","He had lived for a truly short period of time.","And yet he spoke to a being that had lived for billions of years freely- the tyranny of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage burning brightly inside him!","Orion looked at this while shaking his head with a smile.","\"You are not far from your father at all. No, I am not here to take back those eyes. After I lost my connection to them, I never tried to regain it as without them, my vision only continued to expand. But...they are still part of me. I wish to know how they have been used. I wish to know how they ended up in your hands.\"","His voice was akin to that of an old man wishing to ease his heart as Henry turned towards him briefly before turning his gaze back to the expanding Haven before him.","His voice was light as he began slowly.","\"The last person to have them, however briefly it was, was a child known as Oppenheimer...\"","A story began between an existence with an utterly young soul and one who had experienced too much age and time!","—","BOOM!","A shocking battle!","Erikson's figure was indomitable as the probability of piercing through the barrier around him was still at 0, yet the force his enemy released was still enough to push his body back.","With no injuries, his dominating visage ripped apart the black gold branching Vein he had smashed into, his hand motioning towards the two Golden Extremity Panaceas blooming from its stalk as they were propelled towards him- disappearing into his unique storage as soon as they neared him!","He then licked his lips as he remained carefree, bending down to pull one of his beach slippers off of his right foot and grasping it in his hands.","\"Now you've gone and made me draw my weapon. Are you ready for what is to come?\"","He grasped the slipper in his hands with shocking dominance as his enemy was a tall humanoid whose entire body was made of pulsing neon lights.","She felt the rising pressure in the surroundings as she scoffed, the robe she wore coming off as one could see a glistening automaton skin layered with dense neon lights, her hands forming into pulsing cannon like weapons as her plump breasts were circular metal blessing that released a gleaming mechanical light!","As she glared at Erikson holding the slipper in his hands, anger rose in her heart as behind her back, the sound of an engine humming began to resound as hundreds of illusory drones appeared behind her.","\"I hate fools like you the most. Fools that have lived a life so good that they take nothing seriously.\"","WAA!","Each of the Hundreds of drones in the skies gradually became real as they shone with a dangerous glint- the power they released matching an Unequaled Reverend Emperor for every single one!","It was like facing a few hundred Unequaled Reverend Emperors in the form of neon death drones, yet Erikson seemed unfettered.","\"Remember my name as you perish. I am the disciple of the great Hyperversal Extremity Mechanica. I fused my wounded soul with countless automatons until I gained a alteration capable of turning the bodies of my enemies into an army of automatons that are impervious to Boundary Essences!\"","The fluorescent lights around her blared gorgeously as the hundreds of drones behind her pulsed while releasing pulsing missiles from their lower compartments- ready to bombard everything here!","Gazing at this scene, Erikson scoffed as he raised the slipper in his hand- this simple object expanding and becoming enormous above him as a fantastical distorted probability was attached to it.","Yet the enemy before him continued.","\"I am the ruler of the Innumerable Drones of Destruction. And I will have my retaliation against the Clans that wiped out my whole Inheritance because of their greed for our technology. You will just be the first. This, I swear in my name. For I am Sal-...!?\"","BOOOM!","Her words first get to finish.","From above, the splendid figure of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity had appeared as his hands held a sparkling cherry colored spear of light- this spear smashing down from above as it pierced the head of the mechanical existence before Erikson, facing no obstruction as the Spear continued further down and separated the chest, waist, and eventually the entire body was split in two from top to bottom!","Thereafter...","BZZT!","The essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity buzzed as the two halves of the body and every trace of Aspects of Existence they held became wrapped in a light of destruction as they turned into dust!"]},{"number":2468,"title":"Chapter 2468: Chapter 2467 No Mercy! II","paragraphs":["2467 No Mercy! II","A cherry colored spear descended from nowhere and turned its target to dust soon after, a prompt rising before Noah's eyes soon after as the illusory drones in the surroundings faded.","[A type of Golden Origin Mutationem Embryo has been obtained!]","A welcomed prompt that came at the same time as Erikson's voice echoed out in the distance.","\"You didn't have to kill steal a creature like that...I was curious about her mutation too!\"","The slipper in his hands reduced in size as Noah's visage gazed towards him calmly while replying.","\"You all take too long and give them time to begin telling their histories and motivations.\"","...!","\"The motivations of these enemies do not matter. Lesser side characters like them should only have a line or two before they perish.\"","WAA!","Noah's voice was resonant as he had already heard the brief histories of two of these Mutated Entities before they died.","Even though they had been killed seconds in between, Noah still felt like it was taking too long as before any major changes occurred, he wanted to sweep all of them away and make them his Loot!","To accomplish such a thing quickly, his eyes shone as an ability that would aid him in doing just that was available.","And it was one that he wanted to test out as well.","It was String Theory Manifestation!","[String Theory Manifestation]:: The nature of reality has been a conundrum that many have tried to solve. This ability allows you to discern reality and its makeup through the lens of an infinite number of Aletheian strings moving in harmony to form the very fabric of reality, waves of vibrations being released that usher forth the movements of the very atoms and forces that make up nature in different dimensions. It is but a theory, but a manifestation of it makes it closer towards truth than a theory. Activating it will passively consume your soul values as you enter a state where you can manipulate nature smoothly through the vibrations of strings and how they alter the different dimensions of reality. Greater understanding of this will increase the rate of Convergence of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity and even the formation of your Aletheian Havens of Extremity...","A feature that took the 9th Boundary Layer of Dimensions and put it on steroids!","The 9th Boundary Layer of Dimensions gave Noah a peek at utilizing the string like vibrations of nature and how different Dimensions of reality came to be because of it, but the control gained from String Theory Manifestation was unimaginably greater.","And now, he wanted to see just to what extent the different dimensions of reality could be manipulated with it!","\"String Theory Manifestation.\"","HUUM!","Time seemed to slow down Infinitely to the point that it came to a halt.","With his Quintessential Emperor of Extremity at the very center, a black gold light of utmost regality flourished around Noah and spread out.","His eyes of singularities were closed as with his body at the center, he felt countless string like vibrations emanating outwards and continuing to spread towards the nearby reality!","They spread far and wide as they came to cover Erikson.","Noah's soul felt like it was interconnected to the countless vibrations of the Aletheian Strings as he was everywhere they passed.","The vibrations passed through Erikson as Noah felt the transparent Boundary around this being that held a staunch and unbreakable authority of reality. Yet he knew that in this state, he could manipulate the string like vibrations to break down this Authority and reach the Aspects of Existence of this being!","But this wasn't the current enemy.","The Aletheian Strings continued to propagate outwards as very quickly, they covered vast distances as Ayame's figure and the one attacking her could be seen.","Lodovico's visage and his attacker could be seen!","Bharatam of the Prometheus Clan and his attacker could be felt as the countless strings like vibrations reached them!","Antoinette of the Scholars of Extremity with her wand thrust out and blaring with singularities could be seen as her attacker was a massive existence that had transformed into a Reality Devouring Gold Ant.","Noah felt all of this as with the countless string like vibrations he felt, it was as if his will had reached all of these places!","The makeup of reality was that of these strings and the vibrations they released. So if he used the dominance of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity to simply impose his will through these materialized strings...","THUMP!","He felt the beat of his heart as with his eyes closed, he grasped the Spear filled with the essence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity...and threw it in front of him.","The Spear was wrapped in the countless string like vibrations as an instant later, it disappeared as if it melded and traversed through them, crossing vast distances like nothing as it warped across space to manifest once more from the strings right before the enemy that Ayame faced!","At this same time, Noah's right hand that had just released the Spear thrust out with a fist- a massive black gold stellar illusory fist materializing and shooting out as it also melded in the string like vibrations and instantly came to appear behind the enemy in front of Antoinette!","Noah's left hand then tapped as a ray of severing light formed and shot out, carried by the string like vibrations to instantly appear above the Mutated Entity that Lodovico faced.","Thereafter, a sea of blue flames bloomed before him as they also spread out in different directions, being carried by the countless strings he could feel as they instantly appeared next to their targets!","And in the nanosecond that followed...reality resumed as normal.","Yet before multiple Mutated Entities, horrific attacks arrived at the same time as a burning cherry colored spear annihilated reality around one entity.","A massive black gold fist arrived to flatten another Mutated Entity!","A severing ray of light pierced the head of another Mutated Entity who was just about to begin a speech.","And then...massive cerulean seas of flames descended from nowhere as their targets were immolated into nothingness a nanosecond after they were covered!","THUMP!","Noah felt all this as before his luminous eyes...","[A type of Golden Soul Mutationem Embryo has been obtained!]","[A type of Golden Soul Mutationem Embryo has...]","[A type of Golden Body Mutationem Embryo...]","Radiant prompts rained down as the True Emperor of Quintessence eliminated all his foes at once- without even an ounce of mercy!","Tomorrow's working chapter titles: No Mercy! III, Xiaomi I","Adui"]},{"number":2469,"title":"Chapter 2469: Chapter 2468 Xiaomi! I","paragraphs":["2468 Xiaomi! I","Within the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Closer towards the Quasarian Lands where one of Noah's clones was making their way, the skies and the earth were inverted and twisted as broken landmass floated on top while a sky pulsing with tendrils of Ruin and Nullity vibrantly boomed in the bottom.","Past such a region, dense clusters of Planes of Existence shining with obsidian light and pulsing with exaggerated grandeur of a hint of quasars could be seen- a great deal of modifications made on these planes to make them appear like so.","Within the center of one of the more massive planes, towards the deepest reaches of the Sacred Quasarian Lands.","The auras of power contained in this region were much denser than normal as there were nearly three times as many Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as there were before!","The reason for this was none other than the fact that the Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity known as Singularity Overseers had integrated themselves into the Quasarian Lineage!","The Light of the Seven was linked to the Planeswalkers and the Genesis Institute of Extremity was connected to the Noblesse, with the Cult of Endless Shadows sharing an alliance with the Lernaeans.","Many things were done for the start of a smooth relationship between the joining forces as at this moment, two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were moving across the central Sacred Quasarian Plane while one talked.","\"This is the center of our power as this Plane holds a region of Aeonic Quasar Stalagmites- treasures very conducive to our power as we mine a million units every month, and they still continue to propagate.\"","An Apex Aeonic Quasarian was speaking while adorned in a stellar obsidian robe, his dazzling obsidian skin made up of countless quasars shining with a powerful light as he introduced the structure of the Quasarian Lineage towards the leading Elder of the Singularity Overseers.","The being beside him adorned a vibrant purple robe on his fair body, dark hair just reaching his shoulders as his visage showed boundless grace and beauty. He nodded lightly while they continued to tour around the Quasarian Domains.","Eventually, they crossed a region where the Apex Aeonic Lifeform from the Singularity Overseers raised his brows while pointing towards a certain area.","\"Elder Booma, that...veiled domain over there. You haven't said anything about it, yet it seems to hold an air of treasures exceeding any other locations we've been in.\"","...!","His gaze pierced across the many veils as he saw a hidden Plane of Existence!","\"Ah, Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist, that's a sore point for our Lineage.\" Elder Booma of the Quasarian Lineage began slowly with a difficult look, showing slight hesitation as he continued soon after.","\"The veiled plane is filled with countless treasures promoting life force and Vitality because within it, one of our most prized young Scions lies. She was the brightest Quasar to have been born in our whole Lineage, with her aptitude in the Boundary Expansion Realm being so terrifying that she was reaching 9th Boundary Layers in all the concepts she was curious about within decades. Yet, calamity stuck as an unexplainable phenomenon occurred the first day she ventured out. She passed over a region filled with Voidness and Ruin as an instant later, the whole dreadful sea of Ruin in that region surged and poured into her endlessly!\"","WAA!","\"Tendrils and tendrils of Ruin that could fill up tens of Planes of Existence surged into her and filled up every part of her soul, this source of chaos not letting up and continuing to surge into her as we had to forcefully move her body away and stop it from coming near here, with everything coming to a stop thereafter. After bringing her back into our lands though, we found dense RUIN coursing through her soul and vessels as it poisonously began to eat away at everything, her power and grandeur slowly fading to the point that it seemed all other concepts she had were eaten away as the only thing to remain in her Aspects of Existence was Ruin. Ruin that just continued to kill her day by day as at this point, we don't think she has more than a hundred years left. We've tried all avenues to cure her, but alas...\"","His expression was one of pity as he shook his head at what could have been!","Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist's brows rose with interest at such a story as he spoke cooly.","\"Let's go see. I may be able to be of help.\"","...!","A request that caused Senior Booma of the Quasarian Lineage to hesitate.","He thought of the father of the dying girl in this veiled domain who didn't let anyone near this plane apart from him as to allow an outsider...","\"Surely, Elder Booma won't deny help for something like this as our forces are integrated to become one?\" Zeitgeist spoke with a sense of pressure as soon after, Booma nodded as he slowly flew towards the veiled plane- waving his hands to remove the restrictions that only he and the Insane Religious Ruler Caesar knew of!","And soon after, they entered the veiled plane.","Within it, dense waves of lifeforce emanated out of a Vast Space of Valuable Items swayed gorgeously with multiple colors of light.","In such a sea, the figures of Senior Booma and Zeitgeist very quickly locked onto the only Existence here.","Her life force was pulsing weakly as she swam in the cosmic sea of treasures, her gaze filled with countless thoughts as her body was radiant with an black light of Trillions of Quasars!","Yet on her body, one could see a sense of transparency as a dense network of vessels were seen- with thick tendrils of Ruin churning across these vessels constantly as they seemed heavily interconnected with her soul.","Booma sighed when he saw this.","Yet Grand Singularity Senior Zeitgeist...his eyes opened in shock as an instant later, this shock turned into joy and excitement that he quickly repressed!","His eyes flashed with a brilliant light as he smiled and spoke out in a voice that Senior Booma and the woman in the distance could hear.","\"I can cure her.\"","BOOOM!"]},{"number":2470,"title":"Chapter 2470: Chapter 2469 Xiaomi! II","paragraphs":["2469 Xiaomi! II","\"I can cure her.\"","BOOOM!","Explosive words rang out as in the distance, the figure of Xiaomi turned and gazed towards them calmly.","Booma became shocked as he voiced out hurriedly.","\"Truly? How can you say that with such confidence? The only avenue we saw was to maybe have an Esteemed Extremity that had achieved Extremity in Ruin or something similar. Is that...\"","\"Haha, something like that. But I recognize her condition.\" Zeitgeist spoke freely as he floated closer towards Xiaomi.","\"Her condition is a blessing in disguise of a calamity, and my Master...he will be able to entirely cure her. Young Quasarian...do you want to be rid of this ailment?\"","His body emanated grand authority as a purple glint shone in his eyes, affirming his thoughts when he arrived ever closer to this being before him.","The transparent look of her body as it looked crystalline and glass-like while all her veins, arteries, capillaries, and every single vessel could be seen with glass-like clarity!","He had seen this before within one of the most prized Extremity Cultivation Furnaces that his master used!","Others may not be able to put things together, but Zeitgeist knew that what this being held was one of the extremely rare Innate Extremity Foundations- the Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation!","Glass like vessels and a unique disposition!","It held [Hyperversal] in its name as it was a shocking Foundation that took a specific essence it was innately attracted to towards Extremity at a very rapid pace, but it held a deadly drawback as if one didn't contain it when they were exposed to the Innate selected essence, they would perish before they even knew what they held.","This was the case with the being before him as Ruin had interlinked itself with all of her Aspects of Existence.","And of course it would do so when it was attracted to the Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation!","This girl knew nothing about it even with her genius as she wasn't able to properly take reigns, her blessing becoming a misfortune as now, she was dying from the very Source that would take her to Extremity in a short period of time.","'Haha...'","Zeitgeist contained his excitement as when it came to such beings, his Master collected those similar to them as in the past billions of years, he had only obtained a single being with Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation from one of his other Disciples.","And that being was now an Elder Brother of Zeitgeist who had already attained Extremity and sat himself close to their Master!","His Master collected unique beings like this for no other purpose than to use them as Extremity Cultivation Furnaces- with the only Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation Existence he had obtained having a link to Nullity as his master had utilized her until he achieved Extremity in Nullity, adding this as another concept he attained Hyperversal Extremity Authority in!","The Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation of that existence was pretty much used up after that, but she lived as there were still opportunities for her to reach Extremity through normal means like all others after she lost her Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation.","And if he presented another being with a Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation for his Master to attain Extremity in another field...","'Mmm, I will join Elder Brother Kabul in also being granted Extremity by Master...good!'","His thoughts were hidden as he stared at the visage of the young woman who didn't even know what she had.","Seeing her beauty that even matched women who had undergone Apexification...","'Yeah, Master would truly enjoy this gift!'","His ecstasy only rose as he spoke again, since this holder of the Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation seemed shocked and unable to answer after his grand words of being able to cure her!","\"Well? The ailment that has been plaguing you all these years will be cured. We just have to make a trip to the Haven of Helios.\"","He put on his most benevolent smile as the young woman before him gazed up.","And in the next moment...","\"No thanks.\"","WAA!","Shocking words that even caused Elder Booma beside them to blink in shock resounded out!","Booma was taken aback as he came closer to Xiaomi while speaking out.","\"Little Xiaomi, this is what your father and the whole Quasarian Lineage has been looking for all this time, if there is a cure...\"","The gaze of Zeitgeist didn't show a change of emotions at Xiaomi's words as his eyes only flashed sharply.","Xiaomi seemed to have a gentle nature as she turned her eyes that shone like weak singularities towards Elder Booma.","\"Elder, my father had explicit rules that nobody other than you can enter into this domain. Why did you bring an outsider who wishes to usher me harm here?\"","BOOM!","Shocking words emanated from her as Elder Booma blinked in a stupor.","Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist's eyes released beams of terrific light.","\"Harm you? Such a thing...Little Xiaomi, this is an elder of the Aeonic Inheritance of Singularity Overseers. We are joining ourselves to them as Extremity Sanctification unfolds in our Haven.\"","Booma spoke slowly as he tried to salvage this unfolding situation.","Yet Xiaomi weakly rose from her current position as she gazed at the powerful existences before her calmly, her eyes locking onto the figure of Zeitgeist as she replied while shaking her head.","\"As much as he hides it, the light of greed and malice is too strong in his eyes. He is not offering me any salvation, he instead wants to take whatever I have left.\"","...!","One shocking word after another came out as Xiaomi spoke without fear while facing two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","\"Haha!\" Zeitgeist's laugh rang out as he shook his head with a smile.","\"How could I have any intentions to hurt a youngster of a soon to be branch of Singularity Overseers? I will just take you to be cured in the Aeonic Haven of Helios as you will realize my intentions then.\"","He was smiling.","Yet his words now contained a sense of coercion as they seemed like they had to be followed!","At such a juncture...","\"I would like to see just who dares to take my daughter away without my permission!\"","BOOM!","A prevailing voice reverberated out as an astounding aura came in.","Radiant stellar black gold light covered the edges of the trillions of quasars that made him.","In his hands, an glorious Golden Haven Albatross could be seen as his eyes held a sense of ferocity and power.","It was none other than the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar!"]},{"number":2471,"title":"Chapter 2471: Chapter 2470 Xiaomi! III","paragraphs":["2470 Xiaomi! III","The Mad Apex Emperor Caesar arrived in the veiled domain with a Golden Haven Albatross in hand!","His gaze was wild as he looked towards Elder Booma with anger, while Booma himself became utterly happy as he voiced out.","\"You succeeded...\"","Apexification!","He successfully weathered through it and became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","\"I succeeded, and I come back to find my reason for everything about to be taken away with a being I do not know- a being that Xiaomi has voiced out she feels no good will towards! What is this?!\"","BOOM!","His demeanor was relentless as towards his words, Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist lost his smile as he spoke calmly.","\"Junior Elder of the Quasarians...I have been polite and understanding so far. So I expect the same treatment from now on as our forces become integrated.\"","His words released a light of undeniable authority as multiple Dynamis of Extremity buzzed hiddenly within his body!","Yet even towards this low threat...","\"Fuck you and your treatment. Get the fuck out of this domain.\"","...!","His words were blunt as he appeared beside Xiaomi, the Albatross in his hands fading as he erupted with dense lifeforce and grandeur of his new advancement to surge into his daughter's body!","Yet no change occurred as his words only caused Elder Booma to turn pale while Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist became utterly cold.","\"This is how you treat a savior who simply offered to save the life of your most talented Scion? Hmph, it's good to know the true nature of some of the Quasarians joining us!\"","Zeitgeist spoke while moving out, his gaze showing anger that was slowly replaced with coldness as he disappeared.","He didn't go too far away though as his will permeated this region, his Soul buzzing as he pulled out a Communication Medallion and sent his will into it.","\"Master, I have located a being with a Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation inclined to RUIN. Extricating her seems like it will be difficult, so I seek your advice to handle it smoothly.\"","...!","The message traversed across space and time.","Across the veils of the very Havens!","It went through extremely long distances to arrive in a location filled with dense Hyperversal Extremity Authority of multiple concepts, along with the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as well!","The entire region swirled with such potent grandeur of Hyperversal Extremity Authority that even the most powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeforms would feel suffocated.","In a small area of such space, dazzling preserved corpses of all shapes and sizes could be seen floating freely, many showing dull Extremity Meridians never to light up again as the number easily reached thousands.","And that was just in this small region!","Amidst all of this death, there was a single radiant Lifeform who pulsed with the Hyperversal Extremity Authority in the surroundings as it formed into a massive throne that he sat on, his eyes opening up at this moment as he received the message.","His hair was steeped in darkness as his fair skin illuminated with a stellar glint, his figure gallant and strong as tendrils of authority covered it!","\"Another Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation...and this one with a connection to Ruin...\"","Among the many Hyperversal Extremity Authorities he had collected, Ruin had yet to be one of them.","The throne of authorities around him pulsed as one golden one flowed out before his eyes.","It was Destiny.","It vibrated with information as he nodded soon after.","\"If it mind be troublesome with merely Apex Aeonic Lifeforms...Kabul, go and assist your Junior Brother Zeitgeist in retrieving another Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation for me.\"","...!","His last sentence boomed out as a command- this being actually sending a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity Existence out to secure an Innate foundation for him!","He couldn't make a move himself at this moment as too many Hyperversal Extremities had their eyes on him.","This was because he learned early on that on the path to Extremity...resources eventually thinned.","There was ever expanding chaos. And all Sources of Essences and Authorities simply changed from one form to another in these Havens!","To grow further and exceed all others in such an environment...one had to take from others. They had to devour everything around them to further elevate their grandeur!","And this was his path.","He was well known as the Extremity of Devouring.","The Hyperversal Devourer!","His command was heard as outside this domain of authority, a booming aura of a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity followed it and went towards the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution...","—","Noah's Fantasia Aletheian Chassis arrived before the vast array of clusters of Planes of Existence as the endless blue sheen around him gradually warped until his skin shone with a stellar obsidian light.","He had released a wide area of effect attack the first time he delved into the Abyss of the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands as a great deal of Quasarians, Noblesse, and Lernaeans had died to him- their Lineages being something assimilated into his Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage as he could easily pull out their forms!","His skin now shone with a stellar obsidian radiance as if it was made up of countless quasars, seeming like an ancient cosmic lifeform as the air of grandeur and standing of an Emperor still reigned freely.","He received a great deal of information and knowledge on how to get into the heart of the Quasarian Lineage as he made two deals with the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar.","One was that he would save his daughter for the price of the cluster of Planes of Existence he now looked at, and the other was that the two of them would have a match within the coming year as whoever came out on top...would follow the other!","Caesar didn't know what his fate would be before he was whisked away by the Adjudicator of Dissolution as he had given Noah authority and the coordinates to enter the deepest Sacred Quasarian Lands, especially the hidden plane where he instructed him to enter when he had achieved the Extremity Panacea.","As Noah neared, Providence began to buzz within his body as he was wrapped by a clear light of authority- an authority akin to an Elder of the Quasarian Lineage that Caesar had handed off as he freely and without any hindrance headed towards the hidden domain that should hold a dying existence!"]},{"number":2472,"title":"Chapter 2472: Chapter 2471 Xiaomi! IV","paragraphs":["2471 Xiaomi! IV","Noah ignored anything else but the direct path into the Sacred Quasarian Lands as he traversed between the boundaries of multiple Planes of Existence, the Wills of multiple beings waving across him as they left him alone.","His soul felt the clustering of many other auras- even those of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, but he left them all alone and continued forward until he pierced into the depths of the Quasarian Domains!","\"Hmm?\"","His brows rose as outside of the veiled domain where his target should have been, the buzzing aura of a humanoid Apex Aeonic Lifeform could be felt that didn't belong to the Quasarians.","His eyes were sharp and shining with a light Noah was very familiar with- a light of greed!","He also ignored this being even as his Will locked onto him the moment he entered this region, his path continuing straight as he passed across many layers to finally enter the veiled domain where he needed to be.","HUUM!","The sea of treasures promoting life force were strewn all around as the moment he arrived, the Wills of three beings instantly locked onto him.","A smile was etched on his lips as his face still looked the same in likeness to the one Caesar had seen before, with this being gazing towards him in shock as an instant later, his eyes brightened with hopefulness as he was the first one to speak out!","\"Did you succeed? Were you able to obtain one?!\"","Urgency could be felt in his voice as Noah came forward with a smile.","\"Of course, though it seems that a lot of things are currently happening around here.\"","Tension and wildness pulsed in the surroundings as in the next moment, the voice of the second Quasarian Apex Aeonic Lifeform rose out.","\"Caesar, what is this? And the Singularity Overseers are those we have just jumped on the ship of, for you to treat the Grand Singularity Elder overseeing operations here like that...\"","The Quasarian Elder had a difficult look while Caesar ignored him!","Noah's eyes perceptively read the surrounding environment as his eyes and will came to lock onto the third being here.","The one who would make his Conquest of the Quasarian Lands easy as simply curing her granted this cluster of Planes around them!","His eyes locked with the figure of a delicate looking existence whose skin shone with the stellar obsidian radiance of quasars.","A simple sparkling black jeweled dress covered her moderate figure as stellar black hair cascaded past her shoulders like an endless cosmic river.","Her eyes shone with a royal obsidian light as they seemed to be making a judgment on Noah at this moment, blinking like radiant quasars as she spoke out calmly soon after.","\"We have to go.\"","...!","\"Go? Go where? And for what? Little Xiaomi...\"","The Elder besides Caesar and Xiaomi was exasperated as he shook his head, while Caesar turned his somber eyes towards his daughter and asked.","\"What do you sense?\"","He trusted his daughter more than anything across all of reality.","She was the bright shining star who eclipsed all of them before she inevitably fell, and her intuition was the one thing that remained outstanding!","Xiaomi's eyes shone with a weakened light of wisdom as she spoke out calmly.","\"The moment that Grand Singularity Elder saw me, his eyes blazed with a light of greed and malice. He must have noticed something we do not know as his Will still permeates the edges of this domain even now, intent on getting what he wants. Whether by choice, or by force. The longer we wait, the less choice we will have.\"","WAA!","Her voice was low as even Elder Booma held his tongue at this moment, trying to keep everything together while Caesar gripped his fists with his face hardening!","\"Then let's go, the thing that can actually help you has also arrived.\"","Caesar's dense waves of essence carefully wrapped around Xiaomi as he also went towards Noah, when at this moment...","\"I'm afraid this isn't the right choice.\"","BOOM!","A booming voice descended from all around as the Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist made a move!","An intricate weaving of multiple Dynamis of Extremity bloomed as the power of a genuine Apex Aeonic Lifeform erupted out, and it wasn't alone as in the short moment since Noah had entered the veiled domain, four other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms not belonging to the Quasarians appeared.","It was the reinforcements that Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist had called just in case!","The gazes of those in the veiled domain turned somber as a heavy pressure constricted around the small plane, Elder Booma's face turning utterly distorted as he crushed a talisman in his hands, the auras of the Quasarian Apex Aeonic Lifeforms hidden across these lands being called out as a conflict seemed imminent- the weaving of multiple Dynamis of Extremity intent on locking down space erupting out.","\"Zeitgeist! Is this how the Singularity Overseers operate?! We just joined hands...\"","A conversation began between Booma and Zeitgeist as Noah tuned this out.","He stared at the figure of Caesar and the radiant figure of Xiaomi that was actually ignoring what was happening around them and encompassing her gaze with Noah.","In this intricate situation, Noah's Providence buzzed as he found there was potentially much to gain!","And so he moved to secure his boons as the auras of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms increased outside of the veil3d domain.","\"The situation has turned rather grim in a short period of time. Are you still looking for a way out?\"","His words were short as Caesar's gaze was ashen and filled with bubbling anger at the unfolding situation!","He could finally cure his daughter, and now one Apex Aeonic Lifeform after another rose as they seemingly sat in opposition!","Why?! Why could they not leave him alone?","\"Caesar.\"","At such a juncture, Noah's voice rang out again.","\"Are you still looking for a way out?\"","His attention was forcibly brought onto the only other being apart from his daughter who maintained a calm expression at this moment.","A being that had surprised him against Unequaled Reverend Emperors in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","But...he still hadn't undergone Apexification as how could he aid or free them out of this situation?","Even Caesar himself had just entered the ranks of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as he was the weakest of those in this stage currently!","There was no logic to it, but as he saw the continued calmness of this being and no other pathways available, he drew closer to him as he asked grimly.","\"You can provide a way out of this?\"","\"I can. The only thing I would require is the victory of the second bet we made.\"","WAA!","The decided victory of their second bet!","The bet that said within a year, they would have a match as the loser would become a vassal of the winner!","Caesar knew this promise they had made very well as for it to be brought up now...he considered it very seriously.","After all, the life of his daughter was on the line- and they had to act quickly before the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms outside made even more drastic moves!","As he contemplated a weighty choice, he felt the hand of his daughter grasp his arm as she spoke calmly while gazing towards Noah.","\"Grant him the victory he speaks of, father. Worse things than Apex Aeonic Lifeforms are coming.\"","Her voice was weak, and yet it held utmost certainty as her words were enough to cause one's Soul to tremble!","Worse than Apex Aeonic Lifeforms...what did that imply?","The only maddening thing was not knowing why a single glance from the Singularity Overseer Elder would cause such a advancement of events!","Caesar gritted his teeth at such a reality as he spoke valiantly.","\"You have my word.\"","HUUM!","A choice was made.","And Noah's visage smiled as his chest shone with utmost luminosity- the feature of Miniature Pocket Aletheian Haven being activated as a multicolored rift instantly bloomed before him!","He didn't even need to exchange any words or say anything at the appearance of a rift when the authority of multiple Dynamis of Extremity were in the surroundings encompassing down space, Caesar only grasping his daughter's body and turning into a stream of light towards it right away!","...!","\"NO!\"","A shocked bellow erupted out from Zeitgeist as his will fully descended, incredibly sensing the authority of a Dynamis much higher than any of his suddenly surround the last being to enter this domain- the being who was somehow able to open a portal when all space was locked down!","A Dynamis from an existence that wasn't even an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","This being turned his head towards him with a devilish smile as the rift he called out entirely disappeared, his body beginning to turn into dazzling light soon after.","In Noah's mind, there was always the question of whether he could fight Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","His power neared that of one that had just finished Apexification, but the possible enemies in the surroundings...were established Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who may have tens, hundreds, or even thousands of Apex Aeonic Damage Values!","The time to hunt Apex Aeonic Lifeforms would come, but he knew he wasn't quite there yet.","So he released and dissipated the Fantasia Aletheian Chassis as soon as Caesar and Xiaomi entered, one of the goals here being achieved right away as the hiring of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform was all but guaranteed!"]},{"number":2473,"title":"Chapter 2473: Chapter 2472 Impending Danger! I","paragraphs":["2472 Impending Danger! I","BOOM!","Explosive auras clashed and boomed out as Zeitgeist watched the lifeform who had whisked away his Master's possession disappear, his voice ringing out coldly even as Quasarian Apex Aeonic Lifeform came from all around.","\"Find them...turn the entire Haven upside down if you have to!\"","His position as a Grand Singularity Elder was secured, and he also wanted to have good results as he was told that Hyperversal Extremity Kabul would be coming.","He couldn't fail as losing the target at this time...it was already a critical mistake!","HUUM!","Authorities exploded out as a hunt began from the Sacred Quasarian Lands- those leaving it being an Inheritance of Extremity known as Singularity Overseers!","Though even if they turned the Havens upside down...how would they be able to find targets that weren't within it anymore?","—","[A type of Golden Soul Mutationem Embryo has been obtained...]","Past the fissure of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution, the prompts raging before Noah's eyes piled up as those nearby were subjected to a scene of shocking grandeur!","It all seemed to occur at once as a cherry colored spear eviscerated reality in one area, a massive black gold fist flattened another area holding a Mutated Entity, and waves of massive cerulean seas of flames descended in multiple locations as their targets were immolated and turned to ash soon after.","The Scions who were facing these attackers felt their hearts palpation as the damage output they were seeing was enough to make any of them feel a great sense of danger!","And this feeling was utterly unique for many if not all of them.","But...there were still some who held their own heads high.","Erikson gazed at the fine dust of the Mutated Entity who had been boasting before he was turned into mere dust, as well as the stellar visage of the being responsible for his death.","He then grasped the beach slipper in his right hand tighter as he spoke.","\"You've taken a lot of the spotlight, and rightly so with the power you're displaying.\"","As he spoke, he turned around and gazed behind him where throngs of dense branches of veins floated, each of them seeming like snaking paths leading towards a treasured Haven as clusters of Extremity Panaceas could be seen further away- along with the Leviathans of Dissolution not too far away!","\"I'll get serious as well...where I can at the very least obtain the boons to ignite the formation of my Dynamis of Extremity quicker first.\"","Erikson of the Sima Clan was about to get serious!","Noah's visage was still perusing through his prompts as he only gave him a glance.","The calm and laid back demeanor of Erikson faded as his sharp eyes looked further ahead.","The space seemed stellar as it was filled with gold and black lights, the branches filled with Dissolution as a massive Leviathan that seemed like a Lizard Spartoid stood solemnly directly ahead of this region, an Obsidian Extremity Panacea right behind it.","His beach attire fluttered madly as in his seriousness, his left hand flung out as the slipper on his left foot floated out to be grasped in his left hand!","With two slippers in hand, he moved!","BZZT!","Reality was distorted around him.","A specific set of probabilities were altered as Erikson's right hand holding the first slipper swung down- a pulse booming out as the slipper in his hand instantly enlarged to cast a long shadow across the far distances.","It was akin to a slipper of a giant appearing as dense reality altering authority cascaded down with it, smashing towards the Varicella Lizard Spartoid from above while his left hand swung left to right!","HOONG!","A fearsome cry rang out as it also enlarged, the gigantic right slipper smashing down arriving first as it was slightly bigger than the Lizard Spartoid who bellowed out and blazed with green flames to stop it.","With its focus on top, the left slipper arrived an instant later with an utterly heavy impact as large amounts of Soul Value were utilized to make sure that the probability of this particular attack passing the defenses of its targets and greatly wounding it were 90%!","And so...","BOOM!","The Varicella Lizard Spartoid was swatted from left to right, ripping apart dense venous branches along the way as in the spot it was just at, Erikson's visage immediately appeared as he plucked the Obsidian Extremity Panacea that used to have a guard- a choice he had made seconds ago being carried out as his pearly white teeth could be seen, his jaws wide open as they instantly devoured the Obsidian Extremity Panacea.","Seeing the might Noah displayed and the Scions that just targeted him and others, Erikson knew he had to move with intent and power!","And so he consumed an Obsidian Extremity Panacea, his Soul squeezing every ounce of its power as the likelihood that this Panacea could grant him an Extremity Basis rivaling that of a Crimson Extremity Panacea...he distorted and raised it to as much as 75%.","...!","His eyes looked tired and weary as he didn't stop there, gazing further ahead of him where in the distance, the dense branching veins seemed to be leading deeper into Dissolution- boundless riches undoubtedly waiting there.","With his muscles beginning to roll around like tungsten as his Basis was being forged, he moved out with fervor- two slippers in hand as they were ready to strike out towards any Leviathan on his path!","HOO!","Even the laid back Scion was putting in the work as the prominent Scions from other Inheritances and Clans also moved in earnest.","They each tried to shine brighter as they saw one particular being outshining all others here!","What was more astounding in all this was the fact that deadly Scions of Destruction had just descended...and yet they were erased as quickly as they had come, with nobody paying heed or mind to them thereafter as they continued to delve deeper into the Extremity Vein of Dissolution.","Yet these beings were under the watch of someone who had seen everything that was occurring!","A being who had veiled them in Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that was shown how easily his Scions were wiped out right before his eyes!"]},{"number":2474,"title":"Chapter 2474: Chapter 2473 Impending Danger! II","paragraphs":["2473 Impending Danger! II","His red robe bellowed in surprise.","The dense and viscous crimson Hyperversal Authority of Destruction swirled around him like endless waves, his eyes blinking as he took in the reality of a particular group of Scions of Destruction being destroyed in a ridiculously short period of time- each one only receiving a single move as they were entirely outclassed!","This squadron of Mutated Entities was among his strongest ones- and this was why they held the honor of delving into Dissolution.","And to be destroyed like so...","This wouldn't have been much of a surprise if it had been an Apex Aeonic Lifeform having a hand in it.","But it was an existence that had yet to even undergo Apexification, and yet the output he released seemed to be near that of the weakest Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","\"Who...are you?\"","WAA!","Amidst his surprise, one couldn't see any rage or anger as instead, a wide smile arched on his lips as his Crimson eyes held great interest!","He knew preliminary data of this being from his observations as he had changed the main target for his Scions from Atlas and to this being who had managed to begin the Convergence of an Absolute Seed of Extremity.","But even an Absolute Seed of Extremity was not capable of this.","Not the power he displayed!","This being far exceeded the boundaries of common sense as it caused the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction to bring his illusory image up before his eyes, a dense cluster of data rising up as Destruction began to dance wildly.","\"Noah Osmont.\"","\"The True Emperor of Quintessence, is it? What do you have that I wasn't able to pull out from my Scions?\"","The interest of a dangerous Hyperversal Extremity was fully focused on him as the end result of such a development was unknown!","—","In a unique domain seemingly standing above the very Havens of Dissolution themselves.","Billowing transparent stellar clouds rolled beneath his feet as Noah's Aletheian Chassis gazed towards the surprised Adjudicator of Dissolution who heard his affirmation of receiving 'that'!","Before she could ask any more questions though, Noah voiced out calmly.","\"The Scions of Destruction with links to the Avernus Clan have descended into the Havens of Dissolution. I've wiped out the first cluster of the ones who haven't undergone Apexification, but their memories show that Elder Scions who are Apex Aeonic Lifeforms should also be moving and targeting others in this Haven.\"","His words were light as he was speaking about the most casual thing, and yet they caused the dense authority around the Adjudicator of Dissolution to become even thicker and more suffocating as her masked figure rose to stare into the unknown!","\"Beings like them are expected, and it is one of the reasons why I am here. I'll take care of it.\"","Her masked visage held a terrifying light as dense authority erupted to spread out- her desire intent on covering the vast Havens as nothing would escape her reach!","This single action caused dense Hyperversal Extremity Authority to disperse wildly as very few beings could even sense it, but the will of another Hyperversal Extremity who was already observing everything while masked in Vacuous Hyperversal Authority felt it.","His eyes that were focusing on one particular being shifted as he tapped his chin thoughtfully, thinking of the forces he had disperse across this Haven.","If the Adjudicator of Dissolution moved this fast, then they may not be able to accomplish anything!","\"If that's the case...\"","The billowing aura around the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction moved as his figure adorned in a red robe rose.","\"...I can simply go pay respects to the Great Adjudicator of Dissolution. If anything happens while I hold her attention...haha!\"","His eyes were bright as his will surged out towards his Elder Scions, telling them to get ready to make their moves as soon as they located their targets.","And then, his visage disappeared- heading towards the most blatantly shining cluster of Hyperversal Extremity Authority in the whole Havens of Dissolution!","Thus, a sequence of choices which would go to create a shocking future began.","Around this same time, in the Planar Palisades of Extremity where a certain Infinite Hyperversal Haven was floating silently.","In a corner of it, the figure of Orion who was floating next to Henry while listening to the story of his Eyes could be seen.","He signed heavily after he heard everything, contemplating on whether he was right or wrong to leave his eyes be as soon after, his head turned towards a certain direction within this magisterial Hyperversal Haven.","There...the aura of a foreign Apex Aeonic Lifeform bloomed as Orion recognized its signature to be that of a Quasarian, his gaze becoming sharp as he turned into a stream of light to see why such an aura would be in here!","It was, of course, the entry of the Mad Apex Emperor Caesar and his daughter.","Orion shot in that direction, but Henry trusted his father as he knew entry into this paradisiacal Haven would only be granted to those his father allowed.","Thus, he calmly remained staring at the expanding Aletheian Hyperversal Plane of Dreams as he thought about what his path should be!","And thus, another set of choices were made.","Back in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","Euryale's eyes shone with utter brilliance as the authority of Prognostic let her know that once more, the blazing aura of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform was leaving her prime target.","Her soul blazed with brilliance as this was a chance she could not lose, and she mobilized more than 20% of her Apex Aeonic Soul Values to flow into her most dreadful Dynamis of Extremity!","Her objective was set as it would also include all those in the immediate surroundings of the young Lernaean Commander- the main bodies of these beings also being included among those who would receive her wrath and be granted True Death!","Her authority buzzed as it began to move.","At this time, the undeniable will of the Adjudicator of Dissolution was just about to cover the vast stretches of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, and it would have been able to observe the movements of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform about to throw a full powered attack towards a group of beings who hadn't even undergone Apexification.","But just as quickly as the Hyperversal Extremity Authority of the Adjudicator of Dissolution was about to descend, another authority blazed brightly as this action was stopped!","Different beings.","Each making their own choices.","And yet all these choices culminated towards a single path.","\"Haha!\"","An utterly cruel and baleful laugh could be heard as from a Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeform, an attack with unknown Apex Aeonic Damage Values bloomed!"]},{"number":2475,"title":"Chapter 2475: Chapter 2474 Immeasurable Rage! I","paragraphs":["2474 Immeasurable Rage! I","Choices.","The choices of countless existences were what made the current reality!","The choices of extremely powerful beings weighed a whole lot more than others in what reality unfolded, but no single being was free from bearing the consequences of their choices.","In a corner of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, an Apex Aeonic Lifeform from the Noblesse Lineage made a choice as her body glimmered with immaculate radiance, the essence of a Dynamis of Extremity that wasn't entirely geared towards offense erupting out.","It was a Dynamis that was more so geared towards speed as Euryale made the choice of surging with an authority that would reach her targets and their main bodies the fastest!","The power of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform was already fast and dreadful, their foremost concept that defined them likely already overcoming the 10th Boundary Layer as their other concepts were stably at such a stage.","When such speed was paired with a Dynamis of Extremity that culminated multiple Boundaries...","\"Velocious Void Burn.\"","...!","Extreme Speed.","Speed obtained from the Dynamis of the Tenebrosus!","Taking the Void of the Noblesse and elevating it to a greater level with the addition of multiple complementary Boundaries, Euryale was able to call forth such a fantastical Dynamis of Extremity as it focused on the speed and power of darkness.","When one talked about speed, they would mention how something was traveling at the speed of light.","Or far faster than light.","What wasn't normally mentioned was the speed of darkness!","Darkness was the absence of light.","When light left, there was only darkness that came just as fast.","Darkness...traveled at the same speed if not faster than light to those truly capable!","And Euryale was capable.","Speed far exceeded light or darkness erupted out and crossed great distances.","Its target was a cluster of the clones of Conquerors who had appeared victorious yet again within a Noblesse Plane of Existence.","Stellar blinking moons rotated in the surroundings as a silver glow of light permeated all around, the visage of Henry radiating light and grandeur as his eyes released a light of dominance over 3 Noblesse Reverend Emperors.","They lay before him in defeat as around him, the figure of the clone of the Emperor Penguin had its beak raised high with pride!","To his left, Barbatos' clone could be seen as she stood on the floating skull of a Gehenna Phoenix which held the contained light of her Legions within it.","Further around them, the figures of Eowyn, Guinevere, Blue Slime, Tiamat, Kazuhiko, Athena, Lancelot, the Kraken, Anna, Halcyon, Oathkeeper...a great deal of those from the Infinite Hyperversal Haven had their clones joining this Conquest as they dominated one Noblesse domain after another.","None of them knew it.","None of them felt it!","Nobody...but one being in particular.","He was the Son of Destiny.","He was the progeny of the True Emperor of Quintessence!","Destiny and Providence burned fiercely in his Origin as he had also gained an elevation in his Lineage of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor!","The portion of his Will that was contained in this Clone only began to sense immense danger as a thundering cry ripped out the reality not just above their heads, but the whole region of this plane in their immediate surroundings!","Most of them didn't even know what hit them.","The speed of their souls couldn't follow it as the being to target them was much, much more powerful!","Only the soul of the Son of Destiny was able to raise his head up as his eyes brightened up the most they ever had in his short life, the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform bursting from his sockets as he shockingly dispersed the aura and authority of these eyes over himself and those around him.","This was because his destiny and Providence told him a single thing from the endless burning rays of darkness that cascaded from the Havens above them.","Death.","Not just the death of their clones, but what they were connected to as the essence that would rip them apart wasn't even a hundredth of the power which would remain to follow their Sources and decimate their main bodies!","It was a deadly and inciteful move to kill!","It didn't even pause on the dominance of the eyes of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as it shredded through it and smashed down with spite and destruction.","BOOOM!","The time for all of this to occur was extremely short.","The moment that Henry instinctively felt the immediate threat of true death, his Soul moved as his main body in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven roared out a single word- carried the fastest across the very own Lineage that made him.","It was a call for help.","\"Father!\"","...!","The word crossed across the lineage of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor as truthfully, it wasn't even needed.","This was because innately, the Bloodline of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor felt the great danger to a part of itself as Noah's Main Body a distance away that was about to begin a discussion with Aurelia blazed with startling brilliance and moved an instant after.","And yet it didn't take even a fraction of a nanosecond before a booming sound ruptured out.","BOOOOM!","Velocious Void Burn.","This was the ability Euryale had uttered out as unstoppable and extremely fast beams of pure burning voids of darkness instantly appeared from different locations within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven- each one atop the heads of the main bodies of the beings around Henry...as well as Henry himself!","Above the figure of Barbatos who just so happened to be with Valentina.","Above the figure of the Emperor Penguin that was standing before other Spiritual Beasts.","Above Kazuhiko who had been spending time with the Imperial Phoenix!","A dreadful burning void of darkness that carried heavy Apex Aeonic Damage Values flowered from different locations within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as the main bodies of all the advanced forces who were conquering the Lands of the Noblesse were affected!"]},{"number":2476,"title":"Chapter 2476: Chapter 2475 Immeasurable Rage! II","paragraphs":["2475 Immeasurable Rage! II","A void of dreadfully burning beams of darkness zapped down above the heads of multiple beings within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","The speed of the strike of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform was utterly dreadful as one had to be at such a stage to even react to it.","Normally.","Typically!","But the master of the affected Haven was not typical.","And the affected Haven itself was not typical!","The first Entity to act during all of this was not even Noah himself as the very Infinite Hyperversal Haven...mobilized its Defensive Maneuvers right away the moment that rays of burning darkness appeared.","Dense and countless multicolored Aegis- shields of glorious illusory light bloomed above all the beings affected!","Yet even this was still a reactionary action.","The rays of burning darkness were much faster than the formation of the Aegis as above the head of Henry who was targeted with the most precision, dense shields of illusory light tried to bloom an inch above his dark blue hair as this was how quickly the rays of burning darkness had reached his position.","They were an inch away as the proliferating illusory shields were crushed at a far faster rate than they formed.","Henry's eyes burned as his soul was ablaze with power and glory, his devilishly young face bellowing out towards the burning rays of darkness an inch from him as every ounce of his power formed barriers born of his Boundary Essence!","\"OOH!\"","It was a cry of survival and valor, but this alone wasn't enough to stand against an unstoppable power that at this moment...seemed to be in the tens of Apex Aeonic Damage Values.","And this was dispersed over multiple areas in this Haven!","Henry's defenses, just like his clone's, didn't last even an instant as they were shredded.","And a ray of burning darkness crashed into his glorious visage- a moment that turned out to be exactly when his father appeared beside him, his eyes burning with power and rousing rage as he...released a roar that seemed to resonate and vibrate with the very fabric of Reality!","\"OOOOH!\"","Noah's Main Body instantly appeared before the darkly burning visage of his Son, the ray of burning light that landed on Henry instantly spreading to every part of him.","Yet Noah had appeared within this same instant as his body was already erupting out with a mixture of dense essence that held nothing other than...","Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","HOOOONG!","A Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain erupted around them as the first move was to entirely isolate themselves outside the scope of essence, time, space...everything!","He didn't choose to fight against an essence with damage values he could not match, and directly unfolded a domain where essence itself was denied.","At the same time, Noah wanted to cast Vacuous Reality Absorption which was upgraded from Aeonic Mana Drain, but the conditions to cast it were not met as he could only wrap himself around the body of his burning son and breathe in the dreadfully burning essence of darkness with his own soul while becoming entirely surrounded by Hyperversal Hyperversal Authority!","An instant.","At this stage, many things could happen in an instant.","Wrapped in the light of nothingness, Noah's burning eyes felt the burning flames of darkness extinguished, his Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation burning brightly as the cherry colored essence of Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity wrapped around his son.","His son.","His body was charred black as towards its very depths...he felt the blood of the Lineage of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor rouse and surge as...","THUMP!","He felt a heartbeat.","It was weak, but there was a heartbeat.","A small portion of a soul remained after he shared any residual damage himself- with Noah's body currently charred black himself even though he burned with utmost life force and a billowing, ever rising rage!","This was because...he was there for his son.","But the targets weren't only his son!","BZZT!","He released the Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain as billowing anger coursed through his eyes, ready to face the devastation that was out there while the immense life force of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor coursed through the body of his barely alive son.","Less than a nanosecond had passed.","Yet when the outside reality came into view again, the streaks of burning rays of darkness had all but faded.","All they left was an immense aura of shock and desolation.","They had achieved what they came to achieve as during the time that Noah and Henry's barely living visage were wrapped up in the Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain, even more shocking things had occurred outside of it!","—","In the span of a nanosecond while Noah conjured the Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain.","The Infinite Hyperversal Haven felt the booming rage of its Master as well as its inherent protective features of the Lifeforms within it, where after it saw that the blooming illusory shields of light were getting crushed one after another with the burning rays of darkness reaching their targets, even more dazzling Aegis were conjured throughout the head, chest, and torso of all those in peril!","Even if their upper bodies were destroyed, the Infinite Hyperversal Haven wanted to at least preserve an aspect of their existence as to form a fortifiable defense against tens of Apex Aeonic Damage Value cascading from multiple sides...the dense essence of assimilated Planes of Existence that was going towards expanding the Aletheian Planes within it were all redirected to power up its defensive measures.","The quick mobilization of even the Reified Enders of Extremity would not be possible as direct Alteration of reality to assert its authority of defensive maneuvers through these Aegis was the quickest possible option.","The Infinite Hyperversal Haven used what was considered its very life force on the line!","And thus came the culmination that was the reality that Noah currently looked at.","Even with the efforts of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, the attacks still reached their intended targets as it was hard for them to survive.","Where the Emperor Penguin used to be, Reality pulsed with a baleful air as what could be seen...was only a small cluster of a residual soul that was preserved within dense clusters of illusory shields.","And this soul...was actually a trace of Noah's Will mixed in with the Emperor Penguin due to their relationship as Vassal and Emperor!","If this connection of a Servant wasn't there, it was hard to say if even a smidge of the soul of the Emperor Penguin would have been preserved along with Noah's will.","This was because Noah's soul and will wouldn't perish so long as the Infinite Hyperversal Haven existed!","So it was the last bastion of defense for those affected as apart from the Emperor Penguin, all that could be seen where Barbatos and Valentina were was burning dust along with dense clusters of shields protecting two barely pulsing pearls of soul light.","Kazuhiko.","Eowyn.","Blue Slime.","Athena.","Everywhere Noah looked, all he saw was dangerous deaths and destruction as only slivers of the souls of these targeted beings remained!","It seemed like they could be nurtured to go back to how they once were, but even this was filled with uncertainty.","The Infinite Hyperversal Haven already began such a process as thick waves of lifeforce from this very Haven itself flowed and clustered around the barely preserved souls.","At this devastating scene, Noah's soul and will buzzed as a sense of anger and rage that hadn't risen in his heart before!","Grasping his burnt son who had yet to come to, his Soul and the Will of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven already traced where the burning rays of light came from Quintessential Hyperversal Mana and Soul Values were used up freely, signals beginning to rise before Noah's eyes as infinite rage spilled out into the outside reality!","[Uncontained rage capable of warping reality is budding.]","[The Quintessential Hyperversal Soul has directed the rage towards a certain direction.]","[The Concept stemming from the Seven Deadly Sin- Wrath, is being elevated towards Extremity.]","...!","[The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation has called upon all Mutationem Embryos!]","[The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation has called upon the other bodies and Reified Sources of Extremity to fuse into the Main Body!]","As the source of burning rays of darkness was traced, unimaginable waves of rage erupted from the depths of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as its Master warped towards the area of the trace, his other bodies returning as an unknown future bloomed!"]},{"number":2477,"title":"Chapter 2477: Chapter 2476 Immeasurable Rage! III","paragraphs":["2476 Immeasurable Rage! III","An event that occurred within the span of less than a nanosecond!","It was so rapid that even other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were forced to act as observers, where Orion and Aurelia's clones only saw the radiant burning rays of darkness as they were descending on their targets.","Their bodies instinctively moved towards their nearest location to try and lend any aid- this being the same case with the newly arriving Caesar!","In his mind, an attack from the Singularity Overseers may have passed through, although this theory was quickly erased when he saw the targeted attack that didn't involve him at all.","Yet even he still moved!","But...the burning rays of darkness were far faster than even light.","YAA!","Aurelia had cried out valiantly while moving towards where Anna was, and yet when she arrived there, the only thing left was a cluster of illusory shields conjured from the very Infinite Hyperversal Haven itself- only containing a sliver of a soul protected within Noah's will!","The recently dispersed forces of Ancestral Lernaeans and Maximilian came out and gazed at the Desolate scene in shock.","The few Dimensional Rulers not affected among the small Legion that moved with Henry's clone came out to observe such a dreadful scene!","None of them could do a single thing as they could only observe helplessly.","From this unfolding event, a few things could be discerned.","One was that the helplessness of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to change anything with this attack here showed that the Infinite Hyperversal Haven could react and shift far faster than them.","After all, all of this happened within its fabric of Reality.","Second...it didn't fully settle in, but a reminder of just how drastic things could change for those who were weak thundered down as many of Noah's Vassals cried out while going towards those they had formed bonds with!","The Longest Dream and Oldest Dreamer cried out while going towards where Eowyn used to be.","Anna's father felt the faint light of his daughter's soul as he cried out in shock and sorrow!","But all of this...was overshadowed by the roar of immeasurable rage from the True Emperor of Quintessence.","His body had already disappeared as his cry still resonated, warping across space and clasping onto the source of the burning rays of darkness with the help of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","He knew the source to be within the Noblesse Region where the clones of his Son and others used to be, his bodies in the Haven of Dissolution linking with his and the Infinite Hyperversal Haven as under their eyes, the flow of the essence of a Dynamis of Extremity was extremely clear.","From where his son's clone was, a shimmering light of darkness pointed towards a certain location.","And he barreled towards it while burning with utmost rage- a rage that wasn't just directed towards the one responsible for this situation.","A portion of this rage was directed towards himself.","Among the many things he had calculated in the illusory trillions of years outside the scope of space and time, the movements of his people were among them.","He had already experienced Apex Aeonic Soul Totems and their power when Ophelia's clone was erased and they appeared above her main body.","He had theorized the very real possibility that at some point in time, an Apex Aeonic Lifeform may aim at himself or his people- even with the rules set in place and the watchful gaze of the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","He came up with possible solutions to this- the most achievable ones being in the form of a unique Boundary and another Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","But he didn't embark on this right away after his transformation.","Granted, it was only the span of minutes since the boons of the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation were granted as he was just testing them, but this was among many things he theorized that he had yet to implement!","Never was there an expectation that an attack would come in such a short time span.","But more than that, Noah had a portion of this rage directed to himself as truthfully, he actually gave weight to the rules and power of others!","He gave weight to the power of the Adjudicator of Dissolution after he basked in her grandeur of Hyperversal Extremity Authority, and after her intervention of his own actions!","A sense of complacency bloomed- however miniscule it was.","Even if what just occurred was still unexpected, it was still something he missed. It was his responsibility as he bore its weight.","And he would be the one to correct it!","Thus, his rage unfurled as from different parts of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven and Aeonic Haven of Dissolution, the different parts of his stretched out came to fuse with him.","This was all to rectify the current situation and let loose the boiling rage that had long since reached a tipping point!","Rage.","Anger.","It was an emotion that all Lifeforms felt many times in their lives, no matter how long or short.","A vast majority of the time, anger gave birth to absolutely nothing.","It was commonly weak Lifeforms feeling anger and unfairness as a lot of the time, they lived with it and bottled it as they didn't even have the power to release it!","A select few gave in to this anger.","When one gave into bubbling anger and rage, they would likely die an early death against those who brought forth this anger.","There were then the rare few who utilized the burning anger into something that could actually produce results!","Noah's immeasurable rage was reigned in as he turned it calculative.","He directed it towards a specific place as he put the rage to use!","[The Boundary of Wrath has reached the 9th Boundary Layer!]","And...","[Understanding of Wrath far exceeding the 9th Boundary Layer is being expressed!]","[The 10th Boundary Layer is not achievable unless one's Extremity Meridians are enacted.]","[Your Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds take on the budding Seed of Wrath!]","The rising aura of madness and rage around his body became even more intense as from a certain direction, an Aletheian Chassis shining with multicolored grandeur smashed into his main body.","[The Quantum Aletheian Chassis has fused with your Main Body.]","[The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation is taking the reins of the fusion of all parts that make the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor!]","His body buzzed with heavy Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values that would not be attainable before as a shocking transformation began.","At the same time, Noah continued to turn his rage into a precise blade as it first swung at himself to correct the ever-minuscule complacency that even made it a possibility for his son and people to be so heavily wounded to the extent their status was uncertain.","[The Concept of the Soul is being ushered towards Extremity!]","[The Concept of the Body is being ushered towards Extremity!]","[The Concept of the Origin is being ushered towards Extremity!]","[The Concept of Cloning is being ushered towards Extremity!]","The tools to rectify even the possibility of what had just occurred to never occur again began to be forged!"]},{"number":2478,"title":"Chapter 2478: Chapter 2477 Immeasurable Rage! IV","paragraphs":["2477 Immeasurable Rage! IV","Clones.","The Body.","The Soul.","The Origin!","How they were connected, how they were separated.","Noah began by expanding these concepts as the theories he had were put into practice amidst his contained and directed rage!","And this was only the beginning.","[The Concept of Reification is being ushered towards Extremity!]","[The Concept of Separation is being ushered towards Extremity!]","[The Concept of Unification is being ushered towards Extremity!]","Lastly, a critical piece of the puzzle that was something Noah had forged for the purpose of having clones move with their own utility and lives in the past.","A concept that was merely at the level of an Insuperable Nomological Edict at the time of its conception- Anima!","[The Concept of Anima is being ushered towards Extremity!]","A concept that made a distinction between the Aspects of Existence. One's clones were connected, and yet they were also separated.","It was one of the many moving parts that would go towards granting something which would allow the destiny and fate of a clone or a reified form of oneself to never be reflected on the main body!","HUUM!","A droning symphony of baleful drums only rose higher after he finished this action, his body smashing through the layers of space as the Havens above the Noblesse Domains fissured and were ripped out, his two hands pulling apart the very fabric of Reality as surging violent waves of Wrath and Quintessence blared out- a sound akin to a horn that announced the start of a Cataclysm reverberating out.","It was the sound marking the fearsome arrival of the Main Body of the True Emperor of Quintessence in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","And at his arrival, he saw a single scene that caused the Wrath on his heart to blaze with utmost fervor.","The source that caused all this was grasped and traced back to this location as when his will followed it, he saw the figures of two existences floating high in a region that began to be filled with tendrils of Ruin and Nullity.","The source led back to the visage of a female Noblesse expressing a sense of cruel beauty, where at the moment of his arrival...her right hand was placed over her mouth that was cackling with a sense of profound satisfaction and malice.","She was laughing.","Vibrantly laughing after she released terribly fast burning rays of darkness towards existences that hadn't even touched Apexification!","She was laughing as the fate of many of his people lay uncertain for her actions.","She was laughing as his son was charred black and nearly killed by her purposeful actions.","When Noah saw this scene, his eyes turned dangerously sharp as the billowing Wrath around him rose by another magnitude.","His aura and booming roars of essence caused the eyes of the female Noblesse and the male one beside her to stare towards his direction with their brows raised.","The words of the female Noblesse could be heard from afar as she blinked amidst her satisfied laughter.","\"Is that...another Lernaean? No way, did they actually manage to trace my attack and send someone, and it's a tiny little thing that hasn't even undergone Apexification? Hah!\"","Her glee was bountiful.","Her eyes smiled with joy and cruelty!","Noah stepped out of the crack in space and floated towards her as his eyes became sharper than any time in history, his face utterly losing the expression of any emotions as the blaring light of Quintessence blazed from them.","It was a set of eyes that turned cold and cruel amidst their Wrath as they set forth a judgment that would be achieved without a single doubt across all of reality.","It was the judgment of death on this woman before him!","BZZT!","Tendrils of authority danced all around him, and at this moment from multiple different directions...Aletheian Chassis, Quintessential Clones of Extremity, and Reified Sources of Extremity arrived and turned into grandiose lights that fused into his body.","[The Fantasia Aletheian Chassis has fused with your Main Body.]","[The Niflheim Aletheian Chassis has fused with your Main Body.]","[The Reified Source of Manadynamics has fused with your Main Body.]","His Reified Sources of Extremity in the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands that were leading the Shadowlings.","His bodies in the Haven of Dissolution and in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","All of them returned to him as his aura ignored all possible forms of Reality and began climbing up to a shocking level.","And in the midst of all this...","[All currently held Body, Origin, and Soul Mutationem Embryos have been assimilated and fully devoured by the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation.]","[The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation has taken a major step forward!]","[Your Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values have increased from .10 to 1]","[Your Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Values have increased from .33 to 3]","[Your Quintessential Hyperversal Defence Values have increased from .33 to 3]","[Your Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Values have increased from .10 to 1]","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance has risen from 5% to 7.5%]","[Hyperversal Dignity has increased from .1 to .3]","[Hyperversal Mastery has increased from .1 to .3]","OOOM!","Essence surged around wildly as the enhancements of the Body, Origin, and Soul Mutationem Embryos were all eaten up to elevate Noah's Foundation!","The results were astounding enough to grant him a form that was equivalent to a being who had freshly undergone Apexification and became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform.","The pressure he released was vibrant enough...to be mistaken for an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","The pressure he released was vibrant enough...to be mistaken for an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!","With deep Dignity and grandeur, he gazed towards the being behind all this as data about her rose before his eyes.","\"Euryale of the Noblesse. Too cowardly to even face them, you swung a blade to kill my people that haven't undergone Apexification.\"","...!","As he spoke, more and more clusters of light that were different parts of him fused into his body, the gaze of Euryale sneering with sharpness at the blazing aura of power as the other Apex Aeonic Noblesse beside her frowned!","Yet the voice of the True Emperor of Quintessence continued to thunder out as his billowing visage seemed like a roused ancient beast that made a proclamation.","\"Your death...will not be a quick one.\"","WAA!","Euryale blinked and laughed wildly at such words as her figure began to buzz with waves of power.","\"Haha, my death? Me? Against a creature burning up the last of their soul to barely touch the cusp of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform? I would like to see a vile Lernaean like you tr-\"","BOOOOM!","Behind Noah's constantly enlarging and changing visage, the stellar form of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity that was at the forefront of the exploration of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution with prominent Scions appeared.","Its eyes only consisted of the flaming singularities that were at this moment twisted with cruel rage and apathy, its form sinking into Noah as a blazing light rose to the skies and caused the sources of chaos in the surroundings to churn!","[A sufficient number of Reified Sources and Clones have been fused into the main body.]","[You have attained a version of your strongest self!]","[Your state of mind has influenced this version of your strongest self.]","[The Advent of the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor has been manifested!]","Crimson gold wings stretched out behind him with fervor. Two horns rose from his head as above it, a crown of multicolored flames appeared and blazed with shocking brilliance!","Eyes that held vertical slits of pupils seeming like Infinite singularities buzzed with grandeur as his face carried devilish coldness and apathy.","His hair danced below his shoulders like vengeful snaking stellar Realities as his form was adorned by a black, gold, and crimson armament that was still forming- the potent essence of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity widely buzzing from it!","Amidst this transformation, the daring prompt that even caused Euryale's words to stop came.","[For the next minute, all Quintessential Hyperversal Values are augmented by a factor of 25!]","...!","One of the boons of the fusion of the myriad parts of himself was expressed.","One!"]},{"number":2479,"title":"Chapter 2479: Chapter 2478 The Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor! I","paragraphs":["2478 The Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor! I","Atop the very Havens of Dissolution.","Towards the undeniable domain of the Adjudicator of Dissolution, a cloud of dense authority nearly as vibrant barreled towards it!","It came at a time when the Adjudicator of Dissolution had just spread her authority to cover the vastness of the Haven- with the voice of an existence steeped in both Hyperversal Extremity Authority and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority buzzing out.","\"Little Old Destruction has come to pay his respects to the Adjudicator of this Haven.\"","His words were reserved as one could see his smile as he said them, the visage of a red robed devilishly handsome existence manifesting with his blazing authority as the veiled visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution was momentarily forced to focus on him!","Yet even as this being appeared, the figure of Noah's Aletheian Chassis erupted with immense waves of Haki as without even caring about the Esteemed Extremity arriving, his body shot out purposefully and warped across space as it sank into the depths of Haven of Dissolution.","Sensing the rage in his voice, the veiled eyes of the Adjudicator of Dissolution flashed as they simply followed his figure- her will already sensing a violation of the very rules she was upholding in this Haven!","\"Oh?\"","This scene was caught by the Will of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction as he was curious what type of being would be so freely around the Adjudicator of this Haven!","So his Will and Svetlana's Will watched as the Aletheian Chassis pierced across the skies of the Noblesse Domains.","They watched as this body fused into the main one as much to the surprise of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction, he recognized the visage of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity who killed his Squadron of the Scions of Destruction in the Extremity Vein of Dissolution actually fuse into this body as well!","Thereafter, fantastical words that gave them the larger picture erupted out as this being actually went towards two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms with clear hostility.","\"Euryale of the Noblesse. Too cowardly to even face them, you swung a blade to kill my people that haven't undergone Apexification.\"","...!","\"Your death...will not be a quick one.\"","Shocking words that showed an existence who had yet to undergo Apexification was actually pitting himself against Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","The eyes of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction flashed with profound interest while the veiled figure of the Adjudicator of Dissolution already discerned what had occurred, the coldness from her gaze spreading far as her will already covered the Plane where the dreadful essence of a Dynamis of Extremity pulsed- along with the aura of death of many beings!","Under her watch, an Apex Aeonic Lifeform had shifted to erase lower lifeforms as even now, one such being was seeking retribution on his own.","One of his bodies was right there with her, and yet he hadn't gone to her to impose justice and rectify this mistake.","He wished to take this on with his own hands!","And yet...was it even possible?","He may have an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity and even possibly attained a semblance or the starting point of 'that'.","But would this alone be enough to bridge the unbridgeable gap of the stage of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms?!","With this in mind, the Adjudicator of Dissolution didn't intervene right away as she watched to see how the situation would unfold.","At the same time that this was occurring, a blinking light traversed across the territory above the Domains of the Noblesse as it permeated into the Communication Medallions of all Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","It was a light that stemmed from Richard- this being explaining to the Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeforms what Euryale had done as he was unsure of what the fallout would be!","If the rest of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of the Noblesse Lineage were involved and knew what was happening, they would at least be able to seek a lesser punishment for Euryale when the Adjudicator of Dissolution intervened.","Thus, a disorderly stage continued to be set as one must not forget the reason why the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction went forward to grab the attention of the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","It was all so that his Elder Scions of Destruction could finally make a move against their objectives that included Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Lernaeans, Quasarians, Noblesse, and Planeswalkers!","Among these targets, Aurelia of the Lernaean Lineage was among them- her main body still moving with Orion and other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms after they splintered from Roan.","Along this procession of events, there was also the fact that from the Quasarian Lineage, the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of the Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity- the Singularity Overseers, were looking for the entity who had just taken away a lifeform holding an Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation.","Their Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were already spread out across the Quasarian Domains as they were moving even further out to seek their target- and behind them...the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring had sent forth a Tier 1 Hyperversal Extremity under him to ensure he received what was his!","It was an completely confounding intersection of events as when all of it came together...ah!","—","[For the next Minute, all Quintessential Hyperversal Values are augmented by a factor of 25!]","One of the benefits of the fusion of the myriad parts of himself was expressed as more followed.","[For the next Minute, Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values are granted a quasi-quality of the Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Values.]","[No matter how many abilities you utilize, so long as their Soul Value Requirement does not exceed 25 Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values, they can be cast endlessly. Your Maximum numerical soul value will not decrease for the next 1 minute!]","\"....\"","A truly ridiculous reality altering authority came down.","An authority originating from the state of fusion Noah currently boasted as it spelled utmost doom for his enemies!","His Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value was granted a quasi-quality of nothing other than Infinite Mana.","But what did this truly mean?"]},{"number":2480,"title":"Chapter 2480: Chapter 2479 The Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor! II","paragraphs":["2479 The Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor! II","His Soul Value would not reduce for the next minute!","To visualize this and all the changes the current state of fusion granted, Noah's stat panel quickly flashed before his eyes.","[Name]:: Noah Osmont","[Realm]:: Boundary Expansion(Third Aletheian Haven of Extremity)","[Lineage]:: Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor","[Titles]:: True Emperor of Quintessence, Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor, One Who Gazes Upon Hyperversal Authority, Aletheian, Indefatigable, Tyrannical Emperor...","[Quintessential Hyperversal Mana Value]:: Infinite","[Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality Value]:: 3(75)","[Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value]:: -/1(-/25)","[Quintessential Hyperversal Defense Value]:: 3(75)","[Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Value]:: 1(25)","[Hyperversal Dignity]:: .3","[Hyperversal Mastery]:: .3","[Absolute Hyperversal Authority Resistance]:: 7.5%","[Dynamis of Extremity]:: Indefatigable(Absolute), Aletheian(Absolute)","[Boundaries of Extremity]:: Quintessence, Blood, Manadynamics, Loot, Reality, Dimensions, Anima, Body, Origin, Soul, Genesis, Apocalypse, Prana, Dreams, Avalon...","...!","When he initially viewed his stat panel right after awakening as a Hunter, the value of [Focus] that represented Mana held the dash symbol.","Now, he saw a similar presentation for his Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value as for the next minute, he could cast any abilities that required 25 Soul Values or below freely as if he held an infinite number of such values!","This was the quasi-quality of Infinite Mana that his Soul Values momentarily attained.","It was a change that made him utterly terrifying as the True scope of what it meant could only be ascertained when he began to run utterly wild!","Then there was the augmented damage and Defense Values that were increased by a factor of 25.","It granted Noah a Quintessential Hyperversal Defense and Vitality Value of 75, along with an Innate Quintessential Hyperversal Barrier of 75!","Now, something had to be made abundantly clear.","After an existence underwent Apexification, the vast majority of average Lifeforms would normally be able to attain the very minimum of 1 Apex Aeonic Damage, Vitality, and Defense Value.","If it was powerful Scions with dozens of Consummate Boundaries, unique existences who had formed Dynamis of Extremity even before Apexification, or those who had established a type of Extremity Foundation would have a value much greater than 1!","But an Apex Aeonic Value of 1 was the starting line as it was in no way the average numerical power of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","As they progressed past the 9th Boundary Layer of their concepts and forged Dynamis of Extremity while fortifying their Foundations and Realms, this Value of 1 was quickly exceeded as it was hard to determine the power of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform until they erupted out to display their might- or unless one had an inquisitive Boundary or Dynamis of Extremity that could peer across veils of secrecy!","Noah did not know what Apex Aeonic Values Euryale held.","Whether it was in the tens or hundreds, he did not know!","Yet to him, this didn't matter.","Because he held a state of fusion that allowed his Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values to mimic his Infinite Mana!","[This state that calls forth one of your strongest states through fusion can only be activated once every three days.]","[After the duration of the state of fusion has ended, you will enter your weakest state with all Values weakened by half for the next day.]","[The breadth of your Soul at the time of fusion will determine the factor that your strength is multiplied by, as well as additional boons and restrictions.]","[The limitation of 1 Minute to maintain the fused state is nearly impossible to exceed.]","HOOONG!","His visage was astounding as the flaming crown above him span with glory and madness, his body entirely becoming encased by an Armament that could only be distinguished as the Hyperversal Demon Emperor's Armament! It pulsed with the grandeur of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity as Noah's Innate Quintessential Hyperversal Barrier fused into it to further expand its defenses!","The armament extended to his hands as his fingers seemed encased in Crimson, black, and gold crystalline claws that pulsed dangerously.","A crimson aurora of wings stretched out behind him as his vertical slit-like pupils of singularities buzzed with intense pressure that finally caused the laughter from Euryale to cease!","The visage of Richard beside her also became careful as even at such a juncture, Euryale still sneered while voicing out.","\"This is the state you've reached after sacrificing all of your soul? Pathetic, it is still below me!\"","BOOM!","Halfway through her words, beams of burning darkness erupted as this was a hardened Apex Aeonic Lifeform who moved and killed with precision!","Yet the being that came to collect today was no normal existence.","Apart from the utterly ridiculous fact that his Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values were momentarily given the quasi-quality of Infinite Mana, he also had a level of access to an authority that very few others held!","\"I told you that your death will not be a quick one.\"","BOOM!","Towards her attack, Noah's visage blinked.","He blinked, and the stretch of reality before him turned dark as Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain was ushered forth.","It unfolded at such a shocking pace and speed as it arrived before the floating figures of Euryale and Richard, his voice buzzing it one last time before this whole region had the targets within it negated of their connection to the very workings of space, time, and reality!","\"It will also be a very, very painful one.\"","...!","1 minute.","It was a short period of time for some, but also an extremely long period of time for those truly powerful.","Trillions of illusory years in a domain filled with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority could be akin to a nanosecond in the outside reality.","Noah's 1 minute of fusion worked with the timing of reality as this battle against an Apex Aeonic Lifeform...could very well be ended within the span of a few seconds, if not much less...so extended as he could overpower her.","So extended as what he had achieved was enough!","A rageful orchestra played in the background as with a resounding authority, the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor bellowed out while plunging into the dark realm that covered everything before him with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","It was a shocking scene that caused the Wills of two extremely potent beings to buzz as one gained affirmation, while the other spoke out freely.","\"An existence yet to undergo Apexification and he has already achieved 'that'? You've nurtured an intriguing Entity, O Adjudicator of Dissolution!\"","...!"]},{"number":2481,"title":"Chapter 2481: Chapter 2480 2480 The Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor! III","paragraphs":["2480 The Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor! III","Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","Something that very few beings attained as those who didn't have it had to survive purely based on their essences- with a Dynamis of Extremity being one of the few authorities that could handle the authority of nothingness and stop it from permeating into one's Soul.","Yet there was one truth that made those who had attained Vacuous Hyperversal Authority so crucial.","Even if one could survive in such a region outside the scope of time and reality...could they ever have an output of their essence?","The moment they released any of their essence outside to release an ability or skill, it would be devoured by the authority of nothingness unless...it was the essence of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","BZZZT!","Burning cherry colored light rose in the depths of darkness as to Noah's eyes, the space was as clear as day.","To others, there was only endless darkness as they couldn't feel anything.","Yet his Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation could withstand Vacuous Hyperversal Authority while his Absolute Dynamis of Extremity was the one authority that could freely isolate one from Vacuous Hyperversal Authority even before Noah gained his Foundation!","It was one of the few methods of attacking here.","And with the quasi-quality of Infinite Mana for his Quintessential Hyperversal Soul...","An endless cherry colored sea bloomed behind Noah's visage.","His figure moved across the dense space of nothingness as he floated ever closer towards his target.","Euryale of the Noblesse Lineage.","A name only looked at as a Legend from the memories of the noblesse Noah had destroyed. Yet now, her dark hair buzzed as one could see a malevolent and shocked expression on her face, layers of vibrant Crimson black illusory shields conjured around her as they covered her entirely!","Not too far from her, the other Apex Aeonic Noblesse Richard could be seen doing something similar as he cast protective layers a Dynamis of Extremity to prevent the area of nothingness from entering his Aspects of Existence.","The both of them only had a singular goal while surrounded by Vacuous Hyperversal Authority that they had only heard about!","Noah drew closer to Euryale as the burning cherry flames around him cried out with rage.","He drew inches away from her as she was crouched in a battle stance ready to move at any moment, preserving all of her essence and authority as she truly felt nothing around her!","Even though Noah was right in front of her figure, she didn't feel anything about him as more layers of defenses wrapped around her, a malevolent gaze on her face as she bellowed out even in such a situation.","Sound could not be heard as Noah inferred from her lips.","\"Little rat, where are you?! I know a domain like this is timed as when I get out...you're ripped to fucking pieces!\"","WAA!","Her lips repeated these words over and over again as even in this situation, she was confident in her own power.","She knew her enemy was someone who hadn't even undergone Apexification- no matter how they had access to momentarily lay out a region of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","So long as she persevered in this state...that would be it for him.","This was what she believed anyway.","Noah stared at her battle ready visage right in front of him as a vile being like this who nearly killed his son...he would break her down until she sensed such terror herself!","He would tear her apart piece by piece until this malicious expression on her face was entirely torn away.","And so...he raised his hand and unfurled his fist as with the back of his hand that was wrapped in a scaled armament pulsing with Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity, he swung towards the left side of her face!","PAH!","A backhand filled with the authority of an Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","A backhand carrying 25 Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Values!","The impact was dreadful, and yet the layers of defenses Euryale laid out at least worked as they fluctuated, her figure feeling the impact only when it arrived as thereafter, she moved quickly to strike where Noah's hands had been!","SHAA!","Her hands had naturally and naturally moved while trying to release beams of burning darkness, but they were devoured by the emptiness around them as nothing reached Noah.","Instead, Noah's swung right hand came down from the other side to smack her right cheek, his left hand forming into a fist that directly went towards her abdominal region!","PAH!","BOOM!","Heavy impacts boomed out as Euryale roared out silently, none of the damage reaching her as it seemed her Apex Aeonic Defense Values were at the very minimum nearing 100!","Noah's strikes pulsing with 25 Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Values shouldn't be reaching her, yet every single one ate up at her Soul Values as she had to both survive and expend her power in this realm of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, and also defend against an enemy she couldn't see!","And this wasn't all.","Hyperversal Damage Values. Apex Aeonic Damage Values.","These different values held a distinction that even Noah himself had yet to fully grasp as the latter Value was much greater in its standing!","Every time Noah struck, even though his Damage Values were 25, he saw the layers of defenses around Euryale fluctuating in a much greater effect as it felt like his Damage Values were much more penetrative- overpowering the Apex Aeonic Defense Values Euryale conjured by an unknown percentage.","It was the difference in quality as truthfully, it may have been 30 or 35 Damage Values being delivered instead of the 25!","Noah had to better analyze the differences between Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Values at a different time as now, his hands continued to smash down and release their cold anger on this foe before him.","She couldn't see or feel him, and she could only react after being hit.","She couldn't express any manifestation of her core as for her, no matter how much more potent she was compared to him- she was a sitting duck unless she could withstand and freely move around in this realm filled with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!"]},{"number":2482,"title":"Chapter 2482: Chapter 2481 2481 The Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor! IV","paragraphs":["2481 The Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor! IV","HUUM!","The cherry colored flames behind Noah flowed into his fists.","His figure was enlarged as a single smack of his hand covered Euryale's whole head, and a smash of his fist would have its impact felt with half of her whole body!","He moved around her freely and began pummeling her from different directions, her expression buzzing and full of rage as she flailed around trying to hit back against an enemy she couldn't see or feel.","It was a terrifying state!","PAH! BOOM! PAH!","Her layers of defenses fluctuated and flickered as they absorbed tens of Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Value multiple times within an instant, the authority of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority sneaking in with any open gaps as this situation was truly the worst against someone that had no connection to it.","One of the only ways to defend against it was to never allow oneself to be covered in its domain!","\"OOOH!\"","Euryale bellowed out with fervor and anger at taking hits constantly, feeling her used up soul values continuing to drain as she spun her body with her fists and legs outstretched around her while they shone with the glint of multiple Dynamis of Extremity.","At such a juncture, Noah's cold figure moved above her as he tapped out.","BZZT!","A singularity born of the essence of Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity was born as it remained steady and ready.","An instant later, an infinity rune carrying the black gold essence of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity formed as it spun with infinite mass and density!","Then, the surging cherry flames coalesced into a single region as three abilities, each boasting 25 Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Values, formed with utmost grandeur.","Noah's left hand then pulsed dangerously as a black gold sword of flames instantly bloomed, his right hand conjuring a pulsing spear bearing the weight of the whole Infinite Hyperversal Haven in addition to the flames of a Dynamis of Extremity!","The Singularity, Infinity rune, coalesced cherry flames, and the black gold sword of flames in Noah's left hand simultaneously thundered down as their aim was to instantaneously deliver over 100 Quintessential Hyperversal Damage Values.","To instantly shatter the barrier still trying to protect Euryale!","At the same time, more manifestations of singularities, infinity runes, cherry colored flames, and black gold swords of flames began to bloom around Euryale's figure as even if they couldn't all be controlled to arrive simultaneously, it would be close as what was about to happen now...was a bombardment of abilities.","Mana and Soul Values were used without reservations as the rage of the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor led to nothing other than spamming!","The top four attacks arrived first as...","BOOM...CRACK!","A heavy set of damage values exploded out as the barrier around Euryale shattered.","And before she could reform it as her head turned up while bellowing out, the Spear in Noah's right hand...was already an inch from her raised forehead.","...!","A spear burning with the flames of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity while also carrying the weight of the whole Infinite Hyperversal Haven!","It arrived first before any other spammed attacks as Noah coldly and with blazing Wrath drove it into the head of Euryale!","Skin, bones, and stellar brain matter shattered as the Spear pierced her head and passed through the very center of her throat, continuing down and piercing her chest and buzzing with destruction as it crossed her abdominal region and came out on the other end!","...!","It was a horrific scene as at that same instant, the other bombardment of attack arrived while streams of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority streamed towards her mutilated body.","\"GRHOO!\"","Her mouth and neck were split apart as guttural sounds came, and yet her lifeforce was abundant as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform as she shockingly grabbed onto the Spear mutilating her tightly, ferociously pushing it even deeper into her as she rose up to grasp the hand of the man holding it!","She...had actually maxed to grasp onto him while surrounded by nothingness, her bleeding eyes filled with anger and madness as she ushered all of her Damage Value to bombard the being she had grasped!","Noah's Innate Quintessential Hyperversal Barrier fluctuated as the protective cherry flames around him burst, but this was all.","The streams of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority had sunk into different parts of her body during the bombardment that continued even now as Euryale was losing feeling in different parts of her, her soul and other Aspects of Existence becoming jumbled!","Noah's gaze was exceedingly cold as his left hand came down and grasped the tight grasp of Euryale's hand that had grasped onto his, unclasping her fingers as if they were steeled metalloids.","Her eyes on her head that was split in two were still as ferocious as she choked on the heavy spear, the feeling of nothingness becoming ever present as Crimson blood burst and trickled down into nothingness.","Immense pain wracked different parts of her body as her immense life force was making it even worse- where she could feel every single thing!","\"...\"","Noah's bombardment of attacks stopped as he looked at the body of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform torn and shredded due to his actions.","An Apex Aeonic Lifeform- skewered by a spear through his hands!","Streams of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority had entered different parts of her as the moment this occurred, her fate was sealed!","At such a juncture, dazzling cherry colored flames moved out with utmost control from Noah as they encased the splintered head region of Euryale that still had a spear piercing through it.","The Vacuous Hyperversal Authority in that area was isolated out as for the first time in what seemed like a million years to Euryale, she could see again.","Her eyes that were staring in different directions due to her body being split left and right gazed forward with utmost fury as the light of the cherry colored flames only allowed her to see the devilishly handsome face of the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor.","\"Fu-rckign c-oward...\"","She slurred her words out as even at this juncture, she held many grievances as her personality didn't change.","She knew that if this Vacuous Hyperversal Authority around them wasn't there, this being wouldn't have been able to put her in this state!","Yet he stared towards her coldly as he voiced out.","\"For trying to kill my son and my people, you shall experience trillions of years of pain before your soul faces nothingness.\"","...!","She heard simple words that caused her bloodied eyes to expand and blink, even more insanity and rage rising within them as she found out her attacks hadn't even managed to kill the young Lernaean Commander she targeted!","Then what the hell was all this for?!","Guttural sounds erupted from her as she tried to gather the authority of her Dynamis of Extremity, but the Vacuous Hyperversal Authority dispersing throughout other parts of her Aspects of Existence made it extremely hard to put anything together as she could only state with hate towards Noah.","If what he said was true, then...","\"My...birg-gest re-grret is that I dir-dn't kirll morre Le-rrneans!\"","Her torn tongue could barely formulate words as while feeling Vacuous Hyperversal Authority infecting everything about her, she didn't despair as she even started cackling with rage, despondency, and madness!","She stared towards the frigid visage of the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor as even while pierced with a spear, she bellowed out and tried to surge towards him in a last ditch effort!","\"...\"","And the cherry colored flames of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity disappeared.","Everything around her turned into nothingness once more as her guttural roars and voice couldn't be heard anymore.","'Fuck.'","She cursed in her mind.","'Fuck! Fuck! Fuck that Lernaean Commander. Fuck his father! Fuck all of them to oblivion!'","For what seemed like forever, she cursed and continued cursing as the lifeforce and Soul of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform that had undergone Apexification was extremely strong!","Even as her aspects of Existence were permeating with nothingness, it would take a long time for them to be ground down and destroyed.","Of course, this 'long time' was not a real passage of time as it was simply what she would experience as the passage of time.","Off to the side, Noah could already see different parts of her body being eaten up by Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as the Source that made her...Noah wouldn't waste it to be thrown to void as his Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation pulled the different parts of her being devoured by nothingness into Noah!","His frigid eyes then watched her be obliterated as he then turned towards the second Apex Aeonic Noblesse who was beside Euryale.","The one who stood beside her as she assaulted his people!","It was another Apex Aeonic Lifeform who would face his Wrath as dense singularities, infinity symbols, and flames rose up while they burned with the light of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!"]},{"number":2483,"title":"Chapter 2483: Chapter 2482 Killing An Apex Aeonic Lifeform! I","paragraphs":["2482 Killing an Apex Aeonic Lifeform! I","Around the same time that Noah released the utterly expansive domain of Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain.","Silver skies filled with floating islands of glaciers and freezing ice could be seen in what used to be the past region where Planes of Existence belonging to the Ancestral Lernaeans stood, the main bodies of Aurelia, Orion, and a few more Apex Aeonic Lernaeans who had joined them could be seen with troubled faces as Aurelia was speaking with a sharp tone.","\"We need to make our way into the Infinite Plane and protect it with our main bodies. For an attack to reach there during such a critical time...\"","Worry was abundant on hers and Orion's faces as they already saw the tremendous potential and possibilities for all Lernaeans within the Infinite Plane!","Seeing the recent events, these Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were ready to bring their main bodies into the Infinite Plane as Orion and Aurelia still remembered Noah's words for the other Apex Aeonic Lernaeans.","He wanted them to bend the knee in order to enter his lands and relish the benefits!","As they were thinking about how to move...","ZAP!","The silver skies above them crackled as Aurelia's gaze instantly changed, a golden light of a Dynamid of Extremity erupting around her as a moment later, the skies were filled with an illusory blue palm smashing down towards them with utmost ferocity!","A few hundred Apex Aeonic Damage Values were contained in this strike as after Aurelia reacted, Orion's body also lit up with a milky white light along with the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms around them- facing the surprise attack head on as even then, their gazes heavily changed and turned ashen.","This was because in the skies, tens of illusory blue hands manifested an instant after as their target seemed to be Aurelia at the very center of their group!","It was...the forces of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction making a move to hunt their suspected Mutated Entities!","—","The gazes of Aurelia and Orion's clone changed in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, this change very soon being picked up by the reality around them that was more observant than ever after what had just occurred.","Their eyes turned more difficult by the second as a moment later, Noah's voice reverberated from all around them as his will that was left behind communicated with them.","\"What happened?\"","His voice was utterly cold as it emanated out, Aurelia gritting her teeth as she spat out with a sense of shock.","\"We are being attacked by an Apex Aeonic Lifeform stronger than any we've met before...he shouldn't even be from this Haven!\"","The pressure and level of damage they were receiving was catastrophic as their main bodies were barely defending!","Noah only listened to Aurelia's account briefly as before even a fraction of a Second passed, his voice emanated out once more as bright balls of light floated towards Aurelia and Orion.","\"Head to these coordinates in the Lands of the Noblesse. I can lend you aid there.\"","...!","The area where his Main Body was stuck dealing with two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms already!","He couldn't move from his at this moment as less than 3 seconds had already passed from his 1 Minute time where he could maintain his fusion.","This was just how rapidly the attacks and communications could occur with existences as powerful as them who could even throw out attacks within the span of nanoseconds!","A dreadful and powerful battle could be finished with a victor decided in less than the passage of a second, and yet to the powerful Boundary Expansion Realm experts fighting, it may have seemed like the ordeal of a lifetime with hundreds of attacks exchanged.","Aurelia's eyes snapped with a difficult light as it didn't seem right that they would listen and seek the aid of an existence who hadn't undergone Apexification- no matter how unique and powerful he was, but she didn't have time to think it over as her Boundary of Fortune warned her that this peril was the greatest one in her life!","So she quickly ascertained the information released by Noah as the task for her, Orion, and the few Apex Aeonic Lernaeans following them was to protect against the heavy attacks being thrown their way while teleporting towards the coordinates of a location the Noblesse Domains!","—","In the Quasarian Lands.","Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist had a cold countenance as he was receiving information from multiple sources, his heart feeling trepidation as he already knew Hyperversal Extremity Kabul was nearing!","Over a dozen Apex Aeonic Elders of the Singularity Overseers were spreading outwards from this location to search for any signs of the perpetrator that arrived to snatch away the prize that belonged to the Hyperversal Devourer.","The images of Caesar, Xiaomi, and most of all the Unknown assailant that aided their escape were passed around to all Apex Aeonic Elders of the Singularity Overseers.","The Apex Aeonic Quasarians were pacified as he quickly took control and reigned in Quasarian Elder Booma, the power of an Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity being something others couldn't even fathom- especially one connected to the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring!","As a few seconds trickled, information quickly flowed as he finally received something.","\"Grand Singularity Elder, I sense heavy fluctuations of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms towards my direction. Looking at the local topology, it should be within the aboriginal domain of the Noblesse who are now under the influence of the Genesis Institute of Extremity...\"","...!","The information buzzed in Zeitgeist's mind as his Kismet Dynamis of Extremity shone brightly.","It told him that there was a high likelihood of what he sought to be there!","So his countenance hardened as he commanded.","\"Converge upon this location. Monitor and only act if you confirm the targets.\"","Kismet danced wildly in his heart.","He could feel it.","It further told him that his chance to perform a achievement that would be worthy of recognition of the Hyperversal Extremity of Devouring was coming!","He didn't want to miss it as he himself moved from the Quasarian Lands to head towards the coordinates his subordinate specified...","---","[Author's note]:: 1/3 chaps today!"]},{"number":2484,"title":"Chapter 2484: Chapter 2483 Killing An Apex Aeonic Lifeform! II","paragraphs":["2483 Killing an Apex Aeonic Lifeform! II","The Apex Aeonic Lernaeans and their attacker converged towards a single location.","The Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the Singularity Overseers also converged towards a location.","All of it was connected to a single being!","But this wasn't all.","It was the Noblesse Domains.","Naturally, those living in this region would be those to arrive first.","HUUM!","Essence buzzed wildly as a few thousand miles away from the circle of darkness pulsing with Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, the figures of over a dozen Apex Aeonic Lifeforms rose as the distinct obsidian skin of the Noblesse could be seen.","Each of them released brilliant grandeur, yet they were still eclipsed by two men and women who floated amongst them who weren't of the Noblesse Lineage!","\"I'll have to thank Grand Genesis Elder Meiying for your help today. Explaining things to the Adjudicator of Dissolution will be that much easier with the aid of the Genesis Institute of Extremity. We shall discipline Euryale after this to make sure such things don't happen again...\"","A Noblesse with a valiant visage adorned in a sleek Crimson battle armor spoke with an ingratiating expression towards a pink haired woman of utmost beauty!","Her nose was sharp as her eyes were beautifully wide, one being inadvertently lost in them if they stared for too long.","She wasn't just any Grand Elder who led the incursion into the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution this time- but a powerful Apex Aeonic Lifeform who was rumored to be close to grasping an Absolute Seed of Extremity!","She held multiple Dynamis of Extremity already as she was Infinitely close to fusing multiple Concepts of Extremity into a single Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Against common Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, she was considered exceptional!","Grand Genesis Elder Meiying nodded with a smile while her eyes released blinding radiance, moving ever closer to the coordinates they had received as she stared closely at the mass of darkness ahead of them.","\"I came to help...but I'm not sure if we have made it in time. That...seems eerily close to Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.\"","...!","WAA!","A dangerous authority was uttered from her as this was something she had felt an Esteemed Extremity freely control before!","Her words caused the expressions of the Apex Aeonic Noblesse to change as the leading one spoke in a heavy tone.","\"Could the Adjudicator of Dissolution have already acted? Punishment for violating the Investiture of Extremity by killing lower lifeforms will never be death. Accepting isolation or an Albatross at most...\"","The Investiture of Extremity!","The set of rules and regulations that all Races in the Havens of Extremity followed after the Extremity Sanctification of the Aeonic Haven of Genesis!","They knew these rules well, along with the results of violating them as Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were treated well when any violations were made.","After all, they were the current and future weapons who would stand against the terrible enemies that could even bother Hyperversal Extremities!","\"Didn't the message you all received say that a Lower Lifeform had appeared before Richard and Euryale? A Lernaean coming to seek revenge from those Euryale targeted and killed?\"","Grand Genesis Elder Meiying spoke inquisitively while staring ahead as her words caused the minds of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms nearby to buzz.","A lower lifeform...did she truly imply that he was the one who may be responsible for the swirling mass of darkness ahead of them? For calling upon Vacuous Hyperversal Authority?!","\"Lernaeans...Lernaeans! Commander Vladic, it is always these rats we have been fighting with!\" An Apex Aeonic Noblesse spoke with distaste while gazing towards their Commander who stood besides Meiying.","Vladic!","A famous Apex Aeonic Lifeform of their Lineage who sat at the leading seat of their council!","His expression was cold as he went forward.","\"It can't be a Lower Lifeform who is capable of this. If an Apex Aeonic Lernaean gets involved to cause any harm to Euryale...\"","His eyes shone with a dangerous glint that betrayed some of his emotions and showed a hidden connection this being held with Euryale that far surpassed merely a colleague of the same race.","Her wild demeanor and unstable nature crossed through his eyes as billions of years of memories passed.","She was a being who did what she wished as at certain times, even those closest to her called her crazy!","But he adored that craziness.","He loved her wild and somewhat cruel nature as his position of power allowed her to run free all these years!","If anything actually happened to her...much through the hands of Lernaeans no less- he would burn them all to the ground.","All of them!","\"Let's go!\"","He uttered out while moving ever closer to the swirling mass of darkness.","—","Within the Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain.","Noah's gaze was cold as he stared at the masculine Apex Aeonic Noblesse who held over a dozen blazing crimson back flaming swords piercing his body from different directions.","Each of them pulsed with both the Aletheian and Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity as they burned brightly even while encircled by Vacuous Hyperversal Authority!","Any Apex Aeonic Lifeforms who didn't have an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity and actually managed to get stuck in Noah's Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain when he was in his fused state...their fate would be abysmal!","If he had his normal power, maybe they would outlast how long he could have it active.","And he wouldn't be able to bypass their defenses of tens or hundreds of Apex Aeonic Defense Values so easily.","But in his fused state as the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor...his lives were up to him!","He stared at them as to his left, Euryale kept up a ferocious expression while her Aspects of Existence were entirely invaded by Vacuous Hyperversal Authority.","Her body seemed dead and ready to turn to ash as the only thing keeping it together were illusory Extremity Meridians numbering 8 still pulsing weakly within her body!","They contained the concepts she characterized herself with in abundance, as well as the Sources of the Dynamis of Extremity she formed.","Yet even they were slowly turning gray as for her, there was no turning back!"]},{"number":2485,"title":"Chapter 2485: Chapter 2484 Killing An Apex Aeonic Lifeform! III","paragraphs":["2484 Killing an Apex Aeonic Lifeform! III","Over 80% of Euryale's Aspects of Existence were already permeated with the authority of nothingness as she couldn't return from this even if she tried.","Now, she just experienced pain outside the scope of time itself as she wallowed in her hatred.","To his right, Richard held a regretful expression as his lips would occasionally voice out...","\"I...tried to stop her.\"","...!","70% of his Aspects of Existence were already infected and about to fade away into nothingness as the Vitality of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform held strong, his 7 Extremity Meridians pulsing weakly as half of them had already turned gray!","They would die here, but Noah did not feel content.","He felt like even though they were experiencing the passage of countless illusory years, it was still not enough.","His Wrath wanted to do more.","His eyes buzzed as an instant later, a path bloomed as he chose it.","He would do more than just kill them.","He would also send a message!","HOONG!","His figure moved as each of his hands wrapped around the husks of the necks of Euryale and Richard.","They couldn't even react to him as they preserved the last of their Souls from fading away, and the vibrant darkness of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority around them began to pulse and retreat!","Noah deactivated this Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain as he wanted to take the dredges of what remained of two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to send a message to the Noblesse and any others on what would happen if they targeted anything that was his!","He wanted to send a message to whoever was attacking Aurelia and the others headed here about what would be in store for them.","BZZT!","So the Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain pulsed and began to fade as his figure clasping onto the dying necks of husks of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms was gradually unveiled!","—","\"My oh my....\"","The voice of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction echoed out as his figure appeared meters away from the Adjudicator of Dissolution.","Each of their bodies pulsed with the shocking authority of Hyperversal Extremity and Vacuous Hyperversal Authority as the both of them were watching the unfolding scene below!","\"An existence yet to undergo Apexification and he can stand toe to toe with Apex Aeonic Lifeforms because he can call upon a semblance of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority, however weak it is, and even survive in it.\"","His voice carried immense interest and power as he spoke, his Will watching the veil of the Vacuous Hyperversal Domain fade as a shocking scene was gradually revealed!","At his words and appearance, the Adjudicator of Dissolution was utterly cold as she voiced out calmly and with authority.","[Do not think we do not know your connection to the Avernus Clan. Can I take your actions today as the actions of the Avernus Clan falling out of the 7 Clan Investiture Alliance?]","WAA!","Her words held a hint of danger as the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction replied while shaking his head.","\"My actions are my own...but what have I exactly done that was wrong today? All I did was come pay my respects to you. I would never dare to even show a semblance of dishonor towards a Hyperversal Extremity who has taken the job of an Adjudicator.\"","He pounded his chest with a smile as he spoke, where he truly had all of his bases covered today!","[Oh?]","The veiled visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution shone brightly as she spoke with coldness.","[Then what is the authority of Destruction barreling here at this moment?]","...!","Her words caused the brows of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction to rise and look down as an instant later, space cracked and fissured as a few Apex Aeonic Lernaeans were spat from it- multiple illusory blue hands of Destruction now tainted with tendrils of red emerging and following behind them closely!","The Golden hair on Aurelia could be seen shining brightly as she bellowed out with power, a milky white light covering Orion as Flowers of Genesis bloomed to protect him and the other Apex Aeonic Lernaeans!","Behind them, a single man stepped out of the fissure of space as his hands were folded behind his back.","His expression was calm and unfettered as his red robe fluttered amidst the surging essence.","A single being.","It wasn't even a cluster of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms targeting them and putting them in such a dire state- but a single one causing all this as they couldn't even escape his chase!","But as soon as they arrived in this new region, they were forced to come to a stop as their surroundings were utterly messy and chaotic, and yet they seemed to be palpating with danger.","Far, far above them, the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction smiled as he saw the one chasing after this group of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms was none other than one of his most prized Disciples.","The Grand Elder Scion of Destruction who had attained 'that'!","Events seemed to be unfolding in an utterly wild direction as the moment he arrived, his chase momentarily stopped as he seemed to sense the fading Vacuous Hyperversal Domain towards the direction where a certain being could be seen holding the necks of husks of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","As soon as this party of beings arrived, those who were already there before them also appeared as from the depths of the Noblesse Domains, the figures of multiple Apex Aeonic Noblesse appeared as they were followed side by side with the Elders and a Grand Genesis Elder Meiying of the Genesis Institute of Extremity!","Commander Vladic led the Noblesse as his squinting eyes and piercing will instantly focused on the region where a stellar existence blazed with a flaming crown and devilish horns- especially focusing on the husks clasped within his hands as his pupils vibrated when he identified who they were!","BZZZT!","Essence began to dance wildly in this whole region.","Coming out of the Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain, Noah's will felt the convergence of multiple Apex Aeonic Lifeforms here as Providence and Destiny vibrated with immense scrutiny and grandeur.","He smelled opportunity.","He smelled chaos.","He smelled the calculative manipulation and guidance of his anger towards a glorious path.","He sensed the potential of immense glory and Loot as he fearlessly gazed towards the oncoming powerhouses of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, fear not even being a thing in his heart!"]},{"number":2486,"title":"Chapter 2486: Chapter 2485 Killing An Apex Aeonic Lifeform! IV","paragraphs":["2485 Killing an Apex Aeonic Lifeform! IV","Commander Vladic saw...her.","Her skin was turned gray as if she could fall apart any second, her Extremity Meridians thinned and decayed as her foundation was at risk of entirely falling apart. A Spear impaled her top to bottom as she was nearly split in two.","Yet...it was her.","HUUM!","His will was roused as it surged powerfully, his figure going forward and looking at the being grasping onto her with her right arm- seemingly indicating that the last vestige of her life was in his hands!","Bubbling Wrath and apprehension rose as while he neared, his voice echoed out.","\"You have greatly wounded and nearly destroyed the foundation of an Apex Aeonic Noblesse. Let it end there as if anything happens to any of them...\"","His eyes also caught Richard who was grasped on this being's left hand as he uttered out a threat with his very soul, his eyes becoming ever more baleful as he saw the figures of Apex Aeonic Lernaeans scramble to come behind this being!","—","The situation before Aurelia exceeded her wilderness dreams.","The coordinates they arrived at showed an inconceivable scene as her bright eyes felt the auras of multiple Apex Aeonic Lifeforms...along with him.","An expansive aurora of wings stretched out behind him as he was adorned in an Armament shimmering with an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Horns rose from his head as a Wrathful flaming crown spun above it!","His face held a devilishly handsome look and utmost coldness as in his hands, the husks of what seemed to be two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were grasped.","Aurelia and the rest of the Apex Aeonic Lernaeans scrambled to appear behind him as the constant attacks from the force behind them didn't keep coming at this moment, their strained bodies gaining a pause as they heard the words of Commander Vladic of the Noblesse!","This caused their minds to buzz as they truly affirmed that Noah held in his hands the lives of two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","\"How...\" Orion wiped the blood from his lips as the milky white light around him only intensified, each of them gazing towards Noah trying to rationalize how this being who had yet to undergo Apexification had managed to dominate two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","Yet no answers came from him at this juncture as he looked towards the distance where the being who was chasing Aurelia and the others could be seen.","His face was that of a saint gracing these lands with his grandeur, his red robe fluttering calmly as his eyes contained immense power and possibilities.","Out of all beings here, this existence was the one that was most unknown and granted the most sense of danger.","A close second...was behind the Noblesse who had just spoken.","Noah turned towards this direction as he came to concentrate on the forces of the Aeonic Inheritance of Extremity behind the Noblesse.","Each of them seemed more powerful than the average Apex Aeonic Lifeforms present here, yet Noah was fearless in their appearance as he came to focus on the Apex Aeonic Noblesse that had spoken, his voice ringing out coldly and with regality against this being.","\"I didn't already extinguish the souls of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms I grasped because I wanted to send a message.\"","...!","His words caught the attention of all beings here as the eyes of Commander Vladic turned bloodshot.","A foreboding sensation permeated as his body wrapped in power, ready to make a move at any second as the voice of the existence who pulsed with an unfathomable Dynamis of Extremity continued!","\"I want to show all those watching what happens when you fuck around with my people.\"","WAA!","As he spoke, his hand holding the mutilated body of Euryale rose as a spear wrapped in tendrils of black, gold, and cherry colored lights still remained impaled across her body!","\"This pest here thought her status as an Apex Aeonic Lifeform distinguished her as she attacked to kill those who haven't even undergone Apexification freely. I want to let you all know that it doesn't matter whether you are an Apex Aeonic Lifeform...nor if you have reached Extremity.\"","BZZZT!","As he spoke, the arcs of light around the spear impaling a nonresponsive Euryale began to buzz, cherry colored flames erupting around it as what remained of her body and Aspects of Existence began to be broken down!","\"If you touch my people...I will tear all the statuses you hold dear as no matter your Realm or power, this will be your only fate!\"","...!","\"Don't! If you do this...if you do this!!!\"","Commander Vladic's eyes raged with blood as he spoke threateningly while moving forward.","Aurelia and the Apex Aeonic Lernaeans behind Noah also buzzed with power as they prepared to fight if need be.","It was a critical moment in time where depending on the actions taken, a very unstable future could bloom.","And these actions lay in the hands of one man as he held the life of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform within his fingertips!","Far above this region, the Wills of two Hyperversal Extremities watched this as the red robed man had a smile on his face as he spoke.","\"I dare not presume or impose on the task of the Adjudicator, but in the doctrines of the Investiture of Extremity, the punishment for acting to slay lesser Lifeforms was never death- with every Apex Aeonic Lifeform or Hyperversal Extremity being too vital of a force to simply erase. Is the Adjudicator not going to move to stop this being from taking the lives of not one, but two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms?\"","His eyes shone with destruction and chaos as he couldn't hide his smile while he spoke, the Adjudicator of Dissolution not even turning towards his way and replying as she recalled what she had told this being below them not too long ago.","That she wouldn't interfere when others exploded with conflict against him!","Yet never was there an expectation that it would move on to be a conflict with Apex Aeonic Lifeforms merely minutes later.","Due to this, she coldly looked at the two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in his hands as...their fates were shockingly decided.","She wouldn't interfere here.","But if the situation continued to head towards the direction she expected it to...","HOONG!","Essence and authority buzzed below them as a choice was made.","The True Emperor of Quintessence brought his hand to crush what he held within it as cherry colored flames rose torrentially!","They painted a beautiful and chaotic picture as for the first time in his life, the True Emperor of Quintessence killed an Apex Aeonic Lifeform!"]},{"number":2487,"title":"Chapter 2487: Chapter 2486 The Spark Of A War! I","paragraphs":["2486 The Spark of a War! I","Life's firsts.","They were always special.","The first meal, the first birthday, the first love, the first job, the first child...","the first kill.","A lot of the time, firsts were special for the beings involved in them as they fundamentally marked a milestone and a change in one's life!","But there were firsts that didn't just affect a single person and the few beings closest to them.","There were firsts that could affect the very tilting of reality and cause an eruption of chaos that could have never been imagined!","The Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor grasped the life of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform in his hands as he crushed down and took such a life for the first time in his life.","His first kill of an existence supposedly much higher than him in power!","And the moment he did it, his words echoed out for all to hear.","\"Apex Aeonic Lifeform or Hyperversal Extremity...this will be their fate when they stand against me and my people!\"","BOOOM!","When he did this, apart from the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that were already here, a few more auras began to appear from the horizon where tendrils of Ruin and Nullity were beginning to converge.","It was the forces of the Singularity Overseers who were looking for a very specific being who had run off with two Quasarians!","They arrived to see the soul of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform be extinguished.","And Noah's actions followed a sequence as an instant after he utterly crushed the residual soul of Euryale, he also crushed his left hand as cherry colored flames rose to extinguish what remained of Richard.","\"OOOH!\" And a guttural bellow followed his words and actions as Commander Vladic of the Noblesse showed immense pain on his face, tears of Crimson red leaking from his obsidian red eyes as he surged out like a comet towards Noah!","His actions were the actions of the other Apex Aeonic Noblesse as they also barreled forth with torrential grandeur.","Time felt like it slowed down Infinitely.","Noah's heart was at ease as from his initial state of fusion until now, 30 seconds had already passed.","And yet he did what he did as he was assured in his power and actions!","As multiple Apex Aeonic Lifeforms no doubt more powerful that Euryale and Richard charged towards him, he didn't sit still as if he was waiting for someone else to protect him.","He surged forward himself as his hands flickered, a Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain blooming towards Commander Vladic who instantly stopped and moved back to evade the mass of darkness!","Yet the circular domain remained in space as an instant later, another one bloomed from a different direction as the other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms felt the trepidation with the authority contained within these domains as unlike Euryale and Richard, they were on high alert to make sure they weren't enveloped!","So without even a delay, Noah had begun throwing out attacks towards multiple Apex Aeonic Lifeforms.","And yet another instant later...","HOONG!","All entities here had to raise a portion of their wills up as they felt the pristine and heavy authority of Extremity begin to descend.","Yet it wasn't singular!","Far above them, the Will of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction was luminous as he smiled while spreading his aura out, intent on seeing what destruction would unfold as his voice began to echo out.","\"O Great Adjudicator of Dissolution. Isn't interfering now a bit lackluster? I wanted to bask-\"","BOOOM!","Before his words could even continue, his eyes flickered as before him, the veiled visage of the Adjudicator of Dissolution instantly exploded forth with such a suffocating and shocking authority that instantly overwhelmed everything he had spread out!","Shock rose within his eyes as he affirmed with disbelief that his Tier 3 Hyperversal Extremity Authority was extinguished in an instant, this being before him seeming larger than anything he imagined her to be as her voice chillingly echoed out!","[This will be my only warning to you.]","...!","Her words were akin to the ruling of the Haven itself as the eyes of the Hyperversal Extremity of Destruction turned sharp, realizing he had greatly underestimated this existence before him as her grandeur extended down freely to halt everything that was occurring down below.","The pristine aura of Extremity descended along with an undeniable voice that rang out.","[Per the regulations of the Investiture of Extremity, no Apex Aeonic Lifeforms shall strike or death lower lifeforms. The debt that was sown with the previous conflict has been repaid as further conflict...is not allowed.]","WAA!","A voice of pristine undeniability rang out as all existences in this region came to a halt.","The eyes of many flashed with shocking brilliance as they were all distinguished beings.","They understood the intricacies in the words and authority of the Adjudicator of Dissolution as all eyes turned towards the existence who was freely conjuring out Domains of darkness that even Apex Aeonic Lifeforms had to evade!","This being...had yet to even undergo Apexification?!","The eyes of the Grand Elder Scion of Destruction in the far distance shone with blazing brilliance.","The Grand Genesis Elder Meiying arrived beside Commander Vladic as this Apex Aeonic Noblesse had eyes bulging with shock and anger while he gritted his teeth!","None of them wanted to believe these words, and yet they knew the grandeur of the Adjudicator of Dissolution as they couldn't deny them!","But still...","Commander Vladic's heart was unwilling.","The pain and loss he felt was too much!","So even amidst the grandeur of Extremity pressing down on them, he uttered out while pulling a Runestone shining with a stellar void filled light- his gaze moving from Noah and onto the Apex Aeonic Lernaeans floating behind him.","\"O Adjudicator of Dissolution! On this day, two Apex Aeonic Noblesse have died by the hands of those belonging to the Lernaean Lineage. The differences we have are unresolvable as one cannot exist with the other under the same Haven!\"","BOOOM!","His words were shocking as those around him instantly knew where he was taking this incomprehensible situation.","Grand Genesis Elder Meiying placed her hand on Commander Vladic's shoulders, but this being ignored all reason as he uttered out with solemnity.","\"As the leading Commander of Noblesse, I call upon my right and the rights of my Lineage as inscribed in the Investiture of Extremity. Due to unresolvable differences and the flagrant murder of our Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, the Noblesse Lineage calls upon an Apex War against the Lernaean Lineage. An Apex War of Annihilation!\"","...!","WAA!","The skies seethed as tendrils of ruin and nullity ran rampant!"]},{"number":2488,"title":"Chapter 2488: Chapter 2487 The Spark Of A War! II","paragraphs":["2487 The Spark of a War! II","An Apex War!","And not just any Apex War, but an Apex War of Annihilation.","Where the differences and hatred ran so deep that out of such a war, it resulted in the complete Wipeout and erasure of the other faction or Lineage!","The Victors of the Apex War held such a right of annihilation!","Apex Wars were called upon when differences ran so deep that conflict was the only solution, but it was something controlled as normally, the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms fought and absorbed the losing faction after blood had been spilled to a great extent.","When it came to Apex Wars of Annihilation, both sides had to agree to it in order for it to be carried out as this type of an Apex War granted the right of Complete annihilation that the Victors could carry out!","It was against everything that the Investiture of Extremity stood for as it was something that rarely ever took place.","After all, the lives of existences were precious!","Each Apex War had to be under the approval of the Adjudicator of said Haven as their job was to prevent conflict from ever rising to such a level in the first place.","The last few Apex Wars to occur in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution had ended with 80% of the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms from the losing side being wiped out before the victors were crowned and attained everything.","They all happened in developed Havens that had already undergone Extremity Sanctification as if this Apex War went through...it would be the first in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution!","\"Noblesse and Lernaeans have fought over the years and spilled much blood, but in the past days...a total of three Apex Aeonic Noblesse lost their lives to Lernaeans. We have cause. We have conflict. We have life force being spilled. Please, do not deny us our right!\"","Commander Vladic gritted his teeth with bloodshot eyes as he mentioned the Apex Aeonic Noblesse killed by Orion during his escape, as well as Euryale and Richard just now.","He provided cause and conflict as the skies filling with Ruin and Nullity crackled silently, the pristine aura of Extremity silent.","Silent as if it was waiting for affirmation from a certain direction.","From a certain being!","HOONG!","Noah's visage shone with blinding radiance as the time to maintain his state of fusion trickled down, waving his hands behind him as he beckoned for Aurelia and the other Apex Aeonic Lernaeans to come float behind him.","His gaze was that of utmost coldness and apathy as he turned his head to the skies swirling with sources of chaos while he spoke.","\"As the Lernaean Lineage Emperor, I accept the summons for an Apex War with the Noblesse Lineage. An Apex War of Annihilation!\"","...!","Aurelia and Orion's minds buzzed at Noah's words, their emotions and hearts telling them to do things very differently as in such a situation, they did not cut down Noah's authority.","After all, he was granted it not too long ago before he fully devoured all Lernaean Domains!","The silence in the surroundings was deafening as it was broken soon after with a voice filled with Extremity Authority.","[An Apex War is frowned upon across all Havens as it only further propagates bloodshed and the loss of life. Are you all sure of taking this path?]","The tone of the Hyperversal Extremity Authority pressing down held a hint of displeasure, and yet Commander Vladic was unfettered as he replied staunchly.","\"Yes, Esteemed Adjudicator. This debt can only be repaid by blood!\"","Beside him, Grand Genesis Elder Meiying sighed thoughtfully as she gazed towards the stellar form of the being wrapped in the Authority of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","His eyes were filled with apathy at this moment as he floated forward silently.","His visage was freely and without fear crossing the skies filled with raining tendrils of Ruin and Nullity, Apex Aeonic Lifeforms surrounding him on all sides as he looked like a magnificent celestial warrior walking upon a stellar battlefield!","He floated until he arrived right before the forces of the Apex Aeonic Noblesse, Grand Genesis Elder Meiying also seeing him closely as he spoke out while staring straight into the eyes of Commander Vladic.","\"This war will end the differences between Lernaeans and Noblesse. And in this war...I shall take part as the Lernaean Lineage Emperor. Any Apex Aeonic Lifeforms can come settle their grudges with me as they like freely without worrying about the Investiture of Extremity!\"","BOOM!","Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could strike or reap the lives of lower lifeforms.","But nothing said a lower life form couldn't target and butcher Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","After all, it wasn't even a possibility.","So Noah told them all that he would be there.","He looked at Commander Vladic and told him that he could settle any hatred with him free of worries!","The malice within Commander Vladic's eyes was potent as he seemed ready to move right then and there, the voice of the Hyperversal Extremity booming down thereafter as both sides came to an agreement.","[Very well. The Lernaeans that accepted the challenge of this Apex War of Annihilation retain the privilege of choosing the time within reasonable limits.]","A time when boundless chaos would kick off.","Noah's cold eyes were sharp as he voiced out with ease.","\"Three days from now.\"","WAA!","At the time when he could fuse with the myriad parts of himself again!","The time was selected as it was a fairly short period of time, with prior histories of Apex Wars showing factions taking months or years to prepare.","[Within three days, the Apex War will be carried out privilege here. Confirm all your forces and those participating on behalf of your Lineages before that time. Now, disperse!]","Displeasure, disappointment, and a trace of anger was present in the voice of the Adjudicator of Dissolution as her words buzzed in the surroundings.","Her last words revealed another working of the Apex Wars.","The factions involved within...could invite other forces to fight with them!"]},{"number":2489,"title":"Chapter 2489: Chapter 2488 The Spark Of A War! III","paragraphs":["2488 The Spark of a War! III","[...Now, disperse!]","The booming words of the Adjudicator of Dissolution echoed out.","The visage of the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor stared down towards Commander Vladic coldly as Grand Genesis Elder Meiying motioned for him and others behind him to move out.","Far behind Noah, Aurelia and the others glared towards a direction where the red robed being who was attacking them still floated without a worry, their Wills also focusing back on Noah on the predicament he had placed all of them in.","On the predicament of a War!","In another direction, three Apex Aeonic Singularity Overseer Elders had just arrived to witness this scene as they sent a message to Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist who was still on his way over.","—","SHAA!","He shot forth like a burning comet on the Crimson silver skies.","He received memories of what the Elders he had sent forth had seen, his gaze tightening as the visage and likeness of the horned existence who had gotten into conflict with the Noblesse was exactly akin to the one who had taken away the existence with an Innate Pellucid Hyperversal Foundation!","\"You say the two sides just entered into an agreement for an Apex War?\"","He confirmed with the Elder he was discussing with as after getting more memories and understanding the situation clearly, Zeitgeist made his choice.","\"Okay. Approach the Noblesse and the Elders of the Genesis Institute of Extremity. Let them know our intention to assist them...so long as we get to question and obtain what we want from this Lernaean Lineage Emperor. Also, establish a line of communication with him personally. We shall see whether threats or riches work on someone like him...\"","Zeitgeist was ready to play both sides as his forces began to move to achieve exactly what he wanted.","At the same time, his Soul buzzed as something close to his chest released pulsing sounds, his figure coming to a stop as he looked above him.","The pulsing was indicative of one thing as in the distance, space cracked and fissured while a force of nature stepped out of it. It was none other than his past Elder Brother making his arrival.","It was the Hyperversal Extremity Kabul who had come under the order of their Master to ensure everything went smoothly!","Zeitgeist's face hardened as he changed direction, floating upwards to welcome him and brief him on exactly what had occurred!","—","The Adjudicator of Dissolution had ordered for them to disperse.","The Apex Aeonic Lifeforms began to do just that as the calm figure of Grand Genesis Elder Meiying had tight command of her people, all Genesis Elders moving out soon after as after she motioned towards the Apex Aeonic Noblesse, they also began to move away as Commander Vladic was the last one to turn around!","As he did, one last message was sent forward only for Noah to hear.","\"I will enjoy destroying everything you hold dear in a matter of days!\"","The pain he felt from seeing Euryale die was still too strong as he muttered out, intending to leave as it wasn't before the voice of the True Emperor of Quintessence reverberated out- and it wasn't only for him to hear as it spread out across the skies!","\"The message I sent didn't seem to have been received, so I will do to you all what I just did to those two worthless Lifeforms.\"","WAA!","His words caused blazing auras to blare, but Commander Vladic motioned with his hands with his rageful eyes as the Noblesse began to disappear!","Noah's body began to flicker as he turned around at this moment to face the Apex Aeonic Lernaeans, his eyes also gazing in the direction of the being who hunted them as before he could act, a blinding Singularity of light shot towards his direction.","It was without any authority as a bejeweled Medallion came to float before him from a direction where foreign Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were floating!","Noah's eyes were sharp as he took this Communication Medallion, his body beginning to fluctuate as prompts appeared before him.","[The fused state of the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor has come to an end.]","[For the next day, all of your Values are weakened by half.]","[The profundity you experienced in your state of fusion has propelled you ever closer to Extremity.]","[The Convergence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity has reached 90%]","[The Convergence of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity has reached 45%]","Bountiful prompts cascaded over his eyes as his body reformed and sized down, his finger tapping the space before him as his connection to the Infinite Hyperversal Haven was roused to create a gateway.","\"Let's go.\"","He spoke towards the main bodies of Aurelia, Orion, and the Apex Aeonic Lernaeans who followed them as with heavy eyes, they turned into streaks of light that delved into the gateway!","Noah's figure remained still as his will strongly gazed at the many eyes undoubtedly still here, a body draped in golden robes budding off from him soon after as his main body disappeared into the gateway himself.","It was time to take stock of what had just occurred and plunge into the states of his Son and affected people, as well as prepare for the shocking future!","Part of these preparations would include utilizing the benefits that came from his Wrath, with the prompts that rose when he took out Euryale and Richard being utterly stunning ones.","[You have obtained 10x Golden Singularities of Extremity.]","[You have obtained 10x Buds of Convergence.]","[You have obtained 10x Golden Havens Essentiality.]","Golden Singularities of Extremity, Buds of Convergence, and Golden Havens of Essentiality!","They were grandiose names of Loot new from Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, but Noah didn't focus on them right now as his mind held greater focus towards an entirely different direction.","As he returned to the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, his weakened body which had half of its strength looked just as vibrant as he put all other things on hold.","Aurelia and the others were put aside, Xiaomi and Caesar were put aside!","His figure warped towards the Prana Aletheian Haven that was filled with an overabundance of life.","Here, the figure of his son with his eyes closed could be seen floating next to dozens of small shining clusters of souls that were about to have their fates ascertained by Noah!"]},{"number":2490,"title":"Chapter 2490: Chapter 2489 Reconstruction! I","paragraphs":["2489 Reconstruction! I","His coldness and apathy faded.","Around him, verdant vines shimmering with a layer of golden light formed a magical stellar garden, multicolored flowers filled with the very essence of Prana permeating all around.","The form of the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor entirely faded as his fair skin was laid bare, a cosmic color flashing above its epidermal skin layer as he looked like an ancient warrior forged and born from the very stars!","His eyes showed an unfathomable light of thought and power as he floated before his son who had entirely been healed from his charred visage along with pulsing clusters of residual soul light.","Far away from them and in the periphery of this deepest part of the forming Prana Aletheian Haven, the figures of Adelaide, the Longest Dream, Amelia, and many others could be seen with somber expressions as they watched on to see what the result would be.","They held worry in their eyes, but they also held a profound sense of trust towards the being who had arrived before Henry's dormant figure and the clusters of residual souls that were people he knew.","Even in this time of uncertainty, they instinctively believed he would show them yet another wonder!","So they watched on with their hearts slightly at ease.","Even further from them outside of the Prana Aletheian Haven, the figures of Aurelia's and Orion's main bodies could be seen along with other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, the leading figures of Ancestral Lernaeans swirling around them while in the distance, Caesar held Xiaomi tightly as Noah had already told them to merely sit tight while he took care of something!","All of this and many more things were happening in the background, but Noah himself focused nearly all of himself in the center of the Prana Aletheian Haven as millions of thoughts flashed in his mind.","Possibilities on the paths that could be taken.","His son was okay, and yet his soul hadn't roused even now for him to open up his eyes while the clusters of souls that used to be Eowyn, Barbatos, Kazuhiko, the Emperor Penguin, and dozens more important beings in his life only had threads of what they used to be held together by his own soul that bound them as his Vassals!","When Noah calculated the options and followed the lead of Providence and Destiny, he arrived towards a few paths.","These paths were further derived as a few were eliminated, some were considered more on, and then a single golden path remained open as the only possibility before Noah!","HOONG!","His body pulsed as his stellar visage was soon covered by a cherry colored light.","The Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.","It was born from concepts of the end and of beginnings.","His son and many others close to him who had nearly met their ends...he could likely raise them to be even grander than they used to be with this new beginning!","\"But this alone isn't enough.\"","...!","His voice was vibrant as it caused the life force in the surroundings to become even more dense.","The Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity alone wasn't enough!","And apart from this, there was also the fact of rectifying how all of this had happened in the first place as while a cherry-colored light covered his body, a myriad of other lights also rose as Noah called upon new concepts of Extremity he had just expanded.","Anima.","Body, Origin, Soul, Cloning, Reification, Unification, Separation!","Each of them were brought to the 9th Boundary Layer as their Seeds of Extremity had already been taken into respective Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds as they only waited for these seeds to bud for them to achieve their 10th Boundary Layers.","Twinkling lights that represented these Boundaries danced around Noah as he...took a breath.","...!","He breathed in these Essences as they began to circulate through every part of him- his will being set on forging something new!","Each of the newly expanded concepts had its own distinctive layers that deserved further exploration.","But this would come at a later time when he further took their standing towards a more pristine level. What he needed to do now was to attain an even greater authority through their combination. Another Absolute Seed of Extremity!","It may be an unlikelihood for other beings, but his Quintessential breathing method and his binding of the Sources of Extremity along with a myriad of other factors that made him the anomaly that he was...all of it allowed him to take the grand actions he took!","[The Convergence of multiple concepts is occurring within your Aspects of Existence.]","[There is a Quintessential Resonance with the selected concepts!]","Anima, Body, Origin, Soul, Cloning, Reification, Unification, and Separation!","Noah circulated their essences as if they were each their own separate lines that gradually came together to fuse into a single one.","To birth a single seed!","[The Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation supports and enhances the birth of another Absolute Seed of Extremity.]","As the prompts came, so did Noah's commands.","\"Add Quintessence and Manadynamics into the mix.\"","What he used with his first Absolute Seed of Extremity to stabilize different concepts.","It brought the number of circulating Boundary Essences to 10 as his body buzzed with grandeur!","He seemed like a forge that was creating a deadly shield or weapon, radiance shining from him in no time as his soul held enough space to allow for the blooming of a third Absolute Seed of Extremity!","[The cycling Boundary Essences have extremely high affinity and reinforcement!]","[The concepts of Anima, Body, Origin, Soul, Cloning, Reification, Unification, Separation, Manadynamics, and Quintessence are converging together to birth a third Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity!]","HOONG!","The colors melded and mixed.","The multicolored light of Quintessence was strong as it seemed to paint everything with it, while Manadynamics fought to paint everything blue!","Yet Reification, Separation, and Unification came into the picture.","Anima, Body, Origin, Soul, and Cloning declared their own dominance as they melded and called for their own color!","As if influenced by the heavy green around the Prana Aletheian Haven Noah was in- such a color began to bloom as shockingly, the lone Boundary of Prana was also pulled into circulation at this critical juncture- joining 10 other Boundaries as brilliant color shone!","It felt strong and pure.","It felt too bright for any single being to hold on to it!","It was...deeply emerald in color as Noah's stellar body was painted with such a light.","[Another Absolute Seed of Extremity has begun to be forged!]","[A Third Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity has been born!]","[The distinctive conditions and harmony of the concepts within the Third Unnamed Dynamis of Extremity have placed its rate of Convergence at 25%]","...!"]},{"number":2491,"title":"Chapter 2491: Chapter 2490 Reconstruction! II","paragraphs":["2490 Reconstruction! II","A Third Absolute Dynamis of Extremity bloomed within Noah as his vibrant mind didn't waste any time on this one, his Will gazing at it as he bellowed out grandly.","\"Vitalistic.\"","WAA!","\"The Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity.\"","...!","In the depths of what Noah was, a blinding seed burned and read [VITALISTIC]!","Vitalistic!","It was a word that more so pointed towards the vital impulse of life.","Life, and how different parts were used to bring it all together.","How the body and mind came unified and separated. How the beating heart acted as the core to pump energy across all systems. How all of these different parts joined together to bloom with the burning impulse of life...life that only came because everything was together, and also apart!","They were the same, and yet distinct as each had their own part to play!","Only when one realized how separate all the parts that made life were, could they truly unify them to bring together a true impulse of life!","[The Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity burns brightly in your Aspects of Existence.]","[The features of Existence Dissociation and Aspect Configuration have been born!]","A burning emerald light set Noah's body aflame as he looked like a kindling of lifeforce.","The cherry colored light of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity was also burning brightly as soon after, the black gold light of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity bloomed out!","And his voice thundered out as waves of information washed over him.","[Aspect Configuration].","[Realm Reconstruction].","Realm Reconstruction was known. But what about Aspect Configuration?","It was a wonder in itself!","[Aspect Configuration]:: With the authority of the Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity, you can configure the very Aspects that make up a living being in a direction you favor. The Body, Origin, and Soul come together in harmony to make all beings, and when one or all of them are altered in any way, the result is one that will make way for an entirely different Existence. With Aspect Configuration, an Existence can be directed on a path of Extreme as their Soul could be configured to make up 90% of their being, with their Body and Origin making up 10%...or any different Configurations between these three Aspects of Existence. With this action and imposed configurations, there is a high likelihood of causing the Aspects of Existence to undergo fundamental changes and Mutations that are capable of producing Entities with a Mutated Soul, Body, or Origin. The level of Configuration sought and the level of the selected existence will affect how many Soul Values are required for the Aspect Configuration...","...!","Yes.","One of the features of the Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity was a simple yet dreadful one.","It allowed Noah to configure the very Aspects of Existence as with it...he could freely give rise to Mutated Entities!","Realm Reconstruction and Aspect Configuration were activated as the black gold light of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity and the emerald light of the Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity surged forward.","Amidst them, the essence that signified beginnings and ends snaked in with a heavy influence!","Noah's soul buzzed with an emerald and cherry colored light that expanded to cover everything before him, his mind drifting off into a myriad of currents of light that entered what remained of the minds of all beings before him!","The mind that he arrived in first...was none other than his son.","—","A blue sea stretched out endlessly in all directions as at its very center, the countenance of a young man with stellar black and blue strands of hair could be seen sitting down with a forlorn expression.","\"My son.\"","Noah appeared beside him as he was adorned in a simple blue Emperor's Robe, his hair shining with a similar light as his son stared out into the expanse with an expression that seemed to contain countless thoughts clashing with each other!","His voice was light as it emanated out.","\"Father...I dare not open my eyes as I am ashamed. Ashamed that I couldn't handle it. Ashamed that without you stepping in once again, everything would have fallen apart.\"","The young man stared out into the expanse of blue as he couldn't meet his father's gaze.","He felt as if he had let him down, as if he didn't deserve to sit beside him and have the same grandiose Quintessential blood coursing through him!","As if his father was a genuine blazing sun...and he was only a fraud.","A fraud that would never be able to amount to anything close to him.","As if Noah could read his emotions, he stared out into the same expanse of blue as his voice boomed from all around.","\"Our Lineage is one that will be etched in the Aeonic Annals of Extremity. One that will be uttered with respect and reverence from the mouths of the countless Inheritances of Extremity across the Seven Havens. From Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to Hyperversal Extremities...to the unknown enemies outside the scope of time and reality itself.\"","WAA!","The surrounding sea buzzed as he spoke, the authorities of emerald, black gold, and cherry colored lights permeating across the blue sea as immensity began to build up!","\"All of them will tremble when our Lineage is merely uttered. You...are a part of that Lineage. You do not take away from it, you only add to its grandeur. But you do have to live in line with its brilliance. When we get knocked down or make a mistake, we do not wallow in our weakness. We rise from any adversity and burn ever brighter because of it.\"","...!","\"The future is unknown, but there may come a day when I will step out of the light and my reign will come to an end as you will have to rise and lead. If that day ever comes, you will have to embody Quintessence itself. You will have to illuminate reality itself with the grandeur of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor. It cannot be anything less!\"","The endless cerulean Seas churned as they were painted with emerald, black gold, and cherry colored lights!","The Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor gazed at his son as he asked calmly.","\"Now, there is an opportunity to reform not just the workings of your Realm, but a basic change in your Aspects of Existence themselves. What realm will you have? How much of your Existence do you want to be dominated by your Origin, Body, and Soul?\"","Realm Reconstruction and Aspect Configuration were ready to be put to work.","The first Existence to experience them both was asked as Henry's visage rose!","He looked towards his father as his expression hardened, millions of thoughts crossing through his blue eyes.","On this day, he came to a realization that whatever adversity or enemies he faced in the future, none of them would compare to the challenge of climbing over his father's shadow!","It was too vast. Too radiant!","It could be considered an impossible challenge, and yet he couldn't back down as within his veins, Quintessence also flowed!","BOOM!","Within him, destiny seethed and erupted with brilliance.","With utmost respect, he kneeled before him while voicing out grandly.","\"My Realm can be reconstructed based on Destiny. There would be Dimensional Realities of Destiny, Providence, Fate, Karma, Fortune, Kismet, Moirai, Wisdom...and Quintessence.\"","...!","As he spoke, Noah's soul already moved as the vast seas around them rose, turning into pillars of light that sunk into Henry's created soul as grand changes were about to take place!","Any concepts Henry mentioned that weren't elevated to the 9th Boundary Layer by Noah were taken to such a stage at this moment until they formed the Seeds waiting to bloom and become 10th Boundary Layers.","While emerald, black gold, and cherry colored lights rushed into him, Henry's blue eyes reflected endless illusory blue skies as he continued.","\"As for my Aspects of Existence...let them be composed entirely of my Soul!\"","BOOM!","The Son of Destiny chose a extreme direction as his destiny took him in a shocking direction!","\"I shall have no Origin nor Body. My Realm shall be forged within the depths of my soul!\"","...!","His endlessly blue eyes showed a light of fanaticism as he spoke, Noah gazing at his son's burning Will as his wide palm went on to grasp his head.","Thereafter, brilliance overflowed!"]},{"number":2492,"title":"Chapter 2492: Chapter 2491 Mass Producing Mutated Entities! I","paragraphs":["2491 Mass Producing Mutated Entities! I","Henry had chosen an utterly drastic path as he sought to have all of his existence be made purely from his soul!","Realm Reconstruction reduced his power to absolutely nothing before Noah's will placed destiny at the very center of his existence.","But before his Realm was built back up, the emerald light of the Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity shone brightly.","Noah's sight changed as before him, he discerned three aspects equally proportioned to make a whole- to make the existence that was Henry Osmont.","This would be Noah's first time utilizing Aspect Configuration as with his will entrenched in Henry's Aspects of Existence...the light of Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity shone as it began to reduce the expansiveness of the Aspects of the Body and Origin, the bubble that signified the soul instead expanding!","Aspects of Existence purely made of the Soul.","Even Noah questioned the feasibility of this, but he had long since stopped doubting the authorities edging closer to Extremity as the test today...was just to what extent he could configure the Aspects of Existence.","The Soul became ever more expansive while the breadth of the Origin and Body reduced, Noah's soul values churning as the image of the three Aspects gradually changed to show a single massive bubble that was about to entirely swallow two distinct points of light!","The Aspect of the Soul became 98% of his total Aspects of Existence.","Only a sliver of the aspect of the body and origin remained as Noah's eyes gloriously focused on them, and yet...","They didn't diminish any further and disappear into oblivion!","'Hmm...'","A truth was affirmed by Noah as the emerald green light of the Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity stabilized the newly reconfigured Aspects of Existence.","The name of the reality altering feature was Aspect Configuration.","It was an Alteration or change of the proportions of Aspects that made an existence. It did not have within it the capability deletion of Aspects of Existence!","Henry's goal of making his Aspects of Existence be entirely made of his Soul was close, but a single percentage in the body and another percentage of his Origin prevented this complete and drastic transformation!","But he had attained an existence that was almost completely made up of his Soul- with this aspect needing to take the previous duties and forms of the Origin and Body as the result wasn't entirely known.","But at the time of its conception...brilliant emerald light shone as prompts thundered down.","[A Blank Soul Mutationem Embryo has bloomed within the target's origin.]","The blinding light showed a blooming mutation as the Aspects of Existence were stabilized!","But this wasn't all.","The Soul of the Son of Destiny took control!","[The target's soul has inherently chosen its mutation to be Soul Manipulation!]","[Soul Manipulation can now be a selected Soul Mutationem for any beings that have gone through Aspect Configuration with their Soul occupying at least 60% of their Existence.]","Henry's Soul released an incandescent gold radiance as the moment Noah affirmed its stability, Realm Reconstruction fully went underway as the tiny 1% of his Origin was centered within his soul- his soul that wrapped around this minuscule remnant of Origin as it began to build up...a brand new realm with the remnant Origin at the very center!","His soul would always reign supreme.","His barely existent Origin would be majorly formed by his soul, and the husk that was his body would also be mainly put together by his soul!","And thus, a profound process took place as a realm was constructed within the depths of his soul, the origin merely acting as a small seed as universes and Cosmos very quickly began to proliferate!","And when the Realm reached a high enough level...a Destiny Dimensional Reality was forged.","Halcyon brilliance covered all of Henry as thereafter, Providence, Fate, Karma, Fortune, Kismet, Moirai, Wisdom, and Quintessence were forged one after another!","[You have opened the path of the Immeasurable Destiny Extremity Foundation.]","[The Immeasurable Destiny Extremity Foundation has been established in Henry Osmont!]","Henry Osmont!]","[When all the resonated concepts and Dimensional Realities of the Immeasurable Destiny Extremity Foundation reach saturation, Henry Osmont can undergo Apexification with a 100% chance of ascending to become an Apex Aeonic Lifeform with an Immeasurable Destiny Meridian Apex Aeonic Foundation. With such a foundation, the vast knowledge and manipulation of the Aeonic Annals of Extremity can begin as an Absolute Seed of Extremity can easily be forged from the Convergence of the concepts at the core of this foundation...]","[The Convergence of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity has increased by 3%]","[The Convergence of the Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity has increased by 3%]","[The Convergence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity has increased by .5%]","A stupendous Foundation was unearthed by Noah yet again as it showed the future possibilities of another Absolute Seed of Extremity that integrated concepts like destiny and Providence!","This wasn't all as due to Noah going through Aspect Configuration and Realm Reconstruction, the respective Dynamis of Extremity of these features had their rates of Convergence further elevated.","Even the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity was roused as its authority added itself in every step!","HOONG!","The viewpoint of a manifestation of a soul in an expanded blue sea changed as back in the center of the Prana Aletheian Haven, Henry's visage could be seen beside his father as his body turned incorporeal.","A golden light covered him as he seemed to be made out of pure soul light, a sense of beauty and grandeur bouncing from him streaks of cerulean light coursed through his veins!","It was the birth of a unique being within the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","It was the birth of a Mutated Entity!","And with the advent of the change that made his existence...","[Henry Osmont has attained a subcategory of the Quintessential Hyperversal Emperor Lineage known as the Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Emperor.]","[All Soul Parameters have a passive boost of 50%]","[The rate of progression towards Extremity, formation of Dynamis of Extremity, and Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity has a passive increase of 50%]","With his body shining gold and blue as his soul replaced the workings of much of his Origin and Body, the Son of the True Emperor of Quintessence opened his eyes as torrential seas of destiny opened with them!"]},{"number":2493,"title":"Chapter 2493: Chapter 2492 Mass Producing Mutated Entities! II","paragraphs":["2492 Mass Producing Mutated Entities! II","Henry's transformation and transformations were stupendous, but he wasn't the only one going through them.","As he felt the grand changes and stabilized his Realm to properly understand just what intricate boons he attained due to his Aspects of Existence being made up 98% of his soul, others were also going through a similar procedure as him!","Noah's exuberant soul had gone to bathe not just Henry, but also all the residual souls floating before him as similar to the experience with Henry, different parts of Noah's will were conversing with all existences affected.","For those who held traces of their souls left bound to him as Vassals, Noah had to drench them in the authorities of the Three Absolute Dynamis of Extremity to spur greater lifeforce and sufficiently regenerate enough of their souls for their very identities to reform!","And after this occurred...","\"Barbatos.\"","Noah's will called out as it was manifested in a space that showed mountains of bones rising and falling endlessly.","A massive throne of bones rose on the highest mountain as the devilishly small and robust figure of Barbatos opened her eyes atop it, her dark eyes blinking with understanding as she smiled and came to focus on Noah's figure floating above her endless mountains of bone.","Her smile was genuine, and yet it held within it traces of fear as she rose from the bony throne and floated towards Noah's will.","\"Little Fish...do you know how scary the thought of complete darkness without ever being able to see you again was?\"","...!","She very rarely showed her emotions, much less a sense of fear- but she truly did fear never being able to wake to see this being before her again!","So her small figure jumped into his embrace and held him tightly, Noah's wide hands stroking her head shimmering with strands of dark light as she spoke while burying her head in his chest.","\"Make me stronger, Little Fish. To the extent that I never have to worry if I'll ever see you again.\"","Her heart let itself be known freely as Noah gently pulled her head back, bending down to lock onto her dark eyes as he lovingly asked her.","\"Then tell me what Realm you want. What you wish your Aspects of Existence to be...\"","The mountains of bones below began to tremble as Barbatos made her choice, with variations of scenes like this occurring simultaneously with Noah's Wills as in another Manifestation, he was faced with an endless sandy gold sea where Eowyn stood waiting for him.","A world filled with darkness and swords as Kazuhiko tried to desperately hold onto them.","An expanse of purple flowers where Guinevere floated patiently!","And...an expanse of stellar blue auroras of light as another portion of Noah's will saw the scenes of his own massive visage floating in this stellar expanse with his eyes closed, and above the head of his manifested self- the figure of a bouncing Blue Slime could be seen smiling innocently.","It cheered with happiness and bounced even more at Noah's appearance, its path also being chosen!","Noah did all of this in the depths of the Prana Aletheian Haven as shocking changes were occurring all around him, and yet he configured the aspects of his heavily injured Vassals as just like Henry...","[The target's soul has inherently chosen its mutation to be Necropolis!]","[Necropolis can now be a selected Soul Mutationem for any beings that have gone through Aspect Configuration with their Soul occupying at least 60% of their Existence.]","[The target's soul has inherently chosen its mutation to be Endless Devourer!]","[The target's Origin has inherently chosen its mutation to be Essence Manipulation!]","[The target's Body has inherently chosen its mutation to be Unbreakable...]","Dozens of such prompts floated before Noah's eyes as freely and with glorious wonder- he was actually taking actions that mass produced one Mutated Entity after another.","In the Aeonic Havens of Extremity, powerful hegemonies conducted a great deal of experiments over billions of years to produce Engineered Entities.","From the Plum Sword of Extremity, Atlas had undergone Plum Soul Ablation like millions of other Disciples over the years- and he was one of the few survivors to have become a Mutated Entity!","It was dangerous, cruel, and often had a high mortality rate.","But not for Noah.","Not for the True Emperor of Quintessence!","—","In the junction between the Havens of Extremity.","The surrounding space was filled with coagulated authority that seemed to be a mixture of the nature of the very Havens themselves- this Authority being something that only Dynamis of Extremity or Hyperversal Extremity Authority could traverse!","One of Noah's bodies was moving with Grand Primeval Elder Silas towards the Aeonic Haven of Penumbra as he turned around with a sharp expression towards Noah- their surroundings buzzing with waves of darkness to keep the authority around them away.","\"An Apex War of Annihilation against the Noblesse? Why would you seek such a thing when the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms of the Lernaean Lineage are only subpar? And you won't just be facing the Noblesse as some of the Singularity Overseer Elders will likely join in to support them!\"","Silas's gaze was difficult as Noah's eyes were indifferent at such a time, his hands waving calmly.","\"None of the Primeval Shadow Elders need to participate. This is something I can take on myself.\"","WAA!","A war against Apex Aeonic Lifeforms!","Noah would have to prepare a great deal for it as it was bound to be deadly, and yet he didn't seek the aid of any other forces!","Silas saw the indifference and assurance on his face as he took out a Communication Medallion while shaking his head.","\"I'll confirm with the higher ups first but...the Cult of Endless Shadows cannot simply sit idle as an Apex War goes on with a force that is now affiliated with us!\"","It was a small war involving two aboriginal Lineages of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","And yet it seemed that a level of influence would be enforced by Inheritances of Extremity within this war!","Far away from this location. Within the depths of the Noblesse Lineage.","A crystalline obsidian floor stretched out for miles above billowing void clouds, an air of wonder and supremacy covering a ceiling that was littered with Cosmos and other stellar bodies as if they were ornaments.","Thrones and exquisite extended tables stretched out across the crystalline obsidian floor as this was within the center of the Imperial Void Planes Cluster where the core powers of the Noblesse would meet!","Commander Vladic could be seen with crimson black eyes debating something with a stern Grand Genesis Elder Meiying when the voice of a Noblesse Apex Aeonic Lifeforms interrupted them.","\"Vladic, a delegation of Singularity Overseers has arrived...\"","Commander Vladic's eyes shone at such words as he beckoned to grant access.","Kismet danced wildly around his heart as it told him another beneficial reality that would further ensure his Wrath would descend upon the Lernaeans after three days had arrived!"]},{"number":2494,"title":"Chapter 2494: Chapter 2493 An Apex Seed Blooms! I","paragraphs":["2493 An Apex Seed Blooms! I","In the depths of roiling skies filled with tendrils of Ruin and Nullity.","Within the region where Noah had just eradicated Euryale and Richard, a clone floated amidst the sources of chaos calmly as while his main body undertook a tremendous job in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven, this Clone had its own role here!","Before he could begin to move though, the blinding Communication Medallion that had shot towards his direction from the late arrivals who were existences from the Singularity Overseers began to pulse with life as a message came through.","\"You seem to be in a predicament right now.\"","The voice was deep and full of power.","Yet it didn't cause Noah to bat an eye as he replied calmly.","\"Oh?\"","\"Yes. And we can aid you in this predicament right now. You just have to let go of the father and daughter pair of Quasarians that escaped with you. Then an Oath can be sworn that the full force of Singularity Overseers will stand with the Lernaean Lineage in their Apex War of Annihilation.\"","WAA!","The voice stemmed from none other than Zeitgeist as Noah's expression remained placid, his gaze turning to the pulsing sources of chaos around him as he could no longer feel the gaze of the existence who was chasing Aurelia and the others!","\"And if I don't let the father and daughter pair go?\"","He replied freely to the Medallion as the voice coming from it became even more stern.","\"A delegation of Singularity Overseer Elders is on the way towards the Noblesse right now. If you agree, it will be us pressuring the Genesis Institute of Extremity to not interfere. If you do not see reason and disagree...you can consider the force of Singularity Overseers in this Haven standing with the Noblesse Lineage against you in this coming Apex War!\"","...!","A threat as clear as day was made as Noah's face remained free of emotions, his voice cold as he began to crush the Medallion in his hands!","\"Go ahead then. It will merely be adding more lambs to the upcoming slaughter!\"","CRACK!","The dazzling medallion shattered and turned to dust in his hands as thereafter, his visage began to float upwards towards the thundering ruin and nullity.","His intent was clear as he was returning to the place he had inadvertently left to keep to the agreement he held with the very Adjudicator of this Haven!","And it didn't take long before a blinding light thundered down that instantly took his figure away.","The region returned to only being filled with tendrils of Ruin and Nullity as a distance away from it, towards the depths of the Noblesse Domains, a meeting was about to take place!","Within the center of the Imperial Void Planes Cluster","The figure of Grand Singularity Elder Zeitgeist could be seen floating towards Grand Genesis Elder Meiying and Commander Vladic with three other Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in tow, their bodies pulsing with grandeur as Meiying was the first one to speak.","\"To what do we owe the great pleasure of having you all here?\"","Her eyes were calm, and yet they held a powerful authority that Zeitgeist laughed off while gazing towards Commander Vladic- his eyes remembering the words Noah had said before the Communication Medallion was crushed as he proceeded with his threat!","\"Nothing too extravagant. The Singularity Overseers just wanted to offer some of our Apex Aeonic Lifeforms to fight on behalf of the Noblesse in the coming Apex War...\"","...!","Words that caused Commander Vladic's brutal eyes to light up rose as his smile became an extremely welcoming one.","The auras of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms blazed brightly as short-lived alliances were made- with the beings in them each wanting different things...that were connected to the same person!","—","Towards the Abyssal Sanctimonious Lands.","Past the wide fissure of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution.","\"Move in formation!\"","A bellow could be heard from a group of Shadowlings as they scrambled to push away another squadron of Scions to attain two pulsing Golden Extremity Panaceas.","Every single being in the surroundings was rushing to get any Aeonic Treasure of Extremity as more and more beings delved deeper into the Extremity Vein!","In the past few minutes, the Shadowlings faced immense scrutiny as the powerful bodies of the beings leading them disappeared, and they finally entered brawls to fight for relics to forge their own Foundations.","They dearly missed the being who was unstoppable against all Scions here as before the situation could become even more chaotic...","SHIING!","Space twisted and tore as the stellar visage of the Quintessential Emperor of Extremity appeared once more.","His stellar body looked just as stunning as even though he was expressing half of his power currently...the pressure he emanated outwards nearly caused the Scions in the surroundings to suffocate as even with half of the 1 Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value Noah's Main body held- this Reified Source of Quintessence could display 9 times the power as ridiculously, Noah's half weakened state was the maddening pressure of 4.5 Apex Aeonic Soul Values!","It meant that the exploration of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution would be something of utter ease for him as Leviathans and Scions alike would be utterly shredded unless it was beings like Erikson or Atlas...and even they had to establish their Foundations and multiply their current selves many times over to even come close to standing next to his brilliance!","\"Let's go.\"","His voice boomed out as more Reified Sources of Extremity materialized beside him, the Shadowlings showing happiness and euphoria as they followed the Arcane Haven Source Engine and other reified forms while Noah's Quintessential Emperor of Extremity turned into a glimmer of light that disappeared into the distance.","The next few days were extremely critical as many things had to fall into place before a massive war broke out.","Noah had a few goals already set that he had to meet before that time as there were a great deal of things he needed to do himself!","One was the thorough exploration of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution and obtaining the relics to aid in the Convergence and progression of Boundaries and whatever else they held.","The other goals...were all meant to come together to allow him to overwhelm the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that would emerge in the coming Apex War of Annihilation!"]},{"number":2495,"title":"Chapter 2495: Chapter 2494 An Apex Seed Blooms! II","paragraphs":["2494 An Apex Seed Blooms! II","His goals were crucial, and Noah had zero doubts in being able to complete them as things were already starting off with unbelievable progress and results so far in the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","This was all due to him utilizing Realm Reconstruction and Aspect Configuration on his people, the results being shocking boons for them...but even greater boons for him as his three Dynamis of Extremity were experiencing a shocking acceleration in their rate of Convergence!","This...accomplished another one of Noah's goals.","His three Absolute Seeds of Extremity bloomed as he wanted to reach full Convergence and have the fully formed Absolute Dynamis of Extremity for him to wield before the Apex War.","And this was Infinitely close to being achieved by the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity that was already above 90%!","Then...came the question of how it was possible for Noah to continue spending his Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values for all of his people.","Even he should've been feeling the strain!","And yet, the answer to this came in the form of his expanded Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values, as well as...","[Quintessential Hyperversal Mana]:: The body of the True Emperor of Quintessence courses with an infinite amount of this immense authority as it holds all qualities of the prior Aeonic Mana of Extremity and further enhances them. When casting any features or abilities requiring the cost of any other Resource or Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values, this type of mana will be utilized first to cover 95% of the cost. This type of Mana has Quintessentially influenced the Quintessential Hyperversal Aletheian Reality Passages within your Origin as the forging Aletheian Havens of Extremity currently allows you to regenerate 100% of your Maximum Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values in 5 minutes. All features and abilities cast through this resource will exhibit 7.5% Absolute Hyperversal Authority Penetration, along with other unquantified boons that will only manifest as the Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation progresses even further....","His Quintessential Hyperversal Mana that was Infinite!","His essence usage would be nestled covered by this type of Mana as if an ability was ridiculous enough to cost 1 Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value to cast, Noah would only need to utilize .05 Soul Values while his Mana would cover the other .95.","With it, he could manifest the Planar Domains of his Boundaries endlessly, and he could spam freely with the cost being kept to a minimum!","It allowed him to take crazy actions that were only supplemented by the fact that all of his soul values would regenerate to their maximum value in 5 minutes.","This was how in the past few minutes, Noah had continued to freely utilize Realm Reconstruction and Aspect Configuration in the depths of the Prana Aletheian Haven as from the cluster of residual souls, many bodies had formed.","Each one held their own chosen composition of their Aspects of Existence and their own Realms, Noah continuing to gain more proficiency in altering Aspects of Existence as his Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity...","[The Convergence of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity has increased to 80%]","[The Convergence of the Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity has increased to 60%]","[The Convergence of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity has increased to 99.9%]","Aletheian and Vitalistic were rising steadily.","And yet the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity had reached 99.9%, and no matter how much more he used this dazzling cherry colored essence...this percentage did not rise up any further.","It was as if it told Noah that unless he had some profound epiphany about beginnings and ends, he wouldn't achieve full Convergence!","Now, if it were in the past, Noah would take his time as such an epiphany could come in a day or two.","If it were in the past.","BZZZT!","While a storm of essence surrounded him with his reborn vassals before his glorious visage in the Prana Aletheian Haven, his left hand beckoned as on it, a dynamic Loot materialized!","It was a Bud of Convergence.","One of the three types of Loot he had received from erasing Euryale and Richard!","It pulsed with a simple milky white light as it was in the form of a crystalline transparent white seed, sparks of authority bounding within it as one's Aspects of Existence would instinctively feel the need to devour it.","[Bud of Convergence]:: The combination of concepts of Extremity is an adversity that calls forth even greater adversity, with some never being able to overcome it. Extremity of one concept is already arduous enough, Extremity of multiple concepts under one definition is nearly an impossibility. This Bud of Convergence exists to bridge the gap of impossibility as it aids in the rate of Convergence of Dynamis of Extremity. An increase of 5% to the rate of Convergence can be obtained when aimed towards Aeonic Dynamis of Extremity, and an increase of 1% Convergence can be obtained when directed towards Absolute Dynamis of Extremity. When trying to achieve the impossible, Buds of Convergence are merely one of the many tools you will need...","A tool to overcome the impossible task one took when they forged a Dynamis of Extremity!","Noah's eyes were sharp as he opened his mouth to devour this Bud right away, directing it towards nothing other than the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity!","HOONG!","The Bud blossomed the moment it settled into his body as the authority within it was unleashed.","It went towards Noah's soul and surged to wrap around a budding Seed.","Around a runic seed that read [INDEFATIGABLE]!","It was akin to a jolt that caused the Absolute Seed of Extremity to surge to life, this seed beginning to release liquified cherry colored light as...it started to bloom.","An Absolute Seed of Extremity...was blooming in Noah's Soul!","Endless waves of cherry colored light blanketed everything.","The green light in the environs was nearly swallowed whole as an series of prompts started to descend.","[The Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity has reached 100% Convergence!]","[An Absolute Seed of Extremity has bloomed within your Soul!]","[A Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity is blooming within your Soul!]"]},{"number":2496,"title":"Chapter 2496: Chapter 2495 A Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity! I","paragraphs":["2495 A Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity! I","[A Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity is blooming within your Soul!]","The prompt was a heavy one as it showed something utterly fantastical blooming in Noah's Soul.","The runic seed that was labeled [INDEFATIGABLE] bloomed into an incandescent tree that spread its root across Noah's Soul, the pristine pure aura of Hyperversal Extremity being felt from it ever so slightly as it showed even though this path was an extremely arduous one...it could grant something standing above all other concepts!","The Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity was lividus in color as its branches shone with the cherry colored light, fully embedded themselves within Noah's soul as his outside body was illuminated.","Its outer trunk seemed as small as an atom and as vast as a Haven at the same time, countless runes reading the word [INDEFATIGABLE] swirling across the magnificent Yggdrasil as the branches looked like cherry colored rivers of reality.","Even though it was occurring within his soul, the image of the Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity was manifested outwardly as far above Noah in the Prana Aletheian Haven, the glorious visage of a cherry colored Absolute Dynamis of Extremity showed itself!","It caused the existences in the surroundings to shudder as the Reverend Emperors and below felt an undeniable authority that caused their very Aspects of Existence to tremble.","And the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms that just entered the Infinite Hyperversal Haven...","Gazed towards the flowering Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity in utter shock as they felt an overwhelming sense of pressure from it!","As if it could surpass them and their power.","\"...\"","Aurelia, Orion, and the other Lernaean Apex Aeonic Lifeforms couldn't make heads or tails of it as their shock grew.","Caesar had a difficult expression as he stared towards the illusory image of the cherry colored tree, Xiaomi floating in front of him with a light of immense interest as her will was trying to understand everything they saw around them.","\"Just what place have we come to, Father?\"","Her voice was as thin as it could be as even the man behind her didn't truly have an idea!","Back in the Prana Aletheian Haven, Noah continued to experience the changes that came with the Complete Convergence of a Dynamis of Extremity as more prompts cascaded down.","[The flowering of the Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity indicates the start of a single definition composed of multiple concepts making its way towards Extremity.]","[The more advancements made in the individual concepts that compose the single definition of Indefatigable, the closer that this definition will be towards Extremity.]","[The increased usage of the authority of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity will also increase the progression of the individual concepts that make it up, where the moment that all of them attain the 18th Boundary Layer, the Extremity Boundary Layer, then the Indefatigable Dynamis will also attain Extremity.]","...!","Why was the task of taking a single Dynamis of Extremity towards Extremity nearly an impossibility?","If a being stuck with a single concept, they could focus on it as over the years, they could define themselves with this single concept at Apexification and attain the 10th Boundary Layer- slowly continuing to put all three efforts of their Aspects of Existence into it as they grudgingly exceeded one Layer after another to reach the 18th Boundary Layer!","The Extremity Boundary Layer!","9 Layers to distinguish one level of lifeform, and 9 more Layers to distinguish Apex Aeonic Lifeforms seeking Extremity.","All of this had to occur for a single Concept to reach Extremity!","For a Dynamis of Extremity to reach Extremity itself...all the concepts it was composed of had to do so.","An Aeonic Dynamis of two or three concepts may still be manageable as one might take double the amount of time as a being focusing on a single concept.","An Absolute Dynamis of 9 Concepts? 10?","It was a heavy wall for one to climb as each Layer past the 10th Boundary Layer...was a wall more massive than all the previous Layers combined.","An impossible path.","This was what Noah had placed himself on.","And yet all of this impossibility...had its own rewards for the being who had managed to grasp onto it.","[Every day, the Indefatigable Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity will bud Indefatigable Fruits of Extremity equivalent to the number of concepts in its makeup. The Indefatigable Fruits of Extremity can be devoured as they are extremely conducive to raising the Boundary Layers of all Concepts of Extremity, with their effectiveness doubling when directed towards the progression of the concepts making up the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity.]","...!","[Due to your Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation, the effects of the Indefatigable Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity are further enhanced as the Indefatigable Fruits of Extremity will bud twice in a single day!]","HOONG!","The boon of his foundation!","His body released waves of gorgeous cherry colored light as it was shown once more just why a powerful foundation was important.","It could truly influence the ease of one's journey towards Extremity!","But apart from this, the appearance of the Indefatigable Fruits of Extremity displayed why Inheritances of Extremity and Hyperversal Extremity Existences favored any Apex Aeonic Lifeform that was able to form an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","Why such a being was eventually guaranteed to reach Extremity?","Such beings were so special as only they...had access to a Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity that bloomed with Fruits of Extremity every single day. Fruits they could then use towards attaining Extremity in a Concept as for them...","there was no bottleneck!","If they lived for a long enough period of time, they would use the Fruits of Extremity until a Concept attained the 18th Boundary Layer. The Extremity Boundary Layer that gave access to Hyperversal Extremity Authority!","At this very moment, Noah felt the Indefatigable Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity vibrate as from its stellar cherry colored branches, 9 Buds already began to form.","They would normally take a full day to bloom, but because of Noah's Foundation, all 9 would bloom to become Indefatigable Fruits of Extremity in half a day as Noah could collect 18 of them daily!"]},{"number":2497,"title":"Chapter 2497: Chapter 2496 A Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity! II","paragraphs":["2496 A Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity! II","This was the reward for his efforts.","This was the grandeur of Absolute Dynamis of Extremity.","And it wasn't done.","[All features under the banner of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity are further enhanced.]","[Realm Reconstruction can now be utilized on existences whose Realm or understanding towards Extremity has exceeded yours by Layers, with their core essence being preserved and utilized when reconstructing their Realm from the very beginning.]","[Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain allows you more leeway and control where now, you can induce the limited Vacuous Hyperversal Authority called within the Domain and control it in a very limited, basic fashion.]","[Vacuous Reality Absorption has the time it can be cast again shortened by half, with the limitation of usage being raised to when you have less than 25% of your Soul Values remaining.]","...!","[The Indefatigable Absolute Planar Domain can now be cast.]","...!","An array of prompts each more fantastical than the last!","Realm Reconstruction could now be used on even existences above him as it meant...Apex Aeonic Lifeforms were beings he could now experiment and modify.","Their power would even be set aside when their Realm was broken down as it could be used when it was being rebuilt into something else entirely!","Miniature Vacuous Hyperversal Domain and Vacuous Reality Absorption became even more dreadful as more than all this, there was the Indefatigable Planar Domain.","There were the Planar Domain of Sanguinity, Halcyon Plane of Loot, or Quintessential Hegemony of the Emperor among many other Planar Domains that Noah could call forth from Boundaries.","He could even manifest the Dimensional Realities that were now as grand as Minor Aeonic Havens in his Aletheian Havens of Extremity around him as they had the fantastical boon where unless they were destroyed, his body wouldn't be!","He had all of this...and now, the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity could also usher forth its own Planar Domain.","A plane of beginnings and ends.","How dreadful would it be when it was released on the battlefield?","This was a question that Apex Aeonic Lifeforms would soon get to experience as Noah continued preparing for them!","[Hyperversal Dignity has increased from .3 to .6]","[Hyperversal Mastery has increased from .3 to .6]","[The Authority of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity will course across your Aspects of Existence to fortify your Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation passively when utilizing your Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, granting an increase in all your Hyperversal Values unceasingly.]","[The Authority of the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity is counted collectively as a single authority, only taking a single slot out of the 24 Authorities of Boundaries that can be spread with every breath you take.]","...!","His body was akin to a precious metal others shouldn't even gaze at as he breathed in.","OONG!","A grand symphony played at his mere breathing as essences and authorities circulated, the Indefatigable Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity vibrating with majesty and releasing its authority to proliferate through all of Noah's very atoms in a single breath as everything felt ever grander and filled with more life thereafter!","[The combination of your Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi, Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation, and the authority of the Indefatigable Absolute Dynamis of Extremity coursing through you has caused the strengthening and strengthening of your Aspects of Existence to reach an abnormal level, granting you an increase of +.5 Hyperversal Soul Values, +.5 Hyperversal Damage Values, +1.5 Hyperversal Defense Values, and +1.5 Hyperversal Vitality Values daily.]","\"...\"","After one completed Apexification and became an Apex Aeonic Lifeform, their power greatly varied based on how quickly they raised the concept that defined them towards Extremity, the latter Boundaries each holding shocking augmentation as depending on the Boundary, a single advancement in a layer could grant them 1, 20, or even 50 Apex Aeonic Soul/Damage/Defense Values for high tier Consummate Boundaries exceeding the 10th Boundary Layer.","And the more Boundaries one brought past the 10th layer, the stronger their Apex Values would grow as in addition to this, their Extremity Circulation Modus Operandi would allow for the circulation of their Boundaries and Dynamis of Extremity to inactively strengthen their Foundation and have their power increased on a daily basis!","But such a daily increase was negligible for average Apex Aeonic Lifeforms as too many years had to pass for the Foundations to bloom and inactively grant them tens or possibly hundreds of Apex Aeonic Values.","Terrifying Mutated Entities and Scions grew at a much faster rate as the longer they lived, the more dreadful their power became as they fortified and strengthened their Foundations with Boundaries advanced past the 10th Layers and Dynamis of Extremity as for them, exceeding 1,000 or 10,000 Apex Aeonic Soul Values could be done with ease after sufficient time passed- with others simply being monstrous as even the aforementioned numbers were nothing to them!","Then...there was Noah.","His Unrecorded Aeonic Quintessential Hyperversal Extremity Foundation that pulsed with 81 Hyperversal Extremity Meridian Seeds.","His Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi.","His Absolute Dynamis of Extremity!","All of it made it so that as he breathed every single day, he would gain a Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Value equivalent to half of the value of a common existence that had just undergone Apexification.","A Quintessential Hyperversal Vitality exceeding what a common existence that had just undergone Apexification could attain!","This was his Foundation.","This was his prize for forging an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity and the Quintessential Breath of Extremity Modus Operandi!","His body pulsed with utter grandiosity to the extent that the reforming figures of Henry, Barbatos, Eowyn, Kazuhiko, and all others who were receiving a reformation of their very existence...they all felt like they were rotating in the gravitational waves of a bright and luminous sun, their figures spinning in his magnificence as they rotated with every breath he took.","Their Aspects of Existence cheered with every breath he took as they felt themselves advancing in power by merely being near him- their minds not even being able to imagine how he was doing all of this!","All of this... was only part of Noah's preparations for the coming Apex War.","One of the goals was to have all three Dynamis of Extremity achieve full Convergence before the war.","Noah had just succeeded with the Indefatigable Dynamis of Extremity as these were the results, his eyes flashing opening at this moment as he continued to breathe calmly- the grand effects of his mere Breathing reducing just slightly as he focused on finishing the reforging of the Aspects of Existence of less than a dozen of his people.","The rest of them were already reborn into even grander versions of themselves as they had their eyes closed tightly while sensing and understanding their changes- their bodies rotating around Noah as if this whole region was a group of stars- melted emerald, black gold, and cherry colored rivers of authorities forming and still sinking into them as they were being forged into beings that could far outstrip even the most special Scions of Inheritances of Extremity!","Everything was flowing smoothly and in a grand order.","And there were still multiple parts that had to come into play before he was ready!"]},{"number":2498,"title":"Chapter 2498: Chapter 2497 Winds of Change! I","paragraphs":["2497 Winds of Change! I","The illusory image of the cherry colored Indefatigable Perennial Yggdrasil of Extremity remained stretched out around the Aletheian Havens of the Infinite Hyperversal Haven.","The group of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms around Aurelia and Orion felt many things when gazing at it as one of them spoke at this moment.","\"Is this why you didn't oppose him when he accepted an Apex War of Annihilation?\"","The voice of this Apex Aeonic Lernaean was not directed to a particular being, and yet all eyes and Wills became focused on Aurelia as they knew to whom these words were directed to!","The strongest of the Apex Aeonic Lernaeans.","The one who had used her Forge to aid most of those here to reach the heights they now held.","The one who held more Extreme Power than any one of them- and the one who had contributed the most on keeping the dreadful enemy who attacked them until they ran into the battle that the Wrathful Quintessential Hyperversal Demon Emperor was waging against Noblesse!","The other Apex Aeonic Lernaeans didn't say a word when all of their lives were put on the line because she didn't! But as the atmosphere calmed and they truly realized what was ahead of them, they couldn't help but ponder.","And Aurelia...","\"I was not opposed to the decision of the man who now shoulders all Lernaeans. You all still haven't gotten the chance to grasp how crucial he is. The Apex War was already set in stone anyways as now...we just have to survive it.\"","...!","Her golden hair shone with radiance as Orion quietly watched the illusory cherry colored tree illuminating the stellar expanse.","But even with her words...there were still voices of logic that rang out!","\"But an Apex War of Annihilation is one of Complete extinction and death. Our numbers are lesser, the Nobility have the Genesis Institute of Extremity behind them as their Elders were even there in person. We...we only have our fractured forces as the Cult of Endless Shadows didn't even show up, even now we don't know if they will support us by sending any forces. We would need a heavy and powerful force of a powerful Inheritance of Extremity to survive such a war as no matter how powerful a single being is...he is just one man.\"","WAA!","A man garbed in a light blue robe shared the hidden thoughts of many of the less than a dozen Apex Aeonic Lernaeans here as they didn't know much about the Master of the land they were in apart from what they had seen prior!","As if emboldened by the thought of their certain deaths in the coming war, a woman with dazzling red hair spoke up next.","\"He alone took down two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, yes. He even seems to hold an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity. All of these are unbelievable achievements while he hasn't even undergone Apexification...but Sis Aurelia, that truly isn't enough to stand against tens of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms. Because that is likely what we'll face...especially the Elders and Grand Elder of the Genesis Institute of Extremity. I do not know why you have an unyielding belief in him, but in three days, even if he successfully undergoes Apexification...how will this give us even a high percentage of probability of coming out of this alive?\"","\"...\"","A heavy atmosphere settled amidst all of this blinding radiance as the eyes of many Apex Aeonic Lernaeans showed their fear and hesitation!","The more they thought about it, the more it seemed like they were just thrown into a war to be butchered and destroyed along with all Lernaeans!","At such a juncture, Aurelia turned and gazed back at all of them with a sneer.","\"This is why I stayed away from you lot. Weak with no damn backbone!\"","WAA!","\"What would you have had me do? Exclaim he wasn't part of the Lernaeans and deny this Apex War of Annihilation when he was just enthroned as Emperor and saved us? Or will you all run away now before the war even comes in fear? Intention you betray to the Nobility or other factions? Unless you have an plan worth a single shit, just stand back and shut up while we try to figure out this whole damn situation!\"","...!","Anger and disappointment could be felt in her voice as below them, Maximilian and other Reverend Lernaeans watched on silently.","They came to understand the whole fate of their Lineage hung in the balance!","—","Outside of the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution.","In a small corner within the Aeonic Haven of Genesis.","Near the Domains of the Genesis Institute of Extremity.","Rivers of reality created a floor that stretched out beautifully, these rivers falling down like waterfalls atop the peak of one of the many mountains in this area that shone with a majestic light.","This particular mountain was an abode reserved for a Grand Genesis Elder and the forces placed under him!","Around the peak of this mountain, stellar liquified streams of essence surged as snaking rivers of reality could be seen beautifully rising and falling every now and then.","It was a mystical and wondrous abode as towards the center of the mountain peak, above the floor made of rivers of reality, two powerful Supreme Divine Entities could be seen sitting.","Between them, a stellar board holding rounded white and black pieces could be seen as they seemed to be playing a game, and yet one could sense the authority of multiple Extreme Power coursing around every piece on the board as just moving one required the opposing being to lose in a contest of authority!","The two beings sitting opposite to each other were two men in their prime, one being the master of this mountain and adorned in a white robe as the other held a radiant violet robe- his voice echoing out calmly.","\"I thought the commotion that the unknown Scion is causing in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution was enough to get a few Inheritances buzzing...but now there's also an Apex War? And you guys are involved in this as well? What's really happening, Demetrius?\"","The violet robed being stroked his chin as he spoke of the messages sent over by the Scions of Inheritances in the Extremity Vein of Dissolution who came across the dreadful being who massacred a few hundred Scions and got off scot-free!","A few squadrons from the Genesis Institute of Extremity were even among them as the situation was extremely peculiar.","The white robed Grand Genesis Elder smiled as he replied while ushering his authority to move a white piece on the board.","\"Oh yes, my dear friend Ophyr. Our communication channels have been lighting up with this as uniquely, it's being found out by those who tracked him since he entered the periphery of the Extremity Vein of Dissolution and from the accounts of aboriginals there...that he is an aboriginal tied to some weak Lernaean Lineage. And now this Apex War that Meiying has told us about...it also involves Lernaeans as from the images she's sent over and what our surviving Scions have sent over, it seems the same being is involved in both incidents!\""]},{"number":2499,"title":"Chapter 2499: Chapter 2498 Winds of Change! II","paragraphs":["2498 Winds of Change! II","Ophyr stared at his friend in surprise as he voiced out with sharp eyes!","\"Oh? He's both dominating Scions in the Initiation Step of Extremity Sanctification and participating in fights with Apex Aeonic Lifeforms? What type of Mutated Entity is he? Any of the Seven Clans or Inheritances whose Scions he hasn't butchered would be interested in him.\"","Ophyr asked with intrigue as he moved a black piece with power and ferocity.","\"He's apparently denied an invitation from the Scion of the Sima Clan already. But word is spreading about him after he received no punishment for killing a few hundred Scions, and now this Apex War that He's apparently participating in when he's not even an Apex Aeonic Lifeform...it's enough to rouse a few eyes as there are those who may not want such a talent to die. Especially with the intelligence that his power is due to him attaining an Absolute Seed of Extremity. Do you really think the Adjudicator of that Haven would allow such a being to die? Some Genesis Elders believe he was treated with favor by the Adjudicator, and that's why he faced no punishment after his actions!\"","The white robe on Grand Genesis Elder Demetrius fluttered as his eyes showed a sharp and dangerous smile!","\"A holder of an Absolute Seed of Extremity who is not even an Apex Aeonic Lifeform appearing in the Youngest and Last Haven to undergo Extremity Sanctification...he could be yet another sign of how many anomalies are about to rise from this event. You are planning on fighting for the boons there when the Culmination Step begins, yes?\"","The Culmination Step!","The time when Apex Aeonic Lifeforms could join in as it would have much more interest and grandeur since tools to aid beings in achieving Extremity would be unfolding!","Demetrius nodded while waving his hands and continuing the game.","\"Why of course. It should have been the calm before the storm in the Aeonic Haven of Dissolution before the Culmination Step began, but this Apex War will draw in a few more eyes- especially on the fate of the holder of the Absolute Seed of Extremity. It seems the Cult of Endless Shadows is apparently backing them, but our contacts in the Haven of Penumbra haven't heard anything. When Meiying joins the fight in support of the aboriginal Noblesse...she's already been told to take the holder of the Absolute Seed of Extremity alive. Let's see, what was his name...ah, Osmont. Before the Scions of Inheritances, he has called himself the True Emperor of Quintessence!\"","WAA!","The accounts of Scions spread.","The events that led up to the Initiation of the Apex War of Annihilation were shared!","From person to person, word would spread as gradually, more and more eyes would be drawn over to a certain Haven.","Ophyr listened to his friend before him calmly as he gazed out from the mountain peak they were on, his eyes filled with churning Dynamis of Extremity as he spoke in a deep voice.","\"Quintessence...it is a unique concept. One that I haven't heard anyone attaining Hyperversal Extremity in, or a variation of it. It may just be another dead path that is never able to glance upon Extremity...\"","Dead Paths!","Concepts too grand and simply too difficult to take towards the 18th Boundary Layer as throughout history, they were never able to attain Extremity!","One had to truly stand by the definition of their concepts as if there was even a shred of dissonance and disconnect, it would never attain the Extremity Boundary Layer.","No matter how many treasures one devoured.","No matter how many other Boundaries one sacrificed.","\"Dead Paths...huh.\" Demetrius smiled at these two words as he placed his hands on his chest, feeling the concepts surging through him as a golden light covered his eyes.","\"On my own path, I've still been stuck on the 16th Boundary Layer this whole time. But I can feel the winds of change being ushered by the last Extremity Sanctification. I'm not the only one as I know all Apex Aeonic Lifeforms in other Havens feel it too. Our chances of advancement and attaining Hyperversal Extremity Authority...may just lie in the Extremity Sanctification of Dissolution!\"","WAA!","The mountain was suffused with brilliance as a calmness descended against the two beings.","They stared at the board they played on when suddenly, Ophyr spoke with a pondering frown.","\"We could also bear the weight of an Obsidian or Crimson Haven Albatross and enter the Cracks of Vacuous Hyperversal Authority. A few prominent beings have attained Extremity in this manner.\"","\"Hmph.\" Demetrius sneered at these words as he shook his head.","\"For every single one that survived and attained Extremity, hundreds more died. Unless you have attained 'that' and you can at least survive in those regions, it is simply a death wish. Especially if you come across any of...","them.\"","\"...\"","A conversation that revealed many truths continued on the peak of a mountain, two Apex Aeonic Lifeforms going back and forth as ever so slowly, word spread to those involved or connected in any way to a certain being's actions.","Whispers of a small war in a far-off land.","Whispers of an existence who massacred hundreds of Scions freely.","Whispers of a being who attained an Absolute Seed of Extremity before Apexification!","—","SHIING!","Emerald brilliance shone as Vitalistic coursed endlessly within the Prana Aletheian Haven.","It blared out with more ferocity right now as the last being to undergo configuration was stabilizing their Realm, its authority seeming much more real as its Convergence rose greatly!","The remaining Vassals who also received Reconstruction and Configuration were rotating like stellar bodies around the True Emperor of Quintessence as he stared at the last round of prompts that arose from his actions.","[The Convergence of the Aletheian Dynamis of Extremity has increased to 91%]","[The Convergence of the Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity has increased to 83%]","The closer it was towards full Convergence, the harder the percentage was to raise.","But Noah had no doubt done the impossible to raise his rate of Convergence as quickly as he did, his eyes releasing torrents of light at this moment as he clenched his fist!","WAA!","The vibrant tendrils of his Dynamis of Extremity and other authorities receded into his body as the surroundings calmed.","The essence of Prana slowly became the dominant one once more as verdant dews filled with life began to coagulate around the bodies of his Vassals that stopped rotating around him and slowly began to open their eyes.","It was a glorious scene as Adelaide, The Longest Dream, Morgana, and others who weren't affected by Euryale's attacks and were watching Noah's actions in the past hour let out sighs of relief as they went forward to check how everyone was!","Sandy gold light shone as Eowyn's father appeared before her, his golden eyes lively as he let out a sigh while holding her close.","The blue haired figure of Adelaide with overpowering beauty and grace floated towards Noah and grasped his hand tightly, gazing deeply into his eyes as if she was trying to look for something...and she nodded soon after with a smile as if she found it!","Thereafter, one face after another began to turn towards Noah's visage as he seemed to shine as bright as a rising sun, Noah looking at the people he came across these past 2 years and how they all stood before him now.","With eyes shimmering with royalty and majesty, his voice began to resound in the surroundings.","\"An oversight caused a brief storm of chaos and uncertainty...and it must be rectified right now before we can move forward.\"","...!","\"Your clones are meant to be your backup plans as you venture out into risky lands...and I will make sure they remain that way.\"","His left hand rose as an green glow shone brightly.","It was the glow of [Existence Dissociation]!"]},{"number":2500,"title":"Chapter 2500: Chapter 2499 Dissociation! I","paragraphs":["2499 Dissociation! I","[Existence Dissociation]:: One is only ever a singular Existence. Those capable can split their Existence into multiple parts that move autonomously, whether in the form of clones or reified versions of the concepts that make them. But ultimately, all these parts are still contained and inextricably linked to their singular Existence. The feature of Existence Dissociation utilizes the authority of the Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity to absolutely separate and dissociate your Existence into different parts, producing a single Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity. Such a clone is considered singular and not part of your Original Existence even though it shares the same consciousness soul. The Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity is duplicated from your current realm as it can cultivate thereafter by itself and ponder on your Concepts of Extremity, even being capable of ascending into an advanced form of life by itself as it will not affect the Main Existence...","[...Only when it is recalled back to rejoin the Main Existence will the gains it has made be assimilated. The Vitalistic Dynamis of Extremity goes further to make the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity filled with the impulse of life, where even if it faces True Death, the Clone leaves behind a Vitalistic Seed of Rebirth that burns and blooms to reform the Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity once in its lifetime. If the Clone faces True Death a second time, only then will it be entirely extinguished along with the part of your Existence that made it, any comprehensions, and any advancements. When you cast this feature with yourself as the target, your Quintessential Hyperversal Mana will pay for the entire cost of making your Absolute Vitalistic Clone of Extremity. If it is cast with another existence as the target, the resources required will vary depending on the level of Existence targeted. Any being below the stage of an Apex Aeonic Lifeform will require 5% of your current Quintessential Hyperversal Soul Values, while an Apex Aeonic Lifeform target will require 80% of your current Soul Values. A Vitalistic Clone of Extremity cannot call forth any additional clones or reified versions of itself or its concepts, with its life burning brightly, only advancing forward and waiting for the time it is recalled to the Main Existence...]","The dazzling feature showed itself before Noah's eyes as it was truly one of utter regality.","One of utter incredulity!","He could cast it on any beings below Apex Aeonic Lifeform for the cost of 5% of his maximum Soul Values, but of course, his Quintessential Hyperversal Mana would pay for 95% of this as Noah only had to pay .25% of his Maximum Soul Values.","Something utterly negligible when one looked at how in 5 minutes, he fully regenerated all of his Soul Values!","In 30 seconds, he regenerated 10% of his maximum Soul Values as by the time the surging waves of authority formed a new Vitalistic Clone of Extremity from his target, his Soul Values would be unchanged as if he hadn't even done anything.","He could ridiculously also set his targets to be Apex Aeonic Lifeforms for this ability as since the cost was 80% of his soul values, it actually meant he had to pay 4% after the ridiculous authority of his Quintessential Hyperversal Mana kicked in, and even this 4%...was utterly negligible to him as he could regain it in less than 15 seconds!","\"...\"","It was a wonder of majesty.","It was overpowered at its finest!","When Noah thought of the calculations of Apex Aeonic Lifeforms, his gaze rose to stare at the figures of Aurelia and others in the far distance as he waved his hands.","The Prana Aletheian Haven around them began to churn as this region changed in geography, verdant floating land masses forming below them as above, stellar verdant Cosmos rotated serenely.","Noah's voice rang out at this time.","\"I'll make a demonstration and present myself for those who do not know me, so gather around.\"","WAA!","He spoke in such a manner towards Apex Aeonic Lifeforms and those below them as the forms of Aurelia, Orion, and other Apex Aeonic Lernaeans had their eyes flash as they floated towards the expansive Prana Aletheian Haven that was far vaster than any Major Plane of Existence, going towards its very center where Noah and his closest people were located!","Caesar took Xiaomi's hands as they also came forward, with a few thousand pertinent Lernaeans under Maximilian also coming towards the periphery so that they could glimpse at the brilliance to unfold.","Noah was at the very center as Adelaide was beside him checking Henry's body with a sharp gaze, this mother seeing her Son who had nearly become a fully soul based lifeform as his body seemed physical in one moment and illusory in the next.","Barbatos, Eowyn, Kazuhiko, the Emperor Penguin, Blue Slime, Tiamat, and others were on the recently formed verdant landmasses a little bit further away as the Apex Aeonic Lifeforms came to stand on other verdant islands a little bit further away.","When all of them arrived, Noah's voice continued calmly.","\"We are in our current reality because an Apex Aeonic Noblesse struck against the clones of my people here...her hit ultimately crossing space and time to appear before their main bodies as they nearly perished.\"","...!","\"Of course, that Apex Aeonic Noblesse has now died under my hands for her indiscretion, and this caused the emergence of the Apex War of Annihilation against Noblesse that shall begin in three days. Everyone here who almost perished from the actions of the Apex Aeonic Noblesse ...I reforged their Aspects of Existence while reconstructing their Realm until each of them attained...an Extremity Foundation.\"","WAA!","His words caused Caesar and Xiaomi to open their eyes wide while those apart from Aurelia and Orion had their mouths gaping in disbelief!","An Extremity Foundation!","This was something none of them held as they knew it came from extremely unique beings or those who had devoured treasures like the Extremity Panacea.","Yet this being...could grant others an Extremity Foundation at will?","\"And now, I'll be fixing what made it possible for an Apex Aeonic Lifeform to kill the main bodies of my people through their clones. By using the authority of an Absolute Dynamis of Extremity, I shall make a replica that lives freely by itself as its own existence- one whose destiny would never have any effect on the main body! A clone just as powerful as the main body as in the event it ever faces real demise from even a Hyperversal Extremity, it can never have its True Source traced and destroyed as well!\"","WAA!","Shocking words left his mouth as sharp lights of disbelief crossed all Apex Aeonic Lifeforms here.","As for his people, they didn't bat an eye at his absurd words as they took it as gospel!"]}]);
